WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:10.380
Hey everyone Diavolo here and today we are
diving into another absolutely BRUTAL yet

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:16.190
visually BEAUTIFUL manga called Jigokuraku
or Hells Paradise that takes place during

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:20.529
the Edo period in a world much the same as
our own.

00:00:20.529 --> 00:00:31.830
Throughout the first of these 4 arcs we dive
into the workings of this cruel Naruto esc

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:51.530
Japanese world, were we follow the story of
a vicious assassin named Gabimaru and 

00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:54.820
his journey in order to gain freedom…

00:00:54.820 --> 00:01:01.430
This story is absolutely dope, its themes
are top tier, its art is visually the most

00:01:01.430 --> 00:01:10.600
stunning of the dark trio and I’ve had so
much more fun that expected unravelling just

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:17.960
how fine tuned it truly is . Jigokuraku is
effectively a blend of 2 Japanese words “Jigoku”

00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:19.421
and “Gokuraku”, Heaven and Hell.

00:01:19.421 --> 00:01:24.010
The whole idea of Good and Evil plays out
in so many different ways that really just

00:01:24.010 --> 00:01:27.860
leave you there thinking, re reading wanting
to understand the underlying message that's

00:01:27.860 --> 00:01:28.860
being told.

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:32.549
So without further ado push this video to
5k likes and subscribe so I know you want

00:01:32.549 --> 00:01:37.189
to see the rest of this series.

00:01:37.189 --> 00:01:44.979
Either way, sit back and relax as we dive
into the 1st arc Of Yuki Kaku’s Hells Paradise.

00:01:44.979 --> 00:01:49.360
So as we kick things off, we find a young
restrained man who’s just been betrayed

00:01:49.360 --> 00:01:51.799
by his comrades on a recent mission.

00:01:51.799 --> 00:01:56.430
Before bring the sword down, he asks him for
any parting words, BUT the infamous Gabimaru

00:01:56.430 --> 00:01:59.200
the Hollow simply replies ‘nah’.

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:04.280
So you see, decapitation demands exemplary
sword technique one in which only a few have

00:02:04.280 --> 00:02:05.570
ever been able to master.

00:02:05.570 --> 00:02:09.879
Typically the spectacle turns into a brute-fest
that transforms the grounds into an arena

00:02:09.879 --> 00:02:10.879
of hell.

00:02:10.879 --> 00:02:15.220
However as the sword comes down atop Gabimaru
it leaves everyone absolutely blown away once

00:02:15.220 --> 00:02:18.810
it snaps and clatters to the ground apon touching
his skin…

00:02:18.810 --> 00:02:23.860
Having managed to survive the initial execution,
Gabimaru wonders why he wont die…

00:02:23.860 --> 00:02:28.500
He knows he doesn't have any kinds of attachment
to life as to his core, ‘he’s a Ninja’,

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:31.050
not someone who see’s the value of life.

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:34.970
Later on during his sentence he is visited
by an inspector who records his life story

00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:36.940
in excruciating detail.

00:02:36.940 --> 00:02:40.060
They go over everything from his parents,
dreams, all of the execution attempts made

00:02:40.060 --> 00:02:45.480
on him, how he actually wants to die and finally
how he was betrayed by his village chief.

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:50.400
Later on and after witnessing another failed
execution attempt, the same female questions

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:54.489
Gabimaru, stating that he told her he wished
to die and yet it appears as though he just

00:02:54.489 --> 00:02:56.250
resisted his execution now.

00:02:56.250 --> 00:03:00.430
She asks him why a man with no reason to live
would do such a thing?

00:03:00.430 --> 00:03:04.490
Sitting there, Gabimaru explains that he was
the best of the best in Iwagakure and because

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:10.260
of this he was to marry the daughter of his
village's chief, however, he could not tolerate

00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:13.340
her and requested to the chief to end his
relationship with her.

00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:16.959
Being restrained apon entry into the house,
the chief states that he would allow Gabimaru

00:03:16.959 --> 00:03:21.659
to leave her BUT only on the condition he
would complete one last mission.

00:03:21.659 --> 00:03:26.349
Then the moment he learned that they had actually
set him up, he also realized that if he tried

00:03:26.349 --> 00:03:31.159
to evade capture, then the Iwagakure would
track him down for the entirety of his life,

00:03:31.159 --> 00:03:34.379
so because of this he decided to throw in
the towel and give up.

00:03:34.379 --> 00:03:38.620
Then skipping forward to after another series
of failed executions, like oml the actual

00:03:38.620 --> 00:03:42.909
insanity and pure beauty of the art in this
story is freaking phenomenal, LIKE LOOK AT

00:03:42.909 --> 00:03:45.189
THIS MAN AFTER SURVIVING THE BOILING POT.

00:03:45.189 --> 00:03:49.239
Anyways so finally The inspector who has been
recording Gabimaru's past tells the other

00:03:49.239 --> 00:03:52.349
men around her that the preparations are complete.

00:03:52.349 --> 00:03:56.250
Having collected Gabimaru from his cell, he’s
slowly walked to yet another room in which

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:58.840
he assumes they’ll fail executing him again.

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:02.689
Yet after opening the door, its revealed that
the female who’d been questioning him is

00:04:02.689 --> 00:04:05.260
actually A slayer named Yamada Asaemon Sagiri.

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:06.260
(aa-sia-mon) (segeri)

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:11.540
SOO this Yamada Asaemon name is handed down
over generations to the Ronin from the Yamada

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:13.280
Clan who are known to be extremely skilled
with a sword.

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:14.530
They’re also known as, neck chopper asa
or decapitator asa and train their blades

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:17.120
by cutting down a multitude of different people!

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:21.540
As Sagiri prepares to bring her blade down
on Gabimaru, she tells him that his wish is

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:22.540
granted.

00:04:22.540 --> 00:04:26.009
Sensing death approaching, he realizes this
woman is indeed genuine and instinctively

00:04:26.009 --> 00:04:28.780
flexes destroying the shackles holding him
restrained.

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:32.979
Quickly darting in behind the ninja, Sagiri
attempts to slice down on him with her Katana,

00:04:32.979 --> 00:04:35.820
but Gabimaru swiftly dodges at the last second.

00:04:35.820 --> 00:04:40.060
Again dodging a quick flurry of strikes from
Sagiri, Gabimaru starts to wonder why he’s

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:42.220
refused to accept his fate and die.

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:46.020
As more fodder fools start to surround the
duo, Sagiri tells him that the blade reflects

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:50.690
ones true nature, some may bluff and keep
a brave face to the bitter end, some turn

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:55.040
desperate and cling to life, while others
deceive themselves into accepting death.

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:58.870
To her its extremely obvious that there is
a great emptiness within him and its fairly

00:04:58.870 --> 00:05:00.150
evident given the life he’s led.

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:02.949
Yet even still, he has been lying, she tells
him that he does indeed have an attachment

00:05:02.949 --> 00:05:07.100
to life, stating that he loves his so called
dim-witted wife…

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:11.440
To Gabimaru her very existence gives him a
reason to live in the first place…

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:15.800
Lunging at her Gabimaru attempts to slice
Sagiri, but she easily blocks and confirms

00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:16.800
her theory.

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:20.979
She wonders if he refuses to be executed because
he still has feelings for her, but he’s

00:05:20.979 --> 00:05:24.540
also tried to convince himself that he has
no reason to actually live.

00:05:24.540 --> 00:05:28.270
SCREAMING AT HER TO SHUT UP, Gabimaru jumps
back and yells asking what the hell she would

00:05:28.270 --> 00:05:32.100
know about this messed up world they live
in, HE IS THE INFAMOUS GABIMARU.

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:36.360
Yettt as our broken man goes to scream the
name that brings terror to the hearts of even

00:05:36.360 --> 00:05:40.919
the strongest men, he’s cut off by a memory
of his beloved wife telling him that he really

00:05:40.919 --> 00:05:42.389
isn't hollow after all…

00:05:42.389 --> 00:05:47.130
No, He’s not the cold hearted demon he’s
made out to be, he’s full of kindness and

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:51.080
is the only one who can stand to gaze apon
her deformed face..

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:55.360
After a small but super cute moment together,
she says that its confirms it!

00:05:55.360 --> 00:05:58.660
there is no way you could be hollow inside.

00:05:58.660 --> 00:06:04.509
Yet in-reality now he continues his scream
THAT HE IS GABIMARU THE HOLLOW, a completely

00:06:04.509 --> 00:06:08.699
heartless monster, he tried his hardest to
live a freaking normal life, BUT ITS JUST

00:06:08.699 --> 00:06:09.949
NOT POSSIBLE!

00:06:09.949 --> 00:06:12.919
Living somewhere peaceful, a normal life like
ordinary people.

00:06:12.919 --> 00:06:14.849
HE ISNT ALLOWED ANY OF THAT!

00:06:14.849 --> 00:06:18.610
All of a sudden though, Sagiri disagrees with
his statement and presents to him a document

00:06:18.610 --> 00:06:22.710
saying that he would be pardon for his crimes
by the Shogunate if he could complete a certain

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:24.870
task, He would have to travel to the ‘other
side’.

00:06:24.870 --> 00:06:29.979
Confused about what she means with this, Gabimaru
asks if she means death, but Sagiri elaborates

00:06:29.979 --> 00:06:33.759
that the other side is actually the pure land
or heaven, a revered holy realm hidden since

00:06:33.759 --> 00:06:34.870
ancient times.

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:37.460
A place of joy and plenty where none will
suffer, that may even hold the elixir of life,

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:42.789
which has just recently been found in the
seas southwest far beyond even the Ryuku Kingdom…

00:06:42.789 --> 00:06:49.760
(btw the Ryuku islands are the set of islands
that hold like Okinawa and stretch down towards

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:55.680
Taiwan!)

00:06:55.680 --> 00:07:01.870
Anyways Anyways

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:06.550
Questioning the fairy tale like story, Sagiri
explains to him that in pursuit of this elixir,

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:10.640
the Shogun had already dispatched a research
team to the island, however the single boat

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:15.479
that returned was filled to the brim with
flowers and a foot with some organic growth..

00:07:15.479 --> 00:07:19.660
Instantly they sent out 5 more boats, but
not a single person among them ever returned,

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:21.259
as for the things that did return.

00:07:21.259 --> 00:07:23.180
They could barely be called human.

00:07:23.180 --> 00:07:26.820
The next team to head to the island shall
consist of those ALREADY MARKED FOR DEATH,

00:07:26.820 --> 00:07:31.050
so because of this Sagiri is here to actually
recruit someone she see’s fit, she seeks

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:34.879
a man of talent but someone still with the
strong will to live.

00:07:34.879 --> 00:07:39.140
Sagiri explains to Gabimaru that his wife
is still alive but has turned inwards from

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:43.410
the moment he was captured and now speaks
to no one and refuses almost every meal.

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:48.470
Sagiri thinks that only one can guess what's
on her mind, but tells Gabi she suspects she’s

00:07:48.470 --> 00:07:49.909
waiting on his return..

00:07:49.909 --> 00:07:54.630
And so because of all of this that I've rambled
on about, she asks him if he is attached to

00:07:54.630 --> 00:07:55.630
this life.

00:07:55.630 --> 00:07:59.240
Will he travel to a crazy ass island with
a bunch of goons to complete his pardon and

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:04.319
return to his wife as that is his only hope
of ever having a reunion with her…

00:08:04.319 --> 00:08:08.220
Standing there with tears in his eyes as he
remembers his wife's words of encouragement

00:08:08.220 --> 00:08:11.259
he asks Sagiri if she wanted to see some Ninjutsu.

00:08:11.259 --> 00:08:16.610
Then as she responds affirmatively, he tells
he to watch closely before sparks of fire

00:08:16.610 --> 00:08:21.979
start lighting turning Gabimaru into a ball
of flames and he states Ninpō: Ascetic Blaze.

00:08:21.979 --> 00:08:27.190
In an absolute blaze of power Gabimaru effortlessly
takes out every single one of the surrounding

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:32.020
guards, before taking the demon lord Sukuna’s
place above a pile of scorched men and confidently

00:08:32.020 --> 00:08:37.050
stating that she can count him in, he’ll
find this so called elixir of life.

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:42.340
Going into a flashback Sagiri remembers the
time she saw her father skillfully beheaded

00:08:42.340 --> 00:08:46.750
a criminal, so skillfully infact that the
dude didn't even realize he’d been beheaded.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:51.040
From that day onwards it want to pursue a
career as an executioner.

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:54.890
Later in her life and after completing her
first clean cut she's congratulated by the

00:08:54.890 --> 00:09:00.029
clueless men nearby, but Sagiri herself knows
and is also reminded of her weakness of holding

00:09:00.029 --> 00:09:03.140
on to fear by her superiors each time she
executes criminals.

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:06.790
Its explained that when there is still fear
inside ones blade, that doubt and fear will

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:09.320
deliver an agonizing death to the condemned.

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:13.480
The blade reflects the truth in all things,
a blade drenched with fear causes the condemned

00:09:13.480 --> 00:09:17.050
to suffer which in turn weighs down ones blade
even further…

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:22.460
Being drowned in this fear Sagiri wonders
how its possible to overcome this, how is

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:26.920
she ever able to rid herself of this fear
and doubt like her once father had.

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:31.050
Back in the present day we find all of the
law breakers and the people who brought them

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:36.000
to the capital along with the 11th Shogun;
Lord Tokugawa Nariyoshi.

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:39.769
One of his goons explains that the confidential
mission being offered to them, if completed,

00:09:39.769 --> 00:09:42.760
will be given a full pardon by decree of the
Shogun himself.

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:44.220
Then going onto the so called island in question,
he explains that at a glance it appears to

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:47.440
be paradise, but after telling the criminals
to remove their blindfolds explains that the

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:50.260
amalgamation before them returned back from
the land with a few lumps over his body then

00:09:50.260 --> 00:09:51.260
the next day they bloomed into what they look
like now!

00:09:51.260 --> 00:09:54.260
One absolutely ripped dude who’s like ‘nah
bro I'm out I don't wanna chill with these

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:56.440
weirdos’ gets up and goes to leave.

00:09:56.440 --> 00:09:59.880
Suddenly though, his head is cut clean off
as at that moment the same guard screams some

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:03.790
more information, informing every criminal
there that ‘they’ the Yamada Asaemon will

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:05.680
accompany them to the island.

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:09.080
This is mainly due to the fact that their
death sentences are already determined and

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:12.209
they don't need anyone trying to flee once
making it to the island.

00:10:12.209 --> 00:10:15.459
The criminals are told that if they make one
wrong move or try to turn on them once landing

00:10:15.459 --> 00:10:18.800
on the island then they’ll instantly be
beheaded on the spot.

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:22.510
Then finally just before ending his explanation
of what awaits them he states that before

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:25.490
the trip begins, they’d like to cut down
a few of the numbers, telling the multitude

00:10:25.490 --> 00:10:29.420
of ruthless monoliths to go on and reduce
the amount of participants!

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:34.070
As the massacre begins filling the fat Shogun
with glee, we see one young man who’s obviously

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:36.440
on another level when it comes to straight
hands.

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:41.250
Man takes out a few small fry’s before it
skips over to a Kunoichi who by herself had

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:45.050
apparently taken down a bunch of retainers
in Sagiwa castle the previous year.

00:10:45.050 --> 00:10:49.120
Back over with Sagiri, she’s approached
by Yamada Asaemon Eizen, who was that guy

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:51.579
who shanked the fodder criminal just before.

00:10:51.579 --> 00:10:55.520
ANYWAYS as the two begin to talk he tries
to discourage her from partaking in the mission,

00:10:55.520 --> 00:10:59.769
literally saying she should be in the kitchen
not in battle which is kinda crazy haha.

00:10:59.769 --> 00:11:03.310
Sagiri explains to him though that she would
have chosen that life if it was a possibility,

00:11:03.310 --> 00:11:07.860
but their clan test their blades on bodies
and turns the remains of those fallen into

00:11:07.860 --> 00:11:08.860
medicine.

00:11:08.860 --> 00:11:13.040
So due to these circumstances her life inherently
revolves around the dead, and as much as she

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:16.950
tried to ignore it she just couldn't as she
knew from the time with her father that the

00:11:16.950 --> 00:11:19.480
blade reflects the truth in all things.

00:11:19.480 --> 00:11:22.440
A few criminals then try to attack Sagiri
as a chance to escape but fail as she manages

00:11:22.440 --> 00:11:26.750
to decapitate them, but just like previously,
she's instantly dragged down by the grotesque

00:11:26.750 --> 00:11:29.180
fear coursing through her blade.

00:11:29.180 --> 00:11:33.750
Noticing this Gabimaru points out that she's
still shaken when she kills, but states he’d

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:37.870
rather avoid unnecessary killing as to him
that seems perfectly normal.

00:11:37.870 --> 00:11:41.680
Having overheard this one of the guards points
out to a large group of criminals and commands

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:46.000
them to take down Gabimaru stating that doing
so will guarantee their participation.

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:52.610
Seeing as he had no choice in the matter,
Gabimaru proceeds to brutally kill the criminals.

00:11:52.610 --> 00:11:56.570
After seeing the hollow himself literally
go demon mode, Sagiri comes to the realization

00:11:56.570 --> 00:12:00.350
that instead of trying to kill without fear
she needed to try to bear the weight of her

00:12:00.350 --> 00:12:03.380
fear and the lives she takes, just like Gabimaru
does.

00:12:03.380 --> 00:12:09.040
Sagiri sheds a single tear and declares that
she will be the one to execute Gabimaru.

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:13.640
So after the complete beatdown we just got
to witness the final participants are all

00:12:13.640 --> 00:12:14.640
revealed.

00:12:14.640 --> 00:12:19.450
We have the scarred up G ‘BANDIT KING’
AZA CHOBE, ‘Blade Dragon’ Tamiya Gantetsusai,

00:12:19.450 --> 00:12:24.350
‘Hunter Of The Hundred’ Warped Keiun,
everyone's favorite Nurugai Of The Sanka,

00:12:24.350 --> 00:12:29.980
‘The Killing Buddhist Prayer’ Hōrubō,
‘STRAY NINJA’ GABIMARU THE HOLLOW, ‘Cannibal

00:12:29.980 --> 00:12:35.410
Courtesan’ Akaginu, ‘Kunoichi’ Yuzuriha
of Keishu, Moro Makiya ‘The Apostate’

00:12:35.410 --> 00:12:39.050
and finally ‘The Giant of Bizen’ ROKUROTA.

00:12:39.050 --> 00:12:42.970
Remember all of these names, along with each
of the disciples from the Yamada clan that

00:12:42.970 --> 00:12:47.140
will be paired with them (they all get revealed
at different moments throughout the early

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:52.380
moments on the island) as moments after the
massacre was completed all 10 survivors were

00:12:52.380 --> 00:12:57.779
loaded onto a large ship and sent towards
their freedom!

00:12:57.779 --> 00:13:02.240
After arriving on the island, Gabimaru tells
Sagiri of the Iwagakure Chief's immortal body

00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:06.790
and how the Elixir of Life may actually exist,
though he doubted it may be on the island

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:08.670
because of the unnatural environment.

00:13:08.670 --> 00:13:12.430
He then easily frees himself of his restraints
stating that they dont know what they could

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:16.970
encounter, but Sagiri refuses to allow him
to do whatever pleases him and demands that

00:13:16.970 --> 00:13:18.880
he put back on the restraints.

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:22.660
Not listening to her, Gabimaru instead goes
on about the ridiculously small amount of

00:13:22.660 --> 00:13:26.570
supplies along with little to no direction
on where to go once arriving.

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:31.709
Snapping back, Sagiri holds her blade to Gabis
throat and commands him to rebind his hands!

00:13:31.709 --> 00:13:35.740
She reiterates that, they are not partners,
she is his executioner and should he fail

00:13:35.740 --> 00:13:37.090
to find the elixir not allowing him to get
pardoned…

00:13:37.090 --> 00:13:38.940
Well she simply couldn't care less…

00:13:38.940 --> 00:13:43.000
Clearing her voice she once again tells him
to bind his hands, in which after sighing

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:46.930
he replies that he gets it and rebinds his
hands stating that he’ll go along with these

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:49.680
little rules, BUT only upto a point..

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:54.630
THEN OUT OF KNOWHERE GABIMARU SUDDENLY BENDS
HIS NECK BACK LIKE A SNAKE DODGING A THUNDERING

00:13:54.630 --> 00:13:56.290
STRIKE FROM WARPED KEUIN.

00:13:56.290 --> 00:14:02.839
Having bounced back out of the way, Gabimaru
instantly points out to Sagiri that the criminal's

00:14:02.839 --> 00:14:04.430
arms were not restrained.

00:14:04.430 --> 00:14:06.210
(Love that)

00:14:06.210 --> 00:14:12.600
Instantly over reacting, Sagiri questions
the rank 2 sword tester Yamada Asaemon Kishō

00:14:12.600 --> 00:14:14.339
as to why he wasn't following the rules, only
for Kishō to reply telling her to chill out

00:14:14.339 --> 00:14:15.339
and that the rules are not necessary.

00:14:15.339 --> 00:14:18.130
Thinking that he’s being ignored by the
Hollow, Keiun charges at Gabimaru and pulls

00:14:18.130 --> 00:14:20.440
out a full case of weapons to attack him with.

00:14:20.440 --> 00:14:25.100
He states that weapons can only shine after
they’ve bathed in blood and soon his entire

00:14:25.100 --> 00:14:27.779
body will learn the beauty of his art.

00:14:27.779 --> 00:14:30.910
Gabimaru who’s just blown away with the
complete weirdness of this new opponent, explains

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:34.120
to him, that if he keeps up with how he’s
going then eventually other criminals will

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:36.310
overtake him in his race to the elixir.

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:40.380
Yet Keiun rebuttals him as he actually thinks
it’ll be a best case scenario to take out

00:14:40.380 --> 00:14:41.949
all of the other competition first.

00:14:41.949 --> 00:14:47.010
Being left with no other choice Gabimaru decided
to take him out, yet Warped Keiun instantly

00:14:47.010 --> 00:14:50.779
charges in and attacks with a huge two handed
spear that shatters apon connecting with the

00:14:50.779 --> 00:14:52.220
top of his head.

00:14:52.220 --> 00:14:55.600
Quickly he changes his stance and sends the
hollow shooting back with a huge jab to his

00:14:55.600 --> 00:14:56.760
body with the spear.

00:14:56.760 --> 00:14:57.760
However…

00:14:57.760 --> 00:15:01.199
they had no effect whatsoever on Gabimaru,
who like the legend he is was just double

00:15:01.199 --> 00:15:03.450
checking to make sure his hands were still
tied together.

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:08.080
He then somehow manages to pin the spear under
his arm and fling the giant upwards directly

00:15:08.080 --> 00:15:11.970
above him, surprising the two retainers watching
before then returning a bunch of the falling

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:16.009
weaponry that had just fallen out of Keiun
armory with some perfectly placed kicks.

00:15:16.009 --> 00:15:21.110
Jumping back, Sagiri wonders if Gabimaru somehow
defeated him in one blow, yet Keiun actually

00:15:21.110 --> 00:15:24.589
managed to survive after revealing that he
was wearing a thick armor coating underneath

00:15:24.589 --> 00:15:25.889
his clothing.

00:15:25.889 --> 00:15:30.149
Getting back up he states that the Legendary
Hollows skills sure are amazing, but they

00:15:30.149 --> 00:15:32.889
weren't legendary enough to pierce through
his living armor.

00:15:32.889 --> 00:15:36.399
He prepares himself to fight Gabimaru once
more, telling the small demon that he doesn't

00:15:36.399 --> 00:15:40.321
understand the use of weapons and couldn't
display the beauty of his blade with his previous

00:15:40.321 --> 00:15:43.680
attack, but now he will teach him its true
beauty…

00:15:43.680 --> 00:15:47.800
Yet this man is apparently completely fodder
and doesn't even deserve 3 panels explaining

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:51.800
what happens as instead he is instantly finished
by the scattered weapons that had fallen to

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:53.790
the ground just previously.

00:15:53.790 --> 00:15:58.569
As Gabimaru walks away from the mess, he signs
and shows the surprised retainers he never

00:15:58.569 --> 00:16:00.959
removed his bindings during the fight.

00:16:00.959 --> 00:16:05.040
Over with another group and while Rokurōta
was being transported (which is the massive

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:09.589
giant looking dude, like it takes 3 vessels
tied together to bull this sleeping giant

00:16:09.589 --> 00:16:13.389
along) Looking at the size of him the random
staff members become worried overthinking

00:16:13.389 --> 00:16:17.790
the possibility that the giant could awake
and go on a rampage, but Eizen, the schools

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:21.770
rank 1 Asaemon assures them that this is literally
the reason they’re here as no one is immune

00:16:21.770 --> 00:16:22.770
to there cuts.

00:16:22.770 --> 00:16:26.830
Back with our main group, Kishō had actually
moved into attack and its revealed that warped

00:16:26.830 --> 00:16:29.959
Keiun was taken by surprise, being taken out
in the process.

00:16:29.959 --> 00:16:33.829
Due to the his prisoner dying Kishō advises
the others that he’s going to head home

00:16:33.829 --> 00:16:36.810
as he really doesn't have a reason to stay
anymore and while leaving Sagiri tries to

00:16:36.810 --> 00:16:40.540
warn him about the sixty men that went missing
on the island.

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:43.889
The swordsman though just finds it a complete
waste of his time to be worrying about others

00:16:43.889 --> 00:16:47.230
and infact considers himself lucky being able
to make an escape.

00:16:47.230 --> 00:16:51.220
He warns her that the criminals with them
have already made their move, they’re individuals

00:16:51.220 --> 00:16:54.860
who’ve never cared for societies laws and
the rules that the shogun gave them should

00:16:54.860 --> 00:16:59.380
not be taken seriously since it might risk
their chances of acquiring the Elixir of Life.

00:16:59.380 --> 00:17:03.420
In his eyes rather than taking the rules literally,
surely the Shogunate would be more pleased

00:17:03.420 --> 00:17:05.510
with success at any cost.

00:17:05.510 --> 00:17:09.910
He points out Gabimaru as a prime example,
asking if she preferred he was cut down now

00:17:09.910 --> 00:17:11.169
so she could pretend and run off.

00:17:11.169 --> 00:17:15.709
Having heard enough, Gabimaru silences Kishō
getting all up in his face and telling him

00:17:15.709 --> 00:17:19.169
nothing else mattered all he wants is to get
back to his wife.

00:17:19.169 --> 00:17:23.940
Kishō tells him to hurry then and snidely
warns the hollow ninja that within a few hours,

00:17:23.940 --> 00:17:25.730
everything will have changed.

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:29.559
Back with Eizen and probably at somewhat of
a similar time, seeing that the Giant had

00:17:29.559 --> 00:17:34.850
risen he asks if he’s hungry but immediately
notices the bloodlust emanating from his criminal.

00:17:34.850 --> 00:17:39.380
In a flash the two don't even trade words
but immediately go to attack, sadly Eizen

00:17:39.380 --> 00:17:43.799
aint living upto the aura that the name holds
and was literally slapped like a bug by Rokurōta.

00:17:43.799 --> 00:17:48.270
(honestly a complete change from all the other
series with an Eizen, plus with him being

00:17:48.270 --> 00:17:52.539
rank one I was so expecting him to be insanely
skilled, yet we never really got to see his

00:17:52.539 --> 00:17:53.610
true potential.)

00:17:53.610 --> 00:17:58.490
As Kishō then continues his ominous statement,
it darts around the outskirts of the island

00:17:58.490 --> 00:18:01.669
revealing the dismay that has erupted in other
groups.

00:18:01.669 --> 00:18:06.289
Apparently an emissary was already headed
to Iwagakure to ask them to help with this

00:18:06.289 --> 00:18:07.289
mission.

00:18:07.289 --> 00:18:10.620
Kishō knows the limits of his strength and
tells Sagiri that this mission will likely

00:18:10.620 --> 00:18:14.900
determine the next head of the Yamada clan,
then with him having warned them about the

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:18.350
coming possibilities finally makes his leave.

00:18:18.350 --> 00:18:21.960
Taking all of this in, she tries to pass of
the idea that Gabimaru would ever make a move

00:18:21.960 --> 00:18:26.929
to attack her, however just as she asks where
they should go next, Gabi looking shell shocked

00:18:26.929 --> 00:18:29.380
darts at Sagiri trying to strike her down.

00:18:29.380 --> 00:18:33.090
Baffled and angered with the change in his
attitude, she just asks him why what could

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:35.540
possibly be the meaning of this?

00:18:35.540 --> 00:18:39.280
Standing there, Gabimaru thinks back on the
moments after his birth and how his parents

00:18:39.280 --> 00:18:42.850
tried to escape the village with him, but
were sadly slain.

00:18:42.850 --> 00:18:46.870
Iwagakure Chief's cruely used this moment
to shape the child, telling him to look apon

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:47.870
their weakness.

00:18:47.870 --> 00:18:52.180
He states that because of his parents sentimental
love it made them weak and if he doesn't grow

00:18:52.180 --> 00:18:56.490
into a strong man he’ll end up like his
parents; uncapable of protecting even his

00:18:56.490 --> 00:18:58.610
loved ones later in life.

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:02.470
Back in the heat of the battle and after learning
what Kishō had to say about Iwagakure getting

00:19:02.470 --> 00:19:05.690
involved, Gabimaru knew that it would all
be over for him.

00:19:05.690 --> 00:19:09.880
He wont have the luxury of taking time and
protecting random people on his path to find

00:19:09.880 --> 00:19:13.650
the Elixir of Life and because of that he
was left with no other choice than to take

00:19:13.650 --> 00:19:14.650
out Sagiri..

00:19:14.650 --> 00:19:19.659
Dashing in the two let loose a flurry of strikes
causing constant sparks to fly off the clashing

00:19:19.659 --> 00:19:20.930
pieces of metal.

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:25.020
Thinking herself, Sagiri wonders why she's
hesitating, why hasn't she been able to write

00:19:25.020 --> 00:19:27.270
him off as just another villan.

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:32.600
Opposing her Gabimaru also confused wonders
why, why is he wavering, before then remembering

00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:36.620
his wife's words on how its only natural that
he doesn't want to follow through with taking

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:37.620
her out.

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:42.280
Instead its best to follow your sentimentality,
he’s different now, he isn't the hollow

00:19:42.280 --> 00:19:47.240
man he once was, its not a form of weakness
but a form strength and it will guide him

00:19:47.240 --> 00:19:48.830
into a pure warrior.

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:53.080
Unable to throw away the beliefs he grew up
with, Gabimaru cant help but fall back into

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:55.679
darkness, knowing that he’s learnt of weakness.

00:19:55.679 --> 00:19:59.340
Using his hand like a spear, Gabi bursts through
his bandages putting Sagiri easily within

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:04.110
range but once again hesitates allowing her
to notice in time and deflect the strike.

00:20:04.110 --> 00:20:07.760
The two once again slash at each other, but
they both note that their own damn emotions

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:09.890
are slowing them down.

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:13.070
Remembering the old fart again though as if
the dude has some kinda hold over his thoughts,

00:20:13.070 --> 00:20:16.640
Gabimaru takes things up a notch proceeding
to straight up just cut her sword in half

00:20:16.640 --> 00:20:20.240
and as she stands there in utter shock seemingly
finishes the job.

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:24.960
Yet its revealed that Sagiri had used her
sheath to deflect the killing blow.

00:20:24.960 --> 00:20:29.030
Momentarily baffled Gabi just tells her that
resisting is useless as he knows she cant

00:20:29.030 --> 00:20:31.169
bring him down with the sheath alone.

00:20:31.169 --> 00:20:36.070
He apologizes for what he has to do However,
Sagiri again hits a nerve within him by saying

00:20:36.070 --> 00:20:40.800
that she didnt realize he wasn't capable of
feeling such sentiment given his reputation.

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:44.900
Agreeing that he doesn't, Gabimaru blitzes
Sagiri appearing atop her as a mass of smoke

00:20:44.900 --> 00:20:46.000
and fire.

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:49.360
Before he could kill her though, he is once
again reminded of his wife's influence and

00:20:49.360 --> 00:20:51.820
stops himself from killing her.

00:20:51.820 --> 00:20:55.950
Appearing on his shoulder the chiefs thoughts
taunt Gabi trying to get him to take out his

00:20:55.950 --> 00:20:56.950
retainer.

00:20:56.950 --> 00:21:00.520
Leaning over her he tries to will himself
to push forth and do something he’s done

00:21:00.520 --> 00:21:05.010
thousands of times before, but he cant as
his wife’s apparition is able to destroy

00:21:05.010 --> 00:21:07.050
the evil emotions controlling him.

00:21:07.050 --> 00:21:11.460
Laying below the broken man, Sagiri realizes
that throughout the entire time she’s known

00:21:11.460 --> 00:21:15.530
him he’s worn an expression of utter pain,
like he was enduring something.

00:21:15.530 --> 00:21:20.070
For her she was able to see this and it actually
allowed her to confront the emotions she had

00:21:20.070 --> 00:21:21.070
kept hidden.

00:21:21.070 --> 00:21:25.360
With Gabi not able to bring himself to kill
Sagiri, he begins crying, believing that with

00:21:25.360 --> 00:21:30.409
the way he is he won't be able to survive
on the island or ever see his wife again.

00:21:30.409 --> 00:21:34.760
Sagiri realizes that this isn't weakness what
he has is a love for his wife which shows

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:37.409
for a fact that he can feel emotions.

00:21:37.409 --> 00:21:41.169
Still lying there she promises him that if
he faces his emotions while reclaiming his

00:21:41.169 --> 00:21:43.880
life then she will support him throughout
the journey.

00:21:43.880 --> 00:21:48.840
Finally, Sagiri tells Gabimaru to show her
what he’s capable of, as even though their

00:21:48.840 --> 00:21:53.210
inherent relationship hasn't changed, he is
no longer the same man he once was.

00:21:53.210 --> 00:21:58.110
Ahh so I actually love these 2 characters
that get introduced throughout this part,

00:21:58.110 --> 00:22:02.070
complete polar opposites but damn there both
so cool in there own ways.

00:22:02.070 --> 00:22:06.970
So in the past the hulking giant Gantetsusai
went by the name “Blade Dragon Eight Provinces

00:22:06.970 --> 00:22:08.200
Unparalleled”.

00:22:08.200 --> 00:22:12.710
After arriving in a certain province a Daimyo
who shared a similar title offered him work

00:22:12.710 --> 00:22:16.180
and food, so he decided to take him up on
the offer.

00:22:16.180 --> 00:22:20.150
After a coupley drinks though, the Daimyo
insisted that even with his nickname he doubts

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:22.450
he could ever take down an actual dragon.

00:22:22.450 --> 00:22:26.580
Utterly insulted with the idea he couldn't
take down a dragon, Gantetsusai destroyed

00:22:26.580 --> 00:22:30.480
the dragon statue atop the entrance way to
the daimyo’s residence along with the whole

00:22:30.480 --> 00:22:31.480
gate.

00:22:31.480 --> 00:22:35.299
Obviously and as your may have suspected this
resulted in him later being kicked out of

00:22:35.299 --> 00:22:40.650
his own clan and sentenced to death, hence
how man ended up on the mission to the island.

00:22:40.650 --> 00:22:45.760
Having revealed his past the his retainer
who’s the Rank 9 Yamada Asaemon Fuchi, Gantetsusai

00:22:45.760 --> 00:22:50.220
tells him that once he gets his pardon and
walks free will return to cut down the silly

00:22:50.220 --> 00:22:52.200
old Daimyo’s mansion.

00:22:52.200 --> 00:22:58.110
Fuchi standing there utterly fails to comprehend
how he even came to that being a good conclusion.

00:22:58.110 --> 00:23:01.760
Gantetsusai jokingly mocks the tiny retainer
and makes a few negative comments about the

00:23:01.760 --> 00:23:02.820
Yamada clan.

00:23:02.820 --> 00:23:07.250
Peeved Fuchi draws out his sword and tells
him not to make fun of the clan causing Gantetsusai

00:23:07.250 --> 00:23:11.190
to back away from the blade feeling a deadly
bloodlust coming from the midget.

00:23:11.190 --> 00:23:15.620
Not escalating the argument, the big man just
tells him to not get in his way before freeing

00:23:15.620 --> 00:23:17.210
himself from his bindings.

00:23:17.210 --> 00:23:21.419
He then explains his plan of eliminating the
other competition around (criminals wise)

00:23:21.419 --> 00:23:24.679
so he can take extra time with finding the
elixir in safety.

00:23:24.679 --> 00:23:28.500
Fuchi takes note of the fact that only a few
criminals will survive the trials on the island

00:23:28.500 --> 00:23:32.280
and if the shogun becomes impatient because
of that, he will call upon a stronger and

00:23:32.280 --> 00:23:41.270
more venomous batch of warriors to dispatch
in their stead.

00:23:41.270 --> 00:23:47.059
(btw the symbolism here is actually taken
from real life, back in early Japan they used

00:23:47.059 --> 00:23:51.409
to put venomous insects in a pot and let them
battle, then the venom that remained would

00:23:51.409 --> 00:23:54.110
be used to curse someone.

00:23:54.110 --> 00:24:01.540
Another big Mangaka to go out of his way to
use this is actually Gege with some of the

00:24:01.540 --> 00:24:07.080
recent stuff in the Manga there like ive explained
before!)

00:24:07.080 --> 00:24:11.860
Eitherway having moved forward together, the
two then stumble upon some ancient man-made

00:24:11.860 --> 00:24:12.860
statues.

00:24:12.860 --> 00:24:16.900
Not paying attention to his surroundings Gantetsusai
is stung on the hand by a random looking butterfly

00:24:16.900 --> 00:24:19.200
that had a human face on it.

00:24:19.200 --> 00:24:22.529
Stunned he quickly remembered what happened
to the guard that had returned from the island

00:24:22.529 --> 00:24:26.700
and without a second thought cuts off his
left hand confusing the retainer with him.

00:24:26.700 --> 00:24:31.340
Looking at the hand though its shown that
in a matter of moments after landing it started

00:24:31.340 --> 00:24:33.670
morphing into a bunch of flowers.

00:24:33.670 --> 00:24:37.679
Suddenly from within the tree’s around them
butterfly's start bursting out, causing Gantetsusai

00:24:37.679 --> 00:24:41.809
to get excited as he prepares to defend himself
against the random creatures.

00:24:41.809 --> 00:24:46.899
However, appearing from behind them once more
a comically large titan like creature starts

00:24:46.899 --> 00:24:48.760
walking in their direction.

00:24:48.760 --> 00:24:52.890
Meanwhile, Gabimaru and Sagiri are also approached
by the same weird looking creatures.

00:24:52.890 --> 00:24:56.951
With them confused over what they’re seeing,
Gabimaru steps forth telling Sagiri to stay

00:24:56.951 --> 00:24:58.169
back.

00:24:58.169 --> 00:25:02.260
Looking at he wonders what in the world it
could possibly be, why a fish, it doesn't

00:25:02.260 --> 00:25:06.039
even look like its supposed to be real, plus
its got these random prayer beads as if its

00:25:06.039 --> 00:25:07.650
subject to some sort of religion.

00:25:07.650 --> 00:25:12.110
With his instincts screaming danger Gabimaru
watches as the beast tries to attack him.

00:25:12.110 --> 00:25:16.690
Easily he’s able to dodge the amalgamation
of hands, before jumping up kicking the monster.

00:25:16.690 --> 00:25:20.779
However the monster was actually able to block
the blow, having grabbed the Ninja’s leg

00:25:20.779 --> 00:25:24.230
it then proceeds to toss him into the ground,
causing Gabi to jump back and rethink his

00:25:24.230 --> 00:25:26.150
attacking strategy.

00:25:26.150 --> 00:25:30.660
Remembering his Ironclad Ninja Law number
5 to avoid an unfamilar enemy he thinks about

00:25:30.660 --> 00:25:32.320
fleeing the area with Sagiri.

00:25:32.320 --> 00:25:36.520
Yet our boy is taken by surprise as a rope
like extension from the monster grabs and

00:25:36.520 --> 00:25:38.590
tosses him through the nearby foliage.

00:25:38.590 --> 00:25:42.440
Wounded from the blow, he tells Sagiri that
they just need to run for now, but as they

00:25:42.440 --> 00:25:47.110
go leave its shown that a plethora of these
random monsters with prayer beads and vestments

00:25:47.110 --> 00:25:48.520
have surrounded them.

00:25:48.520 --> 00:25:52.970
Seeing no way out, Gabimaru clears his head
of all other distractions and goes utter demon

00:25:52.970 --> 00:25:53.970
mode.

00:25:53.970 --> 00:25:57.580
Jumping into the sky he easily takes out the
fights monster with a punch before igniting

00:25:57.580 --> 00:26:00.100
it with his Ninpo Ascetic Blaze.

00:26:00.100 --> 00:26:04.559
Sagiri who’s watching in horror behind him
remembers how Gabi explained that in his clan

00:26:04.559 --> 00:26:08.160
they go through all kinds of bizarre training
and though that they learn abilities akin

00:26:08.160 --> 00:26:11.260
to breathing fire or becoming one with the
sea.

00:26:11.260 --> 00:26:14.820
Gabimaru having sparked alight from the use
of his technique knows that in order to survive

00:26:14.820 --> 00:26:19.500
this hellish island and get the pardon he
has to kill anything that gets in his way.

00:26:19.500 --> 00:26:23.280
Watching Gabimaru fight off the random creatures,
Sagiri thought that she was prepared to take

00:26:23.280 --> 00:26:28.110
on the unknown, but now with everything going
on around her, she starts to wonders if perhaps

00:26:28.110 --> 00:26:30.710
this isn't the pure land but instead?

00:26:30.710 --> 00:26:34.630
Before she’s able to think any longer though
a large buddha like monster confronts her

00:26:34.630 --> 00:26:35.630
from behind.

00:26:35.630 --> 00:26:40.070
Gabimaru who’s fading in and out of some
kind of visual experience notices that Sagiri

00:26:40.070 --> 00:26:44.440
is in danger, but instead of turning to help
her focuses on taking out the large creature

00:26:44.440 --> 00:26:45.720
infront of himself.

00:26:45.720 --> 00:26:49.440
However, without even realizing it Gabimaru
had managed to actually attack her creature

00:26:49.440 --> 00:26:51.370
saving Sagiri in the process.

00:26:51.370 --> 00:26:55.850
As Gabi sits there confused holding her, she
thanks him for saving her life, but then again

00:26:55.850 --> 00:27:00.330
out of nowhere has his head is wrapped up
by one of the creatures tentacles.

00:27:00.330 --> 00:27:03.950
Randomly in the split second before the monster
squeezed down, someone had managed to sever

00:27:03.950 --> 00:27:05.799
its hold on Gabimaru.

00:27:05.799 --> 00:27:10.110
Turning around he notices that 3 newcomers
had arrived and saved them from the surrounding

00:27:10.110 --> 00:27:11.309
creatures.

00:27:11.309 --> 00:27:14.690
Yuzuriha who’s another Ninja like Gabimaru
walks up and makes her introduction.

00:27:14.690 --> 00:27:19.140
While Sagiri thinks its odd that a pair of
retainers are escorting her Gabimaru thanks

00:27:19.140 --> 00:27:23.220
them for intervening, but asks why, why would
they go out of their way to help someone when

00:27:23.220 --> 00:27:25.580
they’re under no obligation to do so.

00:27:25.580 --> 00:27:29.690
Yuzuriha just straight up tries seducing him
to get around the question and into teaming

00:27:29.690 --> 00:27:33.940
up, however, Gabimaru pins her down explaining
that her methods won't work on him.

00:27:33.940 --> 00:27:38.720
(Be like Gabi guys, don't be a sneako cuckboy)

00:27:38.720 --> 00:27:42.230
Yuzuriha was really trying to team up with
them, but before they continue as a group

00:27:42.230 --> 00:27:45.360
Sagiri asks why two people have ended up escorting.

00:27:45.360 --> 00:27:50.160
Rank 8 Yamada Asaemon Genji explains that
he was originally in charge of Moro yet Moro

00:27:50.160 --> 00:27:53.409
was quickly deceived by Yuzuriha and taken
out.

00:27:53.409 --> 00:27:57.429
After realizing what she’d done Genji proudly
determined that she could not be left alone

00:27:57.429 --> 00:28:01.630
with just a single executioner and decided
to watch over her with the other dude.

00:28:01.630 --> 00:28:06.140
Yuzuriha explains that before running into
Gabimaru they were also surrounded by bugs.

00:28:06.140 --> 00:28:09.750
She knows that the island isn't exactly the
safest place out and because of that knows

00:28:09.750 --> 00:28:12.159
finding the elixir and escaping is key.

00:28:12.159 --> 00:28:16.100
Yet if she was to run in without a plan or
by herself she’d probably be killed and

00:28:16.100 --> 00:28:17.490
it would all be for nothing.

00:28:17.490 --> 00:28:21.470
So due to the predicament she found herself
in, the strategy of playing it safe by teaming

00:28:21.470 --> 00:28:24.529
up to find the elixir is by far the smartest.

00:28:24.529 --> 00:28:29.200
After thinking Gabimaru accepted her into
the group, Yuzuriha tried to give him a hug,

00:28:29.200 --> 00:28:33.110
but Gabi instantly pinned her down, telling
her that he wasn't in agreement since he doesn't

00:28:33.110 --> 00:28:34.809
trust them in the slightest.

00:28:34.809 --> 00:28:38.250
Looking at him, Yuzuriha breaks the ninja’s
hold, pulling him in close and telling him

00:28:38.250 --> 00:28:41.559
that they didn't have to trust each other
and can betray one another whenever they’d

00:28:41.559 --> 00:28:45.470
like as after all that elixir is just worth
a single pardon.

00:28:45.470 --> 00:28:49.590
If they team up though, she’ll provide them
with information regarding the human-faced

00:28:49.590 --> 00:28:53.169
butterflies, explaining that they swarm around
the monsters and have scales that emit poison

00:28:53.169 --> 00:28:56.240
that causes hallucinations but are still a
mystery overall.

00:28:56.240 --> 00:29:01.880
Curious on how she figured this out to start
with, Gabi asks how she came to that conclusion.

00:29:01.880 --> 00:29:07.020
Funnily enough, like remember Moro, well Yuzuriha
had got hella friendly with him, then tied

00:29:07.020 --> 00:29:13.330
him to a tree to check certain bugs effects.

00:29:13.330 --> 00:29:17.549
From this she was able to learn that the centipedes
by far have the worst effect, but the majority

00:29:17.549 --> 00:29:20.630
of bugs wont really attack you unless provoked
them.

00:29:20.630 --> 00:29:26.059
Yamada Asaemon Senta who’s originally Yuzuriha’s
executioner finally speaks up and lets them

00:29:26.059 --> 00:29:30.510
all know that all of the monsters he’s seen
have qualities associated with Buddhism and

00:29:30.510 --> 00:29:31.510
Tao.

00:29:31.510 --> 00:29:35.750
Those two religions alone have fundamentally
different core structures so he finds he weirdly

00:29:35.750 --> 00:29:39.830
unsettling that here they’ve blended together
in some dark nature, from just this fact alone

00:29:39.830 --> 00:29:43.290
he believes this islands true nature is defiantly
not pure.

00:29:43.290 --> 00:29:48.380
Sagiri agrees, like even though these monsters
appear as godly beings, the feeling her blade

00:29:48.380 --> 00:29:52.580
gives her solidifies the idea that they’re
simply living creatures.

00:29:52.580 --> 00:29:57.360
To Yuzuriha this just cements that its a priority
they communicate and gather more info but

00:29:57.360 --> 00:30:01.120
Gabimaru wondering what's motivating her to
this extent asks why?

00:30:01.120 --> 00:30:04.260
According to her, this is all for her little
sister.

00:30:04.260 --> 00:30:08.130
She suffers from an incurable disease and
due to their situation in life, they couldn't

00:30:08.130 --> 00:30:09.580
even afford basic medicine.

00:30:09.580 --> 00:30:13.799
In an attempt to earn money she turned ninja
and took part in the hellish training inside

00:30:13.799 --> 00:30:15.640
of the Kai Clan.

00:30:15.640 --> 00:30:19.530
Randomly one day the boss turned on her and
thats how she ended up here.

00:30:19.530 --> 00:30:22.830
Still Gabimaru literally doesn't believe her.

00:30:22.830 --> 00:30:27.279
Finally revealing what seems to be the truth,
she reveals that she doesn't even have a story,

00:30:27.279 --> 00:30:31.400
getting to live and return home is more than
enough for her.

00:30:31.400 --> 00:30:35.820
Wanting to know one more thing, Gabi inquires
as to what exactly she did to her executioner.

00:30:35.820 --> 00:30:39.990
Like last time she insists that he was just
used as a vessel to perform research experiments

00:30:39.990 --> 00:30:45.149
on before snidely asking if he really cares
that much about the lives of others.

00:30:45.149 --> 00:30:48.950
Knowing that she contains information about
the island, Gabimaru agrees to help her with

00:30:48.950 --> 00:30:51.900
fighting but other than that they’re not
cooperating.

00:30:51.900 --> 00:30:56.730
As the others bicker about what information
to share, Sagiri looks back on how far she’s

00:30:56.730 --> 00:31:00.270
come since arriving on the island, which in
her eyes is pretty much no where.

00:31:00.270 --> 00:31:04.450
She knows that she was overwhelmed by the
monsters and the entire situation itself has

00:31:04.450 --> 00:31:06.929
just caused her to feel flustered.

00:31:06.929 --> 00:31:10.730
Disappointed in herself for how powerless
she currently is, Sagiri drops to the floor

00:31:10.730 --> 00:31:13.200
fainting from the effects of the previous
battle.

00:31:13.200 --> 00:31:18.270
Going back in time again were introduced to
Toma who’d managed to earn his license as

00:31:18.270 --> 00:31:22.580
apart of the Asaemon Executioners after only
a month of training, the only thing remaining

00:31:22.580 --> 00:31:25.029
for him to do was the execution itself.

00:31:25.029 --> 00:31:29.150
Funnily enough its shown that the person he’d
chosen was his own brother.

00:31:29.150 --> 00:31:34.210
In a turn of events that the clan isnt privy
to yet, Toma had purposfully infiltrated the

00:31:34.210 --> 00:31:37.690
them so that the two would later be able to
escape together.

00:31:37.690 --> 00:31:41.480
Obviously the way they ended up escaping or
trying to was taking part as retainer and

00:31:41.480 --> 00:31:43.940
criminal in the trip to paradise island.

00:31:43.940 --> 00:31:48.710
Now on the island its shown that the two were
able to make landfall but like everyone else

00:31:48.710 --> 00:31:53.149
had been surrounded by a plethora of random
wildlife and religious figures.

00:31:53.149 --> 00:31:56.799
Watching Chōbei rush forth to protect him,
Tōma thinks back on how, even when they were

00:31:56.799 --> 00:32:00.670
little and had lost their mother to illness,
even after their father betrayed the clan

00:32:00.670 --> 00:32:05.039
and was sentenced, even when bandits attacked
them without a second thought Chōbei always

00:32:05.039 --> 00:32:07.470
figured things out and adapted to every situation.

00:32:07.470 --> 00:32:12.040
He learnt early on that the law of this land
isn't that the strong always win, but rather

00:32:12.040 --> 00:32:15.970
a survival of those who manage to adapt best
to the situation and surroundings effecting

00:32:15.970 --> 00:32:16.970
them.

00:32:16.970 --> 00:32:20.570
(btw you’ll learn all about how this story
teaches us that being strong and weak are

00:32:20.570 --> 00:32:22.580
both valuable to someone's personality.

00:32:22.580 --> 00:32:26.250
Its a much deeper story that I initially thought
when I started reading.

00:32:26.250 --> 00:32:33.510
I came into it under the precedent it was
a darker shounen that went crazy with some

00:32:33.510 --> 00:32:38.149
of its battles, but I had no idea that some
of the things it tries to teach its readers

00:32:38.149 --> 00:32:40.539
are truly good morals to live by.

00:32:40.539 --> 00:32:45.450
Like straight up even with Gabi just being
faithful to his wife and not on that pervy

00:32:45.450 --> 00:32:57.779
weirdness that other series tend 
to have)

00:32:57.779 --> 00:33:01.630
Having taken out a bunch of the monsters,
the duo notice even more approaching and decide

00:33:01.630 --> 00:33:03.960
to flee the area rather than take them on.

00:33:03.960 --> 00:33:07.460
As they try to escape, Tōma’s hair is caught
by one of the monsters and while freaking

00:33:07.460 --> 00:33:09.559
out screams for his brothers help.

00:33:09.559 --> 00:33:11.419
However, Chōbei continues to run off.

00:33:11.419 --> 00:33:15.679
Left with no other option that to defend for
himself, Tōma strikes at the large monster

00:33:15.679 --> 00:33:16.940
trying to take it down.

00:33:16.940 --> 00:33:20.730
Blowing through the monster though its shown
that Chōbei had just gapped it to grab a

00:33:20.730 --> 00:33:23.909
large axe from one of the previously defeated
members.

00:33:23.909 --> 00:33:27.970
Chōbei is then struck by another monster,
taking him completely by surprise and while

00:33:27.970 --> 00:33:33.370
looking at the group begin to surround them
hears it tell them that killing is a sin.

00:33:33.370 --> 00:33:36.690
Standing there listening to all of the voices
echo around them Tōma begins to freak out

00:33:36.690 --> 00:33:38.710
in a similar way to Sagiri earlier.

00:33:38.710 --> 00:33:43.330
Chōbei on the other hand tho, like mans on
that demon mode spec becomes enraged by their

00:33:43.330 --> 00:33:45.370
speaking of sin and tells them to shut up.

00:33:45.370 --> 00:33:49.440
He screams as he destroys the surrounding
monsters that all of them are just slaves,

00:33:49.440 --> 00:33:52.510
silly puppets stuck to a regimented code of
law.

00:33:52.510 --> 00:33:56.330
UNLIKE THEM HE IS HIS OWN MASTER, HIS OWN
GOD.

00:33:56.330 --> 00:34:00.889
Standing there, looking at her brother Tōma
admires Chōbei's ability to adapt, his constant

00:34:00.889 --> 00:34:03.889
unyielding sense of self is what defines him.

00:34:03.889 --> 00:34:08.220
So when it comes down to their overall plan,
well its now changed from just getting this

00:34:08.220 --> 00:34:10.240
pardon and escaping together.

00:34:10.240 --> 00:34:14.629
Now Chōbei states that he will kill all of
the monsters and criminals on the island before

00:34:14.629 --> 00:34:16.659
downing the elixir of life themselves.

00:34:16.659 --> 00:34:22.540
Back with the main squad, Sagiri awakens terrified
after having a nightmare that involved her

00:34:22.540 --> 00:34:24.649
father looking down on her.

00:34:24.649 --> 00:34:28.290
Genji who’s nearby looking after her while
the others were working brings her up to date

00:34:28.290 --> 00:34:31.760
with how they’ve taken shelter in a tree
hollow and that she’d fainted because of

00:34:31.760 --> 00:34:34.429
the toxic powder coming off the butterfly's.

00:34:34.429 --> 00:34:38.659
As Sagiri leaves the hollow she finds Gabi
chilling outside with Senta making a meal

00:34:38.659 --> 00:34:40.329
for the group.

00:34:40.329 --> 00:34:43.780
Outside he brings her upto date, explaining
that while looking for ingredients for their

00:34:43.780 --> 00:34:47.179
meal he took the opportunity to check out
the island a bit more.

00:34:47.179 --> 00:34:50.831
Pretty much he was able to deduce that there
isn't anything resembling the Elixir of Life

00:34:50.831 --> 00:34:52.710
around the area they find themselves in.

00:34:52.710 --> 00:34:56.791
Instead most of the fauna around are a jumble
of different plants that you could find on

00:34:56.791 --> 00:34:59.640
the mainland, with the exception of a few
random flowers.

00:34:59.640 --> 00:35:04.300
Genji suggests that the plants might be from
the Ryuku islands, but Gabi explained what

00:35:04.300 --> 00:35:07.589
really stood out was how all of the Samurai
were in bloom.

00:35:07.589 --> 00:35:11.850
Remember the initial squad that rolled upto
the island with only the one returning, well

00:35:11.850 --> 00:35:16.290
yes sadly they’d all fallen prey to the
island and become apart of it themselves.

00:35:16.290 --> 00:35:18.980
(btw for anyone who’s curious the Ryuku
islands are a stretch of islands south of

00:35:18.980 --> 00:35:19.980
Japan, but still considered apart of their
country.

00:35:19.980 --> 00:35:23.250
In Jigokuraku’s story the islands are probably
the closest pieces of Japanese land to this

00:35:23.250 --> 00:35:25.079
so called Paradise Island)

00:35:25.079 --> 00:35:30.210
Senta (the old-school weeb legend himself)
then gives his input and tells them how the

00:35:30.210 --> 00:35:34.200
statues all scattered about the place seem
to be either Buddhist or Taoist in design,

00:35:34.200 --> 00:35:36.900
yet that isn't actually what intrigues him.

00:35:36.900 --> 00:35:41.450
More he questions if the technology to create
such things even exists on this island or

00:35:41.450 --> 00:35:44.890
if their creator perhaps lives elsewhere before
they brought them here.

00:35:44.890 --> 00:35:49.430
Sagiri believes that its unfeasible for anyone
to live on the island to start with since

00:35:49.430 --> 00:35:52.640
the creatures make it too dangerous for any
humans to exist.

00:35:52.640 --> 00:35:56.810
She then explains how she detected human traits
from the monsters when she was cutting them

00:35:56.810 --> 00:35:59.849
but detected no signs of organs or reproductive
capabilities.

00:35:59.849 --> 00:36:05.109
The monster forms are utterly bizarre with
them possessing some form of humanoid structure,

00:36:05.109 --> 00:36:07.619
but with bugs and other creatures riding atop
them.

00:36:07.619 --> 00:36:12.540
Senta interrupts and explains it a bit better,
we know they’re religious in nature but

00:36:12.540 --> 00:36:16.490
the details aren't exactly right, as if they’re
poorly thought out deities.

00:36:16.490 --> 00:36:21.560
This island and the monsters as a whole, its
all to artificial to be the creations of divine

00:36:21.560 --> 00:36:25.740
creatures, its as if the group had been tossed
into a ill conceived mandala, an unfamiliar

00:36:25.740 --> 00:36:27.930
space with nothing tying them back to reality.

00:36:27.930 --> 00:36:32.470
Growing a crazed expression Gabimaru becomes
manic after hearing that creatures without

00:36:32.470 --> 00:36:37.050
organs exist, to him that sounds like some
form of immortality, so if he can find that

00:36:37.050 --> 00:36:38.810
source he can return home.

00:36:38.810 --> 00:36:43.110
Taking Gabimaru's advice, Senta says that
they should do more research on the monsters

00:36:43.110 --> 00:36:46.800
before travel any deeper and put their lives
in more danger.

00:36:46.800 --> 00:36:51.500
As the sun begins to start setting Genji confronts
Sagiri and demands that she return home on

00:36:51.500 --> 00:36:55.819
the ship, he knows that this isn't a place
for her and due to his criminal passing away

00:36:55.819 --> 00:36:57.680
can take her stead.

00:36:57.680 --> 00:37:02.800
To anyone who decides to stay on the island
will only face death, but Sagiri denies his

00:37:02.800 --> 00:37:06.249
attempts to send her home, wishing to complete
her duties.

00:37:06.249 --> 00:37:09.990
Genji questions her skill though and points
out that the blade she now has is just some

00:37:09.990 --> 00:37:12.080
random one she picked up along the way.

00:37:12.080 --> 00:37:16.590
To anyone in the Yamada clan they know that
the Katana is a warriors spirit and with Sagiri

00:37:16.590 --> 00:37:21.030
having lost hers its as if she's already lost
what made her a Yamada to begin with.

00:37:21.030 --> 00:37:25.210
He doesn't deny that she is truly skilled
with a blade, but this island is different,

00:37:25.210 --> 00:37:29.050
some weird skill is needed to win the battles
here and she’s clearly being held back by

00:37:29.050 --> 00:37:30.599
one majorly defining factor.

00:37:30.599 --> 00:37:31.599
Her Gender.

00:37:31.599 --> 00:37:35.310
(Which is LIKE YO DUDE CHILL, Some weirdo
masculinity vibe coming off you now Genji,

00:37:35.310 --> 00:37:36.310
like man seemed genuine up until he drops
the Gender play.

00:37:36.310 --> 00:37:39.150
Dude’s so unimportant he cant even break
the forth wall and realize this is MANGA Gender

00:37:39.150 --> 00:37:41.180
is the least of your issues for building strength.)

00:37:41.180 --> 00:37:46.310
Meanwhile, the goats Rank 10 Yamada Asaemon
Tenza and his criminal Nurugai are found on

00:37:46.310 --> 00:37:49.230
a small rowing boat attempting to escape the
island.

00:37:49.230 --> 00:37:53.290
Nurugai brings up that even if they do manage
to leave they’ll both die as they’ve returned

00:37:53.290 --> 00:37:54.970
without the elixir.

00:37:54.970 --> 00:37:58.500
Thinking that he can get his way through any
scenario Tenza reassures him that he’ll

00:37:58.500 --> 00:38:02.590
try to convince the higher ups somehow once
they aboard the shogunate's ship.

00:38:02.590 --> 00:38:06.490
Apparently this large vessel is meant to be
anchored nearby for 3 days, allowing them

00:38:06.490 --> 00:38:08.840
to complete the mission and return home.

00:38:08.840 --> 00:38:12.920
Yet after pointing out something he thought
was the boat, they’re both disheartened

00:38:12.920 --> 00:38:18.109
to only find the remains of their ship strewn
in-between long ago destroyed ships, half

00:38:18.109 --> 00:38:19.410
submerged infront of them.

00:38:19.410 --> 00:38:23.000
Nurugai who spotted something out the corner
of his eye, tells Tenza to stop drawing his

00:38:23.000 --> 00:38:27.619
sword but its to late as a massive tentacle
appears behind and swipes at the two.

00:38:27.619 --> 00:38:31.570
Having noticed in time Nurugai was able to
grab his boy and dodge the attack, telling

00:38:31.570 --> 00:38:35.540
him that most creatures are sensitive to shiny
things so they should just look for an escape

00:38:35.540 --> 00:38:36.540
route.

00:38:36.540 --> 00:38:40.221
Unable to find a boat to escape on, the two
become surrounded causing Nurugai to thinks

00:38:40.221 --> 00:38:43.400
back to the time he accidently led soldiers
to his village.

00:38:43.400 --> 00:38:48.140
Back then he was one of the mountain folk,
someone who didnt pledge loyalty to the Shogunate,

00:38:48.140 --> 00:38:49.819
but instead lived traditionally.

00:38:49.819 --> 00:38:53.420
With Japan having certain rules in this time
period that meant people couldn't live this

00:38:53.420 --> 00:38:57.060
way, they were instead considered rebels against
the regime.

00:38:57.060 --> 00:39:02.099
Sadly they used Nurugai to lure out the locations
of his other family and clan members who subsequently

00:39:02.099 --> 00:39:03.760
died from this.

00:39:03.760 --> 00:39:08.370
Once imprisoned himself, Nurugai had meet
Tenza who out of generosity of his heart offered

00:39:08.370 --> 00:39:11.730
him the mission to search for the Elixir of
Life as a way to escape imprisonment.

00:39:11.730 --> 00:39:16.359
Conflicted on what to do Nurugai wonders if
he should die for the sin he committed or

00:39:16.359 --> 00:39:20.859
live on to continue on his village's bloodline
as the last of its name.

00:39:20.859 --> 00:39:24.859
Obviously as we find them stumbling into Kishō's
body which had begun blooming with flowers

00:39:24.859 --> 00:39:28.819
he’d chosen the latter and decided to take
his chances with Tenza on the island.

00:39:28.819 --> 00:39:33.339
As a massive Tentacle destroys even more of
their surroundings, Nurugai looks upon Kishō's

00:39:33.339 --> 00:39:37.050
body and sees the vision of his grandfather’s
last moments, causing him to become frighten

00:39:37.050 --> 00:39:39.050
and drop to his knees.

00:39:39.050 --> 00:39:42.910
Tenza asked what was worrying him, but Nurugai
utterly broken after the decisions he’d

00:39:42.910 --> 00:39:45.790
made in his life notes that it really all
makes sense now.

00:39:45.790 --> 00:39:50.339
All of this is a divine punishment, his true
sentence for causing the death of everyone

00:39:50.339 --> 00:39:51.880
he holds close.

00:39:51.880 --> 00:39:56.320
As a tentacle bears down apon the duo, Tenza
was luckily able to slice it before it took

00:39:56.320 --> 00:40:00.760
out Nurugai and after listening to his explanation
about the Sankha people’s customs, tells

00:40:00.760 --> 00:40:04.830
him that he doesn't care about the customs
he believes in, he just needs to survive.

00:40:04.830 --> 00:40:08.359
With more attacks pushing Tenza to his limit,
he screams that he doesn't wanna hear about

00:40:08.359 --> 00:40:13.280
his grandpa or the village, the real question
is if you want to live or not!

00:40:13.280 --> 00:40:17.480
Thinking back to a peaceful time in the mountains
with his grandfather, Nurugai says that he

00:40:17.480 --> 00:40:20.160
doesn't want to die and instead just wants
to return home.

00:40:20.160 --> 00:40:24.589
Throwing him a sword Tenza points out Kishō’s
boat, telling him to survive as they fight

00:40:24.589 --> 00:40:26.510
their way off the wreckage.

00:40:26.510 --> 00:40:30.110
Teaming up now, the duo are just barely able
to battle their way through the monsters and

00:40:30.110 --> 00:40:34.369
make it safely to the shoreline of Paradise
Island aboard Kishō’s boat.

00:40:34.369 --> 00:40:38.160
From there efforts to escape the island, Tenza
was able to deduce that even if they find

00:40:38.160 --> 00:40:41.069
the elixir its pointless without a way off
the island.

00:40:41.069 --> 00:40:44.430
He points out that one boat did manage to
make it back to the mainland so there has

00:40:44.430 --> 00:40:48.880
to be some sort of escape current, but as
he turns to look at Nurugai he notices something.

00:40:48.880 --> 00:40:53.880
YES thats right I fooled you all or at least
I hope I didnt give it away because its actually

00:40:53.880 --> 00:40:58.130
revealed that while there washing up Tenza
noted that Nurugai looked extremely feminine.

00:40:58.130 --> 00:41:01.830
To which Nurugai says that he is indeed a
girl, shocking the Asaemon.

00:41:01.830 --> 00:41:06.470
With that massive reveal out of the way and
the two funnily joking around, Tenza says

00:41:06.470 --> 00:41:10.950
that moving forwards they have to scout around
to find a proper escape route, but the monsters

00:41:10.950 --> 00:41:12.700
also pose an issue.

00:41:12.700 --> 00:41:17.069
So he proposes the idea of searching for more
allies that also wish to return home which

00:41:17.069 --> 00:41:19.450
in my eyes makes perfect sense.

00:41:19.450 --> 00:41:23.670
(Plus Nurugai is another really dope character,
its funny how weve got a Yamada who looks

00:41:23.670 --> 00:41:27.030
like a chick in Tōma and a criminal that
looked like a dude in Nurugai.

00:41:27.030 --> 00:41:31.420
Kinda just opposing factors on each side and
in my eyes it goes with the entire theme of

00:41:31.420 --> 00:41:35.180
Yin and Yang that later gets spoken about
in much more depth later on.)

00:41:35.180 --> 00:41:38.461
Back over with Genji who’s really keen to
make a point about how this aint no place

00:41:38.461 --> 00:41:42.319
for a woman and Sagiri needs to take a boat
back when dawn came and leaves.

00:41:42.319 --> 00:41:46.099
Half wanting her to leave and half not Senta
believes that it would be the best choice

00:41:46.099 --> 00:41:50.060
for Sagiri to leave but also thinks that she
should stay to watch Gabimaru.

00:41:50.060 --> 00:41:54.250
From what he’s seen so far he can say without
a doubt that Gabimaru was not the same man

00:41:54.250 --> 00:41:55.500
as he was back at Edo.

00:41:55.500 --> 00:42:00.190
It may only be because he knows that he needs
to return with her, but wonders if there is

00:42:00.190 --> 00:42:02.859
some other reason keeping her here.

00:42:02.859 --> 00:42:07.130
With night falling around them, Sagiri decides
that she’ll watch over the group as they

00:42:07.130 --> 00:42:10.920
sleep, but Gabimaru tells her that he literally
doesn't sleep, so there wasn't any need to

00:42:10.920 --> 00:42:11.920
stay up.

00:42:11.920 --> 00:42:15.710
Even still he asked if she was feeling better
as he suspected that after he wounded her

00:42:15.710 --> 00:42:19.940
in there previous battle, the poison from
the butterfly probably speed thru her quicker.

00:42:19.940 --> 00:42:23.400
Due to how she helped him see the light, he
realized that rushing in is only going to

00:42:23.400 --> 00:42:25.440
result in disaster for the group.

00:42:25.440 --> 00:42:29.320
From now on they wont run from anyone that
threatens there chances of survival or the

00:42:29.320 --> 00:42:34.099
possibility to reunite with his wife, they’ll
meet everyone head on.

00:42:34.099 --> 00:42:38.819
Turning to Sagiri he also compliments, believing
she could be even stronger than himself, as

00:42:38.819 --> 00:42:41.300
obviously he does have an eye for strength.

00:42:41.300 --> 00:42:44.680
Reflecting back on the time with her in the
prison he states that even then he’d felt

00:42:44.680 --> 00:42:45.680
her strength.

00:42:45.680 --> 00:42:47.550
They had a saying back in our boys village.

00:42:47.550 --> 00:42:51.339
‘One cannot know ones own strength without
first travelling far and wide.’

00:42:51.339 --> 00:42:55.240
Most people don't even realize their full
strength until they’re forced to act, its

00:42:55.240 --> 00:42:57.010
that way for everyone.

00:42:57.010 --> 00:43:03.190
As dawn begins to rise, Sagiri becomes encouraged
by Gabimaru's words and faces Genji, telling

00:43:03.190 --> 00:43:07.830
him that she appreciates his concern, but
will not leave the island.

00:43:07.830 --> 00:43:11.859
The flipping nob Genji finds this ridiculous,
a womans only role is to bear a child for

00:43:11.859 --> 00:43:13.230
the Yamada clan.

00:43:13.230 --> 00:43:17.280
Having heard that same thing a million times
before, Sagiri explains her grief growing

00:43:17.280 --> 00:43:21.461
up, telling him of how everyone, including
her father, looked down on her for following

00:43:21.461 --> 00:43:25.760
the path of a warrior and that now a fellow
clansman is doing the same.

00:43:25.760 --> 00:43:30.300
She urges Genji to look at her as a samurai,
to acknowledge that this is the path she took,

00:43:30.300 --> 00:43:34.700
man or woman, regardless of someone's situation
they should always be free to choose their

00:43:34.700 --> 00:43:35.700
path.

00:43:35.700 --> 00:43:39.130
This absolute douche though, like Genji what
happened, who hurt you.

00:43:39.130 --> 00:43:42.970
Obviously man is angered by her statement,
saying that this isn't the way of the samurai.

00:43:42.970 --> 00:43:47.270
He draws his blade and goes to strike down
on her, however, as he stands there talking

00:43:47.270 --> 00:43:51.250
smack, its revealed that Sagiri had managed
to disarm and steal his blade completely perplexing

00:43:51.250 --> 00:43:53.100
the bushy eyebrow freak.

00:43:53.100 --> 00:43:57.150
Literally taking a dumb on this mans head,
Sagiri reveals that Genji was originally the

00:43:57.150 --> 00:44:00.140
person who taught her how to steal a blade
in the heat of battle.

00:44:00.140 --> 00:44:05.540
Genji getting even madder screams again that
a KATANA IS THE WARRIORS SOUL, yet unlike

00:44:05.540 --> 00:44:09.550
Sagiri he was unable to notice Rokurōta approaching
them from behind.

00:44:09.550 --> 00:44:14.849
During his time as an infant, Rokurōta had
I think accidentally killed his entire village

00:44:14.849 --> 00:44:19.450
and family by pushing over a tower of stones
he built, sending them shooting off like bullets

00:44:19.450 --> 00:44:24.320
around the area (at least thats what I think
happened).

00:44:24.320 --> 00:44:28.619
Back on the island Genji had managed to turn
in time, but just like during his childhood

00:44:28.619 --> 00:44:32.732
Rokurōta used his infamous palm strike to
connect with the Samurai sending him spinning

00:44:32.732 --> 00:44:34.740
back severely wounded.

00:44:34.740 --> 00:44:38.360
Sagiri runs towards Genji but is about to
be attacked by the giant, luckily for her,

00:44:38.360 --> 00:44:42.500
Gabimaru arrives on time to landing a fat
head kick on Rokurōta, sending him him crashing

00:44:42.500 --> 00:44:44.240
back through their surroundings.

00:44:44.240 --> 00:44:47.859
Noticing that Eizen, Rokutora’s retainer
isn't with him, Sagiri comes to the correct

00:44:47.859 --> 00:44:51.740
conclusion that he’d been taken out as soon
as they landed on the island..

00:44:51.740 --> 00:44:56.240
Gabimaru quickly goes over his two options,
escape or fight, but ultimately decides to

00:44:56.240 --> 00:45:00.510
take on Rokurōta and tells Sagiri to leave
so that she isn't in danger.

00:45:00.510 --> 00:45:04.190
Dodging a massive tree that takes out a few
more behind it, he then looks towards Yuzuriha

00:45:04.190 --> 00:45:09.630
who’s big chilling with Senta and asks for
her assistance.

00:45:09.630 --> 00:45:13.910
Yuzuriha though is like nah and reminds him
of the deal to providing intel while Gabimaru

00:45:13.910 --> 00:45:15.200
deals with fighting.

00:45:15.200 --> 00:45:20.190
Rokurōta strikes at Gabimaru once more, but
he easily manages to jump back out of the

00:45:20.190 --> 00:45:22.830
way and begins to strategizes on how to handle
Rokurōta.

00:45:22.830 --> 00:45:27.460
His instincts tell him its utterly impossible
to guard against the hand, if he’s hit its

00:45:27.460 --> 00:45:28.460
game over.

00:45:28.460 --> 00:45:31.460
Trying something different, he stomps the
ground causing a few rocks to fly up before

00:45:31.460 --> 00:45:36.079
using Ninpo: Stone Storm, sending a plethora
of stones into the body of the massive brute

00:45:36.079 --> 00:45:37.190
infront of him.

00:45:37.190 --> 00:45:42.080
With projectiles not working, he uses Ninpo:
Unformed blade and goes to strike Rokurōta,

00:45:42.080 --> 00:45:45.490
yet his attack is quickly deflected once more
by the hand.

00:45:45.490 --> 00:45:48.980
Not knowing what to use now, he decides to
throw a couple more range attacks BUT as you

00:45:48.980 --> 00:45:54.000
can see by the like what even is that 1,2,3
7 abilities used on the hulking giant not

00:45:54.000 --> 00:45:59.200
a single one worked leaving Gabi completely
confused on his next course of action.

00:45:59.200 --> 00:46:02.740
Meanwhile in the forest behind them, Sagiri
tries to save Genji, which im like girl your

00:46:02.740 --> 00:46:03.770
should straight up leave him there after what
that man was saying b4.

00:46:03.770 --> 00:46:07.809
EVEN Genji who’s still on the weird gender
spiel finds it strange that earlier Sagiri

00:46:07.809 --> 00:46:11.710
had the attitude of a man but now has the
compassion of a woman.

00:46:11.710 --> 00:46:15.270
Screaming at him Sagiri says that it doesn't
matter what she is, she just doesn't want

00:46:15.270 --> 00:46:17.290
to see a comrade die.

00:46:17.290 --> 00:46:22.119
With that said, Genji finally has some sort
of enlightening and realizes that Sagiri's

00:46:22.119 --> 00:46:24.730
conviction was to accept both sides.

00:46:24.730 --> 00:46:28.460
Understanding who she is now, he brings up
his sword and gives it to her to fight Rokurōta

00:46:28.460 --> 00:46:29.460
in his stead.

00:46:29.460 --> 00:46:33.589
He screams at her now that if she's a so called
Samurai then she wont hesitate to cut down

00:46:33.589 --> 00:46:34.849
Rokurōta taking vengeance for him and Eizen.

00:46:34.849 --> 00:46:36.700
Over with Gabi its obvious that he’s still
struggling to find an opening.

00:46:36.700 --> 00:46:37.700
With Rokurōta swinging at him he’s barely
able to dodge the blow, but as he turns around

00:46:37.700 --> 00:46:38.700
he finds that the giant had somehow lost a
finger in their exchange.

00:46:38.700 --> 00:46:41.600
Gabimaru is still struggling with coming up
with a strategy to fight Rokurōta but notices

00:46:41.600 --> 00:46:44.740
that Sagiri appears and swiftly cuts one of
Rokurōta's fingers.

00:46:44.740 --> 00:46:49.800
Its said that any body no matter how sturdy
or unconventional it is, can be cleaved.

00:46:49.800 --> 00:46:53.770
The principles of decapitation will never
change, you just need to know the body's framework

00:46:53.770 --> 00:46:55.980
and work it to find your own openings.

00:46:55.980 --> 00:47:00.890
Standing there together now both Gabimaru
and Sagiri get ready to take down Rokurōta

00:47:00.890 --> 00:47:01.890
together.

00:47:01.890 --> 00:47:06.320
Still big chilling up in the tree, Yuzuriha
watches the two face off against Rokurōta.

00:47:06.320 --> 00:47:11.380
Senta who’s currently pinned up to the tree
branch asks to help Genji but Yuzuriha tells

00:47:11.380 --> 00:47:15.079
him that its too late and its much safer to
stay up in the tree watching the fight.

00:47:15.079 --> 00:47:18.580
Down below, Gabimaru tells Sagiri that it
will be up to her to finish him off with a

00:47:18.580 --> 00:47:20.160
singular cut.

00:47:20.160 --> 00:47:24.110
Sagiri informs him that in order to do so
she will need him on his knees since his neck

00:47:24.110 --> 00:47:25.150
is too high.

00:47:25.150 --> 00:47:29.400
Literally as Gabimaru says he’s sure she
can pull it off Rokurōta throws a punch towards

00:47:29.400 --> 00:47:34.180
Gabimaru but he deflects it with a kick, leaving
her with the perfect opportunity to drop the

00:47:34.180 --> 00:47:35.180
giant.

00:47:35.180 --> 00:47:38.920
Sagiri gets behind Rokurōta and while remembering
her past mentors prepares to cut his right

00:47:38.920 --> 00:47:39.920
leg.

00:47:39.920 --> 00:47:43.770
However stop just before connecting and jumps
back as a thundering backhand comes thru.

00:47:43.770 --> 00:47:48.069
Its shows that she wants to avenge her fallen
comrades so bad that her swordplay is wavering

00:47:48.069 --> 00:47:49.690
and becoming unsteady.

00:47:49.690 --> 00:47:53.630
Trying to compose herself, she barely dodges
a punch directed at the duo.

00:47:53.630 --> 00:47:57.420
Gabimaru himself realizes that he cant deflect
to many more strikes as his leg is already

00:47:57.420 --> 00:47:58.560
beginning to suffer.

00:47:58.560 --> 00:48:03.210
Sagiri tries to cut Rokurōta's arm but fails
once again, noting how his massive size and

00:48:03.210 --> 00:48:06.790
his fighting style is causing his bones to
interfere with her blades path.

00:48:06.790 --> 00:48:11.430
Rokurōta's stomach then loudly rumbles, causing
him to start crying and screaming almost deafening

00:48:11.430 --> 00:48:12.430
everyone around.

00:48:12.430 --> 00:48:16.290
Gabimaru goes to block the noise with his
hands, but as soon as he does the giant takes

00:48:16.290 --> 00:48:19.020
the opening and slams the hollow into the
ground.

00:48:19.020 --> 00:48:23.000
Darting back up almost immediately Gabi tries
to withstand the unreal level of strength

00:48:23.000 --> 00:48:27.170
and almost does, but sadly he succumbs to
the hit and drops to the ground.

00:48:27.170 --> 00:48:31.020
Panicking now he screams at himself to get
up as it wasn't a fatal attack, though if

00:48:31.020 --> 00:48:33.690
he doesn't move soon hell be annihilated.

00:48:33.690 --> 00:48:37.819
Coming to his aid Sagiri gets infront of Rokurōta’s
next attack but quickly realizes if she doesn't

00:48:37.819 --> 00:48:39.540
move aswell she’ll die.

00:48:39.540 --> 00:48:43.460
Telling herself to calm down, suppress her
emotions and be rational as she has chosen

00:48:43.460 --> 00:48:44.460
that way to live.

00:48:44.460 --> 00:48:48.000
Sagiri is able to figure out that there is
no distinction between the two, and accepting

00:48:48.000 --> 00:48:51.130
both emotion and reason will allow her to
move forward.

00:48:51.130 --> 00:48:55.579
Unlike other members of the Yamada Clan, Sagiri
hasn't seen enough battle to make her a true

00:48:55.579 --> 00:48:59.480
soldier, but when she's on a mission and her
goals and spirit align, when all doubts leave

00:48:59.480 --> 00:49:00.480
her blade.

00:49:00.480 --> 00:49:02.740
Her swordplay is unparalleled.

00:49:02.740 --> 00:49:06.940
Once the insane bout finally comes to an end
its shown that Sagiri was able to drop the

00:49:06.940 --> 00:49:08.430
giant onto his ass.

00:49:08.430 --> 00:49:12.109
She quickly darts in behind him and attempts
to deal the finishing blow, but just as quickly

00:49:12.109 --> 00:49:16.970
as she got in behind, Rokurōta sprung back
realizing that the next attack would be fatal.

00:49:16.970 --> 00:49:20.869
Seeing as how normal moves weren't working,
Gabimaru comes up with a plan but tells his

00:49:20.869 --> 00:49:23.640
partner that it may be slightly extreme.

00:49:23.640 --> 00:49:28.780
After analyzing the situation, Gabimaru pulls
his clothing up over his face and bursts into

00:49:28.780 --> 00:49:29.780
flames.

00:49:29.780 --> 00:49:33.650
Taking out some balls, Gabi uses uses Ninpo:
Ascetic Blaze Mode to send them shooting towards

00:49:33.650 --> 00:49:35.960
Rokurōta, who just knocks them away.

00:49:35.960 --> 00:49:40.240
Following up he combines Ninpo: Zephyr Weave
and Blaze mode to send some flames towards

00:49:40.240 --> 00:49:41.240
the giant.

00:49:41.240 --> 00:49:45.680
Then using another multitude of techniques
Gabimaru attacks the Giant of Bizen over and

00:49:45.680 --> 00:49:49.410
over again, but his opponent somehow manages
to repel every single attack.

00:49:49.410 --> 00:49:54.150
Over with Yuzuriha who decided to gap it earlier
knowing what Gabimaru was actually planning

00:49:54.150 --> 00:49:59.140
tells Senta that Gabi wasn't actually targeting
Rokurōta, no he was going to burn down the

00:49:59.140 --> 00:50:02.890
forest and use the smoke to suffocate their
opponent.

00:50:02.890 --> 00:50:06.940
Once the smaller branches and leaves all light
up, the whole area will be covered with smoke

00:50:06.940 --> 00:50:09.250
that creates a canopy concentrated overhead.

00:50:09.250 --> 00:50:14.790
Bit of a science lesson here, so smoke is
made up of carbon monoxide, carbon dioxide

00:50:14.790 --> 00:50:16.369
and particulate matter.

00:50:16.369 --> 00:50:20.950
What actually effects us is the Carbon monoxide
as it binds with the hemoglobin's in our blood

00:50:20.950 --> 00:50:23.160
even more readily than oxygen.

00:50:23.160 --> 00:50:26.900
This causes the body to instantly be deprived
of air, hence why most people in fires die

00:50:26.900 --> 00:50:30.390
to carbon monoxide poisoning, not the actual
fire.

00:50:30.390 --> 00:50:34.420
Back in the battle and due to the effects,
Rokurōta falls to his knees, giving Sagiri

00:50:34.420 --> 00:50:37.050
an opportunity to finally strike him down.

00:50:37.050 --> 00:50:41.820
Rokurōta notices her and tries to retaliate,
but Gabimaru rushes in and holds down his

00:50:41.820 --> 00:50:42.820
hand.

00:50:42.820 --> 00:50:46.200
He screams at her to hurry as his muscles
cant hold on for much longer.

00:50:46.200 --> 00:50:47.690
Hearing this and becoming tranquil, yet intense
Sagiri becomes one with her blade and swings

00:50:47.690 --> 00:50:51.250
the sword down.

00:50:51.250 --> 00:50:57.430
In his final moments, Rokurōta remembers
his past, wandering aimlessly searching for

00:50:57.430 --> 00:50:59.550
someone to play.

00:50:59.550 --> 00:51:03.609
Obviously from what weve seen with Rokurōta,
like im not gonna slide on his actions but

00:51:03.609 --> 00:51:07.610
its fairly evident the dude still has the
mind of a child and never really grew up.

00:51:07.610 --> 00:51:12.559
Either way Sagiri apologizes to him and lays
his soul to rest, telling him that no-body

00:51:12.559 --> 00:51:15.260
resents him anymore.

00:51:15.260 --> 00:51:19.460
As the fire begins to get closer, Gabi says
its probably best they leave incase the fire

00:51:19.460 --> 00:51:21.470
attracts unwanted visitors.

00:51:21.470 --> 00:51:26.100
While running away, Sagiri remembers Genji
who’s still wounded resting up against a

00:51:26.100 --> 00:51:27.100
tree.

00:51:27.100 --> 00:51:31.660
Though after realizing she’ll perish if
she returns, makes the decision to leave,

00:51:31.660 --> 00:51:35.040
telling herself that she must accept both
her strengths and weaknesses.

00:51:35.040 --> 00:51:39.799
(Which like yo I think Sagiri is onto something
with this Strong Weak thing haha, this is

00:51:39.799 --> 00:51:45.090
my second read thru now before making the
video and oml you just notice so many things

00:51:45.090 --> 00:51:47.589
early on that are foreshadowed in such brilliant
ways.

00:51:47.589 --> 00:51:53.130
If you all didnt know From 2016 to 2018, Yuki
actually worked as an assistant to Tatsuki

00:51:53.130 --> 00:51:57.430
Fujimoto with his work on Fire Punch before
beginning this series later in 2018.

00:51:57.430 --> 00:52:01.900
So its dope to see that greatness breeds greatness
and tbh I don't necessarily see similarities

00:52:01.900 --> 00:52:11.840
between their works, but I just love knowing
that these goats worked together.)

00:52:11.840 --> 00:52:15.490
As expected all of the nearby monsters are
lured towards the flames, which is already

00:52:15.490 --> 00:52:20.140
starting to die down due to the thick level
of mist and humidity around the island.

00:52:20.140 --> 00:52:24.410
Gabimaru suggests heading in the direction
all of the creatures came as despite his injuries

00:52:24.410 --> 00:52:28.599
they’ve really got no other choice if they
want to find leads about the elixir of life.

00:52:28.599 --> 00:52:32.700
As they start to leave Sagiri asks if they
should just take a moment to recover, but

00:52:32.700 --> 00:52:35.590
Gabimaru starts freaking out claiming that
it doesn't matter how dangerous it is they

00:52:35.590 --> 00:52:38.510
just need to find that elixir and make it
back to his wife.

00:52:38.510 --> 00:52:42.510
He asks if Sagiri is worried about all of
her other comrades but she states that everyone

00:52:42.510 --> 00:52:46.309
who took this mission, took it knowing the
insane danger that if held.

00:52:46.309 --> 00:52:49.640
Having concern for them would only in Sagiri’s
eyes dishonor their resolve.

00:52:49.640 --> 00:52:53.799
If she has time to worry about them, then
she also has time to be searching for the

00:52:53.799 --> 00:52:56.810
elixir as a way to also free them from this
hellish mission.

00:52:56.810 --> 00:53:00.369
Hearing this Gabi notes that it seems as if
they’re finally on the same page and while

00:53:00.369 --> 00:53:04.630
running soon catches upto Yuzuriha and Senta
who are stood their in shook looking down

00:53:04.630 --> 00:53:05.950
apon something.

00:53:05.950 --> 00:53:09.760
Coming up behind them, both Gabi and Sagiri
notice that the others had found an abandoned

00:53:09.760 --> 00:53:10.760
village.

00:53:10.760 --> 00:53:14.310
Senta comes to the conclusion that if they
are truly in Shinsenkyo the village must be

00:53:14.310 --> 00:53:15.750
where the Hermits live.

00:53:15.750 --> 00:53:20.830
Which if I haven't mentioned it Shinsenkyo
is the Japanese name for the ancient Chinese

00:53:20.830 --> 00:53:25.240
version of paradise, populated by immortal
gods and mountain hermits, hence how Senta

00:53:25.240 --> 00:53:29.809
has gathered the information for Hermits living
in so called villages.

00:53:29.809 --> 00:53:57.839
Back over with 

00:53:57.839 --> 00:54:00.710
the bruuuutal brothers, like I love these
two.

00:54:00.710 --> 00:54:05.530
Like oml I forgot, but here is when Chōbei
goes full beast mode and began eating the

00:54:05.530 --> 00:54:10.890
various monsters of the island as a form of
fluid to stay hydrated.

00:54:10.890 --> 00:54:14.800
While this is going on Tōma explains to him
that there is a possibility fictional beings

00:54:14.800 --> 00:54:16.460
called Hermits residing on the island.

00:54:16.460 --> 00:54:20.430
They’re based on the old Chinese mountain
hermits, but despite their old age they are

00:54:20.430 --> 00:54:23.210
actually immortal beings that wield strange
magic.

00:54:23.210 --> 00:54:27.540
Shinsenkyo is really meant to be home to these
hermits and not monsters, so Tōma wouldn't

00:54:27.540 --> 00:54:29.540
be surprised if they ran into them here.

00:54:29.540 --> 00:54:33.730
Chōbei jokes that hell just turn those old
fools into another meal, though as they move

00:54:33.730 --> 00:54:38.460
deeper into the foliage of the jungle Tōma
notices something or someone nearby.

00:54:38.460 --> 00:54:43.069
Getting closer its shown that in an opening
atop a fallen statue two beautiful woman are

00:54:43.069 --> 00:54:44.839
basking in the sunlight.

00:54:44.839 --> 00:54:48.630
With all four of them noticing each other
simultaneously one of the random girls atop

00:54:48.630 --> 00:54:53.250
the statue wonders why humans are here, becoming
enraged at the thought that the Soshin Guardian

00:54:53.250 --> 00:54:55.240
Deities were slacking off.

00:54:55.240 --> 00:54:59.470
(So as Senta suspected all of those Creatures
seemed to be some form of poorly thought out

00:54:59.470 --> 00:55:01.510
deities created by someone.)

00:55:01.510 --> 00:55:05.490
Eitherway back in the battle Chōbei readies
himself while pointing out that the girls

00:55:05.490 --> 00:55:07.500
are probably another form of monster.

00:55:07.500 --> 00:55:11.650
One of those apparent monsters snidely asks
if they’d like to lay with them, causing

00:55:11.650 --> 00:55:14.670
the brothers to get hell confused by exactly
what she meant.

00:55:14.670 --> 00:55:17.890
The other one stands up and literally changes
into a male form while cursing them out over

00:55:17.890 --> 00:55:18.910
having lost his solidity.

00:55:18.910 --> 00:55:22.480
(Man really got blue balled) He slams his
hand closed causing the fruit to explode and

00:55:22.480 --> 00:55:25.680
letting the brothers know that now they must
die.

00:55:25.680 --> 00:55:30.490
Back with Gabimaru as they look over the village,
the ninja states that it did not matter what

00:55:30.490 --> 00:55:35.020
was living on the island, what matters is
if the inhabitants are allies or enemies.

00:55:35.020 --> 00:55:38.410
Directly behind the main group, a girl in
a hood is then seen watching them from behind

00:55:38.410 --> 00:55:39.780
a tree.

00:55:39.780 --> 00:55:43.520
Gabimaru turns and notices someone causing
the spy to run off but Gabi manages to quickly

00:55:43.520 --> 00:55:47.760
catch the spy and after removing the hood
discovers that its just a young girl.

00:55:47.760 --> 00:55:51.670
While he wonders if its someone who’s native
to the island a branch comes thru and almost

00:55:51.670 --> 00:55:52.690
takes his head off.

00:55:52.690 --> 00:55:57.000
Its shown that a random looking tree dude,
everyone's favorite bonsai man, kinda like

00:55:57.000 --> 00:56:01.109
groot from guardians of the galaxy had managed
to push Gabi back.

00:56:01.109 --> 00:56:04.780
Thinking the girl might know something about
the island, Gabimaru decides to run after

00:56:04.780 --> 00:56:08.790
her, he manages to dodge another thundering
blow from the tree, before spinning in the

00:56:08.790 --> 00:56:11.740
air and using the back of the monster to boost
himself towards the girl.

00:56:11.740 --> 00:56:16.160
Since Sagiri is still caught up on the original
missions hierarchy she quickly runs after

00:56:16.160 --> 00:56:19.270
him and leaves the rest to Yuzuriha and Senta.

00:56:19.270 --> 00:56:23.400
Yuzuriha being the sneaky Kunoichi she is
flicks off Senta's glasses so he can't see

00:56:23.400 --> 00:56:27.040
her abilities and decides to take on the tree
monster with her ninjutsu.

00:56:27.040 --> 00:56:30.890
Nearby Gabimaru manages to catches up to the
girl but as he asks to just have a chat is

00:56:30.890 --> 00:56:34.200
shocked by her strength after she picks him
up before throwing him into a tree.

00:56:34.200 --> 00:56:38.150
Sagiri yells to her that they don't intend
to harm her, however, the girl stops in the

00:56:38.150 --> 00:56:40.660
forest, turns and throws a punch towards Sagiri.

00:56:40.660 --> 00:56:44.880
Gabimaru blocks the punch but as he tries
to push back notices that she is using a mysterious

00:56:44.880 --> 00:56:46.950
power behind her attack.

00:56:46.950 --> 00:56:50.829
Being pushed back by this random power Gabi
starts to ponder what it could possibly be.

00:56:50.829 --> 00:56:54.360
Ever since he came to this island there have
been so many mysteries.

00:56:54.360 --> 00:56:58.740
He thought it’d just be a simple mission
to find the elixir and return home, but how

00:56:58.740 --> 00:57:00.830
he’s becoming desperate.

00:57:00.830 --> 00:57:04.830
Gabimaru starts to act serious and as he dives
at her uses the vines behind him on the tree

00:57:04.830 --> 00:57:07.860
to captures her before she even realized what
had happened.

00:57:07.860 --> 00:57:11.830
Hanging there restrained in the tree, intimated
by Gabi’s now serious demeanor, the girl

00:57:11.830 --> 00:57:16.280
starts crying, prompting Sagiri to tell Gabimaru
to bring her down and let her calm her down.

00:57:16.280 --> 00:57:21.360
Seeing her in a helpless state, Gabimaru figures
that she was just an ordinary girl.

00:57:21.360 --> 00:57:25.010
Yuzuriha arrives after finishing her business
with the tree monster and asked how things

00:57:25.010 --> 00:57:26.770
were going on their end.

00:57:26.770 --> 00:57:30.770
Gabimaru wanted to ask her about the elixir
but Sagiri says that it wouldn't be possible

00:57:30.770 --> 00:57:31.990
with her crying.

00:57:31.990 --> 00:57:35.940
Suddenly, the tree monster started talking,
pleading with them to let go of the child

00:57:35.940 --> 00:57:40.069
and in exchange that it would tell them about
the elixir and guide them to the village.

00:57:40.069 --> 00:57:44.810
Speaking up Yuzuriha believes that its a trap
as up until now the bonsai dude hadn't said

00:57:44.810 --> 00:57:45.810
anything.

00:57:45.810 --> 00:57:48.819
After persuading her by mentioning that there
is a bath though, the group follows him to

00:57:48.819 --> 00:57:52.609
the village with Yuzuriha overly excited about
that bath.

00:57:52.609 --> 00:57:57.059
Hanging back behind them, Sagiri asks Gabi
whether they should trust him or not.

00:57:57.059 --> 00:58:01.430
Left with really no other options he says
its probably best because he may know about

00:58:01.430 --> 00:58:06.160
the elixir but also tells her that if the
tree man is lying he will take it down.

00:58:06.160 --> 00:58:09.710
Hearing the others chat behind them, the tree
man promises that it will not trick them and

00:58:09.710 --> 00:58:14.140
calms Senta by letting him know that the monster
and butterflies wont come near the village.

00:58:14.140 --> 00:58:18.400
He also reveals that those so called monsters
are like i've said just before called the

00:58:18.400 --> 00:58:20.920
Sōshin, guardians of the island.

00:58:20.920 --> 00:58:25.130
According to master Tree they provide wisdom
and punish those who turn from the teachings.

00:58:25.130 --> 00:58:29.870
He himself isn't one of them but instead used
to be human and was raised on the island.

00:58:29.870 --> 00:58:32.770
These Soshin are actually called Kamadogami
in Japanese.

00:58:32.770 --> 00:58:37.310
They are known as tutelary deities of the
kitchen and household in Chinese mythology

00:58:37.310 --> 00:58:38.369
and Daoism.

00:58:38.369 --> 00:58:43.130
Funnily enough the most famous of all the
Soshin deities was Zao Jun, who also went

00:58:43.130 --> 00:58:44.790
by the moniker ‘Kitchen God’.

00:58:44.790 --> 00:58:48.940
In this universe they mainly take on the role
as a fodder monsters who punish people that

00:58:48.940 --> 00:58:50.590
break the islands rules.

00:58:50.590 --> 00:58:51.590
Anyway!

00:58:51.590 --> 00:58:54.640
They arrive at the village which at this point
is really just a town in ruins and entered

00:58:54.640 --> 00:58:56.180
the tree mans house.

00:58:56.180 --> 00:59:00.520
While Yuzuriha and Sagiri take a bath which
I aahhh cant show on here, lets just say that

00:59:00.520 --> 00:59:02.099
Yuki loves drawing his girls for now hahaha.

00:59:02.099 --> 00:59:05.770
Outside of the bath tho the others apart from
Gabi cause he thinks its poisoned eat some

00:59:05.770 --> 00:59:07.690
delicious looking fruit.

00:59:07.690 --> 00:59:11.430
Moments later both of the girls return and
the tree man goes more in-depth explaining

00:59:11.430 --> 00:59:13.540
the ins and outs of the island.

00:59:13.540 --> 00:59:17.930
Humans may call the island another name but
to him its known as Kotaku, a paradise for

00:59:17.930 --> 00:59:18.930
the Gods.

00:59:18.930 --> 00:59:23.680
There is indeed an elixir of life on the island
thats found in the ancient text.

00:59:23.680 --> 00:59:28.410
Here it goes by the name ‘Tan’ and pretty
much means the source for everlasting life.

00:59:28.410 --> 00:59:32.410
The tree man gives a lay out of the island,
which is broken into 3 distinctive regions.

00:59:32.410 --> 00:59:37.540
Eishu is where they arrived on the island,
Hojo is where the village is located and the

00:59:37.540 --> 00:59:40.410
elixir, is located at the center of the island
called Hōrai.

00:59:40.410 --> 00:59:43.800
In our own world this is the name for the
Chinese Penglai.

00:59:43.800 --> 00:59:47.670
A place said to be a mountain on a random
island in the eastern sea’s of mythological

00:59:47.670 --> 00:59:51.160
China which was home to 8 immortal hermits
of Taoist thought.

00:59:51.160 --> 00:59:55.910
Craaazily enough in a weirdly similar parallel
to this story, during the third century BCE,

00:59:55.910 --> 01:00:00.961
a Qin Dynasty sorcerer named Xu Fu set out
on a mission to find this Penglai and an elixir

01:00:00.961 --> 01:00:01.961
of life.

01:00:01.961 --> 01:00:05.880
Instead though some historical text’s suggest
that he actually found Japan and the mountain

01:00:05.880 --> 01:00:08.349
that would later be named Mount Fuji.

01:00:08.349 --> 01:00:12.160
Continuing with our real world parallels,
both Eishu and Hojo, the other area’s of

01:00:12.160 --> 01:00:17.420
the islands in Hells Paradise are the Japanese
names for two Chinese fantasy islands, both

01:00:17.420 --> 01:00:19.930
Yingzhou and Fangzhang respectively.

01:00:19.930 --> 01:00:24.099
Just love how much mythology and history is
weaved into this story, its truly fantastic

01:00:24.099 --> 01:00:27.820
and just goes to show that Yuki really has
a great understanding of his own countries

01:00:27.820 --> 01:00:28.820
past.

01:00:28.820 --> 01:00:29.820
Anyways continuing forwards!

01:00:29.820 --> 01:00:34.380
Gabi who still doesn't trust this dude asks
him if he’s ever seen the elixir, but Mr

01:00:34.380 --> 01:00:37.609
Tree hasn't although he knows he benefits
from its effects.

01:00:37.609 --> 01:00:41.380
Senta asks if he’s one of these immortals
then as he’s implied he’s been around

01:00:41.380 --> 01:00:42.680
for 1000 years.

01:00:42.680 --> 01:00:47.349
Sitting there the Tree just says that they
will encounter them sooner or later and once

01:00:47.349 --> 01:00:49.560
they do their doubts will be erased.

01:00:49.560 --> 01:00:54.960
For this man, Lord Tensen is, forever young,
undying, beauty incarnate, the perfect being.

01:00:54.960 --> 01:00:59.780
At a similar time, remember how the brothers
bumped into a couple gender benders, WELL

01:00:59.780 --> 01:01:04.160
it turns out that they are absolutely stuffed
as Lord Tensen was one or both of those beings

01:01:04.160 --> 01:01:08.589
and took great pleasure in absolutely obliterating
the pathetic humans who stood in its way.

01:01:08.589 --> 01:01:13.609
Yeah so like the tree man was implying, they
are kinda stuffed if they bump into this immortal

01:01:13.609 --> 01:01:14.609
being.

01:01:14.609 --> 01:01:18.299
Like Tōma and Chōbei were absolutely insane,
especially Chōbei the man didnt care what

01:01:18.299 --> 01:01:22.880
he went up against, yet he was defeated in
a matter of moments.

01:01:22.880 --> 01:01:27.150
After hearing about Lord Tensen, Gabimaru
and Yuzuriha point their weapons towards the

01:01:27.150 --> 01:01:29.160
monster, believing that it wants them to die.

01:01:29.160 --> 01:01:33.500
The monster corrects them and says that it
holds no hostility, only speaking the truth

01:01:33.500 --> 01:01:35.819
about those who step onto the island.

01:01:35.819 --> 01:01:40.839
Meanwhile, the mysterious being carries Tōma
and Chōbei before them down a pit of blooming

01:01:40.839 --> 01:01:42.130
humans.

01:01:42.130 --> 01:01:46.920
These beings are the commanders of the Soshin,
they pass judgment on mainly the sinful humans

01:01:46.920 --> 01:01:48.150
who come to the island.

01:01:48.150 --> 01:01:52.750
One dropped into this pit its said people
are reborn as beautiful blossoms freed from

01:01:52.750 --> 01:01:56.740
the sin and earthly desires, granting them
everlasting bliss.

01:01:56.740 --> 01:02:01.349
Those who eventually become one with the island
are the source of Tan.

01:02:01.349 --> 01:02:05.410
The tree man proves that the elixir does indeed
exist by breaking a part of its hand and showing

01:02:05.410 --> 01:02:07.859
Gabi’s crew that it can regenerate.

01:02:07.859 --> 01:02:11.339
Gabimaru then points his sword towards the
girl wondering if she also benefits from the

01:02:11.339 --> 01:02:15.390
elixir but Sagiri and Yuzuriha criticizes
him for his rude behavior, scolding him for

01:02:15.390 --> 01:02:17.310
pointing a weapon at a child.

01:02:17.310 --> 01:02:20.630
The tree man proceeds to explain that they
can choose to believe it or not, but this

01:02:20.630 --> 01:02:21.630
is Shinsenkyo.

01:02:21.630 --> 01:02:25.599
A land of Gods that fell down to this poor
state centuries ago.

01:02:25.599 --> 01:02:29.420
Escape from the island is impossible and the
gods will be the ones to cast judgement on

01:02:29.420 --> 01:02:30.420
them.

01:02:30.420 --> 01:02:34.180
Meanwhile, Tenza and Nurugai who’ve been
out searching for an ocean current fail to

01:02:34.180 --> 01:02:35.180
find one.

01:02:35.180 --> 01:02:39.589
Since they need to come up with another strategy
they start to plan one, when all of a sudden

01:02:39.589 --> 01:02:41.329
they’re approach by an unknown woman.

01:02:41.329 --> 01:02:45.170
After noting that the forest is indeed full
of activity, she becomes angered by the amount

01:02:45.170 --> 01:02:47.470
of Sōshin corpses she discovers on the island.

01:02:47.470 --> 01:02:50.160
After asking if they were responsible, the
woman’s face begins morphing as it turns

01:02:50.160 --> 01:02:51.420
into a man.

01:02:51.420 --> 01:02:54.740
Feeling threaten, Tenza and Nurugai attempt
to run but the man instantly appears in front

01:02:54.740 --> 01:02:57.570
of Tenza and strikes him with some form of
attack sonic boom attack.

01:02:57.570 --> 01:03:01.790
As Tenza begins falling to the ground, the
godly being flashes in behind Nurugai and

01:03:01.790 --> 01:03:06.480
tries to take her out aswell but luckily she
manages to jump back dodging the attack.

01:03:06.480 --> 01:03:11.410
Tenza then appears in front of the creature
and slashes his eyes, however, its shown that

01:03:11.410 --> 01:03:14.390
its utterly useless as they’d managed to
heal the damage.

01:03:14.390 --> 01:03:18.430
Needing to make an opening to escape, Tenza
rapidly slashes away at the man, thinking

01:03:18.430 --> 01:03:20.630
it'll allow them enough time to escape with
Nurugai.

01:03:20.630 --> 01:03:24.970
Instantly though, the being heals and once
again appears right infront of Tenza.

01:03:24.970 --> 01:03:29.240
Then coming in and seemingly saving the day,
the creature is caught off guard by the BLIND

01:03:29.240 --> 01:03:35.069
KING Rank 4 Yamada Asaemon Shion's sword throw,
giving his fellow humans a moment to escape.

01:03:35.069 --> 01:03:39.700
After getting far away from the man, Tenza
introduces Nurugai to his savior and genuine

01:03:39.700 --> 01:03:42.170
blade master Yamada Asaemon Shion.

01:03:42.170 --> 01:03:46.520
Slapping him on the head though, Shion scolds
Tenza for using only his speed in his swordplay

01:03:46.520 --> 01:03:48.180
against his opponent, stating that he could
hear how messy his footwork was.

01:03:48.180 --> 01:03:52.520
Wanting to know why he’s here now, Tenza
asks Shion what happened with his criminal.

01:03:52.520 --> 01:03:57.579
Originally Shion was in charge of Akaginu,
but after she tried to seduce him, she paid

01:03:57.579 --> 01:03:58.579
with her life.

01:03:58.579 --> 01:04:00.700
Which is crazy hahaha, she just wanted a friend
dude.

01:04:00.700 --> 01:04:03.970
Either way after leaving her, he managed to
find a current that could lead them away from

01:04:03.970 --> 01:04:08.819
the island, however, he pointed out that he
sensed an unfamiliar presence and heard weird

01:04:08.819 --> 01:04:09.819
noises.

01:04:09.819 --> 01:04:12.900
Tenza says that the three of them should go
to the spot where he found the current, but

01:04:12.900 --> 01:04:16.460
Shion raises his sword and asked why he was
helping his criminal.

01:04:16.460 --> 01:04:20.289
Tenza explains that she was innocent, however
Shion literally isn't having it.

01:04:20.289 --> 01:04:24.390
Before arriving on the island he memorized
every criminal with them and knows what they’ve

01:04:24.390 --> 01:04:25.390
done.

01:04:25.390 --> 01:04:28.279
Even though she’s not a criminal in both
of their eyes, it isn't up to them to decide

01:04:28.279 --> 01:04:29.279
what wrong and right is.

01:04:29.279 --> 01:04:33.339
It is the Era that they live in which decides
the crimes people commit.

01:04:33.339 --> 01:04:38.190
Tenza rebuttals him and brings up how he himself
used to be just a wanderer without any purpose

01:04:38.190 --> 01:04:39.190
in life.

01:04:39.190 --> 01:04:43.130
There was no reason for Shion to save him
back then, yet he still decided to take him

01:04:43.130 --> 01:04:44.220
off the street.

01:04:44.220 --> 01:04:48.240
Now in a similar situation of his own Tenza
wanted to do the same for her as he see’s

01:04:48.240 --> 01:04:51.450
a potential for her to live a real life in
the world.

01:04:51.450 --> 01:04:55.710
Remembering the past and realizing just how
far Tenza had truly came from the day he meet

01:04:55.710 --> 01:04:59.029
him, Shion is convinced and allows his student
to do as he pleases.

01:04:59.029 --> 01:05:03.029
Nurugai greets her future husbands master
by calling him sensei to which Shion like

01:05:03.029 --> 01:05:07.300
the goat he isn't, says she needn't call him
that since he had not taught her anything.

01:05:07.300 --> 01:05:10.560
Wanting to quickly head back to the beach,
Shion tells Tenza to chill out as they need

01:05:10.560 --> 01:05:13.790
to be caution of the mysterious being that
they just faced before.

01:05:13.790 --> 01:05:17.250
Its best that instead of making themselves
a target they need to take their time and

01:05:17.250 --> 01:05:18.440
come up with a strategy.

01:05:18.440 --> 01:05:22.950
However, as Tenza begins to ponder what they
should do, the Godly thing drops down into

01:05:22.950 --> 01:05:27.099
the middle of the forest now appearing as
a female and saying that they’ve underestimated

01:05:27.099 --> 01:05:28.099
it.

01:05:28.099 --> 01:05:31.579
Daddy Shion moves the two out of the way but
has his throat cut in the process.

01:05:31.579 --> 01:05:35.450
Tenza fights back, yet he’s unable to hit
the creature at all as it dives in and out

01:05:35.450 --> 01:05:36.789
of his swings.

01:05:36.789 --> 01:05:41.069
Needing to make a stand, Tenza uses his ultimate
technique; Itto-Ryu Pounding Torrent.

01:05:41.069 --> 01:05:46.610
Swinging his sword over and over again creating
an unescapable wave of slashes.

01:05:46.610 --> 01:05:50.170
The female though is of a different skill
level and easily manages to weave through

01:05:50.170 --> 01:05:53.839
all of his strikes before confronting him
directly stating that she’s accustomed to

01:05:53.839 --> 01:05:54.839
his speed.

01:05:54.839 --> 01:05:58.860
Tapping him 3 different times on the chest,
Tenza is sadly downed by another use of that

01:05:58.860 --> 01:06:03.579
mysterious technique, leaving the other screaming
out for their falling ally.

01:06:03.579 --> 01:06:07.549
Falling into a memory from his past, Tenza
recalls the time he asks Shion why he even

01:06:07.549 --> 01:06:08.549
picked hi up off the street.

01:06:08.549 --> 01:06:09.549
a young Tenza asked Shion why he picked him
off of the street.

01:06:09.549 --> 01:06:13.510
Shion says that due to how his profession
is to end lives, he likes to help out others

01:06:13.510 --> 01:06:15.260
and saw potential in him.

01:06:15.260 --> 01:06:19.770
Back in the present, Tenza drops to his knee’s
and while looking at his palms realizes that

01:06:19.770 --> 01:06:22.750
he’s currently dying from the previous attacks.

01:06:22.750 --> 01:06:27.109
As the god stands over him, its obvious that
if he doesn't do something everyone else is

01:06:27.109 --> 01:06:29.310
going to end up just like him.

01:06:29.310 --> 01:06:32.920
SCREAMING he rises to his feet and attempts
to fights back throwing a fat right hook into

01:06:32.920 --> 01:06:34.869
the face of the immortal creature.

01:06:34.869 --> 01:06:38.010
He knows that this is probably it for him,
but he’ll do whatever he can now to make

01:06:38.010 --> 01:06:40.079
enough time for the others to escape.

01:06:40.079 --> 01:06:44.990
However, Tenza receives another fatal blow
to his stomach catching him by surprise.

01:06:44.990 --> 01:06:49.069
With nothing left to do, battered and bruised
Tenza tries to telling Nurugai to run, but

01:06:49.069 --> 01:06:51.819
he cant properly muster the strength to say
a word.

01:06:51.819 --> 01:06:55.059
Luckily Shion was able to reach out and stop
Nurugai from trying to help.

01:06:55.059 --> 01:06:59.589
Not wanting to leave his student alone and
unable to understand what Tenza is trying

01:06:59.589 --> 01:07:03.140
to say, Shion takes his stand ready to save
his wounded friend.

01:07:03.140 --> 01:07:07.619
Knowing that his sensei wont stand a chance,
Tenza tries to muster just one word to tell

01:07:07.619 --> 01:07:11.579
him to leave or run away, but just like with
Nurugai, he’s unable to muster anything

01:07:11.579 --> 01:07:12.710
but a shot gurgle.

01:07:12.710 --> 01:07:17.760
Sensing something, Shion jumps back and stops
his assault before running away with Nurugai.

01:07:17.760 --> 01:07:23.660
Back behind them, the legend himself Tenza
takes his final stand and hinders the immortal

01:07:23.660 --> 01:07:25.730
foe’s attempts to chase the others.

01:07:25.730 --> 01:07:30.520
Now deeper in the forest, his sensei screams
in pain while fleeing with Tenza’s chosen

01:07:30.520 --> 01:07:31.520
disciple.

01:07:31.520 --> 01:07:35.220
In his final moments, Tenza imagines what
his life could have been like in the future,

01:07:35.220 --> 01:07:39.020
seeing himself possibly teaching a bunch of
young students or drinking with all of his

01:07:39.020 --> 01:07:41.180
buddies on a beautiful day.

01:07:41.180 --> 01:07:45.660
Over with the others as they flee, Nurugai
screams and hits Shion wanting to know why,

01:07:45.660 --> 01:07:47.609
why is he leaving Tenza behind.

01:07:47.609 --> 01:07:51.910
With his throat starting to recover, he explains
that he was honoring Tenza's last wishes.

01:07:51.910 --> 01:07:55.650
Tenza knew that they wouldn't be able to defeat
these creatures they way they are now and

01:07:55.650 --> 01:07:58.680
if they stayed they all would've shared the
same fate.

01:07:58.680 --> 01:08:03.261
Retreat was the only way, however he states
that this debt will be paid, before they flee

01:08:03.261 --> 01:08:08.140
the island they will beat it.

01:08:08.140 --> 01:08:13.849
Meanwhile, as Gabi prepares to take a bath,
him and Sagiri think back on the moments earlier.

01:08:13.849 --> 01:08:18.109
They know that both Mei and the tree who goes
by Hoko were born and raised on the island.

01:08:18.109 --> 01:08:21.779
They’ve lived here for centuries and only
wish to live in peace.

01:08:21.779 --> 01:08:26.170
Senta the big brain also knows that in China’s
Shenxian beliefs, Tensen refers to an elite

01:08:26.170 --> 01:08:27.690
type of mystical hermit.

01:08:27.690 --> 01:08:32.850
These Soshin and Hōrai are also words originating
from the Tao, so its fair to say that they’re

01:08:32.850 --> 01:08:35.770
probably telling them the truth about the
island.

01:08:35.770 --> 01:08:41.190
In mainland China’s history Tensen was a
term made up by the Jin Dynasty scholar Ge

01:08:41.190 --> 01:08:42.190
Hong.

01:08:42.190 --> 01:08:46.710
Its simply a classification for the highest
class of immortals or hermits.

01:08:46.710 --> 01:08:53.480
Now in the bath house, Sagiri takes note of
just how many wounds Gabimaru has sustained

01:08:53.480 --> 01:08:55.110
since getting to the island.

01:08:55.110 --> 01:08:59.170
Looking at Mei she also see’s this massive
scar or some kind of strange marking that

01:08:59.170 --> 01:09:01.290
travels up the majority of her back.

01:09:01.290 --> 01:09:05.130
While washing himself, Gabimaru remembers
a time his wife washed his back and gave him

01:09:05.130 --> 01:09:07.799
advice about to properly relax his body.

01:09:07.799 --> 01:09:11.910
She reminded him on how if he didnt take the
opportunity to relax then he’s bound to

01:09:11.910 --> 01:09:13.940
collapse in the the real battle they call
life.

01:09:13.940 --> 01:09:19.160
In times of peace, stick to your convictions,
wear them proudly at times or conceal them

01:09:19.160 --> 01:09:20.160
at others..

01:09:20.160 --> 01:09:23.180
But never let go of what truly makes you,
you.

01:09:23.180 --> 01:09:27.940
For life is far far longer than even the battle
of Kawanakajima.

01:09:27.940 --> 01:09:31.409
Damn I love how poetic Yuki is with his story
and it makes me wanna learn Japanese as I

01:09:31.409 --> 01:09:35.589
know for a fact that the story would be so
much more in-depth in a language that is artistically

01:09:35.589 --> 01:09:36.589
based.

01:09:36.589 --> 01:09:41.359
For example this battle Yui referred to was
actually the site of five or possibly six

01:09:41.359 --> 01:09:45.819
different battles that happened in the waring
states period between 1553 and 1564.

01:09:45.819 --> 01:09:51.319
If ya wanna check out the actual location,
its situated near present day Nagano.

01:09:51.319 --> 01:09:55.340
The battles between commanders Takeda Shingen
and Uesugi Kenshin have becomes some of the

01:09:55.340 --> 01:10:00.469
most romanticized pieces of Japanese history,
giving rise to retellings, reimagining's in

01:10:00.469 --> 01:10:03.820
script, artistic representations and even
movies.

01:10:03.820 --> 01:10:06.870
After remembering how he told her that she
shouldn’t cover her scar with her hair,

01:10:06.870 --> 01:10:10.790
he gives the same advice to Mei about the
marking on her back, saying he knows this

01:10:10.790 --> 01:10:15.450
lady with a bid scar across her face and shes
the prettiest girl around.

01:10:15.450 --> 01:10:19.710
As both girls take this new side of Gabi in,
it causes Mei to becomes star struck wanting

01:10:19.710 --> 01:10:23.480
to stay by his side.

01:10:23.480 --> 01:10:27.870
Leaving the bath house now and as the three
walk back to Hoko’s residence, Sagiri notices

01:10:27.870 --> 01:10:30.420
that Gabimaru is truly starting to change.

01:10:30.420 --> 01:10:34.699
At the same time Gabimaru reminds himself
why exactly he’s here.

01:10:34.699 --> 01:10:38.570
He’d managed to get a breather in and finally
remembered those feelings of his, but his

01:10:38.570 --> 01:10:40.880
priority isn't to bath around.

01:10:40.880 --> 01:10:45.429
No its to make it home and save his wife from
her tyrannical father.

01:10:45.429 --> 01:10:49.850
Inside Hoko’s house Senta who’s literally
fried his brain after gather so much information

01:10:49.850 --> 01:10:54.900
insists that they should spend the night here
as there’s still so much to unravel.

01:10:54.900 --> 01:10:59.540
Sagiri tells him that he should rest now but
Senta who’s overheating insisted he’d

01:10:59.540 --> 01:11:02.219
be able to keep watch after he takes a bath.

01:11:02.219 --> 01:11:06.570
However, once outside and on guard duty he
falls asleep with Gabimaru, who’s chilling

01:11:06.570 --> 01:11:07.710
next to him.

01:11:07.710 --> 01:11:11.130
Sitting there overthinking everything thats
happened so far, Gabimaru decided that it

01:11:11.130 --> 01:11:14.690
would be better to head out alone to Hōrai,
before their enemy makes its move against

01:11:14.690 --> 01:11:15.690
them.

01:11:15.690 --> 01:11:20.100
As Gabimaru rushes for Hōrai, he sees a number
of immobile tree creatures chanting strange

01:11:20.100 --> 01:11:23.920
sutras amongst the fog.

01:11:23.920 --> 01:11:27.880
While walking along, he wonders if they’re
praying and thinks back on how Senta said

01:11:27.880 --> 01:11:31.430
its probably dangerous to act before they
know what's really going on.

01:11:31.430 --> 01:11:34.560
Even though Gabi knows that this could be
the most dangerous place in the world, if

01:11:34.560 --> 01:11:38.340
he doesn't press on then there is absolutely
no chance he’ll ever see his wife.

01:11:38.340 --> 01:11:41.739
Stopping for a moment though, he wonders how
in the world he’s even gonna know when he

01:11:41.739 --> 01:11:45.190
arrives at Hōrai, its not like the Homeland
with road signs.

01:11:45.190 --> 01:11:48.380
At the same time an unknown person is seen
following him.

01:11:48.380 --> 01:11:53.020
Pressing forward, Gabimaru comes to find a
massive gate.

01:11:53.020 --> 01:11:56.880
Remembering what Hōko said about Hōrai being
a place of splendor, he believes this is where

01:11:56.880 --> 01:11:59.139
the Hermits and the elixir reside.

01:11:59.139 --> 01:12:03.480
Just as he goes to enter the area, he stops
still noticing something behind him...

01:12:03.480 --> 01:12:07.639
Coming face to face, both Gabimaru and the
same mysterious being who just took out Tenza

01:12:07.639 --> 01:12:09.949
stare into each others eyes.

01:12:09.949 --> 01:12:14.520
Randomly it becomes saddened by his presence
and drops to its asking him to leave, explaining

01:12:14.520 --> 01:12:18.199
that she had already dealt with capturing
another group of humans today.

01:12:18.199 --> 01:12:22.090
Hearing this flicks a switch in our boys head
and he immediately realizes just from her

01:12:22.090 --> 01:12:25.950
statement alone that she turns people into
the Elixir of Life.

01:12:25.950 --> 01:12:29.500
After seeing each other as a threat, the two
engage in battle, jumping straight for each

01:12:29.500 --> 01:12:30.500
other.

01:12:30.500 --> 01:12:33.639
Gabimaru lands 2 successive blows on the woman
and comes to the conclusion that she wasn't

01:12:33.639 --> 01:12:35.940
human after regenerating her wounds.

01:12:35.940 --> 01:12:39.570
Turning things up a notch, he flips back into
a handstand spinning flame kick that lands

01:12:39.570 --> 01:12:41.850
directly on the face of the immortal being.

01:12:41.850 --> 01:12:46.429
He then activates the ability and uses Ninpō:
Fire Monk to completely incinerates her.

01:12:46.429 --> 01:12:51.429
With the creature smoldering below him Gabimaru
noted that it was far to strong to even consider

01:12:51.429 --> 01:12:54.660
questioning, when all of a sudden the godly
being darts straight back out with its charred

01:12:54.660 --> 01:12:58.600
body and lands a direct hit on Gabimaru, sending
him shooting up into the sky.

01:12:58.600 --> 01:13:03.510
Phasing into the sky in an instant, it then
lands yet another kick to the gut of the Ninja.

01:13:03.510 --> 01:13:07.780
Thinking that its destroyed the human it reforms
its normal male shell, but is perplexed when

01:13:07.780 --> 01:13:10.300
he see’s Gabimaru standing there asking
if he was Lord Tensen.

01:13:10.300 --> 01:13:17.010
In a display of skill yet unseen in the series
both Gabimaru and the being known as Lord

01:13:17.010 --> 01:13:19.010
Tensen continue fighting in Hōrai.

01:13:19.010 --> 01:13:22.969
Coming to a standstill for a moment Gabi asks
where the elixir is, before diving straight

01:13:22.969 --> 01:13:25.489
back in and throwing another series of kicks
and punches.

01:13:25.489 --> 01:13:30.110
He notes that all of the damage he’s inflicting
is pretty much useless as its regenerative

01:13:30.110 --> 01:13:31.690
ability is just too fast.

01:13:31.690 --> 01:13:35.760
Trading blows with this thing is just like
Rokurōta, its only going to result in certain

01:13:35.760 --> 01:13:36.760
death.

01:13:36.760 --> 01:13:40.530
What he needs is a strategy thats actually
going to hurt it, ascetic blaze didnt work

01:13:40.530 --> 01:13:43.020
so he opts for a technique he hasn't tried
so far.

01:13:43.020 --> 01:13:48.070
He throws a swift kick to the gut or tanden
and notices that the impact felt different

01:13:48.070 --> 01:13:49.480
from before.

01:13:49.480 --> 01:13:52.910
Somehow it actually did some form of damage
causing Lord Tensen to coughs up blood and

01:13:52.910 --> 01:13:54.080
transform into a woman.

01:13:54.080 --> 01:13:58.830
(Btw when ever they change into a woman, oml
I have to do so much body modifications so

01:13:58.830 --> 01:14:03.230
there isn't any thing sus going on, Yuki himself
goes ham with his art style and its amazing

01:14:03.230 --> 01:14:07.989
I just wish they wore tops more often hahaha)

01:14:07.989 --> 01:14:11.120
Tensen tells Gabi that he’s probably not
even aware of what he just did and changes

01:14:11.120 --> 01:14:14.199
into another fighting form that we haven't
seen so far.

01:14:14.199 --> 01:14:18.070
Becoming enraged it tells him to die before
sending what seems to be invisible sonic energy

01:14:18.070 --> 01:14:20.130
waves that deal an insane amount of damage.

01:14:20.130 --> 01:14:24.620
Not understanding what in the world just happened,
Gabi becomes overwhelmed as Lord Tensen sends

01:14:24.620 --> 01:14:28.840
out a barrage of attacks that leave our boy
with physically no way to block.

01:14:28.840 --> 01:14:33.100
Unable to counter Gabimaru just throws away
any idea of even trying to defend and grits

01:14:33.100 --> 01:14:35.250
his teeth before charging at the immortal
creature.

01:14:35.250 --> 01:14:39.389
He gets within throwing hands range and begins
doing his thing, man knows that if he survives

01:14:39.389 --> 01:14:40.389
he gets home.

01:14:40.389 --> 01:14:44.190
End of story thats it thats what's going to
happen, even with parts of himself missing

01:14:44.190 --> 01:14:45.690
he will make it home.

01:14:45.690 --> 01:14:49.670
He speeds his attacks up through pure grit
and somehow manages to gain the upper hand,

01:14:49.670 --> 01:14:53.409
before beating the false god down into the
ground, defeating it.

01:14:53.409 --> 01:14:58.380
After being defeated, Gabimaru tells it to
talk as he wants to find that damn elixir.

01:14:58.380 --> 01:15:03.719
However, Lord Tensen smiles and as its body
begins to bloom flowers it states that "they"

01:15:03.719 --> 01:15:05.190
would be furious with it again.

01:15:05.190 --> 01:15:10.110
In that moment, Tensen loses its natural shape
and morphs into a massive monster made up

01:15:10.110 --> 01:15:12.870
of those previously blooming flowers.

01:15:12.870 --> 01:15:17.280
After the Lord Tensen transforms, Gabimaru
calms himself and tries to think up a strategy.

01:15:17.280 --> 01:15:20.990
However, the transformed immortal unleashes
uncontrollable bolts of lightning towards

01:15:20.990 --> 01:15:24.070
that blitz the entire area and badly wounding
Gabi.

01:15:24.070 --> 01:15:27.449
Throwing a massive boulder aside, Gabi doesn't
hesitate and darts back in trying to land

01:15:27.449 --> 01:15:31.340
some form of hit on the monster but its utterly
useless as he’s blasted back once more.

01:15:31.340 --> 01:15:36.389
Lying in a head of rubble he tries activating
Ascetic Blaze, yet its once again useless

01:15:36.389 --> 01:15:39.969
as his body freezes up on him, making him
to realize that he’s already reached his

01:15:39.969 --> 01:15:42.680
limit and has no stamina left at all.

01:15:42.680 --> 01:15:46.489
Being unable to move the monster overwhelms
Gabimaru causing him to wonder if this is

01:15:46.489 --> 01:15:49.219
real, or if this has all just been on long
nightmare.

01:15:49.219 --> 01:15:53.420
Waking up randomly in his house, his wife
lets him know that he’d been tossing and

01:15:53.420 --> 01:15:55.840
tuning possibly having some kind of bad dream.

01:15:55.840 --> 01:16:00.440
Breaking down, Gabi tells her that he had
the worst nightmare he’s ever had.

01:16:00.440 --> 01:16:05.330
As time passes we see Gabi chilling on his
veranda while his wife brings him some dream

01:16:05.330 --> 01:16:06.330
warding tea.

01:16:06.330 --> 01:16:10.020
Looking at her, he says that even if this
is a dream, its wonderful that he was able

01:16:10.020 --> 01:16:11.380
to talk to her again.

01:16:11.380 --> 01:16:16.840
With her becoming confused, Gabi apologizes
as he knows that there is a chance he’s

01:16:16.840 --> 01:16:19.250
never going to see her again.

01:16:19.250 --> 01:16:23.370
Sadly back in the present Gabi re-awakens
in the grasp of the monster moments before

01:16:23.370 --> 01:16:24.850
it seemingly crushes him.

01:16:24.850 --> 01:16:29.679
Nah nah nah though Gabi aint done, instead
what we thought was our boy dying was infact

01:16:29.679 --> 01:16:34.340
him starting his last ditch effort while remembering
a specific Ninja principle.

01:16:34.340 --> 01:16:38.989
Ironclad Ninja Law #20 “Should death be
upon you, in the moments before your doom,

01:16:38.989 --> 01:16:42.690
inflict grievous damage upon the foe that
would wring the life from you.”

01:16:42.690 --> 01:16:47.670
Bursting into flames once more, Gabi knows
that when facing death, he has to surrender

01:16:47.670 --> 01:16:49.130
everything, even his subconscious.

01:16:49.130 --> 01:16:53.570
Having activated Ninpō: Fire Monk Gabimaru
eventually burns through the monsters grip,

01:16:53.570 --> 01:16:55.630
causing him to fall onto the ground below.

01:16:55.630 --> 01:17:00.480
Not having the strength to get back up Gabimaru
just thinks of his wife and apologizes for

01:17:00.480 --> 01:17:03.050
not being able to make it home.

01:17:03.050 --> 01:17:07.330
Randomly though Mei then appears besides Gabimaru
and helps him escape by creating a crater

01:17:07.330 --> 01:17:11.530
using her mysterious ability allowing them
to safely slide down the cliff.

01:17:11.530 --> 01:17:14.520
Enraged the monster attempts to attack the
two with its lightning but fails to hit them

01:17:14.520 --> 01:17:15.520
before they flee.

01:17:15.520 --> 01:17:21.800
Reverting back to normal, Tensen just wonders
what was the reason for Mei's actions.

01:17:21.800 --> 01:17:25.409
Inside of Hōrai all of these mysterious rulers
that each in their own can also be called

01:17:25.409 --> 01:17:29.540
Lord Tensen, are gathered for a meeting about
the humans that landed on the island.

01:17:29.540 --> 01:17:33.290
Ju Fa which is one of the names for these
creatures, becomes angry with Zhu Jin for

01:17:33.290 --> 01:17:37.190
failing his guard duties and being reduced
to a Kishikai state, stating that he used

01:17:37.190 --> 01:17:38.190
to much Tao.

01:17:38.190 --> 01:17:40.420
He violently attacks him but is quickly scolded
by the leader for causing harm to a fellow

01:17:40.420 --> 01:17:41.679
family member.

01:17:41.679 --> 01:17:45.320
He brings up that they can only punish those
which they serve and because of that only

01:17:45.320 --> 01:17:47.270
he man harm Zhu Jin.

01:17:47.270 --> 01:17:51.600
Putting the failure that is Zhu Jin aside,
he asks Ju Fa for any information on the humans

01:17:51.600 --> 01:17:53.120
they’ve encountered so far.

01:17:53.120 --> 01:17:57.190
Ju relays on how he dropped both Chōbei and
Tōma into one of the pits, which in there

01:17:57.190 --> 01:18:00.120
eyes is far to deep for any human to climb
out of.

01:18:00.120 --> 01:18:04.820
(Massive foreshadowing I think so hahahah)
Mu Dan whos tryna take the role of a boss

01:18:04.820 --> 01:18:08.469
here advises them to not underestimate the
humans.

01:18:08.469 --> 01:18:12.650
If it had been just the Soshin that was taken
out, it would've been no big deal, but since

01:18:12.650 --> 01:18:16.239
they managed to slay a Mōnshin things seem
different about these humans.

01:18:16.239 --> 01:18:20.989
He brings up a terrifying possibility, that
say they were to escape the pit Ju threw them

01:18:20.989 --> 01:18:24.850
in, then there would be nothing more fearsome
than a wounded beast.

01:18:24.850 --> 01:18:28.571
Plus if every other human on the island wielded
the same kind of strength then that might

01:18:28.571 --> 01:18:31.360
truly face a terrible beast.

01:18:31.360 --> 01:18:34.800
Unbeknownst to these goons, thats exactly
what's going on.

01:18:34.800 --> 01:18:38.179
The leader then asked Zhu Jin if he they’d
successfully won the battle they had last

01:18:38.179 --> 01:18:39.840
night, which he was certain.

01:18:39.840 --> 01:18:44.260
The seven then make a toast to longevity and
Zhu Jin is restored to his normal form.

01:18:44.260 --> 01:18:49.179
So what they mean by Kishikai like I think
I mentioned earlier is the monstrous plant

01:18:49.179 --> 01:18:55.870
form that they evolve into under great stress,
which also is a representation of Yin and

01:18:55.870 --> 01:18:58.030
Yang.

01:18:58.030 --> 01:19:08.530
It literally means ‘demon corpse undo’
and is a concept inspired by Ge Hong's weakest

01:19:08.530 --> 01:19:10.840
immortal hermit form the Shijie Xian.

01:19:10.840 --> 01:19:16.350
From what i've seen a lot of the story dives
into the more Chinese mythological side of

01:19:16.350 --> 01:19:19.239
things and especially stuff from this Ge Hong
fellow.

01:19:19.239 --> 01:19:20.239
Anyways

01:19:20.239 --> 01:19:26.179
Meanwhile, Senta apologies to Sagiri for accidently
letting Gabimaru leave his sight the previous

01:19:26.179 --> 01:19:27.179
night.

01:19:27.179 --> 01:19:30.219
Hoko brings up that its almost impossible
for any ordinary human to travel through the

01:19:30.219 --> 01:19:33.850
mist, but Sagiri believes that if he did indeed
set out, he may have actually found a way

01:19:33.850 --> 01:19:38.120
to navigate the area and if thats the case
they need to find him at once.

01:19:38.120 --> 01:19:41.699
Yuzuriha disagrees as its not like they’ve
got time to spare themselves and wondered

01:19:41.699 --> 01:19:44.520
why Sagiri was even concerned about Gabimaru.

01:19:44.520 --> 01:19:48.070
Hōko interrupts and offers to guide them
through the mist, seeing as how Mei left he

01:19:48.070 --> 01:19:49.679
has to go find her.

01:19:49.679 --> 01:19:53.679
Hearing this, Yuzuriha switches up and is
persuaded into finding Gabimaru.

01:19:53.679 --> 01:19:59.739
Once they leave, Sagiri notes that with Gabi
having run off its now beyond the scope of

01:19:59.739 --> 01:20:03.909
her duties, still she cant help but hope he’s
okay.

01:20:03.909 --> 01:20:07.389
Elsewhere Gabimaru awakens with Mei beside
him and immediately comes to the conclusion

01:20:07.389 --> 01:20:11.550
that the thing he just fought was no god,
just a living breathing monster.

01:20:11.550 --> 01:20:15.960
Pleased with the realization he stands ready
to figure out a way to defeat the beast.

01:20:15.960 --> 01:20:20.490
From the battle so far its obvious to him
that he cant do it alone, but with two, three,

01:20:20.490 --> 01:20:23.280
four or even more comrades it might be possible.

01:20:23.280 --> 01:20:28.980
In that moment he notices another two newcomers
appear behind him.

01:20:28.980 --> 01:20:34.280
After encountering Tamiya Gantetsusai and
Yamada Asaemon Fuchi, Gabimaru and Gantetsusai

01:20:34.280 --> 01:20:37.601
go back and forth both predicting each other’s
actions in their heads before they make a

01:20:37.601 --> 01:20:39.489
move in the actual battle.

01:20:39.489 --> 01:20:43.659
Stepping in-between the two Fuchi ceases their
pointless imaginary battle and instead plans

01:20:43.659 --> 01:20:46.409
to extract information from Gabimaru.

01:20:46.409 --> 01:20:50.300
Having honed a special ability since he was
young that allows him to recognize someone's

01:20:50.300 --> 01:20:55.030
strength at a glace, Gabimaru decides to sit
down and request an alliance with the two.

01:20:55.030 --> 01:20:58.290
Gantetsusai draws his sword and swings it
at Gabi to see if he was trying to trick them

01:20:58.290 --> 01:21:02.210
but after the previously hollow man didnt
flinch at all, figured he was telling the

01:21:02.210 --> 01:21:03.210
truth.

01:21:03.210 --> 01:21:08.080
Still he felt disappointed with him showing
just how week he was and told Gabi that he

01:21:08.080 --> 01:21:10.650
wasn't looking for cowards who’d bow to
an enemy.

01:21:10.650 --> 01:21:15.429
Either way Fuchi asks to hear him out, wanting
to know why the infamous Gabimaru would go

01:21:15.429 --> 01:21:16.550
this far.

01:21:16.550 --> 01:21:21.510
Going over everything that happened to him
up until this point, both Fuchi and Gantetsusai

01:21:21.510 --> 01:21:25.420
especially intrigued to hear about this random
Lord Tensen fellow.

01:21:25.420 --> 01:21:30.010
Fuchi who’s just blown away with Gabi’s
explanation asks how it was able to regenerate

01:21:30.010 --> 01:21:32.050
and was there any signs it had internal organs.

01:21:32.050 --> 01:21:35.989
Not knowing every detail exactly, Gabimaru
says that he’s honestly not even sure what

01:21:35.989 --> 01:21:39.489
happened, he just needs to earn that pardon
and get back to a certain someone.

01:21:39.489 --> 01:21:40.489
So the more people there are to help the more
likely it will happen.

01:21:40.489 --> 01:21:44.070
Just as intrigued himself, Gantetsusai agrees
to teaming up and tells him that he had no

01:21:44.070 --> 01:21:49.489
interest in the pardon but rather to become
a legendary figure that will live forever.

01:21:49.489 --> 01:21:53.700
Confused because that obviously means the
dude still wants the Elixir, Gantetsusai reiterates

01:21:53.700 --> 01:21:56.190
that literal immortality would get boring
fast.

01:21:56.190 --> 01:22:01.260
What he wants is to be able to preform feats
that shake the earth, then that way the name

01:22:01.260 --> 01:22:14.170
Tamiya Gantetsusai will live on 
for eternity.

01:22:14.170 --> 01:22:18.340
Screaming to the sky he tells the gods themselves
to believe it, one day they’ll paint pictures

01:22:18.340 --> 01:22:20.300
and write tales about his strength.

01:22:20.300 --> 01:22:24.530
Fuchi who thinks his criminals absolutely
lost his mind also agrees after learning that

01:22:24.530 --> 01:22:27.050
an undying organism exist.

01:22:27.050 --> 01:22:30.820
Having come to their agreement, Fuchi asks
Gabi to spill the beans on what he knows.

01:22:30.820 --> 01:22:35.210
Agreeing, he goes to start off with Mei and
explain her, yet as soon as he looks at her

01:22:35.210 --> 01:22:40.530
he’s shocked to see that she’s grown a
few years in age.

01:22:40.530 --> 01:22:45.889
Fuchi asked why Gabimaru was shocked, to which
he explains that Mei has aged for some reason.

01:22:45.889 --> 01:22:49.989
Then after hearing her speak for the first
time, Gabimaru quickly rushed in and grabbed

01:22:49.989 --> 01:22:54.889
her asking if she was the same as Tensen and
for more information on the elixir.

01:22:54.889 --> 01:22:59.159
Noticing how forward he was being, Gabi stepped
back and thanked her for everything so far,

01:22:59.159 --> 01:23:02.460
but also questions as to why she couldn't
speak up until now.

01:23:02.460 --> 01:23:07.670
At the same time Yuzuriha curiously asked
Hōko what in the world Lord Tensen was.

01:23:07.670 --> 01:23:12.500
Finally its explained to us absolutely confused
readers that Lord Tensen is infact 7 different

01:23:12.500 --> 01:23:14.080
immortals.

01:23:14.080 --> 01:23:18.730
According to Legend its possible that it used
to be one immortal being, but its unsure as

01:23:18.730 --> 01:23:21.040
so much has changed throughout the historical
texts.

01:23:21.040 --> 01:23:28.230
Whats known is that there the Supreme Shandi
Samantabhadra, Heavenly Dadi Aksho, Enthroned

01:23:28.230 --> 01:23:35.969
Juijun Amoghavajra, Sagacious Dasheng Ratna,
Regnant Yuanjun Tathata, Decorous Gonggong

01:23:35.969 --> 01:23:49.860
Manjusri, and Deified Dijun Cundi.

01:23:49.860 --> 01:23:54.070
Apparently the great hermit over 1000 years
ago reached enlightenment, achieved deification

01:23:54.070 --> 01:23:56.370
and thus split themselves seven fold.

01:23:56.370 --> 01:24:00.070
The immortal beings appearance and voice are
shared between them, but they all vary in

01:24:00.070 --> 01:24:02.370
personality and the role they take.

01:24:02.370 --> 01:24:06.270
Like Senta mentioned in the first part on
how it was a poor mix up or religions and

01:24:06.270 --> 01:24:08.860
cultures, these names are exactly the same.

01:24:08.860 --> 01:24:13.020
They combine titles from Chinese culture and
Mythology mixed in with unrelated Buddhist

01:24:13.020 --> 01:24:14.850
deities and their concepts.

01:24:14.850 --> 01:24:20.300
Funnily enough in the Japanese versions of
the story they use the Japanese pronunciations

01:24:20.300 --> 01:24:21.300
for these people.

01:24:21.300 --> 01:24:26.239
Whereas in my video (bar my pronunciation)
and in the English translation it uses the

01:24:26.239 --> 01:24:29.910
accepted spellings from each specific language.

01:24:29.910 --> 01:24:33.989
The tree man also reveals that everyone of
the island was once human with abnormally

01:24:33.989 --> 01:24:36.739
long life spans in comparison to the average
man.

01:24:36.739 --> 01:24:41.989
Yet even still with their long lives, there
prosperity ended after 1000 years and eventually

01:24:41.989 --> 01:24:43.920
everyone hit arborfication.

01:24:43.920 --> 01:24:47.110
Once someone does begin turning they only
have a limited amount of time before their

01:24:47.110 --> 01:24:51.159
mind goes blank and they travel to Hōrai
to sit in the Zazen pose and chant strange

01:24:51.159 --> 01:24:52.570
sutra’s.

01:24:52.570 --> 01:24:56.320
Hearing this information, Senta objects to
Hoko’s previous statement on the island

01:24:56.320 --> 01:25:00.650
being Shinsenkyo and believes that its more
likely based around a man-made religion.

01:25:00.650 --> 01:25:05.360
Words like, ‘Hōrai’, ’Eishu’, ‘Zazen’
and even lord Tensen’s titles all relate

01:25:05.360 --> 01:25:08.010
to existing different religious spheres.

01:25:08.010 --> 01:25:11.190
Consider the physical remains of statues all
scattered about the place, all of them reflect

01:25:11.190 --> 01:25:13.270
very real human religions.

01:25:13.270 --> 01:25:17.239
Due to all of this he cant accept that this
island is cut off from the real world as some

01:25:17.239 --> 01:25:20.780
sort of spiritual realm isolated for over
a 1000 years.

01:25:20.780 --> 01:25:25.000
He tells Yuzuriha to remember Moro and how
he was originally arrested for trying to overthrow

01:25:25.000 --> 01:25:28.030
the shogunate by founding a new religion altogether.

01:25:28.030 --> 01:25:30.920
Just like his weird religion, the one that
they’ve discovered here is also made up

01:25:30.920 --> 01:25:32.820
from a distortion of different faiths.

01:25:32.820 --> 01:25:37.410
In his mind, Hoko’s stories have only supported
his theory that this island and everything

01:25:37.410 --> 01:25:41.900
inside of it, including them being lured to
the island, are all the works of a mysterious

01:25:41.900 --> 01:25:42.900
creator.

01:25:42.900 --> 01:25:46.889
With his explanation in mind, Yuzuriha believes
that its pretty much impossible to stop someone

01:25:46.889 --> 01:25:50.969
who’s been planning everything behind the
scenes for over 1000 years and assumes Gabimaru

01:25:50.969 --> 01:25:53.969
and Mei are already dead from even trying
to approach it.

01:25:53.969 --> 01:25:58.159
However, Sagiri believes that Gabimaru is
very much alive and is already formulating

01:25:58.159 --> 01:26:01.440
a plan of action as no matter what he will
see his wife once more.

01:26:01.440 --> 01:26:02.480
Shheeeesh even Sagiri on that Gabi wife hype
train now.

01:26:02.480 --> 01:26:04.900
Well I cant blame her, though yeah at this
point the idea of them taking on these immortal

01:26:04.900 --> 01:26:05.900
opponents and winning seems so foreign.

01:26:05.900 --> 01:26:06.900
Anyway Anyways!

01:26:06.900 --> 01:26:09.620
Back with Gabi, he inquires as to how in the
world Mei saved him back there.

01:26:09.620 --> 01:26:13.690
Mei who cant speak properly tries to tell
him that it was Tao (said Dow), weak strong

01:26:13.690 --> 01:26:14.690
spirit, leaving the group confused with what
she's trying to say.

01:26:14.690 --> 01:26:17.719
Fuchi brings up that the Tanden which was
one of the words she said could be related

01:26:17.719 --> 01:26:19.660
to the flow of Qi or chakra, but cant say
for sure.

01:26:19.660 --> 01:26:20.869
This here is obviously another aspect that
a lot of stories, Naruto for example kinda

01:26:20.869 --> 01:26:21.869
delve into, yet with Hells Paradise’s botched
world, the Kanji for Tanden is translated

01:26:21.869 --> 01:26:22.869
directly as Elixir Of Life and or Field.

01:26:22.869 --> 01:26:24.510
On the other-hand Hoko explains to the girls
that Tao is the energy that flows through

01:26:24.510 --> 01:26:25.889
everything.

01:26:25.889 --> 01:26:29.430
Everything that exists comes from the never
ending flow of Tao and if someone is able

01:26:29.430 --> 01:26:33.860
to tap into that flow then it could allow
them to meddle with creation itself.

01:26:33.860 --> 01:26:37.300
Elsewhere Shion and Nurugai go through some
training exercises.

01:26:37.300 --> 01:26:41.580
After getting absolutely blitzed by the blind
king, Nurugai pleads with him to explain his

01:26:41.580 --> 01:26:45.699
swordsman, but he refuses her as he just couldn't
bear to watch another student fall before

01:26:45.699 --> 01:26:46.699
his eyes.

01:26:46.699 --> 01:26:50.680
Not pleased, Nurugai tells him that she can
sense he isn't any ordinary guy, there was

01:26:50.680 --> 01:26:54.960
someone in there clan who could see with sound,
but the level Shion’s on is almost otherworldly

01:26:54.960 --> 01:26:56.390
in comparison.

01:26:56.390 --> 01:27:01.580
So the reason big Shion is able to merc people
while blind is because just like taste or

01:27:01.580 --> 01:27:05.550
smell, all things in this world possess unique
waves and thats exactly what he’s able to

01:27:05.550 --> 01:27:06.550
perceive.

01:27:06.550 --> 01:27:10.710
The technique is so refined he’s even able
to tell exactly what Nurugai’s hairstyle

01:27:10.710 --> 01:27:15.750
looks like, yet there isn't any said name
for the ability so he just calls them waves.

01:27:15.750 --> 01:27:20.360
So mastery over Tao allows the user to not
only sense things, but it boosts their physical

01:27:20.360 --> 01:27:22.690
abilities to the same level as a god.

01:27:22.690 --> 01:27:26.890
Tapping into the power requires an extremely
balanced spirit, so remember the stuff Mei

01:27:26.890 --> 01:27:30.830
was trying to say, well the strong, weak more
or less meant a balanced spirit.

01:27:30.830 --> 01:27:37.150
Once someone achieves mastery over the ever
flowing cycles between rage and serenity then

01:27:37.150 --> 01:27:38.670
they will begin to sense the waves.

01:27:38.670 --> 01:27:43.390
According to Buddhist texts its called the
middle way, the state of being able to draw

01:27:43.390 --> 01:27:45.920
out a power that exceeds your natural potential.

01:27:45.920 --> 01:27:49.860
Asking what the right wave is then, Shion
gives her an example of how he activates the

01:27:49.860 --> 01:27:50.860
technique.

01:27:50.860 --> 01:27:54.100
He explains everything from his stance to
how he holds the blade and the feeling that

01:27:54.100 --> 01:27:55.869
he gets while wielding the blade.

01:27:55.869 --> 01:28:01.410
With a bunch of Soshin rolling up behind Shion
he displays just exactly what he sees.

01:28:01.410 --> 01:28:05.400
Tapping into all of the specific waves it
reveals a dark world made up of white waves

01:28:05.400 --> 01:28:09.820
weaving in and out of the darkness creating
the creatures and landscape around him.

01:28:09.820 --> 01:28:13.530
Lashing out Shion easily takes down every
single monster, all the while explaining to

01:28:13.530 --> 01:28:15.960
Nurugai what goes into the use of the technique.

01:28:15.960 --> 01:28:19.670
As they both begin taking on the remaining
creatures together, he tells Nurugai that

01:28:19.670 --> 01:28:25.219
he still refuses to become her teacher but
she is free to learn as much as she wants.

01:28:25.219 --> 01:28:28.489
Elsewhere Gabimaru's group is also ambushed
by a large amount of Sōshin.

01:28:28.489 --> 01:28:32.719
Stepping forth and in one freaking massive
swing Gantetsusai takes out the first wave

01:28:32.719 --> 01:28:34.130
of creatures with ease.

01:28:34.130 --> 01:28:37.940
He knows he wants to learn this Tao thing,
but sitting around in lessons is just to damn

01:28:37.940 --> 01:28:39.360
boring for the beast.

01:28:39.360 --> 01:28:43.020
He teases Gabi for how beat up he’s gotten
since making land fall and tells him that

01:28:43.020 --> 01:28:44.750
they need to learn in the heat of battle.

01:28:44.750 --> 01:28:49.000
With all of the so called training dummies
infront of him he asks Mei to jump down and

01:28:49.000 --> 01:28:50.870
give them a few examples of Tao.

01:28:50.870 --> 01:28:56.430
Though as he does so Gabimaru notices an unfamiliar
presence amongst the Sōshin.

01:28:56.430 --> 01:29:02.130
Remember that pit Chōbei and Tōma were in,
so that thing there was created by Lord Tensen

01:29:02.130 --> 01:29:06.530
in order to assimilate any human dropped inside,
making them one with the flowers.

01:29:06.530 --> 01:29:11.410
From that they are able to extract something
called Tan, or more simply the elixir of life.

01:29:11.410 --> 01:29:16.040
If anyone tries to escape those pits of theirs,
which is almost impossible due to just how

01:29:16.040 --> 01:29:18.880
deep it is, then the walls themselves will
hinder them.

01:29:18.880 --> 01:29:23.070
Still its shown that their pits weren't enough
for the demon brothers who somehow managed

01:29:23.070 --> 01:29:24.900
to climb their way out.

01:29:24.900 --> 01:29:29.080
After escaping, Tōma suggests leaving the
island but Chōbei angrily declares that he

01:29:29.080 --> 01:29:31.570
will take revenge on the two that put them
there.

01:29:31.570 --> 01:29:35.090
Man doesn't even need a strategy, as from
the first battle he figured out their weakness

01:29:35.090 --> 01:29:37.260
was the lower halves of their bodies.

01:29:37.260 --> 01:29:40.929
After trying to offer Tōma a piece of flesh
to eat from the pit, the two brothers are

01:29:40.929 --> 01:29:45.210
taken off-guard when a random monster rolls
up as if its apart of their conversation.

01:29:45.210 --> 01:29:48.791
Not meaning to frighten them, the random looking
thing dressed in a Chinese outfit tells them

01:29:48.791 --> 01:29:51.220
to not lash out as it posses some form of
intelligence.

01:29:51.220 --> 01:29:53.920
Instead of fighting, they should talk.

01:29:53.920 --> 01:29:58.280
So this thing here is used for scouting purposes
and a bunch of them have been sent out to

01:29:58.280 --> 01:30:00.340
all of the still alive humans on the island.

01:30:00.340 --> 01:30:04.619
Unlike the Soshin which are incomplete beings
that lack any thought or emotion and aren't

01:30:04.619 --> 01:30:08.380
even allowed inside Hōrai or the Mōnshin
who act as guards for area.

01:30:08.380 --> 01:30:13.830
They are the Doshi, direct disciples of lord
Tensen who posses intellect and are taught

01:30:13.830 --> 01:30:15.540
directly by 1 of the 7.

01:30:15.540 --> 01:30:18.639
The Dōshi explains that he was ordered to
assure that they were still in the pit becoming

01:30:18.639 --> 01:30:22.330
Tan while his other comrades were out locating
the other humans on the island.

01:30:22.330 --> 01:30:27.400
He then asked for the two to return to the
pit however Chōbei responds by diving forth

01:30:27.400 --> 01:30:29.090
and attacking the creature.

01:30:29.090 --> 01:30:33.280
Easily dodging a slow blow by the Doshi, Chōbei
lashes out disarming the monster and causing

01:30:33.280 --> 01:30:35.110
it to jump backwards.

01:30:35.110 --> 01:30:38.720
Knowing that this thing is in touch with Tensen,
Chōbei demands that he tell him everything

01:30:38.720 --> 01:30:42.590
about those freaks but the Dōshi refuses
calling him a foolish idiot.

01:30:42.590 --> 01:30:48.639
Bringing in some backup, it commands the Soshin
to take out the humans so he can return them

01:30:48.639 --> 01:30:49.639
to the pit.

01:30:49.639 --> 01:30:53.739
Chōbei orders Tōma to fight off the Sōshin
while he handles fighting the Dōshi.

01:30:53.739 --> 01:30:57.469
As the two continue to scuffle, its revealed
that Chōbei's attacks are causing almost

01:30:57.469 --> 01:31:00.160
no harm to the Dōshi because he doesn't wield
Tao.

01:31:00.160 --> 01:31:03.771
This leaves a perfect opening for the Doshi
to fatally wound Chōbei, striking him in

01:31:03.771 --> 01:31:07.670
the face, causing him to fall face first onto
the ground below.

01:31:07.670 --> 01:31:11.770
Seeing his bro fall down, Tōma becomes horrified
screaming out his name.

01:31:11.770 --> 01:31:16.290
Getting up he runs at the Doshi who’s taunting
him, when all of a sudden Chōbei re-opens

01:31:16.290 --> 01:31:17.640
his eyes.

01:31:17.640 --> 01:31:21.800
Doshi leans down to drag him back to the pit,
when simultaneously Chōbei awakens and spins

01:31:21.800 --> 01:31:25.890
on the floor facing his opponent before striking
a blow directly to his face.

01:31:25.890 --> 01:31:29.110
Looking at his brother Chōbei tells Tōma
to return to fighting the fodder losers while

01:31:29.110 --> 01:31:30.690
he deals with this feign.

01:31:30.690 --> 01:31:34.830
The Dōshi notices that Chōbei's throat has
regenerated from the previous damage and while

01:31:34.830 --> 01:31:38.100
baffled deduces that during his time in the
pit he must’ve been affected by the vines

01:31:38.100 --> 01:31:40.300
that infused some kind of Tan into him.

01:31:40.300 --> 01:31:43.560
Looking at him some more, The Doshi takes
note that its probably the case since his

01:31:43.560 --> 01:31:46.410
Tao has changed shape in such a short period
of time.

01:31:46.410 --> 01:31:49.469
Realizing just how dangerous he could be if
Chōbei isn't dealt with now, he re-ignites

01:31:49.469 --> 01:31:52.429
the battle against the newly evolved human.

01:31:52.429 --> 01:31:56.210
Instantly he breaks his arms by manipulating
the Tao around his body, but just as quickly

01:31:56.210 --> 01:31:58.780
Chōbei manages to regenerate them and strike
back.

01:31:58.780 --> 01:32:02.620
The Dōshi questions whether Chōbei feared
losing his humanity after his transformation

01:32:02.620 --> 01:32:07.030
but the demon brother states that he couldn't
care as nothing in this world is set in stone.

01:32:07.030 --> 01:32:11.260
Fixing his statement he says that no there
is one thing that never changes thats always

01:32:11.260 --> 01:32:14.500
current, but pointed out that someone like
him wouldn't understand where he was coming

01:32:14.500 --> 01:32:15.500
from.

01:32:15.500 --> 01:32:19.050
He charges forward, asking to see more of
this new power, yet this time he’s actually

01:32:19.050 --> 01:32:21.800
able to visualize what Doshi’s invisible
attacks look like.

01:32:21.800 --> 01:32:25.670
He then strikes the monsters navel, causes
damage and showing proof to him that weakness

01:32:25.670 --> 01:32:28.400
does indeed lie within the stomach.

01:32:28.400 --> 01:32:32.860
These Doshi fellow are kinda like the messengers
and personal assistants to the Tensen.

01:32:32.860 --> 01:32:36.550
The word that they originate from, ‘Doshi
or Daoshi’ in Chinese is a blanket term

01:32:36.550 --> 01:32:40.730
that refers to Taoist priests, monks and masters.

01:32:40.730 --> 01:32:44.510
As Chōbei’s Tao begins to grow larger and
larger the Dōshi becomes frightened, trying

01:32:44.510 --> 01:32:48.320
to call forth the Sōshin to save him, but
sadly for our little Doshi its shown that

01:32:48.320 --> 01:32:50.790
the other bro managed to dispose of all of
them.

01:32:50.790 --> 01:32:55.050
Willing the little Tao he has left, the Doshi
creates some kind of energy orb, but is unable

01:32:55.050 --> 01:32:57.520
to use it as his hand is crushed by Chōbei.

01:32:57.520 --> 01:33:02.380
Staring into the terrified soul of this pathetic
creature, Chōbei states that he now knows

01:33:02.380 --> 01:33:04.150
how he manipulates his Tao.

01:33:04.150 --> 01:33:07.250
Its simple, he brings it in from the environment
around him.

01:33:07.250 --> 01:33:11.650
With nothing left to do Chōbei activates
the exact same ability the Doshi just used,

01:33:11.650 --> 01:33:14.290
perplexing the creature who thought it was
impossible.

01:33:14.290 --> 01:33:18.469
Now seeing the waves of Tao in a similar way
to that of Shion, Chōbei smiles knowing just

01:33:18.469 --> 01:33:21.730
how weak his enemy is, before finally dealing
the finishing blow.

01:33:21.730 --> 01:33:26.040
While Chōbei begins integrating what's left
of the Doshi creature, Tōma looks closely

01:33:26.040 --> 01:33:29.610
at the markings on his neck and notices that
they are spreading.

01:33:29.610 --> 01:33:33.120
Snapping his head towards his brother, Tōma
gets frightened by Chōbei but soon comes

01:33:33.120 --> 01:33:35.430
out of the daze he found himself in.

01:33:35.430 --> 01:33:39.210
Walking in to help tie up the Doshi Tōma
takes an even closer look at Chōbei's neck

01:33:39.210 --> 01:33:41.630
and notices that his scars look plant like.

01:33:41.630 --> 01:33:45.840
Meanwhile, while fighting off the Sōshin,
Gantetsusai asks Mei if he was starting to

01:33:45.840 --> 01:33:50.040
understand Tao, but Mei shakes her head in
disagreement, saying that he was focusing

01:33:50.040 --> 01:33:51.570
too much on his strength.

01:33:51.570 --> 01:33:55.330
Looking at over at his fierce rival who’s
absolutely destroying the other Sōshin, he

01:33:55.330 --> 01:33:57.420
asks if he was starting to understand Tao.

01:33:57.420 --> 01:34:02.070
Just like himself though Mei also states that
he was also focusing too much of strength.

01:34:02.070 --> 01:34:05.940
Fuchi who’s off to the side examining the
remains of the creatures becomes delighted

01:34:05.940 --> 01:34:10.150
with his inspection of the Sōshin's anatomy
and relays the information to Gabimaru.

01:34:10.150 --> 01:34:13.410
He finds it odd that even creatures who share
the same outward appearance have completely

01:34:13.410 --> 01:34:15.389
different anatomical structures.

01:34:15.389 --> 01:34:18.880
From that alone he’s able to deduce that
each opponent they go up against has its own

01:34:18.880 --> 01:34:23.650
weak point, however that doesn't exactly explain
what Mei is aswell.

01:34:23.650 --> 01:34:27.360
After remembering how she helped him escape
Gabimaru comes to the realization that no

01:34:27.360 --> 01:34:31.300
ordinary human would have been able to pull
of the feat she did when they escaped.

01:34:31.300 --> 01:34:36.000
Funnily he intently looks towards her wondering
what she is, but as Mei see’s him it causes

01:34:36.000 --> 01:34:38.929
her to break down and begin crying for a fourth
time.

01:34:38.929 --> 01:34:43.160
This always gets me but as Gabi and Gantetsusai
continue taking out the fodder Soshin, he

01:34:43.160 --> 01:34:47.230
asks Tamiya if he was married aswell and the
big man lets him know that he has wives all

01:34:47.230 --> 01:34:49.320
over the continent.

01:34:49.320 --> 01:34:50.570
King.

01:34:50.570 --> 01:34:53.909
Taken by surprise Gantetsusai then blocks
a sneak attack by a Dōshi.

01:34:53.909 --> 01:34:57.480
Trying to strike back he swings his hook arm
towards the creature but sadly he was unable

01:34:57.480 --> 01:35:00.929
to stop it from weaving between his attack
and taking Mei off his shoulder.

01:35:00.929 --> 01:35:05.110
Now back a fair distance from the main group,
the Dōshi greets Mei in a polite manner,

01:35:05.110 --> 01:35:07.810
stating that they had been searching for her
in secret for centuries.

01:35:07.810 --> 01:35:12.350
After she vanished from Hōrai it caused the
Doshi to fall into despair as they were unable

01:35:12.350 --> 01:35:15.550
to search for her publicly due to Lord Reins
orders.

01:35:15.550 --> 01:35:19.289
Now that they’ve finally re-united he begs
her to return to Hōrai as they are in grave

01:35:19.289 --> 01:35:20.289
need of her aid.

01:35:20.289 --> 01:35:24.440
(hmm so I wonder what in the world could Mei
possibly be or the relation that she has to

01:35:24.440 --> 01:35:25.820
the immortals in Hōrai.

01:35:25.820 --> 01:35:30.580
What do the Doshi need her for so desperately
and who in the world is the Lord Rien fellow.

01:35:30.580 --> 01:35:31.960
Still so many questions.

01:35:31.960 --> 01:35:35.380
Ofcourse with us being like almost a third
through the story here Id love to know your

01:35:35.380 --> 01:35:36.380
thought on it down below.

01:35:36.380 --> 01:35:40.190
I find some things get repeated quite a lot
but thats always going to be the case when

01:35:40.190 --> 01:35:44.020
you have a few different groups all needing
to learn the same information.

01:35:44.020 --> 01:35:47.949
So hopefully I was able to slim the repeat
info down here and make it more concise.

01:35:47.949 --> 01:35:51.460
Though they way Yuki does it where he swaps
around between characters as he’s explaining

01:35:51.460 --> 01:35:53.110
parts of the world is really damn good.

01:35:53.110 --> 01:35:56.780
Its hard to script in a way that doesn't sound
whack, but world building wise and visually

01:35:56.780 --> 01:36:01.060
this man is cracked out of his mind, so I
cant wait so see what other series he decides

01:36:01.060 --> 01:36:02.810
to release in the future.)

01:36:02.810 --> 01:36:06.869
Wanting to know what in the worlds going on,
Gabimaru insists the Doshi tell them what

01:36:06.869 --> 01:36:07.869
Mei is.

01:36:07.869 --> 01:36:12.550
Firstly it tells them that it is non of their
concern as Mei is not supposed to be near

01:36:12.550 --> 01:36:13.550
humans.

01:36:13.550 --> 01:36:16.929
Yet since they helped with her return it says
that she is similar to Lord Tensen, one nourished

01:36:16.929 --> 01:36:18.350
by the lives of humans.

01:36:18.350 --> 01:36:21.950
Finding out that she isn't human pushes Gabi
to the edge because he knows that getting

01:36:21.950 --> 01:36:24.870
caught up in something he doesn't understand
will only result in death.

01:36:24.870 --> 01:36:28.890
He needs to remember why he took this mission,
but after seeing the tears beginning to fall

01:36:28.890 --> 01:36:32.930
from Mei’s face, he rushes to her side and
puts himself in-between her and the Doshi

01:36:32.930 --> 01:36:33.930
creature.

01:36:33.930 --> 01:36:37.280
He knows that acting on impulse is usually
the last thing he would do, yet despite not

01:36:37.280 --> 01:36:41.590
having any association with her he cant bear
to make her cry again.

01:36:41.590 --> 01:36:44.860
Furious with his interference, the Dōshi
partners himself with another similar looking

01:36:44.860 --> 01:36:49.389
goon and declares that they will turn them
into Tan and retrieve Mei if thats truly the

01:36:49.389 --> 01:36:50.389
case.

01:36:50.389 --> 01:36:54.500
After noticing the second Dōshi's appearance
and how it manipulates the bugs around them,

01:36:54.500 --> 01:36:58.480
Gantetsusai realizes he’s the mofo that
made him lose a hand, he’s the butterfly

01:36:58.480 --> 01:36:59.560
boss.

01:36:59.560 --> 01:37:03.050
Watching the two Dōshi summon a swarm of
their respective insects, Gabi quickly comes

01:37:03.050 --> 01:37:06.510
to the conclusion that they’re able to manipulate
the insects around them.

01:37:06.510 --> 01:37:10.659
Before he could strategize any further though,
Gantetsusai steps in an cuts down the butterflies

01:37:10.659 --> 01:37:15.400
and states that he seeks revenge on the Butterfly
Dōshi for causing him to lose his left hand.

01:37:15.400 --> 01:37:19.320
He lunges in for another attack angered by
the fact he’s had to refine his swordstyle

01:37:19.320 --> 01:37:23.219
but is hit by and invisible attack by the
Centipede Dōshi that grazes the side of his

01:37:23.219 --> 01:37:24.219
face.

01:37:24.219 --> 01:37:28.050
Initiating a close hand battle, the two Doshi
charge forth, pushing our boys back into a

01:37:28.050 --> 01:37:29.050
defensive fight.

01:37:29.050 --> 01:37:32.290
Bugs weave in and out of the battle field
in combination with the Doshi, blocking their

01:37:32.290 --> 01:37:35.090
vision and causing them to accidentally hit
each other.

01:37:35.090 --> 01:37:38.960
With the boys bickering between each other,
the second Doshi, which is the dude controlling

01:37:38.960 --> 01:37:43.440
the centipedes asks as to why they wanted
to protect Mei despite not having any connections

01:37:43.440 --> 01:37:44.790
with her.

01:37:44.790 --> 01:37:47.820
Gabimaru knows that if it was the old him
he would've just left as soon as possible.

01:37:47.820 --> 01:37:52.469
But now wonders as to why he’s begun changing
ever since he landed on the island.

01:37:52.469 --> 01:37:56.159
Accepting this as the new him, he replies
to the creature that he was just repaying

01:37:56.159 --> 01:37:57.159
a debt.

01:37:57.159 --> 01:38:01.020
He then flipped the conversation back on the
Doshi curious as to why their so fixated on

01:38:01.020 --> 01:38:03.470
a girl that doesn't want to leave with them.

01:38:03.470 --> 01:38:07.619
The Centipede Dōshi explains that his kind
train themselves in the way of Tao, just like

01:38:07.619 --> 01:38:08.880
Lord Tensen.

01:38:08.880 --> 01:38:12.340
For them Mei is a key component to their training
in the ways of Tao.

01:38:12.340 --> 01:38:15.350
There are 5 ascetic methods to train ones
body in Tao.

01:38:15.350 --> 01:38:19.960
(That makes me wonder if Gabi’s Ascetic
form is also one of these 5 methods or something)

01:38:19.960 --> 01:38:24.139
Do’in, Taisoku, Shu’itsu and Shuten are
the first four and they you can train them

01:38:24.139 --> 01:38:25.510
all by yourself.

01:38:25.510 --> 01:38:31.300
However the most impost of all, is hot steamy
Bochu Jutsu which as you can probably pick

01:38:31.300 --> 01:38:34.100
up on demands a partner of opposite gender.

01:38:34.100 --> 01:38:37.370
This is due to how I brought up earlier in
the video, for the cycle of yin and yang to

01:38:37.370 --> 01:38:39.650
complete it demands intimate congress.

01:38:39.650 --> 01:38:45.840
These 5 meditation methods come from real
life Chinese history thru both Taoist and

01:38:45.840 --> 01:38:46.889
qigong practices.

01:38:46.889 --> 01:38:51.750
All things inside of this world posses Chi
of either a Yin or Yang affinity, even those

01:38:51.750 --> 01:38:53.070
that do not live.

01:38:53.070 --> 01:38:57.170
The higher levels of a specific affinity will
result in an even greater level of Tao when

01:38:57.170 --> 01:38:58.630
someone performs Bochu Jutsu.

01:38:58.630 --> 01:39:07.739
Do’in, Taisoku and similar things will prepare
someone's body and mind, but the method to

01:39:07.739 --> 01:39:10.310
join both is thru Bochu Jutsu.

01:39:10.310 --> 01:39:13.730
Those who’re able to hone their Tao thru
this method unlock the ability to reshape

01:39:13.730 --> 01:39:15.679
the fabric of reality.

01:39:15.679 --> 01:39:20.409
Lord Tensen has apparently achieved this level
of power and is now an ascended being in which

01:39:20.409 --> 01:39:22.800
the entire Yin and Yang cycle flows unbroken.

01:39:22.800 --> 01:39:29.099
Thus it has been this way for the past 1000
years as Lord Tensen manifests the ultimate

01:39:29.099 --> 01:39:30.099
Tao.

01:39:30.099 --> 01:39:34.300
The reason the need Mei is because the Doshi
are made up of Yang energy and in order for

01:39:34.300 --> 01:39:39.400
them complete their training they require
Mei's assistants since she possess Yin energy.

01:39:39.400 --> 01:39:43.680
Mei in their eyes is a failure as one of the
Tensen as instead of possesing both Yin and

01:39:43.680 --> 01:39:46.699
Yang, Mei was only able to produce the Yin
aligned chi.

01:39:46.699 --> 01:39:51.370
Therefore Lord Rien banished her from the
palace and offered her 2 different options.

01:39:51.370 --> 01:39:56.310
Either she could pass away back then or like
she chose, reforge herself from the start

01:39:56.310 --> 01:39:57.909
as their training partner.

01:39:57.909 --> 01:40:00.130
Yeah thats messed up.

01:40:00.130 --> 01:40:05.150
Im purposefully not going into depth on certain
aspects of things or showing half the panels,

01:40:05.150 --> 01:40:20.869
otherwise the video will be taken down and
I want it to stay up.

01:40:20.869 --> 01:40:28.560
The reality of the situation is just sad,
I can fully understand why Mei wanted to break

01:40:28.560 --> 01:40:34.110
down after being threatened within going back,
thats all im gonna say.

01:40:34.110 --> 01:40:39.830
Hearing all this both Gabimaru and Gantetsusai
becomes disgusted with this information.

01:40:39.830 --> 01:40:43.730
Angered Tamiya tells him that hell take on
the Centipede creep, but looking at his boy

01:40:43.730 --> 01:40:47.670
he’s blown away to see just how enraged
he is.

01:40:47.670 --> 01:40:51.860
Stepping and asking if she's marked? he tells
them to stop with their rude explanation of

01:40:51.860 --> 01:40:55.699
Mei and treat her like a normal person, not
an object.

01:40:55.699 --> 01:41:00.179
Not bothered with the threats of a human,
The Dōshi's transform into their Shikai form

01:41:00.179 --> 01:41:03.370
and declare that they will kill them on the
spot.

01:41:03.370 --> 01:41:07.310
Gantetsusai makes the first attack, jumping
up and swinging at the Butterfly Dōshi who

01:41:07.310 --> 01:41:09.210
retaliates by sending a swarm after him.

01:41:09.210 --> 01:41:12.460
He notices that they’re easier to attack
when bunched up, but gets caught off-guard

01:41:12.460 --> 01:41:14.469
by the powder coming off the butterflies’.

01:41:14.469 --> 01:41:18.679
Slowly becoming dizzy he asks for Gabimaru's
assistants but gets told to deal with it by

01:41:18.679 --> 01:41:22.140
himself as he’s just as busy with fighting
the Centipede Dōshi.

01:41:22.140 --> 01:41:26.270
Shooting out an attack itself, the Doshi uses
a similar blast to lord Tensen to push Gabimaru

01:41:26.270 --> 01:41:27.270
back.

01:41:27.270 --> 01:41:31.090
Yelling to his teammate, Gantetsusai lets
him know that the butterflies are dangerous.

01:41:31.090 --> 01:41:35.560
Hearing him Gabimaru uses Ninpo; Pyro Bridge
to expels a torrent of fire that seemingly

01:41:35.560 --> 01:41:39.520
burns all of the butterflies and soaks the
Doshi in a cloak of flames.

01:41:39.520 --> 01:41:43.550
Looking at his enemy, Gabi realizes that he
won't stand a chance unless he finds a way

01:41:43.550 --> 01:41:44.550
to sense Tao.

01:41:44.550 --> 01:41:49.989
Yooo so remember Fuchi who’s chilling with
Mei in the middle of this, well, after interpreting

01:41:49.989 --> 01:41:53.599
her words from earlier, Fuchi yells out to
Gabimaru telling him that he’s focusing

01:41:53.599 --> 01:41:55.050
to much on strength.

01:41:55.050 --> 01:41:59.679
To perceive Tao your heart must accept both
strength and weakness and unless he accepts

01:41:59.679 --> 01:42:02.460
his weakness, he won't learn it.

01:42:02.460 --> 01:42:06.470
Mei also helped Fuchi sense his own Tao by
touching his hand and giving a demonstration

01:42:06.470 --> 01:42:08.390
on how she uses it.

01:42:08.390 --> 01:42:12.170
Gabimaru tries doing the same with her, but
once she activates her Tao he can only slightly

01:42:12.170 --> 01:42:15.730
feel something however thats it he cant see
it.

01:42:15.730 --> 01:42:21.130
Yet, After hearing Mei state in her own weird
way that weakness gives birth to strength,

01:42:21.130 --> 01:42:24.679
Gabimaru is reminded of Sagiri's words and
how his love for his wife that he thought

01:42:24.679 --> 01:42:27.460
was a weakness is actually a strength.

01:42:27.460 --> 01:42:31.199
Finally understanding what this strong weak
is that Mei keeps going on about, Gabimaru

01:42:31.199 --> 01:42:34.630
watches some form of glowing energy appear
around his hand.

01:42:34.630 --> 01:42:38.760
Stepping forth towards the heat of battle
the previously hollow man tells Fuchi that

01:42:38.760 --> 01:42:41.090
he thinks he gets the gist of it now.

01:42:41.090 --> 01:42:45.550
Watching him walk ahead of them, Mei notices
just how large Gabimaru’s Tao truly is.

01:42:45.550 --> 01:42:49.631
Having felt the sensation from before, Gabimaru
is now able to see the invisible attacks from

01:42:49.631 --> 01:42:52.050
the Dōshi's and dodges them.

01:42:52.050 --> 01:42:55.780
Blown away with just how quickly he caught
on, Gantetsusai states that its probably due

01:42:55.780 --> 01:42:59.760
to the specific training he went through as
a member of Iwagakure.

01:42:59.760 --> 01:43:03.590
Apparently the people there even have otherworldly
moves and inhuman forms that they can take

01:43:03.590 --> 01:43:05.270
on at a moments notice.

01:43:05.270 --> 01:43:09.630
Its likely that its not exactly Tao but possible
the techniques are based on similar principles

01:43:09.630 --> 01:43:12.080
however Mei shakes her head in disagreement.

01:43:12.080 --> 01:43:16.420
As he continues to fight the Centipede Dōshi,
Gabimaru begins to understand how Tao works

01:43:16.420 --> 01:43:19.969
and begins perceiving everything around him,
not just the stronger aura’s but also the

01:43:19.969 --> 01:43:21.510
weak and dying ones.

01:43:21.510 --> 01:43:25.949
He also manages to understand why he perceived
Sagiri as such a terrifying force.

01:43:25.949 --> 01:43:30.469
Even with all of her doubt, she still pushes
forth making her a strong person.

01:43:30.469 --> 01:43:34.300
With the Centipede Doshi throwing a fat right
hook towards Gabimaru, our boy just puts his

01:43:34.300 --> 01:43:36.520
hand out and simply blocks the strike.

01:43:36.520 --> 01:43:40.889
Being able to distinguish every single insect
apart that makes up the monsters form, he

01:43:40.889 --> 01:43:44.800
reverses the polarity of the monsters Tao
exploding the arm of its Shikai form.

01:43:44.800 --> 01:43:48.630
Now with the upper hand, Gabi darts up and
screams that the pathetic Doshi no longer

01:43:48.630 --> 01:43:50.270
stands a chance.

01:43:50.270 --> 01:43:53.780
Spinning in midair Gabi lands a fat kick that
pushes the creature completely out of its

01:43:53.780 --> 01:43:55.160
Shikai form.

01:43:55.160 --> 01:43:59.389
Feeling gassed up, Gabimaru tells the Centipede
Dōshi that he’s ready to throw some hands

01:43:59.389 --> 01:44:00.389
with their master.

01:44:00.389 --> 01:44:04.969
Laying there on the ground after being defeated,
the Dōshi compares Gabimaru's abilities to

01:44:04.969 --> 01:44:08.550
that of Lord Tensen blown away with just how
accurate he was.

01:44:08.550 --> 01:44:13.191
Annoyed Gabimaru demands that the Dōshi tell
him who he was working with and where can

01:44:13.191 --> 01:44:15.190
he find Lord Tensen.

01:44:15.190 --> 01:44:18.770
Seeing no other option the Dōshi explains
that itself along with two other Dōshi's

01:44:18.770 --> 01:44:22.000
were ordered by Lord Tensen to observe the
humans that arrived on the island.

01:44:22.000 --> 01:44:26.420
They were to discover how this new group differed
to those that had landfall in the past.

01:44:26.420 --> 01:44:30.369
Mainly though it was to asses if leaving the
humans alone would suffice or if they could

01:44:30.369 --> 01:44:31.670
present a threat.

01:44:31.670 --> 01:44:35.880
Wanting to make the final blow, Gantetsusai
swoops in to steal the day.

01:44:35.880 --> 01:44:39.440
With Gabimaru turning around to look at him,
the two Doshi use their abilities to attack

01:44:39.440 --> 01:44:41.409
our boy while his guard was down.

01:44:41.409 --> 01:44:44.960
Gabi though having achieved bliss, perceives
the attacks and quickly manages to jump off

01:44:44.960 --> 01:44:47.810
Gantetsusai towards the butterfly Doshi.

01:44:47.810 --> 01:44:51.770
Falling down on the other one, Gabi uses his
Ninpo: Stone Storm to pepper his opponent

01:44:51.770 --> 01:44:56.170
while simultaneously Tamiya Gantetsusai kill
the Centipede Dōshi.

01:44:56.170 --> 01:45:00.690
With Tao still a mystery to him, Gabimaru
figures if he experiments more with it he

01:45:00.690 --> 01:45:03.010
can find a way to cause damage to his enemies.

01:45:03.010 --> 01:45:07.980
Since they cant question the dead Doshi, Fuchi
considers asking Mei for more information

01:45:07.980 --> 01:45:11.219
but Gantetsusai thinks it would be best for
her to return home.

01:45:11.219 --> 01:45:15.679
Having saved his life twice, Gabimaru wanted
to repay his debt to Mei by going along with

01:45:15.679 --> 01:45:17.010
whatever she wanted to do.

01:45:17.010 --> 01:45:21.449
Knowing of the notes that Sagiri had written
on Gabi before the mission begun, Fuchi notices

01:45:21.449 --> 01:45:26.020
that his behavior is different from what she
interpreted and wonders if this new soft side

01:45:26.020 --> 01:45:28.050
will help him on his mission.

01:45:28.050 --> 01:45:31.780
Suddenly though Gabimaru begins bleeding from
the nose before collapsing to the ground confusing

01:45:31.780 --> 01:45:33.239
everyone around him.

01:45:33.239 --> 01:45:38.000
This is for the fact that Tao is life force
itself, to employ it in battle is to eat away

01:45:38.000 --> 01:45:39.159
at ones life.

01:45:39.159 --> 01:45:43.180
Using to much will cause the backlash to not
only effect someone's body but even their

01:45:43.180 --> 01:45:44.180
soul.

01:45:44.180 --> 01:45:47.580
This is for the simple fact that the body
and soul are one in the same there a manifestation

01:45:47.580 --> 01:45:48.909
of Tao.

01:45:48.909 --> 01:45:52.950
Meanwhile in Hōrai, one of the seven is seen
showing Rien the new training area, which

01:45:52.950 --> 01:45:54.750
features an indoor pool.

01:45:54.750 --> 01:46:01.449
After presenting the final part of the room,
the Bochu Jutsu chamber, another Tensen criticizes

01:46:01.449 --> 01:46:05.699
how ridiculous the idea was but Rien objects
saying that by copulating with others can

01:46:05.699 --> 01:46:07.260
bring out new powers.

01:46:07.260 --> 01:46:12.190
Ju Fa comes out of the chamber covered in
blood after undergoing an absolutely insane

01:46:12.190 --> 01:46:15.580
session with another Tensen and is offered
Tan to recover.

01:46:15.580 --> 01:46:20.600
After grabbing a fresh glass of the immortality
liquid, Ju Fa asks Rien about Mu Dan's whereabouts,

01:46:20.600 --> 01:46:25.449
to which its revealed that as Sagiri enters
the gate to Hōrai, Mu Dan had gone to confront

01:46:25.449 --> 01:46:26.449
the them.

01:46:26.449 --> 01:46:30.671
Upon entering the palace gateway, Sagiri,
Yuzuriha, Senta, and Hōko don't initially

01:46:30.671 --> 01:46:35.350
see Mu Dan as instead they’re blown away
by just how weird their surroundings are.

01:46:35.350 --> 01:46:39.030
Bringing them all back to reality though Mu
Dan waves his hand causing Hoko’s head to

01:46:39.030 --> 01:46:40.369
fall clean off.

01:46:40.369 --> 01:46:46.250
FIIINALLY with a name reveal I can actually
tell you how dope Yuki is, so each of these

01:46:46.250 --> 01:46:49.989
Tensen’s true names refer to Chinese names
for flowers.

01:46:49.989 --> 01:46:57.940
Ri En is ‘Lotus,’ Mudan is ‘Peony,’
Zhu Jin is ‘Hibiscus,’ and Ju Fa is ‘Chrysanthemum.’

01:46:57.940 --> 01:47:01.300
Which itself fits with the whole theme of
fake beauty.

01:47:01.300 --> 01:47:06.679
Like im not to keyed in with the flower meanings
themselves but from what I read, their meanings

01:47:06.679 --> 01:47:10.630
almost reflect exactly how each specific Tensen
tries to act.

01:47:10.630 --> 01:47:18.690
In an inn in the Satsuma Domain, after learning
of his return from the island, the shogun's

01:47:18.690 --> 01:47:22.860
officials ask Yamada Asaemon Jikka about the
events that had occurred.

01:47:22.860 --> 01:47:26.760
Jikka explains before they even arrived at
the island, Chōbei killed his assigned criminal,

01:47:26.760 --> 01:47:30.050
so with heavy heart he had chosen to return
back from the mission.

01:47:30.050 --> 01:47:34.760
Even still the current had forced him to the
island, eventually though man made it home.

01:47:34.760 --> 01:47:38.240
After cutting the story short about how he
managed to escape, an official begged him

01:47:38.240 --> 01:47:43.050
to explain in detail what exactly happened
during his escape but Jikka refuses, saying

01:47:43.050 --> 01:47:46.560
that explaining it would only be troublesome
and he no longer wanted to be involved with

01:47:46.560 --> 01:47:47.920
that hellish place.

01:47:47.920 --> 01:47:52.830
Another Yamada Asaemon then interrupts and
bows while also apologizing for Jikka's behavior.

01:47:52.830 --> 01:47:56.619
Knowing that the Yamada knelt before them
isn't any ordinary man, the representative

01:47:56.619 --> 01:48:01.080
overlooks this offense and reads a message
from the shogun ordering more Asaemon to travel

01:48:01.080 --> 01:48:02.380
to the island.

01:48:02.380 --> 01:48:09.179
After the meeting, Jikka complains about how
the Asaemon were being treated as pawns but

01:48:09.179 --> 01:48:13.270
the young bloke Shugen reprimands him for
his behavior toward the officials.

01:48:13.270 --> 01:48:17.349
Hearing Jikka's half laxed reply about Shugen’s
presence being a help to him in the meeting,

01:48:17.349 --> 01:48:22.050
Shugen becomes furious and tells him to change
his attitude as its unbefitting for a samurai.

01:48:22.050 --> 01:48:27.409
Jikka apologies and instead of pushing the
issue further, enquires as to what re-enforcements

01:48:27.409 --> 01:48:29.880
they’d bring along on this journey to the
island.

01:48:29.880 --> 01:48:34.250
Shugen informs Jikka that instead of criminals,
the shogun plans to hire ninja from Iwagakure.

01:48:34.250 --> 01:48:38.310
During the time Jikka was returning from the
island, another screening was held to gauge

01:48:38.310 --> 01:48:40.030
the average strength of the criminals.

01:48:40.030 --> 01:48:44.370
Once the battle commenced, every single one
of the criminals was annihilated by Iwagakure’s

01:48:44.370 --> 01:48:45.370
shinobi.

01:48:45.370 --> 01:48:49.760
The reason for their involvement in the return
to the island is because their chief wants

01:48:49.760 --> 01:48:52.590
to make certain of someone's demise.

01:48:52.590 --> 01:48:55.910
Shugen explains that they will make for the
island in a few days and bring a swift end

01:48:55.910 --> 01:48:57.080
to the mission.

01:48:57.080 --> 01:49:01.110
Having walked outside a random dude then comes
for Jikka asking what they should do with

01:49:01.110 --> 01:49:04.639
the giant monster head he had brought back
from the island.

01:49:04.639 --> 01:49:08.530
Jikka’s actually to goated, mans so cooked
that he completely forgot to bring up the

01:49:08.530 --> 01:49:11.190
evidence he’d managed to grab while fleeing
the island.

01:49:11.190 --> 01:49:14.980
Either way he states that it never really
felt like the right time to reveal the literal

01:49:14.980 --> 01:49:17.679
monsters he’d fished out of the ocean.

01:49:17.679 --> 01:49:23.430
Walking up, Shugen then takes a closer inspection,
curious as to what in the world it is, but

01:49:23.430 --> 01:49:24.760
the worker warned him that it might be alive.

01:49:24.760 --> 01:49:28.450
However, the Anakin looking wannabe states
that the creature was indeed deceased as he

01:49:28.450 --> 01:49:31.590
couldn't sense any waves of life force coming
from it.

01:49:31.590 --> 01:49:44.130
(Honestly feel like this dude did the Anakin
and merked a whole village or something, he

01:49:44.130 --> 01:49:47.849
just has that demeanor hahah) Nearby and after
having meet with two shadowy-figures, its

01:49:47.849 --> 01:49:51.980
confirmed that the Rank 2 Shugen and Rank
3 Jikka will be joining them on a journey

01:49:51.980 --> 01:49:55.290
to the island thats based purely on someone's
ability.

01:49:55.290 --> 01:49:59.210
Skipping back to the moments before our core
crew entered Hōrai.

01:49:59.210 --> 01:50:04.230
After traveling for a day, Sagiri, Yuzuriha,
Senta, and Hōko manage to reach the gates

01:50:04.230 --> 01:50:05.420
of Hōrai.

01:50:05.420 --> 01:50:09.050
Just like before, they take in the odd surroundings
when all of a sudden the random figure infront

01:50:09.050 --> 01:50:11.770
of them cuts off Hōko's head from a distance.

01:50:11.770 --> 01:50:14.849
Mu Dan cruely jokes that he’s impressed
with them as they’re the first humans in

01:50:14.849 --> 01:50:18.360
over a millennium who’ve made it inside
of Hōrai.

01:50:18.360 --> 01:50:21.540
Yuzuriha senses that the thing infront of
them defiantly wasn't human and attempts to

01:50:21.540 --> 01:50:23.869
flee but is caught in an instant by him.

01:50:23.869 --> 01:50:27.840
Sagiri draws her sword and demands that he
let Yuzuriha go, when from the ground below

01:50:27.840 --> 01:50:32.199
Hōko states that he is Lord Tensen, the Peony
Spirit Enthroned Fuku Jukun.

01:50:32.199 --> 01:50:36.429
Obviously we know him as Mu Dan one of the
7 gender benders and as he looks at the tree

01:50:36.429 --> 01:50:41.820
quickly figures that Hōko was still alive,
however due to his size being reduced tells

01:50:41.820 --> 01:50:45.050
the others that his Arborfication process
will only speed up.

01:50:45.050 --> 01:50:50.280
Hōko accepts this fate since he believes
that his soul will rest in Hōrai.

01:50:50.280 --> 01:50:54.909
Yet in probably the biggest gut punch for
bonsai king, Mu Dan smiles stating that the

01:50:54.909 --> 01:50:59.540
religious beliefs of his were all lies in
order to maintain peace and structure on the

01:50:59.540 --> 01:51:00.540
island.

01:51:00.540 --> 01:51:04.210
In truth, every living thing on the island
were results of experimentations and the humans

01:51:04.210 --> 01:51:07.650
that venture to the island were merely research
materials.

01:51:07.650 --> 01:51:15.100
Leading into that, coming up behind him he
presents the Kiyōshi as examples of his experiments.

01:51:15.100 --> 01:51:19.400
Btw these Kiyoshi is like hells paradise’s
messed up take on the historical Jiangshi

01:51:19.400 --> 01:51:21.290
or Chinese hopping Zombie or Vampire.

01:51:21.290 --> 01:51:23.889
Like with what you could imagine in the story,
the idea behind these creatures is that they

01:51:23.889 --> 01:51:25.890
take out people in the night by absorbing
their life force or Qi, but can also be used

01:51:25.890 --> 01:51:26.890
to resurrect the dead.

01:51:26.890 --> 01:51:29.400
(Annnyways) With the others disgusted with
what he’s done, Mu Dan states he just loves

01:51:29.400 --> 01:51:33.130
tinkering around but this isn't even half
of what he could do and that higher quality

01:51:33.130 --> 01:51:35.300
humans usually become Tan.

01:51:35.300 --> 01:51:38.600
Hearing him bring up this random Tan thing,
Senta questions if he was talking really talking

01:51:38.600 --> 01:51:40.409
about the Elixir of Life.

01:51:40.409 --> 01:51:44.710
Quickly realizing what Senta was referring
too Mu Dan tells him that it does exist, yet

01:51:44.710 --> 01:51:48.989
the elixir doesn't actually benefit humans
as it will only turn them into trees.

01:51:48.989 --> 01:51:52.329
So if they are only here for that, then there
isn't any chance they'll find what they’re

01:51:52.329 --> 01:51:53.329
looking for.

01:51:53.329 --> 01:51:57.099
After hearing this piece of information, Sagiri
worries over Gabimaru's as now it doesn't

01:51:57.099 --> 01:51:59.800
even seem like there's a way to complete the
mission.

01:51:59.800 --> 01:52:03.100
Breaking her train of thought, Mu Dan just
asks that they surrender here as their mission

01:52:03.100 --> 01:52:04.100
has ended.

01:52:04.100 --> 01:52:08.449
Catching him by surprise though, Yuzuriha
substitutes herself for an Arborified tree.

01:52:08.449 --> 01:52:11.810
Appearing directly behind him, she throws
a bunch of kunai into the back of Mu Dan,

01:52:11.810 --> 01:52:15.210
then as she begins to fall down pulls out
her sword while chanting and slices the immortal

01:52:15.210 --> 01:52:16.210
being.

01:52:16.210 --> 01:52:19.239
Just as quickly darting away from the monster,
she grabs Sagiri’s shoulder turning the

01:52:19.239 --> 01:52:23.380
direction she was facing and telling her that
they need to escape while they have the chance.

01:52:23.380 --> 01:52:27.570
With the others trying to gap it, a regenerating
Mu Dan comments that she's extremely impressive,

01:52:27.570 --> 01:52:31.350
but got one thing wrong, the Kiyoshi are not
servants but toys.

01:52:31.350 --> 01:52:35.099
Again with the flick of the wrist Mu Dan commands
the Kiyōshi to jump at Yuzuriha and detonate

01:52:35.099 --> 01:52:36.850
upon coming into close contact.

01:52:36.850 --> 01:52:41.790
Getting caught between the two of them, Yuzuriha
only barely manages to avoid the explosion.

01:52:41.790 --> 01:52:45.659
Rising to her knee’s Mu Dan notes that though
she’s hidden it extremely well, but she

01:52:45.659 --> 01:52:46.830
can already perceive Tao.

01:52:46.830 --> 01:52:51.630
Wanting to back up his girl, Senta steps forth
telling Mu Dan that if this concerns her life

01:52:51.630 --> 01:52:54.400
and death, then he’ll have to go through
him.

01:52:54.400 --> 01:52:58.489
Becoming intrigued the immortal comments that
if Yuzuriha has the aptitude for it then he’ll

01:52:58.489 --> 01:53:02.850
teach her how to properly wield Tao, if not
she’ll make quality Tan either way.

01:53:02.850 --> 01:53:07.599
Having watched Senta step out infront of her
prepared to put his life on the line, Sagiri

01:53:07.599 --> 01:53:10.280
wonders if he had any attachments to Yuzuriha.

01:53:10.280 --> 01:53:14.030
Not interested in anyone but the Shinobi,
Mu Dan rushes towards Sagiri telling her to

01:53:14.030 --> 01:53:17.820
move aside before launching her across the
area using a distant strike.

01:53:17.820 --> 01:53:22.550
Moving his attention to Yuzuriha, Mu Dan asked
if she observed how he gathered Tao together.

01:53:22.550 --> 01:53:26.560
Before going any further, Senta who’s way
quickly than I ever expected cuts both of

01:53:26.560 --> 01:53:30.140
Mu Dan's hands off, saying that he will have
to get past him first.

01:53:30.140 --> 01:53:34.280
Jumping in from behind Yuzuriha tells the
number 5 to back off before using her Ninpo:

01:53:34.280 --> 01:53:36.429
Slime String to trap the creature.

01:53:36.429 --> 01:53:40.320
Wondering what might work on him she uses
Ninpo: Nectar Prison to melt away the immortals

01:53:40.320 --> 01:53:44.820
shell then follows up and annihilates the
rest of him with Ninpo: Grim Garrote.

01:53:44.820 --> 01:53:49.100
Reviving himself as bunch of thorns he taunts
Yuzuriha calling her application of Tao nothing

01:53:49.100 --> 01:53:51.670
more than a child flailing around.

01:53:51.670 --> 01:53:54.889
Thinking that if they keep him blinded they
might stand a chance Senta cuts the top part

01:53:54.889 --> 01:53:58.400
of Mu Dan's head but its utterly useless as
he taunts them while blind.

01:53:58.400 --> 01:54:02.670
He also ceases the regeneration of his eyes
and dodges every one of their attacks.

01:54:02.670 --> 01:54:06.760
Getting in next to Yuzuriha he grabs her leg
and swings her towards Senta knocking them

01:54:06.760 --> 01:54:07.760
both to the ground.

01:54:07.760 --> 01:54:12.469
The reason that Mu Dan is able to comfortable
fight back even while blind is because Tao

01:54:12.469 --> 01:54:14.320
is felt, not seen with someone's eyes.

01:54:14.320 --> 01:54:17.929
If he cloaks himself in it, it allows him
to feel out the movements of his opponents

01:54:17.929 --> 01:54:20.600
and tells them they are no match for him.

01:54:20.600 --> 01:54:25.510
Standing there fully T posed out of his mind,
the immortal god re welcomes them to Hōrai,

01:54:25.510 --> 01:54:30.449
causing Senta to fall into about of despair
not knowing what to do against such a monster.

01:54:30.449 --> 01:54:35.050
Nearby Sagiri tries to recover from Mu Dan's
earlier attack stating that it was if it affected

01:54:35.050 --> 01:54:36.050
her very soul.

01:54:36.050 --> 01:54:39.449
She pleads with Hoko to think back over all
of the text’s he own for anything that relates

01:54:39.449 --> 01:54:40.719
to a possible weakness.

01:54:40.719 --> 01:54:44.320
Hōko though who is obviously going through
it realizing that everything he every knew

01:54:44.320 --> 01:54:48.719
was a lie, says that he can't be stopped since
he has the powers of a god and he’s already

01:54:48.719 --> 01:54:50.600
accepted his passing.

01:54:50.600 --> 01:54:54.870
Unable to just give up Sagiri encourages him
to try remember anything and reminds him of

01:54:54.870 --> 01:54:58.780
the fact that if they don't survive here,
then he’ll never see Mei again.

01:54:58.780 --> 01:55:03.150
Cutting in, Mu Dan notes that Yuzuriha's Substitution
technique and other uses of Tao appear to

01:55:03.150 --> 01:55:07.619
have the same attribute as him, though this
left her confused as to what he was even talking

01:55:07.619 --> 01:55:08.619
about.

01:55:08.619 --> 01:55:12.530
Not noticing Sagiri behind him he considers
taking out Senta, but quickly catches on and

01:55:12.530 --> 01:55:13.929
avoids the sneak attack.

01:55:13.929 --> 01:55:17.579
Having figured out that he was using someone's
intent to figure out their next movements,

01:55:17.579 --> 01:55:21.540
Sagiri throws her sword forth wondering what
an item without intent would do.

01:55:21.540 --> 01:55:26.140
Mu Dan I swear this man just closed his eyes
or something, but dude just watches as Sagiri’s

01:55:26.140 --> 01:55:28.329
blade fly's straight into his tanden.

01:55:28.329 --> 01:55:32.940
With Hoko screaming at her to finish the job,
Sagiri catches upto her blade and cleaves

01:55:32.940 --> 01:55:35.440
down, pulling the blade through the monsters
tanden.

01:55:35.440 --> 01:55:39.199
The reason that the Tanden is such a vital
spot to attack throughout the series is because

01:55:39.199 --> 01:55:40.790
Tao is born there.

01:55:40.790 --> 01:55:44.610
Then from that there it cycles around someone's
body before returning back to that point.

01:55:44.610 --> 01:55:48.210
So in the case with Sagiri, even if someone
like Tensen takes damage to the Tanden it

01:55:48.210 --> 01:55:50.369
should theoretically destroy them.

01:55:50.369 --> 01:55:55.110
However, Mu Dan reveals himself to be perfectly
fine, explaining that attacks without Tao

01:55:55.110 --> 01:55:56.139
do no harm to him.

01:55:56.139 --> 01:55:59.840
Already having coming to that conclusion herself,
Sagiri thanks him as all she needed was to

01:55:59.840 --> 01:56:02.750
get in close and confirm exactly how it was
activated.

01:56:02.750 --> 01:56:06.870
Taking a breath, Sagiri releases a massive
burst of Tao completely confusing the immortal

01:56:06.870 --> 01:56:07.870
nerd.

01:56:07.870 --> 01:56:11.449
Shocked by this phenomenon, Mu Dan leans back
just enough to avoid the lethal swing.

01:56:11.449 --> 01:56:15.960
Trying to think about what in the world just
happened Mu Dan quickly concludes that Sagiri

01:56:15.960 --> 01:56:18.610
can also control Tao and gleefully smiles..

01:56:18.610 --> 01:56:22.079
Due to the stuff thats happened so far throughout
the series like her experience with being

01:56:22.079 --> 01:56:26.489
near Gabimaru and fighting Rokurōta, Sagiri
knows that she’s already able to perceive

01:56:26.489 --> 01:56:27.489
Tao.

01:56:27.489 --> 01:56:30.190
All she has to do now is input a certain amount
of energy while controlling her breathing

01:56:30.190 --> 01:56:31.190
pattern.

01:56:31.190 --> 01:56:35.591
After learning that Sagiri's Tao can harm
him, Mu Dan screams in delight, wondering

01:56:35.591 --> 01:56:39.929
if she will become another piece of beautiful
art, or manage to kill him first.

01:56:39.929 --> 01:56:44.260
Placing his hands together and using Hojutsu:
Earth Yin, Night Pilgrim he instantly vanishes

01:56:44.260 --> 01:56:47.420
and appears before an unaware Sagiri attempting
to attack her.

01:56:47.420 --> 01:56:51.600
Seeing through his trick, Yuzuriha restrains
Mu Dan using her strings and calls out to

01:56:51.600 --> 01:56:55.920
Sagiri saying that he’s using a similar
ability to her substitution technique.

01:56:55.920 --> 01:57:00.190
Seizing the opportunity, Sagiri tries to take
out Mu Dan, but the immortal uses his Senjutsu

01:57:00.190 --> 01:57:03.409
technique to releases a burst of Tao from
his mouth to deflect her attack, allowing

01:57:03.409 --> 01:57:04.530
him to kick her back.

01:57:04.530 --> 01:57:09.430
Then with both girls somewhat occupied he
commands the Kiyōshi to attack Yuzuriha.

01:57:09.430 --> 01:57:12.980
Coming in clutch though Senta quickly cuts
them down before taking a distant Tao strike

01:57:12.980 --> 01:57:14.590
directly the the chest.

01:57:14.590 --> 01:57:18.560
Thinking that the battles going smoothly Mu
Dan taunts the group letting them know its

01:57:18.560 --> 01:57:22.800
to easy to read their movements, yet in that
typical think before you speak manga way of

01:57:22.800 --> 01:57:27.679
doing things, dude has his leg forcefully
detached by Yuzuriha using her Ninpo: Whiplash

01:57:27.679 --> 01:57:28.679
Slash.

01:57:28.679 --> 01:57:32.170
Closing in the group absolutely ravages the
immortal while he simultaneously taunts them

01:57:32.170 --> 01:57:34.210
for just how well there doing.

01:57:34.210 --> 01:57:38.340
Quickly escaping the mess before Sagiri strikes,
Mu Dan levitates up into the sky above them

01:57:38.340 --> 01:57:41.619
using Hojutsu: Earth Yang, Sky Pilgrim.

01:57:41.619 --> 01:57:45.810
Speaking as if this dudes a god of something,
it says that those ignorant of the of Tao

01:57:45.810 --> 01:57:48.250
would consider his techniques to be divine.

01:57:48.250 --> 01:57:52.310
Having summoned large water droplets he then
activates Senjutsu: Tin Splinter sending all

01:57:52.310 --> 01:57:55.590
of them rocketing towards the ground below
cracking the very floor they’re all standing

01:57:55.590 --> 01:57:56.590
on.

01:57:56.590 --> 01:57:59.690
With blood beginning to fall from her nose,
Sagiri notes just how much of her stamina

01:57:59.690 --> 01:58:01.890
is being robbed by this Tao.

01:58:01.890 --> 01:58:05.679
Remembering Mu Dan's previous statement about
different types of Tao, Yuzuriha informs her

01:58:05.679 --> 01:58:08.790
that her Tao might be the specific type that
counters his.

01:58:08.790 --> 01:58:12.530
Needing to force an opening for Sagiri to
strike him down, she steps forth and uses

01:58:12.530 --> 01:58:15.739
that sticky string ability of hers to bring
the immortal closer.

01:58:15.739 --> 01:58:19.360
After withstanding a point blank showering
from Mu Dan’s Tin Splinter, she rips the

01:58:19.360 --> 01:58:23.000
creature towards the floor while screaming
out for Sagiri to finish the job.

01:58:23.000 --> 01:58:26.790
Reappearing himself, the beaten and bruised
Senta seizes his chance to pin him down allowing

01:58:26.790 --> 01:58:29.239
Sagiri a few more moments to prepare her attack.

01:58:29.239 --> 01:58:33.060
Boosting it in, Sagiri slices straight through
the Tanden of Mu Dan while implementing her

01:58:33.060 --> 01:58:36.850
specific affinity for Tao, finishing off the
supposedly immortal creature.

01:58:36.850 --> 01:58:41.570
Absolutely knackered from the battle they
just endured, both Yuzuriha and Sagiri quietly

01:58:41.570 --> 01:58:42.690
rejoice.

01:58:42.690 --> 01:58:46.849
After finally ending their fight with Mu Dan,
Sagiri comes to Hōko's aid and recaps what

01:58:46.849 --> 01:58:47.869
she knows abou Tao.

01:58:47.869 --> 01:58:52.690
The amount of Tao depends on a specific individual,
it can be boosted or lessened by manipulating

01:58:52.690 --> 01:58:53.690
spiritual intensity.

01:58:53.690 --> 01:58:58.400
There are a different attributes, each of
which can give someone an advantage over the

01:58:58.400 --> 01:58:59.400
other.

01:58:59.400 --> 01:59:02.600
However the most important thing that the
group confirmed, even if it disappointed them,

01:59:02.600 --> 01:59:07.040
was that the Elixir of Life didnt exist, not
in the form they suspected at least.

01:59:07.040 --> 01:59:10.860
Due to that realization, Yuzuriha states that
they would have to come up with another plan,

01:59:10.860 --> 01:59:14.340
but its no use thinking on something they
cant do anything about.

01:59:14.340 --> 01:59:17.820
Looking over though she see’s the massive
golden head statues and considers the idea

01:59:17.820 --> 01:59:20.489
of replacing the elixir with a massive amount
of gold.

01:59:20.489 --> 01:59:24.800
Putting that aside for now though the group
just decide to sit down and rest.

01:59:24.800 --> 01:59:28.810
Sagiri sits down with Senta and hears him
give Yuzuriha a compliment, making her question

01:59:28.810 --> 01:59:30.100
if he had any feelings for Yuzuriha.

01:59:30.100 --> 01:59:35.380
Senta denies this and says that its actually
more he is envious of Yuzuriha's innate freedom.

01:59:35.380 --> 01:59:39.989
During his childhood he really wanted to become
an artist, but for generations the boys inside

01:59:39.989 --> 01:59:42.829
of his family had been sent to train under
the Yamada clan.

01:59:42.829 --> 01:59:47.250
He couldnt deny or change his future because
it was tradition, though in truth he hated

01:59:47.250 --> 01:59:48.250
it all.

01:59:48.250 --> 01:59:51.239
The idea of killing most of all struck a note
within him that led him to seek religion and

01:59:51.239 --> 01:59:52.570
eventually become a scholar.

01:59:52.570 --> 01:59:57.460
In the end Senta chose to abandon his dream
and carry out his duties as an executioner.

01:59:57.460 --> 02:00:01.420
He recalls how moments after taking out Moro,
Yuzuriha managed to see right through him

02:00:01.420 --> 02:00:04.199
and how he admires the way she seemed so free.

02:00:04.199 --> 02:00:07.830
Feeling similar about Gabimaru and how he’s
changed over this mission, Sagiri brings up

02:00:07.830 --> 02:00:12.130
the possibility that in the future all of
them could work together on the island.

02:00:12.130 --> 02:00:17.090
Nearby Yuzuriha notices that Mu Dan's body
is continuing to turn into flowers at a progressively

02:00:17.090 --> 02:00:18.860
alarming rate.

02:00:18.860 --> 02:00:22.619
Instantly a stinger launches towards Yuzuriha
taking her by surprise, Senta though like

02:00:22.619 --> 02:00:27.520
the weeb king he is, quickly comes in shoving
her out of the way but sadly receiving a direct

02:00:27.520 --> 02:00:29.329
hit by the plant.

02:00:29.329 --> 02:00:33.030
Falling into a hallucination, it shows Senta
thinking about Yuzuriha while showing the

02:00:33.030 --> 02:00:35.030
beautiful artwork he’d made of her.

02:00:35.030 --> 02:00:39.390
Deeply sinful was the way of his work, yet
she was the gale to completely change the

02:00:39.390 --> 02:00:41.820
perception he had about everything.

02:00:41.820 --> 02:00:45.829
Back in the present the effects of Mu Dan’s
last ditch attack caused flowers to instantly

02:00:45.829 --> 02:00:50.050
begin sprouting from the head of Senta, confirming
his demise.

02:00:50.050 --> 02:00:52.130
Rip Big Senta.

02:00:52.130 --> 02:00:56.820
Above him though, Sagiri and Yuzuriha watch
in horror as Mu Dan starts to transform into

02:00:56.820 --> 02:01:01.679
a monster, before completing his transformation
as a visual representation of Yin and Yang.

02:01:01.679 --> 02:01:06.290
It laughs at the flabbergasted humans knowing
that now they’re completely unable to do

02:01:06.290 --> 02:01:07.780
anything against another attack.

02:01:07.780 --> 02:01:11.469
Readying itself, it shoots a plethora of similar
stingers towards the girls.

02:01:11.469 --> 02:01:16.530
However, Saving the day, the blind king Yamada
Asaemon Shion arrives on time and beautifully

02:01:16.530 --> 02:01:18.320
cuts the stingers.

02:01:18.320 --> 02:01:21.260
Acting quickly, he then orders Nurugai to
remove the growing flowers from Senta's body

02:01:21.260 --> 02:01:24.860
and tells Sagiri that he will stand in for
the fight against this creature.

02:01:24.860 --> 02:01:28.880
After Nurugai helps remove Senta's blooming
flowers, Sagiri asks Hōko if there was a

02:01:28.880 --> 02:01:30.570
way to save him.

02:01:30.570 --> 02:01:34.510
Unfortunately, Hōko states that it was beyond
his control, either way she helps Senta by

02:01:34.510 --> 02:01:36.920
giving him medicine to slow down the bleeding.

02:01:36.920 --> 02:01:40.810
Sagiri looks towards Shion and asks about
his current condition but Nurugai informs

02:01:40.810 --> 02:01:44.480
her that Shion is more than capable enough
to fight the monster and that they came with

02:01:44.480 --> 02:01:47.190
the purpose of finding a certain someone.

02:01:47.190 --> 02:01:51.130
Using the knowledge he acquired from his experimentations
on the Sōshin, Shion fends off a bunch of

02:01:51.130 --> 02:01:54.909
stingers, before sprinting at the creature
and using Fiends Flurry along with Autumn

02:01:54.909 --> 02:01:56.460
Rains to injure the creature.

02:01:56.460 --> 02:02:00.220
Not bothered, Mu Dan’s Shikai form just
annihilates the area by creating more Tin

02:02:00.220 --> 02:02:02.070
Slinters that rain down from above.

02:02:02.070 --> 02:02:05.889
Throwing his sword forth though the smoke
as a distraction, Shion then appears himself

02:02:05.889 --> 02:02:07.690
and kicks the monster across the courtyard.

02:02:07.690 --> 02:02:11.610
However, random flowers start sprouting up
all over Shion due to the scratches he was

02:02:11.610 --> 02:02:13.150
given by the monsters stingers.

02:02:13.150 --> 02:02:18.210
Without even considering the damage, he removes
them by slicing away at the stem of every

02:02:18.210 --> 02:02:19.239
flower.

02:02:19.239 --> 02:02:23.760
Despite this set back, Shion refuses give
up stating that he has no death wish, yet

02:02:23.760 --> 02:02:27.420
if death lies in the coming road, then he’ll
accept it without hesitation.

02:02:27.420 --> 02:02:31.950
Sagiri tries to help aid him, but Nurugai
stops her, stating that she can barely walk,

02:02:31.950 --> 02:02:33.870
let along fight.

02:02:33.870 --> 02:02:37.400
Regardless, Sagiri explains that she can't
allow Shion to sacrifice himself for the lives

02:02:37.400 --> 02:02:42.579
of others, however if she intervenes then
by working together they could win.

02:02:42.579 --> 02:02:46.302
Hearing this Nurugai is persuaded to fight
alongside but Yuzuriha complains that she

02:02:46.302 --> 02:02:48.410
just cant as she’s to low on energy.

02:02:48.410 --> 02:02:53.579
Walking over to them, Nurugai randomly hugs
both Yuzuriha and Sagiri, explaining it as

02:02:53.579 --> 02:02:57.050
a weird way to restore stamina that she’d
been doing from a very young age and now after

02:02:57.050 --> 02:02:59.400
learning of Tao, tried to implement it differently.

02:02:59.400 --> 02:03:03.400
Able to move now because of it, Sagiri and
Nurugai ready themselves to step into the

02:03:03.400 --> 02:03:04.580
battlefield.

02:03:04.580 --> 02:03:10.150
With the duo coated in bandages and Yuzuriha's
protective fluid as a way to prevent infection

02:03:10.150 --> 02:03:13.920
from the monsters stingers, they both step
in to fight alongside Shion.

02:03:13.920 --> 02:03:17.949
Getting the blind kings attention, she informs
him that she knows the monsters weak point,

02:03:17.949 --> 02:03:21.880
so the plan to take him down will be distracting
the monster while he gets in behind and slices

02:03:21.880 --> 02:03:22.880
its Tanden.

02:03:22.880 --> 02:03:26.380
Rushing at them, Mu Dan attempts to take out
Nurugai first, who somehow manages to weave

02:03:26.380 --> 02:03:28.070
in and out of the stingers.

02:03:28.070 --> 02:03:32.730
Not seeing its hand though, Mu Dan almost
manages to slam down on Nurugai, however Sagiri

02:03:32.730 --> 02:03:36.620
comes in clutch, slashing at the hand and
defending herself from a secondary stinger

02:03:36.620 --> 02:03:37.620
attack.

02:03:37.620 --> 02:03:40.900
Running to get in behind the monster himself,
Shion uses his Harvest Shower technique to

02:03:40.900 --> 02:03:45.060
create an opening, but its just no use as
it quickly retaliates shooting a blast of

02:03:45.060 --> 02:03:46.949
Tao towards the Samurai.

02:03:46.949 --> 02:03:50.750
Refusing to be pushed back, Shion charges
forth, jumps into the sky and strikes down

02:03:50.750 --> 02:03:51.750
on the creature.

02:03:51.750 --> 02:03:55.820
Yet, this was all a rouse, using this moment
he lands on the ground and strafes under the

02:03:55.820 --> 02:03:58.380
monster as its leg was still coming down.

02:03:58.380 --> 02:04:02.050
Appearing behind its back now, Shion unleashes
a flurry of cuts that seemingly cut through

02:04:02.050 --> 02:04:04.880
its branch like legs, dropping it do the floor
below.

02:04:04.880 --> 02:04:09.000
Now not at the same height, the monster tries
to defend itself but Shion forces himself

02:04:09.000 --> 02:04:12.350
through its attacks while Sagiri restrains
one of its hand with her sword, allowing Shion

02:04:12.350 --> 02:04:14.599
to get behind the monster.

02:04:14.599 --> 02:04:18.639
Thinking about everything that has happened
since he made landfall, Shion becomes enraged.

02:04:18.639 --> 02:04:22.570
The fact that all he could do was flee when
his disciple was dying is unforgivable..

02:04:22.570 --> 02:04:26.920
For his own unforgivable crimes of weakness,
he curses the gods stating that until this

02:04:26.920 --> 02:04:31.489
foe is ended of his life ends, Yamada Asaemon
Shion shan't know exoneration.

02:04:31.489 --> 02:04:35.739
This next technique of his took years to craft,
thousands of lives made this hidden technique

02:04:35.739 --> 02:04:36.770
so lethal.

02:04:36.770 --> 02:04:41.340
For Shion manipulating these waves of Tao
is akin to manipulating his own life force

02:04:41.340 --> 02:04:42.659
and spirit.

02:04:42.659 --> 02:04:46.370
Swinging his blade down now, he threatens
these false gods, telling him that its time

02:04:46.370 --> 02:04:51.080
they learnt about the fleeting nature of a
normal life, its beauty and terror.

02:04:51.080 --> 02:04:55.219
Shion swings his blade down towards the monsters
tanden, but halts himself after not sensing

02:04:55.219 --> 02:05:02.900
any strong waves making him wonder if those
were even its weak points.

02:05:02.900 --> 02:05:06.659
Knowing that he doesnt have time to overthink
the situation, Senta the goat rises from the

02:05:06.659 --> 02:05:10.510
ashes for a moment to scream out that the
monsters weakness is its ovule since its body

02:05:10.510 --> 02:05:11.510
is plant-based.

02:05:11.510 --> 02:05:15.780
Guiding him to exactly where the ovules located
on the creature, Shion dives forth dodging

02:05:15.780 --> 02:05:19.590
the regenerated stingers and slashing at its
weak spot causing multiple Mu Dan heads to

02:05:19.590 --> 02:05:20.980
begin sprouting out.

02:05:20.980 --> 02:05:25.230
One of the heads becomes captivated by Shion’s
unwavering ability to face death, stating

02:05:25.230 --> 02:05:29.630
that he had truly achieved bliss, Yin and
Yang in perfect harmony.

02:05:29.630 --> 02:05:34.030
Slashing at the open weak spot, Shion finally
manages to take down Mu Dan, sending the massive

02:05:34.030 --> 02:05:37.050
creature he’d formed into crashing down
onto the ground below.

02:05:37.050 --> 02:05:42.920
With it beginning to dissipate, the surrounding
area becomes covered in flowers.

02:05:42.920 --> 02:05:48.370
After finally ending the battle, Sagiri rushes
to Senta who is still somehow alive, but readily

02:05:48.370 --> 02:05:49.690
succumbing to his wounds.

02:05:49.690 --> 02:05:52.730
Sagiri begs Yuzuriha to apply more of her
medicine to him.

02:05:52.730 --> 02:05:56.340
However, she refuses as it just wouldn't make
sense to use the remaining amount she has

02:05:56.340 --> 02:05:58.739
left on Senta when he’s guaranteed to die.

02:05:58.739 --> 02:06:02.679
Instead she’s more of a realist and understands
that Senta knows he’s at the ends of his

02:06:02.679 --> 02:06:06.070
road so it only makes sense to give it to
Shion.

02:06:06.070 --> 02:06:10.170
Yuzuriha comforts Senta as she tells him to
let go of his duties as an executioner and

02:06:10.170 --> 02:06:13.389
think about something he desires as his last
memories.

02:06:13.389 --> 02:06:17.800
Crouching down beside Senta in his final moments,
she tells him to instead think about something

02:06:17.800 --> 02:06:20.070
else instead of this honor bound stuff.

02:06:20.070 --> 02:06:24.310
Think about something that he holds dear instead,
like a family pet or a lover he wont ever

02:06:24.310 --> 02:06:28.610
see again and if it helps she’ll hold him
close in these dark times.

02:06:28.610 --> 02:06:32.849
Slowly passing away now Senta just thinks
about the few small joys he had in life and

02:06:32.849 --> 02:06:36.960
now the beautiful Yuzuriha next to him as
he dies with a smile.

02:06:36.960 --> 02:06:42.301
In a moment of silence the group buries his
body and decides to rest before continuing

02:06:42.301 --> 02:06:43.489
on their journey.

02:06:43.489 --> 02:06:47.739
Sagiri thanks Yuzuriha and Nurugai for their
help, but states that from now on she will

02:06:47.739 --> 02:06:49.780
not suffer the death of another ally.

02:06:49.780 --> 02:06:53.730
All of them will survive and escape this island
no matter what.

02:06:53.730 --> 02:06:57.130
After waking up from his unconscious state,
Gabimaru instinctually jumps from where he

02:06:57.130 --> 02:07:01.260
was to see Gantetsusai, Fuchi, and Mei all
just chilling out staring at him.

02:07:01.260 --> 02:07:04.850
Fuchi informs him that they’re in a cave
situated halfway up the valley and are just

02:07:04.850 --> 02:07:06.480
stopping in for the night.

02:07:06.480 --> 02:07:10.639
Gabimaru thinks to himself that he cant seem
to remember the details of how he fell unconscious.

02:07:10.639 --> 02:07:14.880
With him awake, Fuchi begins going over what
they know so far about Tao.

02:07:14.880 --> 02:07:18.810
Meanwhile, Sagiri's group enter Hōrai and
settle’s inside of a building to also go

02:07:18.810 --> 02:07:20.920
over what they know so far.

02:07:20.920 --> 02:07:25.040
Yuzuriha and Nurugai happily use the opportunity
to change into some Chinese looking clothes

02:07:25.040 --> 02:07:27.860
while Shion tries to discuss what they know
about Tao.

02:07:27.860 --> 02:07:32.040
He explains that they need to use Tao wisely
or there will be grave consequences to their

02:07:32.040 --> 02:07:34.950
body, mind and in worst cases even death.

02:07:34.950 --> 02:07:38.199
Remembering what Hoko had told him, Shion
brings up the idea that multiple types of

02:07:38.199 --> 02:07:40.280
waves or Tao actually exist.

02:07:40.280 --> 02:07:44.440
In his eyes they would have to be; Wood, Fire,
Earth, Metal and Water.

02:07:44.440 --> 02:07:48.239
These 5 attributes are locked into a web of
constant influence.

02:07:48.239 --> 02:07:52.330
Some types would help to heal or restore someone's
Tao whereas others would do the opposite and

02:07:52.330 --> 02:07:54.250
hinder someone to a greater extent.

02:07:54.250 --> 02:07:58.420
Shion believes that if they can exploit these
attributes or types then maybe even the immortals

02:07:58.420 --> 02:07:59.550
might be felled.

02:07:59.550 --> 02:08:04.080
Nurugai then reminds him that they need to
also focus on acquiring the Elixir of Life.

02:08:04.080 --> 02:08:08.320
(which from what we know doesn't exactly exist
in a fruit like form) Yuzuriha states that

02:08:08.320 --> 02:08:11.920
from what Mu Dan had said about the elixir
during the early stages of their fight its

02:08:11.920 --> 02:08:13.159
not actually what they’re looking for.

02:08:13.159 --> 02:08:16.380
However, Sagiri tells them that according
to Gabimaru, his village chief is immortal

02:08:16.380 --> 02:08:19.010
because of an elixir which proves that something
similar must exist.

02:08:19.010 --> 02:08:23.639
Being a Kunoichi Yuzuriha just knows how these
villages work behind the scenes and explains

02:08:23.639 --> 02:08:27.770
the possibilities of the chief using an illusion
known as genjutsu to try and fool his people

02:08:27.770 --> 02:08:31.980
into thinking he was immortal in order for
them to bend to his authority.

02:08:31.980 --> 02:08:35.880
Meanwhile, Fuchi interprets Mei's words and
explains to them that the proper use of certain

02:08:35.880 --> 02:08:37.980
attributes will help them defeat the enemy.

02:08:37.980 --> 02:08:42.390
While listening, Gabimaru wonders if he has
some kinda amnesia or mind blank as he’s

02:08:42.390 --> 02:08:45.030
still unable to recall anything from the past.

02:08:45.030 --> 02:08:49.650
With this in mind, Yuzuriha also explains
her theory that Gabimaru's wife might also

02:08:49.650 --> 02:08:53.880
be an illusion set up by the clan in order
for Gabimaru to have a purpose in surviving

02:08:53.880 --> 02:08:54.880
his missions.

02:08:54.880 --> 02:08:55.880
With Yuzuriha questioning if she even exists
and asking if she was ever told her name,

02:08:55.880 --> 02:09:00.449
Sagiri stands there shocked unable to reply,
while over in the cave Gabimaru confirms that

02:09:00.449 --> 02:09:02.639
he cant remember anything once more.

02:09:02.639 --> 02:09:07.230
He knows that he’s Gabimaru the Hollow the
strongest Shinobi in Iwagakure, but because

02:09:07.230 --> 02:09:10.920
his memory is fragmented decides to go along
with what is happening until he can determine

02:09:10.920 --> 02:09:14.230
whether the people around him are allies or
hiding their true nature.

02:09:14.230 --> 02:09:17.370
Having finished discussing what they know
about Tao Fuchi decides that they should get

02:09:17.370 --> 02:09:19.849
some rest for now and move off tomorrow.

02:09:19.849 --> 02:09:24.570
Later on as the others sleep, Mei walks outside
to check up on Gabi who tells her that he

02:09:24.570 --> 02:09:29.199
is okay but Mei becomes shocked after seeing
that half of his heads Tao is completely gone.

02:09:29.199 --> 02:09:33.369
At the same time inside of Hōrai, Sagiri
sits outside until she’s also joined by

02:09:33.369 --> 02:09:34.369
Shion.

02:09:34.369 --> 02:09:37.659
The two joke around for a moment, but Sagiri
cant help but to think about all of her fallen

02:09:37.659 --> 02:09:40.520
comrades and what could've possibly happened
to Gabimaru.

02:09:40.520 --> 02:09:44.990
After hearing her concern, Shion asked if
Sagiri had feelings for Gabimaru, however

02:09:44.990 --> 02:09:47.520
she stops him midway and denies his allegation.

02:09:47.520 --> 02:09:51.949
Nevertheless she explains that she feels sorry
for Gabimaru, he was born into a murderous

02:09:51.949 --> 02:09:54.190
village and his past still haunts him.

02:09:54.190 --> 02:09:58.230
Plus what's even worse is the fact that if
Yuzuriha is correct about his wife not existing,

02:09:58.230 --> 02:10:02.090
then his motivation for surviving this mission
was a complete farce.

02:10:02.090 --> 02:10:06.909
Sagiri apologizes to Shion for spewing out
all her thoughts onto him, however Shion explains

02:10:06.909 --> 02:10:10.809
that he understands what she’s talking about
and says that he can "overlook" this matter,

02:10:10.809 --> 02:10:12.329
causing Sagiri to laugh at his pun.

02:10:12.329 --> 02:10:15.360
(Ya know cause he’s the blind king man cant
see, genius)

02:10:15.360 --> 02:10:19.270
The next day, Gabimaru's group leave their
cave and travel up the rest of the valley

02:10:19.270 --> 02:10:22.190
before encountering the brothers Chōbei and
Tōma.

02:10:22.190 --> 02:10:26.890
Hearing Fuchi say that more humans might mean
more friends, Chōbei smiles and spin kicks

02:10:26.890 --> 02:10:27.890
Gabimaru.

02:10:27.890 --> 02:10:31.180
Back on demon time, Gabi vanishes from infront
of Chōbei, lands on his shoulders and seemingly

02:10:31.180 --> 02:10:33.070
taking him out in one swift move.

02:10:33.070 --> 02:10:37.110
However, Mei screams out warning him that
Chōbei’s Tao is massive.

02:10:37.110 --> 02:10:40.640
Grabbing ahold of him, Chōbei stands back
up and rips Gabi into the ground telling them

02:10:40.640 --> 02:10:43.440
that he isn't interested in becoming allies.

02:10:43.440 --> 02:10:47.750
Elsewhere and having left the mainland now,
Lord Aoki finds it foolish that the shogun

02:10:47.750 --> 02:10:51.840
has planned to send off around 50 Iwagakure
ninja, believing that their leader has motives

02:10:51.840 --> 02:10:53.309
of his own.

02:10:53.309 --> 02:10:56.590
Shugen tries to calm the Lord down, assuming
that his concern is with the multiple ninja

02:10:56.590 --> 02:10:57.920
on board.

02:10:57.920 --> 02:11:01.790
Randomly though, Aoki questions if him and
the three other Asaemon were capable of controlling

02:11:01.790 --> 02:11:03.990
these Ninja since two seemed to be unranked.

02:11:03.990 --> 02:11:09.099
Yoo so rolling up to the island along with
Rank 4 Jikka and the edgy Aizen stand-in,

02:11:09.099 --> 02:11:14.719
is the lil man Kiyomaru and the beautiful
but unmatched in still Isuzu.

02:11:14.719 --> 02:11:18.960
Kiyo isn't ranked because the man is still
to young to take part in the system and Isuzu

02:11:18.960 --> 02:11:22.599
isn't aswell because she takes the role as
a combat instructor employed personally by

02:11:22.599 --> 02:11:23.909
the shogun.

02:11:23.909 --> 02:11:27.670
Shugen states that they don't just approach
this mission as mere observers, no.

02:11:27.670 --> 02:11:32.230
The whole purpose for their expedition to
the island is to back up and support the vanguard.

02:11:32.230 --> 02:11:37.820
Kiyomaru becomes annoyed with Aoki as he thinks
its pathetic some random old fart can judge

02:11:37.820 --> 02:11:41.389
them because they’re unranked when in all
reality he could probably take him out before

02:11:41.389 --> 02:11:43.700
the dude even knew what happened to him.

02:11:43.700 --> 02:11:46.940
Isuzu tries to stop him but Kiyomaru flex’s
the fact that he could literally take down

02:11:46.940 --> 02:11:51.469
everyone on the ship alone and cuts the mask
off the ninja that appears next to him.

02:11:51.469 --> 02:11:55.450
Furious with Kiyomaru's rude behavior Isuzu
draws her blade, placing it near his neck

02:11:55.450 --> 02:11:57.080
and demanding that he sheathes his sword.

02:11:57.080 --> 02:12:01.530
With the two exchanging cold glares at each
other a random Iwagakure Ninja tells them

02:12:01.530 --> 02:12:03.889
that they mustn't worry about them at all.

02:12:03.889 --> 02:12:07.590
Noticing him, she awkwardly apologies to the
male ninja but he continues to assures her

02:12:07.590 --> 02:12:11.400
that he didnt mind and if they still had doubt
then to pick any one of them, then that said

02:12:11.400 --> 02:12:14.650
chosen one will be thrown overboard to show
their loyalty.

02:12:14.650 --> 02:12:18.349
Intrigued Kiyo hilariously tests his loyalty
by choosing the ninja who spoke up as the

02:12:18.349 --> 02:12:20.230
one to take emself out.

02:12:20.230 --> 02:12:24.210
Crazily enough its shown that this dude was
the leader of the Iwagakure squad and before

02:12:24.210 --> 02:12:28.719
following through with what he promised, passed
on the leadership to the ninja next to him.

02:12:28.719 --> 02:12:32.230
Following through with the order, he takes
himself out proving the loyalty their squad

02:12:32.230 --> 02:12:33.470
commands.

02:12:33.470 --> 02:12:40.540
Crazily enough the tune he mutters before
doing the deed called “Tooryanse” is a

02:12:40.540 --> 02:12:47.469
tune that accompanies a childhood game, similar
to london bridge is falling down type thing.

02:12:47.469 --> 02:12:55.929
Its also often used on the modern day crosswalks
as a tune to let people know when it is and

02:12:55.929 --> 02:12:57.090
isnt safe to cross.

02:12:57.090 --> 02:13:02.760
(when the music stops the games over)

02:13:02.760 --> 02:13:06.320
Having gained leadership, the other ninja
speaks up saying that they only desire to

02:13:06.320 --> 02:13:09.050
exist as tools and pleads for their trust.

02:13:09.050 --> 02:13:12.550
At that moment, one of the other Iwa ninjas
walks over to his former boss and remembers

02:13:12.550 --> 02:13:14.560
the orders given to them by the Chief.

02:13:14.560 --> 02:13:19.190
“Infiltrate this mission and kill Gabimaru,
ensure that he is purged from this world even

02:13:19.190 --> 02:13:23.100
if you have to sacrifice yourselves for the
cause.

02:13:23.100 --> 02:13:27.389
Kiyomaru discusses with the validity of what's
just gone on with Shugen, calling them just

02:13:27.389 --> 02:13:28.920
random weirdo’s.

02:13:28.920 --> 02:13:32.760
Shugen agree’s explaining that it matters
not as he never trusted them to begin with.

02:13:32.760 --> 02:13:37.059
All he’s ever seen them as is criminals,
they are alone are enough to find this elixir

02:13:37.059 --> 02:13:38.140
of life.

02:13:38.140 --> 02:13:42.070
Becoming enraged with the thought of losing
even move loved ones, Shugen states his resolve

02:13:42.070 --> 02:13:46.310
to have every criminal on the island executed
so that his clan members can return home.

02:13:46.310 --> 02:13:51.230
Kiyo throws out the possibility of them already
being felled yet after receiving a vicious

02:13:51.230 --> 02:13:52.230
glare, sprints off.

02:13:52.230 --> 02:13:57.500
I always laugh at this but oh well rip, Shugen
hopes that Eizen and that everyone else is

02:13:57.500 --> 02:13:59.500
still safe on the island.

02:13:59.500 --> 02:14:03.440
Meanwhile, Jikka questions Aoki if bringing
all these shady dudes was going to make the

02:14:03.440 --> 02:14:05.139
mission more difficult.

02:14:05.139 --> 02:14:09.400
Again its reiterated that its the shogun plans
to make a swift resolution and he thinks that

02:14:09.400 --> 02:14:12.579
the vanguard will be overjoyed by their upcoming
arrival.

02:14:12.579 --> 02:14:17.679
However, Jikka knows the reality of the situation,
this ship isn't the bringer of hope, no.

02:14:17.679 --> 02:14:22.139
Only chaos and death, the personification
of a vessel equipped with people to drive

02:14:22.139 --> 02:14:23.900
them to hell even faster.

02:14:23.900 --> 02:14:25.920
The stuff of nightmares.

02:14:25.920 --> 02:14:32.220
With this in mind Jikka tries one last time
to persuade him into having the ship return

02:14:32.220 --> 02:14:33.220
home.

02:14:33.220 --> 02:14:39.650
(I honestly love Jikka, reminds me of the
Ogi-san or similar characters, I guess him

02:14:39.650 --> 02:14:41.340
and Shion are similar in ways.

02:14:41.340 --> 02:14:45.130
There is so many amazing lines in this story
that are almost artistic with the way they

02:14:45.130 --> 02:14:47.290
spark some sort of vivid image in your mind.

02:14:47.290 --> 02:14:51.099
Both Shion with when he was trying to fell
Mu Dan and here with Jikka are prime examples.

02:14:51.099 --> 02:14:57.210
I think it plays into the whole era that Japan
is in, its one where art and language flourished

02:14:57.210 --> 02:15:09.639
and I think its perfectly adapted into this
story in its own subtle way.)

02:15:09.639 --> 02:15:13.250
Floating there as he rebounds back off the
ground, Gabimaru knows that Chōbei just healed

02:15:13.250 --> 02:15:16.909
a fatal wound and figures that he’s most
likely also one of the immortals Fuchi and

02:15:16.909 --> 02:15:17.909
the others were referring to earlier.

02:15:17.909 --> 02:15:19.849
Flinging himself into a handstand, Gabi shoots
a kick towards Chōbei but its comfortably

02:15:19.849 --> 02:15:20.849
blocked.

02:15:20.849 --> 02:15:24.150
Having a hold of his leg now the criminal
then flings Gabi over and smashes him into

02:15:24.150 --> 02:15:27.900
the ground below as if he had some sort of
super human strength.

02:15:27.900 --> 02:15:32.840
Gabimaru focuses his mind on trying to take
out Chōbei, he screams that he’s gonna

02:15:32.840 --> 02:15:37.340
tear him to pieces before pulling up his mask
and activating Ninpo: Blooming Needle shooting

02:15:37.340 --> 02:15:39.950
a rock straight at his opponent.

02:15:39.950 --> 02:15:44.040
Chōbei dodges but Gabimaru used the previous
attack as a distraction to quickly get above

02:15:44.040 --> 02:15:45.070
his target.

02:15:45.070 --> 02:15:49.590
Immortal or not Gabi foolishly assumes that
if he targets the brain and other senses then

02:15:49.590 --> 02:15:51.320
it should allow him to get the upper hand.

02:15:51.320 --> 02:15:56.090
However, as weve learnt so far, when someone
can manipulate Tao that just wont work.

02:15:56.090 --> 02:16:01.219
Instead Chōbei kicks Gabi in the head knowing
exactly where he was just off presence alone.

02:16:01.219 --> 02:16:04.690
Gabimaru then bites at him as a last ditch
effort which completely throws Chobei off.

02:16:04.690 --> 02:16:09.600
Jumping back he wonders as to why he’s acting
so uncivilized while at the same time Gabi

02:16:09.600 --> 02:16:13.580
still on that animal vibe tries to bite his
opponents vital areas.

02:16:13.580 --> 02:16:17.690
Managing to get on his shoulders, Gabi bites
down carotid but is unable to cause him damage

02:16:17.690 --> 02:16:20.130
as Chōbei wounds are instantly healed.

02:16:20.130 --> 02:16:23.159
Standing opposite each other now, Chōbei
steps it up a notch and stomps the ground

02:16:23.159 --> 02:16:27.409
causing the area to break apart leaving Gabi
open to a free hit as he struggles with his

02:16:27.409 --> 02:16:28.409
footing.

02:16:28.409 --> 02:16:31.059
Chōbei comments that Gabimaru is weak and
uses his Tao strike him, gritting his teeth

02:16:31.059 --> 02:16:32.059
through the pain though Gabi manages to unknowingly
throw a Tao infused punch, however it’s

02:16:32.059 --> 02:16:33.059
quickly intercepted by Chōbei lays down a
few more hits.

02:16:33.059 --> 02:16:35.950
Standing nearby and having watched the entire
battle so far, Gantetsusai wonders why Gabimaru

02:16:35.950 --> 02:16:40.320
is fighting poorly in-comparison to his last
battle and asks Mei if she has any idea.

02:16:40.320 --> 02:16:44.670
Being able to see Tao with ease Mei knows
that Gabi’s Tao is lacking its form and

02:16:44.670 --> 02:16:48.800
he lost something extremely important to him,
but due to her inability to communicate properly

02:16:48.800 --> 02:16:51.269
the others cant follow what she's saying.

02:16:51.269 --> 02:16:54.130
Beginning to take a fair amount of damage
now, Chōbei calls out to Tōma to attack

02:16:54.130 --> 02:16:55.130
the others.

02:16:55.130 --> 02:16:59.300
Listening to his broski, Tōma flies forth
and goes after Gantetsusai assuming that because

02:16:59.300 --> 02:17:01.719
he lost his hand he’s easy taking.

02:17:01.719 --> 02:17:06.429
Tamiya Gantetsusai, the dragon, utterly perplexed
by this persons choice to attack him first

02:17:06.429 --> 02:17:10.519
catches his sword and headbutts Tōma while
stealing blade in the process.

02:17:10.519 --> 02:17:13.969
Insulted with the thought a kid could take
him out, he throws the former Asaemon’s

02:17:13.969 --> 02:17:15.961
blade down telling them to get ready for the
real battle.

02:17:15.961 --> 02:17:16.961
As the battle gets underway Gantetsusai not
even using his blade is able to comfortably

02:17:16.961 --> 02:17:17.961
land a direct hit and catch Tōma’s blade
under his foot while taunting the former Asaemon.

02:17:17.961 --> 02:17:18.961
Knowing that they have potential, big G beats
Tōma around while telling him that he hasn't

02:17:18.961 --> 02:17:19.961
taken form yet and instead is weak because
he relies on his brother to fight his battles.

02:17:19.961 --> 02:17:20.961
He offers him the opportunity to join their
group, but Tōma tells him that his brother

02:17:20.961 --> 02:17:21.961
has no interest in teaming up with them and
also hates nothing more that seeing random

02:17:21.961 --> 02:17:22.961
people band together.

02:17:22.961 --> 02:17:23.961
In Tōma’s mind he only see’s himself
as an extension of his older brother and his

02:17:23.961 --> 02:17:24.961
brother decides the order of things.

02:17:24.961 --> 02:17:26.210
Screaming at the Doshi, Tōma then gets it
to join the battle, commanding it to attack

02:17:26.210 --> 02:17:30.109
the small ones but Fuchi who’s still with
Mei, steps in to guard her.

02:17:30.109 --> 02:17:33.979
Back in the other beatdown and seeing as how
he is being overpowered, Gabimaru ignites

02:17:33.979 --> 02:17:37.080
his body and focus solely on destroying Chōbei.

02:17:37.080 --> 02:17:40.860
He knows that when on the verge of death a
shinobi can wreak untold levels of destruction

02:17:40.860 --> 02:17:42.130
upon their enemy.

02:17:42.130 --> 02:17:46.769
Now completely ablaze, he sprints towards
the immortal criminal and uses Ninpō: Burning

02:17:46.769 --> 02:17:51.030
Bridge in combination with Ninpō: Stone Storm
to send a bunch of heated rocks flying through

02:17:51.030 --> 02:17:52.140
Chōbei.

02:17:52.140 --> 02:17:55.650
Crashing to the ground, Gabimaru gets onto
of him prepared to send himself and Chōbei

02:17:55.650 --> 02:17:56.870
to the shadow realm.

02:17:56.870 --> 02:18:00.410
The criminal tries saying that they’ll both
perish if he continues, but Gabi literally

02:18:00.410 --> 02:18:01.410
doesn't care.

02:18:01.410 --> 02:18:04.260
He doesn't even know why he’s on this random
island or partaking in this mission.

02:18:04.260 --> 02:18:08.090
If he dies right now, its not like it’ll
even matter, his village will just send another

02:18:08.090 --> 02:18:12.300
person to take his place, as at the end of
the day Shinobi are just a hive with nothing

02:18:12.300 --> 02:18:15.439
to lose and those who cling to life will never
win.

02:18:15.439 --> 02:18:19.760
Hearing this and becoming enraged at the idea
that he cant win because he has an attachment

02:18:19.760 --> 02:18:22.969
to his brother, Chōbei thanks Gabimaru for
helping him realize his resolve.

02:18:22.969 --> 02:18:27.620
So remember Mei and the Strong Weak stuff
from earlier, well as Chōbei states to himself

02:18:27.620 --> 02:18:31.519
that he does indeed have something to lose,
his mind becomes weaker and his body begins

02:18:31.519 --> 02:18:49.200
to transform into his breakdown state.

02:18:49.200 --> 02:18:52.719
I love how this forms called a breakdown cause
oml these boys bouta dance.

02:18:52.719 --> 02:18:56.689
Having unlocked this new form Chōbei unleashes
a transformation and uncontrollably attacks

02:18:56.689 --> 02:18:57.689
Gabimaru.

02:18:57.689 --> 02:19:01.349
Gabimaru tries to ward him off by releasing
a large burst of flames using Ninpo; Burning

02:19:01.349 --> 02:19:04.830
Bridge, but its no use as the demon just slashes
his way through them.

02:19:04.830 --> 02:19:08.660
Unable to block in time, big C sends a bunch
of his tentacles shooting into the hollow

02:19:08.660 --> 02:19:11.880
allowing him to toss Gabi across the area.

02:19:11.880 --> 02:19:15.660
Activating Ninpo Ascetic Blaze, Gabi just
barely manages to detach himself from the

02:19:15.660 --> 02:19:16.660
vines.

02:19:16.660 --> 02:19:20.849
Unable to see anymore, Chōbei's consciousness
begins to be consumed by the darkness, causing

02:19:20.849 --> 02:19:24.280
him to slash out in anger wondering where
in the world the Ninja could have gone.

02:19:24.280 --> 02:19:28.469
With the others no longer fighting, Gantetsusai
wonders why Gabi isn't using Tao to fight

02:19:28.469 --> 02:19:34.880
like he did yesterday, Mei says that he is
unable to use Tao and can't win against Chōbei

02:19:34.880 --> 02:19:37.130
as he’s just too strong.

02:19:37.130 --> 02:19:41.590
Falling into a moment of deep though, Gabimaru
makes the decision to use up his remaining

02:19:41.590 --> 02:19:47.240
life to kill Chōbei, however, he is briefly
stopped by a vision of someone long forgotten.

02:19:47.240 --> 02:19:52.109
Ignoring this uneasiness he rushes towards
Chōbei ready to do whatever it takes.

02:19:52.109 --> 02:19:55.550
Watching these beasts become more and more
confused, Fuchi just notes that both of them

02:19:55.550 --> 02:19:58.060
have lost themselves.

02:19:58.060 --> 02:20:02.039
Turning and seeing his brother become more
beast that man, Tōma remembers Gantetsusai

02:20:02.039 --> 02:20:05.920
words from earlier and realizes that Chōbei
has been fighting for his sake.

02:20:05.920 --> 02:20:10.050
Back in the battle Chōbei continues on his
rampage, sadly though he soon comes to see

02:20:10.050 --> 02:20:14.290
that for the past few blows, as he wondered
what he was, he’d unknowingly attacked Tōma

02:20:14.290 --> 02:20:17.310
who tried to make him come to his senses.

02:20:17.310 --> 02:20:21.240
Stuck and unable to move, taking in what he’d
just done, Tōma tries to break through his

02:20:21.240 --> 02:20:24.290
brothers shell, telling him that he’s everything
in the world to him.

02:20:24.290 --> 02:20:28.140
Sadly as he was doing this Gabimaru saw the
perfect opportunity to deal the finishing

02:20:28.140 --> 02:20:30.780
blow and prepared himself to do so.

02:20:30.780 --> 02:20:34.170
Not wanting Gabimaru to burn away the last
of his Tao because he’ll die, Mei rushes

02:20:34.170 --> 02:20:36.450
in to stop him from doing anything else.

02:20:36.450 --> 02:20:39.940
Standing behind him she releases a massive
blast from her Tao creating a crater that

02:20:39.940 --> 02:20:43.320
causes Gabimaru and the two siblings to start
falling.

02:20:43.320 --> 02:20:46.310
Gabimaru manages to get himself to safety
and as Chōbei turns trying to look for an

02:20:46.310 --> 02:20:49.850
escape route, throws stones forcing him deeper
into the whole.

02:20:49.850 --> 02:20:53.280
Thinking quickly, Chōbei uses his vine things
to throw Tōma to safety while telling him

02:20:53.280 --> 02:20:55.460
to wait for his return.

02:20:55.460 --> 02:20:59.810
So remember how Gantetsusai and Fuchi don't
really know Mei yet, like this aint the Hoko

02:20:59.810 --> 02:21:04.270
group and seeing her use this level of Tao
makes them question just how she accomplished

02:21:04.270 --> 02:21:05.270
such a feat.

02:21:05.270 --> 02:21:10.811
In an even more surprising revelation for
the two its shown that Mei was now fully grown.

02:21:10.811 --> 02:21:14.950
Meanwhile inside Hōrai, Sagiri suggests that
they go outside and reunite with Gabimaru

02:21:14.950 --> 02:21:16.140
and the others.

02:21:16.140 --> 02:21:20.010
However, Yuzuriha doesn't agree and instead
thinks their focus should be trying to escape

02:21:20.010 --> 02:21:21.229
from the island.

02:21:21.229 --> 02:21:25.060
Sagiri sees threw her intentions of wanting
to save herself and reveals her own plan to

02:21:25.060 --> 02:21:29.870
return home safely with every remaining person
as that way they then have an alibi.

02:21:29.870 --> 02:21:33.970
Sagiri reassures her that her desire to escape
hasn't changed its just that EVERYONE will

02:21:33.970 --> 02:21:35.160
be leaving this place together.

02:21:35.160 --> 02:21:39.050
Switching the conversation up, she ponder
if Gabimaru managed to arrive at the gate

02:21:39.050 --> 02:21:42.840
from the very beginning, to which Yuzuriha
reveals that he defiantly did as she found

02:21:42.840 --> 02:21:45.120
evidence that he was there before they came.

02:21:45.120 --> 02:21:50.050
In her eyes their best bet to bump back into
Gabimaru now is to wait around that gate.

02:21:50.050 --> 02:21:53.690
After deciding to head over to the gate the
girls note that seeing Hōrai clearly during

02:21:53.690 --> 02:21:55.910
the day is absolutely insane.

02:21:55.910 --> 02:21:59.550
Looking around the godly setting the group
becomes captivated by its mystic aura.

02:21:59.550 --> 02:22:03.790
Hōko remembers Mu Dan's words about Lord
Tensen experimenting with human life's and

02:22:03.790 --> 02:22:06.920
the humans on the island acting as test subjects.

02:22:06.920 --> 02:22:10.490
He wonders if the current humans on the island
will bring a change after seeing that they

02:22:10.490 --> 02:22:15.149
managed to take out an immortal and wonders
if he will still be himself when they do.

02:22:15.149 --> 02:22:20.300
Once they reached the gate, the group encounter
Fuchi, Gantetsusai, Mei, Tōma and an unconscious

02:22:20.300 --> 02:22:21.450
Gabimaru.

02:22:21.450 --> 02:22:25.561
After the initial surprise of everyone noticing
each other, Both Sagiri and Fuchi ask what

02:22:25.561 --> 02:22:27.420
happened in their time apart.

02:22:27.420 --> 02:22:31.780
Noticing that Mei was okay and had matured
after using her power, expresses his gratitude

02:22:31.780 --> 02:22:33.880
that her allies kept her safe.

02:22:33.880 --> 02:22:37.609
Confused on how they arrived here, Hoko asked
if they came up from the Soshin pit at the

02:22:37.609 --> 02:22:39.171
valley floor and after learning that they
did, Hōko becomes shocked to see that they

02:22:39.171 --> 02:22:40.171
also have a Dōshi hostage.

02:22:40.171 --> 02:22:41.960
Left speechless, Hoko can only think that
throughout the 1000 years he’s lived, no

02:22:41.960 --> 02:22:45.311
one had managed to accomplish these feats
and because of that believes that the current

02:22:45.311 --> 02:22:47.939
travelers are humans beyond compare.

02:22:47.939 --> 02:22:53.240
After being informed of Senta's passing, Fuchi
stands next to his grave and cries in sorrow.

02:22:53.240 --> 02:22:57.090
After confirming the deaths of most groups
and seeing the remaining survivors, Shion

02:22:57.090 --> 02:23:00.670
expresses regret that so little have survived
the ordeal on the island.

02:23:00.670 --> 02:23:04.819
However, Gantetsusai comments that his feeling
of regret was wasted on the condemned criminals

02:23:04.819 --> 02:23:08.110
since they were fated to kill each other the
moment everyone made landfall.

02:23:08.110 --> 02:23:12.530
Unlike Shion thought, he also states that
thinking all your comrades would also survive

02:23:12.530 --> 02:23:13.530
is ridiculous.

02:23:13.530 --> 02:23:16.880
He then points towards Tōma since its obvious
the dude was a traitor and offers to get rid

02:23:16.880 --> 02:23:17.880
of him.

02:23:17.880 --> 02:23:22.240
Not wanting him to, Sagiri steps in to stop
him as without Chōbei around, he really doesn't

02:23:22.240 --> 02:23:24.870
pose a threat to at all.

02:23:24.870 --> 02:23:30.160
Yuzuriha interrupts and has everyone around
focus their attention towards Gabimaru's injures,

02:23:30.160 --> 02:23:32.340
stating that the dude’s literally knocking
on deaths door.

02:23:32.340 --> 02:23:36.779
Rolling up Fuchi elaborates on what happened
before they got here and how he’s expended

02:23:36.779 --> 02:23:37.779
far to much Tao.

02:23:37.779 --> 02:23:41.260
He did what he could when it came to healing
him, but because the injuries go beyond physical

02:23:41.260 --> 02:23:43.310
he wasn't able to do much.

02:23:43.310 --> 02:23:47.540
Kneeling down and looking at her injured friend,
Sagiri watches as Gabimaru re-awakens and

02:23:47.540 --> 02:23:48.980
instantly tries to stand up.

02:23:48.980 --> 02:23:52.490
Sagiri says that they should look into his
wounds but Gabimaru though shrugs her off

02:23:52.490 --> 02:23:53.990
while saying he’s fine.

02:23:53.990 --> 02:23:58.271
Shion warns him that without proper treatment
he will die, but Gabi claims he’s already

02:23:58.271 --> 02:23:59.710
accepted this fact.

02:23:59.710 --> 02:24:03.479
Stunned with hearing the old Gabi again, Sagiri
just questions who he is.

02:24:03.479 --> 02:24:06.540
Looking at her Gabimaru answers that she already
knows who he was.

02:24:06.540 --> 02:24:08.810
He’s Gabimaru the Hollow.

02:24:08.810 --> 02:24:12.479
Launching himself forward Gabimaru attacks
Sagiri, luckily for her though big Fuchi and

02:24:12.479 --> 02:24:15.460
Shion noticed what he was upto and blocked
the strike.

02:24:15.460 --> 02:24:19.529
Knowing that a disturbance in ones Tao can
effect memory, Sagiri explains that Gabimaru

02:24:19.529 --> 02:24:23.510
has lost all of his memories due to every
battle he’s fought wearing away at the construction

02:24:23.510 --> 02:24:25.120
of his very soul.

02:24:25.120 --> 02:24:29.290
Sagiri tries to reason with her confused friend,
explaining that she is his ally and wants

02:24:29.290 --> 02:24:30.570
to help him.

02:24:30.570 --> 02:24:34.700
After he repeatedly tries pushing her away,
Sagiri becomes enraged and uses force to pin

02:24:34.700 --> 02:24:35.970
him down.

02:24:35.970 --> 02:24:39.529
Gantetsusai watches thinking that they’re
doing the sneaky Bochu Jutsu, though Fuchi

02:24:39.529 --> 02:24:43.960
doubts this while Mei blushes saying that
this act was different yet similar.

02:24:43.960 --> 02:24:50.800
Sagiri explains to that they really dont have
times for such trivial activites, but they

02:24:50.800 --> 02:24:52.800
really need his strength to escape this island.

02:24:52.800 --> 02:24:57.060
So in an attempt to wake him up even quicker
she reminds Gabi that he has someone to return

02:24:57.060 --> 02:24:58.060
home to.

02:24:58.060 --> 02:25:05.700
In the same moments Gabimaru's Tao is restored
and his memories begin flooding back in.

02:25:05.700 --> 02:25:15.200
Soo throowwwback boys, remember the crater
incident.

02:25:15.200 --> 02:25:19.520
Well after reaching the bottom of the valley
and regenerating his limbs, Chōbei reflects

02:25:19.520 --> 02:25:22.229
on his actions during his fight with Gabimaru.

02:25:22.229 --> 02:25:25.811
Looking at just how far down he fell dude
literally cracks the code and figures out

02:25:25.811 --> 02:25:29.279
that the island is shaped like a bowl with
ridges connecting the middle parts.

02:25:29.279 --> 02:25:34.080
He then spots a group of Sōshin and decides
to use them to test out his applications of

02:25:34.080 --> 02:25:35.080
Tao.

02:25:35.080 --> 02:25:37.950
Meanwhile, all of the remaining survivors
relocate to a cave that Gantetsusai found

02:25:37.950 --> 02:25:42.311
to remove themselves from Lord Tensen's sensory
in Hōrai.

02:25:42.311 --> 02:25:48.939
This is just due to the fact big Rien can
sense where they are at all times using the

02:25:48.939 --> 02:25:50.050
Tao in the air.

02:25:50.050 --> 02:25:53.930
Remember how there was a higher level of humidity
to the island hiding it to start with, well

02:25:53.930 --> 02:25:57.620
thats my thought aswell that he uses his abilities
to hide the island while brining in a select

02:25:57.620 --> 02:26:02.670
few to turn into Tan.

02:26:02.670 --> 02:26:06.750
After Gantetsusai calls Shion a coward because
he was scared of Lord Tensen and warned everyone

02:26:06.750 --> 02:26:07.750
to be cautious.

02:26:07.750 --> 02:26:12.340
He receives judgement from Yuzuriha and Nurugai
who also reiterates just how dangerous they

02:26:12.340 --> 02:26:13.340
are.

02:26:13.340 --> 02:26:16.770
Having regained his memory Shion asked Gabimaru
if he had fought one as well and he confirms

02:26:16.770 --> 02:26:17.770
it.

02:26:17.770 --> 02:26:20.630
He also confirms to them that he knows how
to manipulate Tao now, but went about learning

02:26:20.630 --> 02:26:25.140
it the hard way along with finding out just
how terrifying Lord Tensen truly is.

02:26:25.140 --> 02:26:28.920
Having told his experience, Yuzuriha gives
her opinion that it would be best for them

02:26:28.920 --> 02:26:32.580
to escape the island but Gabimaru objects
as he knows that without the pardon he’ll

02:26:32.580 --> 02:26:34.010
never be safe.

02:26:34.010 --> 02:26:38.060
Hearing this, Yuzuriha goes to tell him about
her theory, but a shocked Gabi cuts her off

02:26:38.060 --> 02:26:41.319
knowing that she was going to say his wife
was just a form of Genjutsu.

02:26:41.319 --> 02:26:45.100
He tries just pushing past what she said,
but Yuzuriha wants to make sure she’s not

02:26:45.100 --> 02:26:46.220
walking into a trap.

02:26:46.220 --> 02:26:50.521
Our boy knows she exists though as he can
tell just based off the sensation he has when

02:26:50.521 --> 02:26:51.529
he thinks about her.

02:26:51.529 --> 02:26:56.141
Wanting to know more info that isnt just a
sensation, as its not very logical of him

02:26:56.141 --> 02:26:57.920
to think a sensation is real.

02:26:57.920 --> 02:27:01.990
Gabimaru describes the little things he can
remember about her, like her voice or the

02:27:01.990 --> 02:27:05.830
shape of her eyes and says that even now on
beautiful days like this when he’s drenched

02:27:05.830 --> 02:27:08.699
in nature he can sense her nearby.

02:27:08.699 --> 02:27:13.660
Phasing into a blissful memory he reveals
her name as Yui, saying that this was the

02:27:13.660 --> 02:27:18.500
only proof he had, the only way to be sure
was to make it home and find out.

02:27:18.500 --> 02:27:23.521
His confidence causes Sagiri to feel delighted
and Gantetsusai who calls our boy a mans man

02:27:23.521 --> 02:27:29.990
to feel like he finally found a perfect fighting
partner.

02:27:29.990 --> 02:27:33.800
Yuzuriha found it weird that a shinobi like
Gabimaru can talk about his weaknesses but

02:27:33.800 --> 02:27:37.900
Shion adds in that the fact that he could
sense Gabimaru's Tao growing proves that his

02:27:37.900 --> 02:27:45.540
wife is real and people who have something
to lose are considered strong.

02:27:45.540 --> 02:27:50.779
So funily enough and continuing with the possible
idea that she doesnt exist, Yui doesnt really

02:27:50.779 --> 02:27:52.590
confirm that its a person.

02:27:52.590 --> 02:27:56.710
The Kanji he uses for her name simply means
bond or connection and is also the first part

02:27:56.710 --> 02:27:59.180
to how you’d spell out marriage.

02:27:59.180 --> 02:28:08.890
So does she truly exist or is she a manifestation
made up by the chief of the clan? id love

02:28:08.890 --> 02:28:11.310
to know your thoughts on that down below!

02:28:11.310 --> 02:28:16.430
Back down in the valley and after merking
every Soshin around, Chōbei is met by Rien

02:28:16.430 --> 02:28:19.520
who questions if he was the one who killed
Mu Dan.

02:28:19.520 --> 02:28:23.620
Elsewhere Fuchi, Feeling in no mood to examine
the Dōshi after finding out about the death

02:28:23.620 --> 02:28:26.220
of his comrades, decides to set him free.

02:28:26.220 --> 02:28:30.390
Over inside the cave now Sagiri informs Fuchi
that Mei’s feeling ill and hasn't been able

02:28:30.390 --> 02:28:33.540
to recover any strength so would he be able
to make some medicine.

02:28:33.540 --> 02:28:37.870
Annoyed after finding out that she’s the
same as Lord Tensen, Fuchi agrees to help

02:28:37.870 --> 02:28:42.569
but demands that in return Mei tell them everything
they need to know about herself and Lord Tensen.

02:28:42.569 --> 02:28:46.620
Meanwhile, Gabimaru sits outside and makes
a request to the other four to help him train

02:28:46.620 --> 02:28:48.729
to utilize Tao even more efficiently.

02:28:48.729 --> 02:28:53.330
Super eager to learn more himself, Tōma starts
off by attacking with Gantetsusai's sword.

02:28:53.330 --> 02:28:58.140
Dodging the slashes Gabi focuses on sensing
the movements of his opponents Tao not tracking

02:28:58.140 --> 02:28:59.300
him with his sight.

02:28:59.300 --> 02:29:03.460
Gantetsusai then comes in to make his attack
on Gabi, but he easily uses his Tao to sense

02:29:03.460 --> 02:29:07.860
the strike weaving out of its way and allowing
him to examine Gantetsusai’s weak spots.

02:29:07.860 --> 02:29:11.310
He then kicks off the Tao in the sky to put
some space between them.

02:29:11.310 --> 02:29:15.460
Nurugai jumps in and tries attacking however
Gabi grabs her and uses her to push back the

02:29:15.460 --> 02:29:16.979
others as they approach.

02:29:16.979 --> 02:29:20.710
As the battle continues, Gabimaru believes
that its pointless trying to hone a more refiened

02:29:20.710 --> 02:29:24.310
technique than the immortals since they’ve
been training for over 100 years.

02:29:24.310 --> 02:29:28.810
Instead the key to defeating Lord Tensen is
to use their own Tao against them.

02:29:28.810 --> 02:29:32.630
Standing back up, Nurugai approaches Gabi
believing that he was more than capable enough

02:29:32.630 --> 02:29:34.410
to take down Lord Tensen.

02:29:34.410 --> 02:29:38.311
However, Gabimaru believes he still needs
more time to improve.

02:29:38.311 --> 02:29:42.130
Gantetsusai asks if he’s finished with the
warm up cause mans keen to get serious, before

02:29:42.130 --> 02:29:45.410
randomly diving forth, raging out and preparing
to strike down on Gabi.

02:29:45.410 --> 02:29:51.260
While the other 2 start freaking out, back
inside the cave Fuchi explains to Sagiri and

02:29:51.260 --> 02:29:56.540
Yuzuriha that the island, the monsters, and
Lord Tensen were created by a singular entity.

02:29:56.540 --> 02:30:00.840
This being is apparently a famed Hōshi who
used Shenxian principles in his attempt to

02:30:00.840 --> 02:30:02.390
research ways to achieve immortality.

02:30:02.390 --> 02:30:07.090
(for those confused on what a Hoshi is, so
pretty much its an Ancient Chinese Mystic

02:30:07.090 --> 02:30:11.850
versed in Divination and other healing arts)
This particular Mystic developed methods to

02:30:11.850 --> 02:30:13.590
tinker with Tao directly.

02:30:13.590 --> 02:30:17.819
From this he created crossbreeds of creatures
that had similar affinities for Tao.

02:30:17.819 --> 02:30:21.120
Then after an age of creation Lord Tensen
was born.

02:30:21.120 --> 02:30:25.810
This being is a fusion of human an plant Tao
that is both male and female, both Yin and

02:30:25.810 --> 02:30:26.810
Yang.

02:30:26.810 --> 02:30:29.490
Hence how they can change genders in an instant.

02:30:29.490 --> 02:30:33.979
Lifeforms usually use Tao over the course
of their life, but the Lord Tensen's energy

02:30:33.979 --> 02:30:38.960
has been polished for over 1000 years, far
beyond the scope of any human ability.

02:30:38.960 --> 02:30:45.399
Yuzuriha asks what their purpose in living
on the island was all for, Fuchi explains

02:30:45.399 --> 02:30:49.850
that the Tensen's have been practicing Taoism
or more specifically the Inner Ways of Tan,

02:30:49.850 --> 02:30:53.270
which is meditation, and also the Outer Ways
of Tan, which is making an elixir, to achieve

02:30:53.270 --> 02:30:54.979
immortality.

02:30:54.979 --> 02:30:59.050
Hearing this, Yuzuriha and Sagiri become shocked
realizing that the elixir does indeed exist.

02:30:59.050 --> 02:31:03.189
Yet Fuchi tells them that its probably just
a prototype, a potion created from harvesting

02:31:03.189 --> 02:31:07.500
and extracting the Tao of humans in order
to expand the Tensen's lives.

02:31:07.500 --> 02:31:12.050
Knowing this, Fuchi tells them it is possible
to take out Lord Tensen if their Tao is depleted.

02:31:12.050 --> 02:31:16.000
Curious after learning this, Yuzuriha questions
why they are going further with their research

02:31:16.000 --> 02:31:17.470
since they have already created Tan.

02:31:17.470 --> 02:31:21.980
Mei answers saying that it was possible that
Lord Tensen was following the will of their

02:31:21.980 --> 02:31:23.180
master, Xu Fu.

02:31:23.180 --> 02:31:28.100
Fuchi explains that Xu Fu, also known as Jofuku
in japan, he was a Hōshi Mystic and servant

02:31:28.100 --> 02:31:32.190
to the emperor of the Qin Dynasty, who journeyed
off to research the secrets of immortality

02:31:32.190 --> 02:31:35.120
1,000 years ago but eventually came to an
end once he entered Japan.

02:31:35.120 --> 02:31:43.720
Perhaps though he never really came to an
end and instead lives on as someone to this

02:31:43.720 --> 02:31:44.720
very day....

02:31:44.720 --> 02:31:47.090
HMMMMMMMM I really wanna know your thoughts
on what you think.

02:31:47.090 --> 02:31:51.430
Its given us the image of this dank looking
foot, so surely that hints that someone is

02:31:51.430 --> 02:31:53.470
indeed still alive.

02:31:53.470 --> 02:32:00.340
So this Xu Fu or Jofuku person is actually
a real man from waaay back in the 3rd century

02:32:00.340 --> 02:32:01.340
BCE.

02:32:01.340 --> 02:32:04.140
As I mentioned earlier in the video he was
sent out to search for this mythical mountain

02:32:04.140 --> 02:32:05.760
and the elixir of life.

02:32:05.760 --> 02:32:10.939
He oversaw a fleet of 60 vessels and thousands
of crew members, artisans and civilians.

02:32:10.939 --> 02:32:15.850
In 219 BCE he actually made it back after
the first voyage having unsuccessfully found

02:32:15.850 --> 02:32:21.771
the elixir or Penglai, yet after heading out
9 years later in 210 BCE he never returned.

02:32:21.771 --> 02:32:27.319
Some people suggest that he ended up making
landfall near Mt Fuji, however in Hells Paradise

02:32:27.319 --> 02:32:31.170
its obvious that the mans voyage ended in
the sea’s southwest of Japan.

02:32:31.170 --> 02:32:36.550
While the girls and Fuchi discuss the Jofuku's
existence, Mei falls back exhausted also revealing

02:32:36.550 --> 02:32:38.880
that her left arm has turned into a branch.

02:32:38.880 --> 02:32:42.700
She explains that her usage of Tao is causing
her body to turn into a tree and needs to

02:32:42.700 --> 02:32:45.280
take in energy in order to heal.

02:32:45.280 --> 02:32:49.200
Yuzuriha suggest using a restoration technique,
however, Mei says that it will not work since

02:32:49.200 --> 02:32:53.200
she has little Tao already and because Rien
broke her Tanden causing it to constantly

02:32:53.200 --> 02:32:54.521
leak.

02:32:54.521 --> 02:33:00.130
After the cruel past Mei went thru is shown
to us, Hōko then offers his Tao in order

02:33:00.130 --> 02:33:01.550
to fully heal her.

02:33:01.550 --> 02:33:06.620
Due to how Lord Tensen can extract Tao from
living life forms its the only way for Mei

02:33:06.620 --> 02:33:09.700
to heal herself, but obviously she’s hesitant
to sacrifice Hōko.

02:33:09.700 --> 02:33:14.630
He insists though as soon he’ll go through
the process of arborfication.

02:33:14.630 --> 02:33:19.380
To him this is one way he can also atone for
his sins, explaining that he ignored Mei’s

02:33:19.380 --> 02:33:24.220
desire of wanting to leave the island, choosing
to raise her as a replacement to his deceased

02:33:24.220 --> 02:33:25.220
daughter.

02:33:25.220 --> 02:33:29.080
Mei tearfully tells Hōko that from the time
he found her, she’s always thought of him

02:33:29.080 --> 02:33:30.609
just like a father.

02:33:30.609 --> 02:33:34.649
She then accepts his offer, placing out her
hand and absorbing his Tao.

02:33:34.649 --> 02:33:38.960
With Hoko’s energy flowing into Mei, she
gives him her final farewell before returning

02:33:38.960 --> 02:33:40.890
back to her younger state.

02:33:40.890 --> 02:33:48.920
Meanwhile, the previously raging practice
battle has come to a peaceful end.

02:33:48.920 --> 02:33:52.460
Shion is left impressed with Gabimaru's abilities
and believes that he may have what it takes

02:33:52.460 --> 02:33:53.890
to defeat Lord Tensen.

02:33:53.890 --> 02:33:57.850
Tōma then randomly drops down on his knees
and begs Gantetsusai to help train him how

02:33:57.850 --> 02:34:01.620
to wield a sword so that he can gain the power
to escape the island.

02:34:01.620 --> 02:34:06.170
Big G doesn't believe he can trust him, but
in a show of honor Tōma then cuts his hair

02:34:06.170 --> 02:34:09.100
and asks once again to help make him strong.

02:34:09.100 --> 02:34:12.830
Impressed with the lil guys determination
Gantetsusai agrees with helping Tōma and

02:34:12.830 --> 02:34:13.830
tells him to come follow him.

02:34:13.830 --> 02:34:14.830
Braining his hair together states to himself
that until he can fight on his own.

02:34:14.830 --> 02:34:15.830
No until he can fight alongside his brother
as an individual he needs to get stronger.

02:34:15.830 --> 02:34:18.439
Back down in the Soshin valley, Chōbei notes
that the thing infront of him has the exact

02:34:18.439 --> 02:34:20.590
same face as the creature he fought earlier.

02:34:20.590 --> 02:34:24.521
Fascinated with the hybridization Chōbei
had achieved, Rien explains that they create

02:34:24.521 --> 02:34:29.149
the Waitanhua flower that converts human bodies
into Tan, yet somehow, even as the root of

02:34:29.149 --> 02:34:32.870
that plant dug into Chōbei’s Tao he still
kept a sense of self.

02:34:32.870 --> 02:34:37.569
Wanting to examine him further, Rien attacks
Chōbei with an attack similar to Tin Slinter

02:34:37.569 --> 02:34:40.229
causing him to quickly dodge while realizing
that he has no chance in winning this battle.

02:34:40.229 --> 02:34:45.109
In an attempt to fight back he transforms
into his breakdown state and dashes at him

02:34:45.109 --> 02:34:49.780
before letting lose a flurry of strikes and
stakes that Rien just barely manage to block.

02:34:49.780 --> 02:34:53.569
Somehow Chōbei manages to overwhelm Rien
but finds it difficult to keep the vines inside

02:34:53.569 --> 02:34:56.200
his mind from taking over his body.

02:34:56.200 --> 02:35:00.350
After piercing Rien's tanden, Chōbei expands
his vines and destroys his the immortals body,

02:35:00.350 --> 02:35:04.779
making him assume that the Tanden was the
correct place to take out these creatures.

02:35:04.779 --> 02:35:10.400
However, Rien suddenly appears behind Chōbei,
revealing that he has destroyed one of his

02:35:10.400 --> 02:35:12.720
many clones he brought along.

02:35:12.720 --> 02:35:16.750
After seeing Chōbei unleash Tao from the
Waitanhua flower, Rien expresses his satisfaction

02:35:16.750 --> 02:35:20.609
at the fact he managed to control it and decides
to take him back to the palace.

02:35:20.609 --> 02:35:25.130
Chōbei tries to attack but is unable to resist
the effects of the vines allow Rien to bend

02:35:25.130 --> 02:35:28.800
down infront of him and use a Tao strike to
knock him unconscious.

02:35:28.800 --> 02:35:32.779
Slowly falling into a dream he reiterates
his desire of not making the same mistake

02:35:32.779 --> 02:35:35.200
as his father by abandoning his brother.

02:35:35.200 --> 02:35:39.780
Later, Chōbei wakes up tied to a bed and
sees Rien as a female standing nearby tending

02:35:39.780 --> 02:35:40.780
to the plants.

02:35:40.780 --> 02:35:44.819
Rien explains that she finds Chōbei to be
the final key to completing her research and

02:35:44.819 --> 02:35:48.880
wishes to understand his Tao cycle better
through Bōchū Jutsu.

02:35:48.880 --> 02:35:50.540
BUT YA KNOW WE CANT GO THERE.

02:35:50.540 --> 02:35:53.850
Just know that man is the key to unlocking
the perfect being.

02:35:53.850 --> 02:35:56.471
Okay yeah I really cant go over some of the
stuff that gets revealed here cause its done

02:35:56.471 --> 02:36:01.359
in the most Yuki Kaku of ways, BUT pretty
much its revealed that because Chōbei is

02:36:01.359 --> 02:36:05.760
the perfect being, when his Tao is extracted
then it will allow these creatures to turn

02:36:05.760 --> 02:36:08.160
everyone on the mainland of Japan into Tan.

02:36:08.160 --> 02:36:12.670
So yeah thats I guess that big evil plan in
store that our main crew is yet to figure

02:36:12.670 --> 02:36:13.670
out.

02:36:13.670 --> 02:36:17.641
Something else I wanted to mention was that,
the Kanji in Waitanhua translates to Outside,

02:36:17.641 --> 02:36:22.149
Tan and Flower, meaning a flower used for
the outer way of Tan.

02:36:22.149 --> 02:36:27.729
Anyways Later on Gantetsusai breaks down crying
in pain that Mei has reverted back to her

02:36:27.729 --> 02:36:32.470
child body, in his eyes it was way more comfy
carrying her around when she was older.

02:36:32.470 --> 02:36:33.470
Actual chad tho, aint into to that weirdo
shi, thats why Gantetsusai is a champ in my

02:36:33.470 --> 02:36:34.470
eyes.

02:36:34.470 --> 02:36:35.470
Yuki as an author in general is the one of
the only ones i've read that make a proper

02:36:35.470 --> 02:36:37.160
attempt to not do any of the normalized weird
Japanese troupes.

02:36:37.160 --> 02:36:38.160
WHICH IS GOATED.

02:36:38.160 --> 02:36:41.851
Coming back to the main group Shion in collaboration
with Gabi prepares to announce their next

02:36:41.851 --> 02:36:42.851
plan.

02:36:42.851 --> 02:36:45.680
However, Mei catches their attention when
she senses that the second landing party has

02:36:45.680 --> 02:36:47.210
arrived on the island.

02:36:47.210 --> 02:36:51.120
She knows it isn't lord Tensen, but due to
how she cant articulate herself well just

02:36:51.120 --> 02:36:53.760
says that their Tao is very strong.

02:36:53.760 --> 02:36:57.550
Having taught this man, Shion believes that
its most likely Shugen and the other reserve

02:36:57.550 --> 02:37:00.500
Asaemon who were sent as reinforcements by
the Shogunate.

02:37:00.500 --> 02:37:04.210
Fuchi also tells them that another group of
criminals were to accompany them as well.

02:37:04.210 --> 02:37:08.460
Curious, Gabimaru asks Sagiri if Shugen is
a potential ally and she vouches for him,

02:37:08.460 --> 02:37:12.580
saying that he might even be the strongest
amongst them, however, Gantetsusai doubts

02:37:12.580 --> 02:37:16.470
her statement knowing that he’ll need more
than just strength to survive here.

02:37:16.470 --> 02:37:20.229
Thinking back on the past, Shion confirms
that Shugen is already able to perceive Tao

02:37:20.229 --> 02:37:23.460
since it was actually him to first notice
the sixth sense and call them waves.

02:37:23.460 --> 02:37:28.080
Over at the coast, Shugen hands off his blade
and confronts a Sōshin.

02:37:28.080 --> 02:37:31.200
Obviously mans yolked up, already able to
perceive the environment around him through

02:37:31.200 --> 02:37:32.650
the use of Tao alone.

02:37:32.650 --> 02:37:36.520
The monster manages to grab him, but through
what he learnt while training with Shion,

02:37:36.520 --> 02:37:39.320
Shugen easily lifts its hands from his shoulders
and defeats it barehanded.

02:37:39.320 --> 02:37:45.770
On the island Nurugai is impressed with the
idea of how strong Shugen is, however Yuzuriha

02:37:45.770 --> 02:37:48.650
mentions a certain story that made him infamous.

02:37:48.650 --> 02:37:52.520
Sagiri explains the story of how Shugen executed
all of the captured members infront of their

02:37:52.520 --> 02:37:55.430
leader in order to reveal the remaining members.

02:37:55.430 --> 02:37:59.979
After he revealed their location, they were
too all arrested and well yeah you can image

02:37:59.979 --> 02:38:04.750
what happened next.

02:38:04.750 --> 02:38:08.850
The Shogun was so impressed by his brutality
that he presented the young Asaemon with a

02:38:08.850 --> 02:38:12.479
ceremonial outfit and the named blade; Fuributsu
Kaneaki

02:38:12.479 --> 02:38:16.800
The group becomes concerned but Sagiri reassures
them that deep down he’s a great guy, leading

02:38:16.800 --> 02:38:19.560
Fuchi to state that Shugen was Sagiri's first
crush.

02:38:19.560 --> 02:38:23.840
She says that even if that was the case, she
merely admires his involvement in her earning

02:38:23.840 --> 02:38:27.470
a ranking in the Yamada clan.

02:38:27.470 --> 02:38:31.900
After taking out a group of Sōshin, Isuzu
and Kiyomaru come to his aid but Shugen reassures

02:38:31.900 --> 02:38:35.630
them that as their senior, he will take on
the responsibility of taking care of lesser

02:38:35.630 --> 02:38:37.970
matters like fighting the pathetic monsters.

02:38:37.970 --> 02:38:41.930
While Sagiri believes that Shugen will come
to their aid, Shion disagrees and reveals

02:38:41.930 --> 02:38:46.330
the full story of how Shugen not only merked
the entire Silver Serpent group but also their

02:38:46.330 --> 02:38:50.050
loved ones since they might hold some form
of vengeance towards the Shogun.

02:38:50.050 --> 02:38:53.700
Shion explains that Shugen despises criminals
and would not think of allying with them or

02:38:53.700 --> 02:38:56.140
have anyone he associates with work with them.

02:38:56.140 --> 02:39:00.720
As the new group travels, Shugen stumbles
across the site where Eizen was turned into

02:39:00.720 --> 02:39:03.229
a pancake by Rokurōta.

02:39:03.229 --> 02:39:08.460
After his were taken out by an infamous bandit,
Shugen was dropped at the door of the Yamada

02:39:08.460 --> 02:39:10.310
Clan.

02:39:10.310 --> 02:39:14.370
As the two begin talking about what it means
to be an executioner, Shugen tells Eizen that

02:39:14.370 --> 02:39:17.860
he fails to see the logic in the their clans
way of executing criminals with and wonders

02:39:17.860 --> 02:39:20.859
why they can't give them a painful death instead.

02:39:20.859 --> 02:39:24.390
Eizen explains that such an act would defile
the execution grounds and the chipping of

02:39:24.390 --> 02:39:25.569
his blade would be meaningless.

02:39:25.569 --> 02:39:29.961
Being an Asaemon means ridding yourself of
that hatred and he’ll hone him into a great

02:39:29.961 --> 02:39:30.961
man.

02:39:30.961 --> 02:39:35.390
He then tells him that he looks forward to
the day he becomes a "glorious blade".

02:39:35.390 --> 02:39:39.340
In the present, Shugen screams in pain over
Eizen's death and instead of moving forward

02:39:39.340 --> 02:39:42.100
with the mission makes the decision to lay
his soul to rest.

02:39:42.100 --> 02:39:46.319
While giving him a proper burial, one of the
ninja thinks to himself that 3 of these people

02:39:46.319 --> 02:39:49.390
are extremely odd and Jikka’s just as random.

02:39:49.390 --> 02:39:53.390
With the priority for them being Gabimaru,
they all plan on using the dangers of the

02:39:53.390 --> 02:39:56.380
island to outsmart the Samurai and complete
their mission.

02:39:56.380 --> 02:40:00.149
Out of freaking know where though a massive
flower type thing drops down on the 50 or

02:40:00.149 --> 02:40:01.979
so Ninja catching a few of them.

02:40:01.979 --> 02:40:05.609
Looking up, the group see a bunch of Mōnshin
rolling up to try and capture them commanded

02:40:05.609 --> 02:40:06.850
by a Dōshi.

02:40:06.850 --> 02:40:10.221
Another massive flower trap thingy drops down
on the trio, but Kiyo and Isuzu quickly cut

02:40:10.221 --> 02:40:14.600
it to shreds while Shugen sat there unmoved
still mourning Eizen's passing.

02:40:14.600 --> 02:40:18.939
The genin also dispatch 2 squads to assist
in bringing down the Mōnshin.

02:40:18.939 --> 02:40:23.729
After finishing reciting his sutras, Shugen
finally says Eizen can rest in piece.

02:40:23.729 --> 02:40:27.600
Not even standing yet, Shugen then swiftly
draws his blade and cuts down a Mōnshin that

02:40:27.600 --> 02:40:29.010
attempted to attack from behind.

02:40:29.010 --> 02:40:33.569
Angered with everything he’s seen, Shugen
smashes his brand new named blade against

02:40:33.569 --> 02:40:36.350
the monsters staff to repeatedly damage it.

02:40:36.350 --> 02:40:40.050
Standing there and bleeding from his eyes
with rage, he swears vengeance against all

02:40:40.050 --> 02:40:41.529
that resides on the island.

02:40:41.529 --> 02:40:42.529
Just like with Naruto the Ninja here have
the same class setup with it being Genin as

02:40:42.529 --> 02:40:43.529
foot soldiers, mid level Chunin and high level
Jonin.

02:40:43.529 --> 02:40:44.529
Also while im here, the Sutra that Shugen
was reciting is the most recited text in Mahayana

02:40:44.529 --> 02:40:45.529
Buddhism and is one that goes over the great
emptiness in all things.

02:40:45.529 --> 02:40:46.529
Hearing Shugen declaring his wrath to him,
the Dōshi prepares to attack him with Tao.

02:40:46.529 --> 02:40:49.890
However, the fight quickly comes to an end
with Shugen utterly obliterating and stopping

02:40:49.890 --> 02:40:51.370
him from regenerating.

02:40:51.370 --> 02:40:53.640
He then starts to do some really questionable
acts.

02:40:53.640 --> 02:40:57.939
Jikka gets him to stop and tries to reason
with Shugen in returning to the mainland with

02:40:57.939 --> 02:41:02.270
the information they gathered but is angrily
told that its not gonna happen.

02:41:02.270 --> 02:41:07.600
He then asked why he hadn't drawn his blade,
leading Jikka to state that he can't, even

02:41:07.600 --> 02:41:12.080
still Shugen knows that he can making him
get even more furious.

02:41:12.080 --> 02:41:17.180
Cutting in on the boy, Isuzu calms him down,
making him realize the stupidity of his ways.

02:41:17.180 --> 02:41:21.250
Quickly changing his demeanor, Shugen apologizes
to Jikka, but states that his earlier statement

02:41:21.250 --> 02:41:25.310
of eliminating everything living on the island
was true so don't forget that.

02:41:25.310 --> 02:41:28.220
Hearing this, one of the ninja recommends
that they should handle everything in regards

02:41:28.220 --> 02:41:33.640
to collecting information since the ninja
have special tactics in that area.

02:41:33.640 --> 02:41:37.899
Meanwhile, the survivors of the vanguard party
listen to Shion's plan of separating everyone

02:41:37.899 --> 02:41:42.561
into two groups where one finds an escape
route and the other finds the Tan elixir.

02:41:42.561 --> 02:41:46.700
After Gantetsusai asks how exactly they’re
gonna fight Lord Tensen, Shion repossessions

02:41:46.700 --> 02:41:51.149
everyone and creates a diagram on the ground
of the Tao attributes each one of them possess.

02:41:51.149 --> 02:41:55.600
The idea is that they will use their attributes
to hinder each member of Lord Tensen and defeat

02:41:55.600 --> 02:41:56.600
them.

02:41:56.600 --> 02:41:59.790
Yuzuriha believes that it’s hopeless to
continue due to the risks and not knowing

02:41:59.790 --> 02:42:02.000
who they’re up against at the coast of the
island.

02:42:02.000 --> 02:42:05.890
She then suggests an alternative by finding
a way off the island and instead going into

02:42:05.890 --> 02:42:08.250
hiding as a way to possibly survive.

02:42:08.250 --> 02:42:12.220
Shion understands where Yuzuriha's is coming
from and knows that there are just too many

02:42:12.220 --> 02:42:14.050
unknowns in the coming future.

02:42:14.050 --> 02:42:17.930
So because of this he takes everyone's thoughts
on the matter into consideration by giving

02:42:17.930 --> 02:42:22.359
them the option of going their own separate
ways or working together in surviving.

02:42:22.359 --> 02:42:27.120
After walking into the cave, Shion immediately
senses the presence of everyone behind him

02:42:27.120 --> 02:42:31.790
deciding to move forward with his plan due
to their own personal reason in surviving.

02:42:31.790 --> 02:42:35.600
With their situation growing more dire, Shion
is relived that everyone came to the same

02:42:35.600 --> 02:42:40.350
decision and tells them that they are all
each other’s last chance of survival.

02:42:40.350 --> 02:42:45.990
After Mei does her thing, Fuchi interprets
for the group and begins explaining the plan

02:42:45.990 --> 02:42:47.350
they’re about to undergo.

02:42:47.350 --> 02:42:51.779
From what they can learn, Hōrai is designed
to be a massive fortress modeled off China’s

02:42:51.779 --> 02:42:55.410
Epang Palace and that the sea monsters prevent
anything from leaving the island.

02:42:55.410 --> 02:43:00.000
However, Mei reveals that Hōrai contains
numerous ships at a underground floodgate

02:43:00.000 --> 02:43:01.930
that allows departure along a safe current.

02:43:01.930 --> 02:43:06.640
So their mission is to avoid confrontation,
acquire the elixir and steal a ship to make

02:43:06.640 --> 02:43:08.100
it back home on.

02:43:08.100 --> 02:43:11.850
Gabimaru tells them that according to Mei
the Tan elixir is located in a laboratory,

02:43:11.850 --> 02:43:14.500
but the palace's interior is constantly changing.

02:43:14.500 --> 02:43:19.040
With time drawing closer to the moment they
invade enemy territory, Shion pulls Gabimaru

02:43:19.040 --> 02:43:23.720
and Yuzuriha over to have them instruct the
group in the art of espionage using Tao.

02:43:23.720 --> 02:43:27.950
Looking like an absolute babe with these specs
on Yuzuriha teaches the group on how to mask

02:43:27.950 --> 02:43:30.120
their presence by suppressing their Tao.

02:43:30.120 --> 02:43:35.250
Afterwards Gabimaru also nerded out, teaches
his lesson in using Tao against their opponents.

02:43:35.250 --> 02:43:39.950
After the training was over, everyone is divided
into two teams, the Escape-Route Team made

02:43:39.950 --> 02:43:45.720
up of big G, Shion, Nurugai, Tōma, Mei, and
Fuchi and the Elixir Retrieval Team made up

02:43:45.720 --> 02:43:46.800
of the other 3.

02:43:46.800 --> 02:43:51.200
While the 3 powerhouses are off doing there
thing sourcing the elixir, the Escape team

02:43:51.200 --> 02:43:54.200
needs to find the boats and open the flood
gates.

02:43:54.200 --> 02:43:58.040
Realizing that Mei has wanted to leave the
island for a while now, Gantetsusai suggests

02:43:58.040 --> 02:44:01.430
that they let her depart alone and not wait
for the Elixir Team.

02:44:01.430 --> 02:44:06.439
However, Gabimaru asks Mei if there was anything
she desired to do before leaving the island.

02:44:06.439 --> 02:44:10.100
Surprisingly Mei tells him that she actually
wished to meet with Rien and Jofuku again

02:44:10.100 --> 02:44:13.510
to ask why they changed from how they were,
before then escaping.

02:44:13.510 --> 02:44:18.510
Remembering his wives words to him about valuing
everyday and living a decent life, Gabimaru

02:44:18.510 --> 02:44:21.330
promises to fulfill Mei's wish no matter what.

02:44:21.330 --> 02:44:25.250
At a similar time inside of Hōrai, Tao Fa
greets Chōbei after the end of the Doshi

02:44:25.250 --> 02:44:27.850
ritual ceremony but is stopped by Ju Fa.

02:44:27.850 --> 02:44:31.660
He cruely tells the other Tensen that there
is no need to communicate with livestock and

02:44:31.660 --> 02:44:33.880
just breathing the same air makes him feel
ill.

02:44:33.880 --> 02:44:39.690
Angered by his presence Ju Fa lashes out at
Chōbei who manages to block the strike.

02:44:39.690 --> 02:44:42.990
Realizing just how much stronger he’s become
Chōbei tells the immortal that he should've

02:44:42.990 --> 02:44:48.060
finished him off in the last fight, because
now he can see thru all of his moves.

02:44:48.060 --> 02:44:52.930
Stopping them from further escalating, Rien
orders Ju Fa to behave himself and has Chōbei

02:44:52.930 --> 02:44:55.670
follow him to his laboratory so that he can
study his Tao.

02:44:55.670 --> 02:45:00.130
As the two walk and talk Chōbei notices that
he is starting to get use to his new power

02:45:00.130 --> 02:45:04.410
but after looking at Rien senses that his
Tao is on a completely different level.

02:45:04.410 --> 02:45:08.990
Initially he was planning on escaping as quickly
as possible and running back to Tōma, however

02:45:08.990 --> 02:45:12.820
after seeing the difference in strength decides
to stick around incase he can find some sort

02:45:12.820 --> 02:45:13.820
of weakness.

02:45:13.820 --> 02:45:18.820
Once entering the laboratory, we see a massive
Waitanhua flower which is called a Banko.

02:45:18.820 --> 02:45:22.290
These flowers don't allow them to store the
extra Tan, but unlike the smaller flowers

02:45:22.290 --> 02:45:26.420
it can process a far greater quality of Tan
all in one go.

02:45:26.420 --> 02:45:30.930
The reason Tan cant be preserved is because
over time the Tao eats away at that of the

02:45:30.930 --> 02:45:35.380
humans lifeforce, eventually and just like
the human that plant will soon wither before

02:45:35.380 --> 02:45:37.020
it can produce the perfect quality Tan.

02:45:37.020 --> 02:45:42.180
This is why Rien desires Chōbei's rare Tao,
to complete his research.

02:45:42.180 --> 02:45:47.210
Again with Yuki referring to something from
our world, this Banko here or Pangu in Chinese

02:45:47.210 --> 02:45:49.960
is an entity that appears in prominent creation
myth.

02:45:49.960 --> 02:45:54.680
In this creation myth it explains that in
a world of nothingness, Banko was the giant

02:45:54.680 --> 02:45:59.610
who emerged from his egg, separated Yin and
Yang with his axe, elevated the sky above

02:45:59.610 --> 02:46:04.550
the earth and apon his death turned himself
into the sun, moon, landscape, weather and

02:46:04.550 --> 02:46:05.550
animals.

02:46:05.550 --> 02:46:10.240
Pretty much its the god of earth in this creation
myth and maybe something similar in hells

02:46:10.240 --> 02:46:11.240
paradise.

02:46:11.240 --> 02:46:16.229
Meanwhile, the Elixir Retrieval Team infiltrates
Hōrai and once safely landing on the roofs,

02:46:16.229 --> 02:46:19.030
signals to the others that the area is clear
to enter.

02:46:19.030 --> 02:46:22.641
Sagiri notices that the plan is moving quickly
and wonders if its truly time for the mission

02:46:22.641 --> 02:46:24.120
to come to an end.

02:46:24.120 --> 02:46:28.271
Pulling up his mask, Gabimaru States that
they always knew they were on a timer, so

02:46:28.271 --> 02:46:31.850
yes everyone will leave this island tonight.

02:46:31.850 --> 02:46:36.060
Flashing back to the preparation, Fuchi breaks
down Mei’s explanation and gives out a basic

02:46:36.060 --> 02:46:37.490
layout of the castle.

02:46:37.490 --> 02:46:41.950
He reveals that each Tensen has a sanctuary
of their own and the Elixir and escape ship

02:46:41.950 --> 02:46:44.200
are most likely in the center area.

02:46:44.200 --> 02:46:47.160
Popping in Mei tells us who is in each area
of the castle.

02:46:47.160 --> 02:46:52.370
In here eyes the elixir is most likely with
Rien in the Laboratory, Ju Fa and Tao Fa will

02:46:52.370 --> 02:46:55.310
be doing the silly inside of the Bochu Jutsu
sanctum.

02:46:55.310 --> 02:47:00.080
The Taisoku sanctum is the domain of Zhu Jin,
Shu’itsu sanctum which is the meditation

02:47:00.080 --> 02:47:06.360
domain ruled by Gui Fa and finally the Shuten
sanctum run by Mu Dan but ya know he know

02:47:06.360 --> 02:47:10.250
around anymore hahaha.

02:47:10.250 --> 02:47:14.250
She also states that since the Banko flower
drops down at night, Rien will not be in the

02:47:14.250 --> 02:47:15.920
temple conducting research.

02:47:15.920 --> 02:47:20.470
Instead he’ll most likely move to the main
residence where Jofuku resides, making it

02:47:20.470 --> 02:47:24.609
possible to avoid running into him after securing
the elixir.

02:47:24.609 --> 02:47:27.609
Gabimaru then explains that he and Yuzuriha
will land at the top of the inner gate and

02:47:27.609 --> 02:47:30.649
will survey the layout of the castle using
their Tao sensory.

02:47:30.649 --> 02:47:35.160
In the present, Sagiri notices the dreadfully
sinister amount of Tao coming from the palace

02:47:35.160 --> 02:47:36.530
and starts to falter.

02:47:36.530 --> 02:47:40.729
Gabi and Yuzuriha though console her stating
that it doesn't bother them as they’re already

02:47:40.729 --> 02:47:41.899
used to it.

02:47:41.899 --> 02:47:45.450
Using what they’d learnt in preparation
for the mission, both Gabi and Yuzuriha take

02:47:45.450 --> 02:47:49.960
out all of the guards while constantly keeping
their Tao suppressed to not alert anyone.

02:47:49.960 --> 02:47:53.590
After taking out all of the Doshi, the Elixir
Retrieval Team successfully make it through

02:47:53.590 --> 02:47:56.410
with the first part of their predetermined
plan and enter the castle.

02:47:56.410 --> 02:48:00.630
Almost instantly after getting inside they
make it to the supposed room with the Elixir.

02:48:00.630 --> 02:48:04.399
Gabimaru opens the door and senses the layout
of the room but suddenly sees Tao forming

02:48:04.399 --> 02:48:06.450
an entity in the middle.

02:48:06.450 --> 02:48:09.720
Surprised that someone knew he was there,
the Tao silhouette is revealed to be Ran who

02:48:09.720 --> 02:48:15.931
had the same idea of suppressing his Tao.

02:48:15.931 --> 02:48:19.319
Stepping forth Mei asks her younger brother
how he knew of their arrival.

02:48:19.319 --> 02:48:24.050
Ran commends their attempt but reveals that
Chōbei has informed them that the humans

02:48:24.050 --> 02:48:27.910
would be coming to invade the palace and agreed
to keep track of their arrival by sensing

02:48:27.910 --> 02:48:29.940
their Tao on one condition.

02:48:29.940 --> 02:48:33.880
This is just due to the fact that after hurting
his brother in the last battle, Chōbei was

02:48:33.880 --> 02:48:35.870
able to track his exact location.

02:48:35.870 --> 02:48:44.090
Just as if he went up against Zhu Jin Gabimaru
finds himself in trouble due to Ran possessing

02:48:44.090 --> 02:48:47.080
the Water-attribute which hinders his Fire-attribute.

02:48:47.080 --> 02:48:51.359
The plan if they bumped into an enemy with
a stronger attribute was to run, as if try

02:48:51.359 --> 02:48:54.880
fighting with such a heavy debuff they’ve
got no chance.

02:48:54.880 --> 02:48:59.470
Hoping into a JoJo esque pose Ran becomes
delighted to see Mei once again and begs her

02:48:59.470 --> 02:49:03.251
to return back to their side, explaining that
they no longer need to follow the Outer Way

02:49:03.251 --> 02:49:07.160
of Tao since they have completed their research
in creating the Elixir of Life.

02:49:07.160 --> 02:49:10.400
Utterly Shocked Gabimaru asks for more info
on what he just said.

02:49:10.400 --> 02:49:14.970
Obviously because of the fact the Tensen discovered
Chōbei they feel that with his co-operation

02:49:14.970 --> 02:49:17.930
they’ll easily be able to create a potent
enough elixir.

02:49:17.930 --> 02:49:22.720
All that they need to do now is produce more
Tan that has a considerable quantity of exceptional

02:49:22.720 --> 02:49:23.720
material.

02:49:23.720 --> 02:49:27.720
Thats why for this exact reason that Rien
has started the Rite of just consumption,

02:49:27.720 --> 02:49:30.320
the end is indeed coming near.

02:49:30.320 --> 02:49:35.061
Despite his plea, Mei refuses and says that
she only wishes to say goodbye to everyone.

02:49:35.061 --> 02:49:39.250
To her now its obvious that she’s different
to them, but dying is sad.

02:49:39.250 --> 02:49:43.930
Instead she just came to say goodbye before
leaving the island with everyone else.

02:49:43.930 --> 02:49:47.130
Disappointed Ran just states that the Rite
of Just Consumption would have to continue

02:49:47.130 --> 02:49:48.819
and she can become another offering.

02:49:48.819 --> 02:49:53.720
After Sagiri asks what he meant, Ran explains
that it was ritual to capture and offer the

02:49:53.720 --> 02:49:55.390
humans to the grandmaster.

02:49:55.390 --> 02:50:01.300
Over with the Boat Squad, Gantetsusai, Fuchi,
and Tōma get separated from Shion and Nurugai

02:50:01.300 --> 02:50:04.061
due to a massive cloud of mist that obscures
their vison.

02:50:04.061 --> 02:50:08.439
Pushing forward either way the three then
bump into Tao Fa and Ju Fa while Shion and

02:50:08.439 --> 02:50:12.450
Nurugai are approached by Zhu Jin for a second
time.

02:50:12.450 --> 02:50:15.840
Knowing that their plan to avoid Lord Tensen
has failed, the group decide to move onto

02:50:15.840 --> 02:50:20.140
their second plan, which is just straight
hands, giving everything they’ve got cause

02:50:20.140 --> 02:50:22.630
its not like they could ever outrun these
feigns.

02:50:22.630 --> 02:50:26.210
Not phased, our boy announces to Ran that
they won't give up without a fight and instead

02:50:26.210 --> 02:50:29.689
they’re beat him down and say bye bye to
this island.

02:50:29.689 --> 02:50:33.290
Seeing as how the ritual has already begun,
Ran prepares to let loose knowing that all

02:50:33.290 --> 02:50:35.310
they need know is the sacrifices.

02:50:35.310 --> 02:50:41.220
So I just want you all to think back to the
pot analogy I used at the start of the video

02:50:41.220 --> 02:50:44.760
and how it was literally shown to us on the
panels themselves.

02:50:44.760 --> 02:50:48.399
Now think about how what they’re doing with
this elixir is simply another form of this

02:50:48.399 --> 02:50:52.770
old-school Japanese curse, there sticking
all of these ‘venomous beasts’ into the

02:50:52.770 --> 02:50:57.420
island which is literally shaped like a pot
in the hopes they can precure a vial of immortality

02:50:57.420 --> 02:50:58.420
juice.

02:50:58.420 --> 02:51:01.410
Idk its something that just clicked in my
head right now, but I love how early on its

02:51:01.410 --> 02:51:06.910
foreshadowed that this exact this would happen.

02:51:06.910 --> 02:51:10.700
Knowing that even though he’s going up against
someone with an unfair advantage, Gabimaru

02:51:10.700 --> 02:51:14.890
tells Sagiri and Mei to go search for the
elixir while he and Yuzuriha hold off the

02:51:14.890 --> 02:51:15.890
creature.

02:51:15.890 --> 02:51:19.770
However, Mei warns him that they are not in
the Rien’s Temple, shocking Gabimaru.

02:51:19.770 --> 02:51:23.529
Sensing the kick coming at him from behind
he quickly dodges and jumps back, before flying

02:51:23.529 --> 02:51:27.979
forth at the immortal trying to land a kick,
but Ran comfortably weaves out of the way.

02:51:27.979 --> 02:51:32.390
Hoping into an unrealistically messed up posed,
Ran confirms his sisters comments as he’d

02:51:32.390 --> 02:51:34.100
restructured the palace before they arrived.

02:51:34.100 --> 02:51:39.930
Apparently the Tao of inorganic material is
even easier to manipulate that of living creatures.

02:51:39.930 --> 02:51:43.850
Constructing buildings and renovating are
all tasks that actually fall to Ran, so its

02:51:43.850 --> 02:51:46.620
even easier for him to control it than the
others.

02:51:46.620 --> 02:51:50.439
With that he creates some spikes from the
floor that trap Mei leaving her with no where

02:51:50.439 --> 02:51:52.640
to run as he slowly closes in.

02:51:52.640 --> 02:51:56.800
Needing to protect Mei, Gabimaru decides to
fight Ran but is unable to harm him due to

02:51:56.800 --> 02:51:59.060
not possessing the right attribute.

02:51:59.060 --> 02:52:02.359
Yuzuriha sees an opening to attack Ran and
throws a Tao imbued kunai.

02:52:02.359 --> 02:52:06.880
However, the kunai bounces off of his body
due to Ran cloaking himself in Tao armor.

02:52:06.880 --> 02:52:11.870
Getting caught off-guard Ran snaps a fat double
kick that pushes both Gabi and Yuzuriha back.

02:52:11.870 --> 02:52:16.229
Observing his Tao Gabimaru can visibly seen
the thick layer of armor protecting him from

02:52:16.229 --> 02:52:17.480
any attacks.

02:52:17.480 --> 02:52:21.510
The crazy thing about Ran’s armor is that
unlike traditional armor that has holes under

02:52:21.510 --> 02:52:27.189
the armpits and other vital spots, Ran has
no gaps at all to exploit.

02:52:27.189 --> 02:52:32.240
As he says it, his Tao and muscles are in
perfect harmony, flesh perfected.

02:52:32.240 --> 02:52:36.069
Needing to force an opening, Gabi re enters
the battle and fights Ran vertically while

02:52:36.069 --> 02:52:38.629
they both stand on a bunch of massive pillars.

02:52:38.629 --> 02:52:43.090
Ran jumps at Gabi kicking away a massive chunk
of his pillar, however our man uses this to

02:52:43.090 --> 02:52:46.800
his advantage as he picks up the rocks and
activates Ninpo: Stone Storm sending them

02:52:46.800 --> 02:52:48.740
rocketing back at the immortal.

02:52:48.740 --> 02:52:53.250
Not phased due to the elemental diff, Ran
just returns the ability by kicking them at

02:52:53.250 --> 02:52:54.810
Gabi causing him to drop to the ground.

02:52:54.810 --> 02:52:59.010
Gabimaru then tells Yuzuriha that it was time
to begin their next strategy.

02:52:59.010 --> 02:53:02.970
Confused after hearing this Ran examines his
Tao and notices that nothing has even changed,

02:53:02.970 --> 02:53:05.580
so he cant see how things would also change
in the battle.

02:53:05.580 --> 02:53:10.510
Ran readies himself to fight Gabimaru how’s
closing in, however, Gabimaru suddenly vanishes

02:53:10.510 --> 02:53:14.430
from his site, before re-appearing and landing
a fat blow that sends the immortal tumbling

02:53:14.430 --> 02:53:15.609
across its sanctuary.

02:53:15.609 --> 02:53:20.760
So back before the mission began Gabimaru
explained that Tao was like a current of water

02:53:20.760 --> 02:53:25.479
flowing around ones body, its even tangible
allowing the user to change the speed, size

02:53:25.479 --> 02:53:26.479
and strength.

02:53:26.479 --> 02:53:29.490
The attribute you’ve got determines which
direction your energy flows.

02:53:29.490 --> 02:53:33.640
You have your normal ways of combating opposite
attributes, sadly though the Tao currents

02:53:33.640 --> 02:53:37.729
of Lord Tensen are so massive that normal
rules don't apply.

02:53:37.729 --> 02:53:42.930
Gabimaru theorizes a 3 step process to use
the enemies Tao against themselves.

02:53:42.930 --> 02:53:46.750
Firstly you weaken your own energy around
a specific part of your body to take in their

02:53:46.750 --> 02:53:47.750
Tao.

02:53:47.750 --> 02:53:50.819
Then you ride the current so that the boost
of Tao spinning around your body doesn't damage

02:53:50.819 --> 02:53:54.960
you but floats around till you can reverse
its polarity and sent it back straight at

02:53:54.960 --> 02:53:56.140
the opponent.

02:53:56.140 --> 02:54:00.780
In the present, Gabimaru smashes Ran into
the ground by redirecting the Tensen's Tao.

02:54:00.780 --> 02:54:04.529
He sync’s his breathing with Ran’s and
falls into a place between tranquility and

02:54:04.529 --> 02:54:09.569
serenity, finding the middle way allowing
him to ward of incoming blows.

02:54:09.569 --> 02:54:12.810
Realizing that even getting grazed by one
of the immortals attacks would be brutal,

02:54:12.810 --> 02:54:16.400
he considers starting the second step to his
plan, but decides to hold off.

02:54:16.400 --> 02:54:21.160
Slowly healing himself Ran becomes impressed
by Gabimaru's skills with Tao, he explains

02:54:21.160 --> 02:54:25.380
that the thick clouds of mist tend to activate
a persons hidden powers when the arrive, yet

02:54:25.380 --> 02:54:29.350
he’s just something else, Gabi in his eyes
possesses sheer talent.

02:54:29.350 --> 02:54:33.300
However, Gabimaru disagrees with his comment,
stating that everything that has happened

02:54:33.300 --> 02:54:37.189
was because of everyone's efforts and the
sacrifices they made along the way for the

02:54:37.189 --> 02:54:40.189
sole purpose of defeating Lord Tensen.

02:54:40.189 --> 02:54:44.450
While Ran is left shocked with Gabi’s pure
determination, Sagiri quickly frees Mei from

02:54:44.450 --> 02:54:47.850
the restraints and lets the others know they’re
gonna head for the elixir.

02:54:47.850 --> 02:54:51.510
Screaming at them to behave themselves, Ran
swings around and attempts to stop them but

02:54:51.510 --> 02:54:54.750
is stopped himself by Gabimaru who yells at
the others to get it done.

02:54:54.750 --> 02:54:59.000
Still trying to get past, Ran quickly figures
that Gabi’s using his own Tao against him

02:54:59.000 --> 02:55:03.410
and decides to suppress it, yet as soon as
he does, Yuzuriha comes in and slices the

02:55:03.410 --> 02:55:04.431
plant man in two.

02:55:04.431 --> 02:55:09.609
Darting forth she goes to finish the job but
is warned by Gabimaru to stop.

02:55:09.609 --> 02:55:14.040
Ran, impressed with the skills of his enemies
decides that in light of the ritual, he is

02:55:14.040 --> 02:55:15.350
not allowed to toy with them.

02:55:15.350 --> 02:55:19.870
His body suddenly begins turning into a bunch
of flowers and vines before exploding into

02:55:19.870 --> 02:55:25.370
his 4 armed Kishikai state.

02:55:25.370 --> 02:55:30.229
Rien sits in the ritual circle and reviews
the names of the human invaders given by Chōbei.

02:55:30.229 --> 02:55:34.479
With Zhu Jin encountering Shion and Nurugai,
Rien believes that he holds the advantage

02:55:34.479 --> 02:55:38.720
since Shion's Wood Tao will have no effect
against Zhu Jin's Water Tao and Nurugai isn't

02:55:38.720 --> 02:55:40.520
able to use hers yet.

02:55:40.520 --> 02:55:46.090
Still he does sense a great deal of rage and
knows that anger can greatly increase someone's

02:55:46.090 --> 02:55:47.090
abilities.

02:55:47.090 --> 02:55:51.800
Also at a similar time Gantetsusai and Fuchi
face Tao Fa and Ju Fa, Rien believes that

02:55:51.800 --> 02:55:56.140
his team will defeat them with ease as neither
of their opponents have refined their Tao.

02:55:56.140 --> 02:56:00.479
Though he does takes note of Gabimaru as he
can sense that they need to be extremely careful

02:56:00.479 --> 02:56:01.479
with him.

02:56:01.479 --> 02:56:06.260
After he finishes his review, Rien presents
the completed Elixir of Life to Jofuku and

02:56:06.260 --> 02:56:10.420
announces that once they defeat the human
invaders they will be ready to depart to the

02:56:10.420 --> 02:56:13.010
mainland to continue with their ultimate plan.

02:56:13.010 --> 02:56:16.979
Meanwhile, the Asaemon from the second landing
party become exhausted after travelling so

02:56:16.979 --> 02:56:19.340
far in such a short amount of time.

02:56:19.340 --> 02:56:23.300
After making it to the Tan pits all of them
are disgusted and disheartened once they find

02:56:23.300 --> 02:56:25.920
what remains of Tenza and Genji.

02:56:25.920 --> 02:56:29.450
Furious at the fact that more of his close
friends have died before he was able to save

02:56:29.450 --> 02:56:34.140
them, Shugen states that they make for Hōrai
now, once there, everyone, the hermits and

02:56:34.140 --> 02:56:36.180
the convicts are to be eviscerated.

02:56:36.180 --> 02:56:40.410
Having stolen one of the special flutes the
Doshi use to control the Mōnshin, Shugen

02:56:40.410 --> 02:56:45.489
blows it and commands them to carry him and
his crew to Hōrai at once.

02:56:45.489 --> 02:56:51.060
Remembering their past discussion on how if
the enemy evolves redirecting its Tao will

02:56:51.060 --> 02:56:55.830
be impossible, Gabimaru comes up with the
idea of boosting Yuzuriha's Tao imbued weapons

02:56:55.830 --> 02:56:58.210
with his own to defeat Lord Tensen.

02:56:58.210 --> 02:57:02.290
Back in the fight, Gabi sees Ran going to
attack and prepares to use the same plan of

02:57:02.290 --> 02:57:03.899
redirecting his Tao.

02:57:03.899 --> 02:57:08.370
However, he and Yuzuriha are completely dumbfounded
when a single punch from the immortals Kishikai

02:57:08.370 --> 02:57:12.260
state blows apart the surroundings while also
knocking them back.

02:57:12.260 --> 02:57:17.090
Following up Ran pummels the life out of Yuzuriha
and Gabi, sending our boy shooting outside

02:57:17.090 --> 02:57:21.739
of the building and causing Yuzuriha to drop
to her knee’s severely injured.

02:57:21.739 --> 02:57:25.180
Elsewhere as Sagiri and Mei run throughout
the palace searching for the Laboratory, Mei

02:57:25.180 --> 02:57:29.600
notices the loud noises coming from the Dō'in
Temple and become worried for their allies.

02:57:29.600 --> 02:57:34.239
Sagiri assures Mei that Gabimaru will be alright
since he has a backup plan but even still

02:57:34.239 --> 02:57:37.970
the idea of him following through with that
plan worries her.

02:57:37.970 --> 02:57:41.979
Taking things up a level, the Kishikai monster
Knee’s causing massive damage before following

02:57:41.979 --> 02:57:44.560
up and smashing him into the ground.

02:57:44.560 --> 02:57:48.550
Disappointed in how easily he’s being beaten,
Gabi takes note of how unlike the previous

02:57:48.550 --> 02:57:52.430
Kishikai’s they've seen, Ran’s mind is
still in control allowing him to perform his

02:57:52.430 --> 02:57:54.950
techniques to an even higher degree.

02:57:54.950 --> 02:57:58.600
Despite her past warnings that when push comes
to shove she’ll dip out of the fight, Yuzuriha

02:57:58.600 --> 02:58:02.910
lets loose her rope like ability to grab her
teammate in an attempt to try and survive.

02:58:02.910 --> 02:58:06.600
However, Ran catches up to them and as she
realizes that if she doesn't block its the

02:58:06.600 --> 02:58:10.000
end for her throws, Gabimaru manages to block
the attack on time.

02:58:10.000 --> 02:58:14.200
Having had enough with this pathetic cockroach
of a human, Ran throws away any idea of using

02:58:14.200 --> 02:58:18.700
Gabimaru for Tan and instead smashes down
breaking his guard and seemingly ending our

02:58:18.700 --> 02:58:19.890
mans journey home.

02:58:19.890 --> 02:58:25.870
To top it off, Ran then throws Gabi into pillar,
leaving him their to live out his final moments...

02:58:25.870 --> 02:58:30.190
Remembering all of the times Gabi had said
that his life takes priority and that he wouldn't

02:58:30.190 --> 02:58:31.960
die until he makes it home.

02:58:31.960 --> 02:58:36.720
HE AGAIN REITERATES THAT THOUGHT, AS MAN ISNT
ABOUT TO END IT ALL.

02:58:36.720 --> 02:58:37.920
No no no no...

02:58:37.920 --> 02:58:43.550
Pricking his finger with one of the flowers
the young man chooses to to sacrifice whatever

02:58:43.550 --> 02:58:47.100
it takes in order to return to back to the
love of his life.

02:58:47.100 --> 02:58:51.819
Regaining his footing, Gabimaru stands back
up fully healed, while revealing his black

02:58:51.819 --> 02:58:56.180
eye and the vine like patters that stretch
out over the left side of his face.

02:58:56.180 --> 02:59:00.350
So the reason that Gabimaru can achieve this
state and not just bloom into a bunch of flowers

02:59:00.350 --> 02:59:03.729
like everyone else who’s been stung is for
a very specific few reasons.

02:59:03.729 --> 02:59:07.630
Pretty much if only a little bit of Tan makes
it into the body it has the possibility to

02:59:07.630 --> 02:59:11.220
balance out, making someone the same as Tensen.

02:59:11.220 --> 02:59:14.689
Gabimaru who had overheard this explanation
got everyone to accompany him to Mu Dan's

02:59:14.689 --> 02:59:16.030
pile of bloomed flowers.

02:59:16.030 --> 02:59:19.910
He then retrieves one of his flower stingers
and plans to receive the same powers as Chōbei

02:59:19.910 --> 02:59:25.010
by overcoming the Arborfication, but Mei objected
to doing it at that time due to just how dangerous

02:59:25.010 --> 02:59:26.399
the risks are.

02:59:26.399 --> 02:59:30.420
However, Gabimaru reveals that he was already
aware of how Chōbei managed to accomplish

02:59:30.420 --> 02:59:33.160
this feat and is willing to take the risk.

02:59:33.160 --> 02:59:36.661
What separates Chōbei from everyone else
is that he has someone that he fights for

02:59:36.661 --> 02:59:38.120
beside himself.

02:59:38.120 --> 02:59:41.800
So when he’s down on his luck he finds the
strength to defy death because no matter what

02:59:41.800 --> 02:59:44.489
he’s gotta get back to his brother.

02:59:44.489 --> 02:59:50.450
Back with the girls, Sagiri becomes shocked
after only just learning about part 2 of his

02:59:50.450 --> 02:59:54.830
plan, but knows that he is willing to do this
all in the hopes of returning back to this

02:59:54.830 --> 02:59:55.830
wife.

02:59:55.830 --> 02:59:59.010
Over in the battle Gabimaru dodges out of
the way from a few thundering punches and

02:59:59.010 --> 03:00:00.109
kicks.

03:00:00.109 --> 03:00:03.490
Focusing himself Gabi knows that he needs
to take out Ran before the flower takes over

03:00:03.490 --> 03:00:07.720
his body, even still he notices that Ran’s
attacks are starting to become slower as he

03:00:07.720 --> 03:00:10.170
consumes more Tao throughout the battle.

03:00:10.170 --> 03:00:14.350
Yuzuriha whos still recovering from that previous
blast tells Gabi that he’s not normal, no

03:00:14.350 --> 03:00:18.510
matter what happens, even if he dies he doesn't
stop pushing forward, all for the hope of

03:00:18.510 --> 03:00:21.210
seeing someone that might not exist.

03:00:21.210 --> 03:00:25.600
Turning and looking at her Gabimaru explains
that yeah he may be crazy, but there’s only

03:00:25.600 --> 03:00:28.220
some places idiots can truly reach.

03:00:28.220 --> 03:00:32.640
Someone who keeps a cool head and thinks logically
just wont survive, there’s times were you’ve

03:00:32.640 --> 03:00:34.069
just got to let loose.

03:00:34.069 --> 03:00:38.261
He compliments Yuzuriha as someone who pushes
people away on the off chance that they might

03:00:38.261 --> 03:00:40.050
make her an idiot.

03:00:40.050 --> 03:00:44.149
Hearing this, she becomes encouraged by Gabi
to step forth despite her wounds and fight

03:00:44.149 --> 03:00:47.170
with her friend in a dance of death.

03:00:47.170 --> 03:00:51.410
Knowing that his Fire Tao has no effect on
Ran's Water, Gabimaru tells Yuzuriha that

03:00:51.410 --> 03:00:54.260
they need to rely on her Earth affinity to
defeat him.

03:00:54.260 --> 03:00:58.890
Needing to make an opening for her, Gabi starts
off by activating his ascetic form and using

03:00:58.890 --> 03:01:02.620
Ninpo: Demonic Firebug to throw a burst of
fire at Ran.

03:01:02.620 --> 03:01:06.830
The immortal easily extinguishes the flames
but Gabi slides in next to him and activates

03:01:06.830 --> 03:01:10.970
Ninpo: Burning Bridge sending a fireball rocketing
towards Rans face.

03:01:10.970 --> 03:01:14.979
Slashing his foot back, Ran comfortably dissipates
the flames from around him, yet as he does

03:01:14.979 --> 03:01:19.220
so Yuzuriha makes her move and latches onto
him down with her mucus strings.

03:01:19.220 --> 03:01:22.620
Thinking thats good enough to finish him off,
Gabimaru attacks and dodges an attack Ran

03:01:22.620 --> 03:01:23.830
makes to his tanden.

03:01:23.830 --> 03:01:28.340
He then uses Ninpo: Ascetic Blaze in an attempt
to scorch the creature but as he looks down

03:01:28.340 --> 03:01:32.430
at his work, see’s a hand reach through
and toss him towards Yuzuriha.

03:01:32.430 --> 03:01:36.440
Slightly impressed Ran says that even with
this scheme of theirs its only a futile struggle

03:01:36.440 --> 03:01:40.170
thats prolonging the inevitable and yet its
beautiful to behold.

03:01:40.170 --> 03:01:44.350
Hearing Gabi talk some smack, Ran prepares
himself for the final bout and tells them

03:01:44.350 --> 03:01:46.189
to show him everything they have.

03:01:46.189 --> 03:01:57.510
Okay yeah im not gonna hit ya with 30 seconds
of techniques so re-igniting the battle, the

03:01:57.510 --> 03:02:02.189
two shinobi then unleash their various ninjutsu
techniques in combination with each other.

03:02:02.189 --> 03:02:06.410
Ran somehow manages to block every ability
and bushes them off but suddenly notices that

03:02:06.410 --> 03:02:08.060
his body started to crack.

03:02:08.060 --> 03:02:12.470
With the immortal randomly confused with what
just happened, Gabimaru reveals that his earlier

03:02:12.470 --> 03:02:17.300
attack was meant to overstimulate Ran in order
to make him lose his sense of judgement and

03:02:17.300 --> 03:02:18.300
timing.

03:02:18.300 --> 03:02:23.760
Throughout the fight they were able to stall
for enough time to have the Kishikai use up

03:02:23.760 --> 03:02:25.350
all of its Tao.

03:02:25.350 --> 03:02:30.479
Suddenly Ran's Kishikai form explodes, revealing
his weakened and reforming state, giving Gabimaru

03:02:30.479 --> 03:02:32.859
and Yuzuriha an opening to attack.

03:02:32.859 --> 03:02:37.450
As the two rush in, Yuzuriha starts to feel
pain coming from her wound but tries to endure

03:02:37.450 --> 03:02:39.280
it until they defeat Ran.

03:02:39.280 --> 03:02:42.979
Rising back up infront of them, Gabimaru sees
that Ran had managed to cancel out his form

03:02:42.979 --> 03:02:45.189
before completely running out of Tao.

03:02:45.189 --> 03:02:48.870
While changing genders Ran swipes at Gabi,
making it obvious to the Ninja that he’s

03:02:48.870 --> 03:02:52.180
trying to recover his lost Tao by cycling
between yin and yang.

03:02:52.180 --> 03:02:56.750
He screams out to Yuzuriha to use her ability
before he recovers and hearing this, Ran reaches

03:02:56.750 --> 03:03:00.540
out clutching down on Gabi’s shoulder telling
him that its impossible.

03:03:00.540 --> 03:03:04.240
He knows that the wound she received earlier
is extremely deep and should she continue

03:03:04.240 --> 03:03:06.600
with the plan, she will die...

03:03:06.600 --> 03:03:11.649
Stopping in her tracks Yuzuriha agrees with
Ran's statement and throws her Kunai away.

03:03:11.649 --> 03:03:15.910
Suddenly spinning around though, the QUEEN
catches her weapon and sparks up her Tao as

03:03:15.910 --> 03:03:19.399
its time to follow through with what she came
here to do.

03:03:19.399 --> 03:03:22.740
Slapping his hands together, the immortal
goes on the defense by forming a field of

03:03:22.740 --> 03:03:26.220
massive spikes in an attempt to take Yuzuriha
down before she reaches him.

03:03:26.220 --> 03:03:30.489
Putting out his hand, Gabi helps Yuzuriha
avoid the spikes by flicking her up into the

03:03:30.489 --> 03:03:31.489
air.

03:03:31.489 --> 03:03:34.979
She then jumps down off the ceiling and as
she perceives the remaining Tao inside of

03:03:34.979 --> 03:03:39.300
Ran’s Tanden, annihilates it with the Earth
affinity infused kunai.

03:03:39.300 --> 03:03:44.231
With the battle coming to and end, the immortal
being then starts to crumble away, calling

03:03:44.231 --> 03:03:59.479
out for his brother during his pitiful demise.

03:03:59.479 --> 03:04:05.069
After he fully turned into a bunch of foliage,
Yuzuriha warns Gabimaru about the Arborfication

03:04:05.069 --> 03:04:07.819
process eventually taking over his body.

03:04:07.819 --> 03:04:11.939
Still in his eyes he knew that he had no other
option if he wanted to see his wife again.

03:04:11.939 --> 03:04:17.260
He then suggests that they catch up to Sagiri
and Mei but Yuzuriha needing to rest tells

03:04:17.260 --> 03:04:19.229
him to leave without her.

03:04:19.229 --> 03:04:23.260
Before leaving, Gabimaru tells Yuzuriha that
he’ll be waiting for her at the boats and

03:04:23.260 --> 03:04:27.200
also thanks once again for saving his life
when they first encountered each other on

03:04:27.200 --> 03:04:28.540
the island.

03:04:28.540 --> 03:04:32.250
AHHH man this moment always gets my freaking
tear ducts rolling.

03:04:32.250 --> 03:04:36.890
After being left alone, Yuzuriha unbuttons
her dress and removes the mucus protecting

03:04:36.890 --> 03:04:39.120
the would she received.

03:04:39.120 --> 03:04:43.060
Thinking to herself, she finds its sad that
she never showed her heart to anyone, till

03:04:43.060 --> 03:04:48.990
the end she remained the same, always going
at it alone whether that be life or death...

03:04:48.990 --> 03:04:54.160
Knowing that her life was at risk, Yuzuriha
apologizes to her deceased sister Saya.

03:04:54.160 --> 03:04:59.500
She really really tried to live for the both
of them, but this here is the end of her road.

03:04:59.500 --> 03:05:04.220
Remembering what she said to Senta when he
passed, she tells herself those same words.

03:05:04.220 --> 03:05:07.540
“When it hurts go ahead and think about
whatever you want.

03:05:07.540 --> 03:05:09.420
A pet cat, maybe?

03:05:09.420 --> 03:05:11.290
A lover left behind?

03:05:11.290 --> 03:05:12.290
Your family?

03:05:12.290 --> 03:05:15.229
Pass on with that beautiful vision.

03:05:15.229 --> 03:05:21.180
Yuzuriha then faints with a smile on her face
after thinking about Saya as her final thoughts.

03:05:21.180 --> 03:05:27.830
(Damn that hurts every time, sorry I had to
blur some stuff and have been throughout the

03:05:27.830 --> 03:05:29.710
video cause Yuki is crazy.

03:05:29.710 --> 03:05:35.521
But yeah that really hurts my soul, I don't
know what false expectation id brought on

03:05:35.521 --> 03:05:37.100
myself at this point.

03:05:37.100 --> 03:05:40.680
Like I just thought everyone was gonna be
okay)

03:05:40.680 --> 03:05:44.800
Nearby while Gabimaru runs, he remembers the
plan that they need at least five people of

03:05:44.800 --> 03:05:48.800
their group to help sail one of the underground
ships and goes to push forth to the temple.

03:05:48.800 --> 03:05:52.939
However, he stops still dropping to the ground
as the effects of the vines spread through

03:05:52.939 --> 03:05:54.109
his body.

03:05:54.109 --> 03:05:58.120
Beginning to crawl he remembers Yuzuriha’s
words on how the more he regenerates, the

03:05:58.120 --> 03:06:00.460
