they lure humans over and over and over again

03:10:32.160 --> 03:10:33.480
for a thousand yes.

03:10:33.480 --> 03:10:38.420
Yet still, even now they haven't been able
to achieve perfect immortal bodies.

03:10:38.420 --> 03:10:42.600
They’ve all realized it, its just that if
she stops smiling now, she’ll completely

03:10:42.600 --> 03:10:45.960
