friends, but they also weren't so different

03:12:29.260 --> 03:12:30.380
from each other.

03:12:30.380 --> 03:12:35.010
This didnt apply to just him aswell, all of
the executioners at the end of the day are

03:12:35.010 --> 03:12:39.310
just human and if they make connections with
someone it leads to genuine feelings just

03:12:39.310 --> 03:12:40.310
