rips out his eye.

03:13:05.810 --> 03:13:10.880
Back just before when he dodged that blast
he knew that he was relying on sensation and

03:13:10.880 --> 03:13:12.210
NOT SIGHT.

03:13:12.210 --> 03:13:16.050
Now though, mans on a completely different
level and can perceive everything around him

03:13:16.050 --> 03:13:17.690
