03:14:12.040 --> 03:14:17.771
In the present, Gantetsusai manages to dodge
Tao Fa's projectiles and continuously strikes

03:14:17.771 --> 03:14:20.250
away at he, not giving her a chance to regenerate.

03:14:20.250 --> 03:14:24.640
However, his attacks are unable to stop her
from reviving as sadly Gantetsusai doesn't

03:14:24.640 --> 03:14:27.350
