03:14:27.350 --> 03:14:31.160
Not wanting the battle to turn into one of
attrition, Fuchi knows that only his Metal

03:14:31.160 --> 03:14:35.880
Tao will be able to stop Tao Fa from regenerating
and jumps in to grab her so that it subsequently

03:14:35.880 --> 03:14:39.250
weakens the immortal allowing Gantetsusai
