03:16:10.149 --> 03:16:14.710
since they were partners, the fact that he
is able to imagine the pain she feels is perfect

03:16:14.710 --> 03:16:15.850
proof of that!

03:16:15.850 --> 03:16:19.529
Empathy is both the root of uneasiness and
compassion.

03:16:19.529 --> 03:16:23.670
Yet because of what they are, its inherently
harder for them to understand or internalize

03:16:23.670 --> 03:16:25.510
these thoughts.

03:16:25.510 --> 03:16:29.350
Sadly though a change soon started showing
itself in Rien after he introduces the five

03:16:29.350 --> 03:16:33.580
