03:16:38.340 --> 03:16:43.450
Both of them were in my eyes disgustingly
assigned with Bochu Jutsu, like common man

03:16:43.450 --> 03:16:45.770
they were pretty much family at this point.

03:16:45.770 --> 03:16:51.180
During one of their I guess i've gotta call
