03:19:33.340 --> 03:19:38.060
Looking at his friend though, Fuchi watches
as Gantetsusai starts to laugh uncontrollably.

03:19:38.060 --> 03:19:41.670
Quickly realizing what's causing it, he sees
that one of the spores the monster had sneakily

03:19:41.670 --> 03:19:44.620
let loose managed to sink into Gantetsusai's
neck.

03:19:44.620 --> 03:19:48.830
Having managed to not get hit himself, he
removes the barb and tells the other that

03:19:48.830 --> 03:19:50.010
they need to get under cover.

03:19:50.010 --> 03:19:54.180
Chōbei knowing that he needs to break this
stalemate prepares to jump up and fight the

03:19:54.180 --> 03:19:55.180
monster.

03:19:55.180 --> 03:19:59.439
He transforms and sends forth a couple of
vines that allow him to get ahold of the immortal.

03:19:59.439 --> 03:20:03.689
Hanging there he then morphs his hand into
a massive battle axe and cuts Tao Fa's tanden

03:20:03.689 --> 03:20:07.500
with his vines, making him realize that his
Metal affinity dominates one of the immortals

03:20:07.500 --> 03:20:09.220
wood.

03:20:09.220 --> 03:20:12.860
Randomly splitting itself inhalf, the immortal
then sends a lightning fast barrage towards

03:20:12.860 --> 03:20:15.729
Chōbei, which connects and manages to skewer
him.

03:20:15.729 --> 03:20:20.160
Then picking it up a notch, the creature boosts
itself forwards before using that momentum

03:20:20.160 --> 03:20:23.720
to send Chōbei flying across the area and
back through a building.

03:20:23.720 --> 03:20:27.460
Gantetsusai mocks Chōbei once again while
next to him Tōma panics thinking that her

03:20:27.460 --> 03:20:29.040
brother is in danger.

03:20:29.040 --> 03:20:32.831
Fuchi calms them down and says that there
is no way they could slash the monster in

03:20:32.831 --> 03:20:36.690
one slice so in order to defeat it they have
to work together.

03:20:36.690 --> 03:20:41.050
Big G and the Bandit king exchange some half
assed insults about working with each other,

03:20:41.050 --> 03:20:44.600
yet as soon as the creature tries to attack
them, they turn their anger towards it and

03:20:44.600 --> 03:20:45.600
deflect its attack.

03:20:45.600 --> 03:20:49.810
Fuchi like the calm headed G he is, kinda
just realized Fuchi literally replaced Senta

03:20:49.810 --> 03:20:54.720
as a character with his entirety, except unlike
Senta he isn't afraid to inflict injury.

03:20:54.720 --> 03:21:00.170
Oh well he reminds them that their enemy is
the Kishikai amalgamation in front of them

03:21:00.170 --> 03:21:04.080
and that they can focus on fighting each other
later.

03:21:04.080 --> 03:21:08.640
Finally stepping forth with everyone now planning
to work together Chōbei, Tōma, Gantetsusai

03:21:08.640 --> 03:21:11.080
and Fuchi all vow to win.

03:21:11.080 --> 03:21:14.670
With all of the others standing behind him
Chōbei transforms and blocks the monsters

03:21:14.670 --> 03:21:15.670
vine attack.

03:21:15.670 --> 03:21:19.450
Growing some more branches, the immortal shoots
some stingers towards the group, but the bandit

03:21:19.450 --> 03:21:22.399
throws himself infront of them to save his
bro from being hit.

03:21:22.399 --> 03:21:26.580
While stuck dazed wondering if he can even
handle this foe, Chōbei reviews the elemental

03:21:26.580 --> 03:21:30.770
attribute cycle and knows that because of
the secret technique he has in store hes the

03:21:30.770 --> 03:21:33.189
only who can actually finish the immortals.

03:21:33.189 --> 03:21:37.710
Ju Fa sprouts an extra vine to attack Chōbei
but suddenly its sliced in half by Tōma.

03:21:37.710 --> 03:21:41.750
He then grabs Fuchi's hand in order to strengthen
his Metal Tao and darts forth with him to

03:21:41.750 --> 03:21:43.100
slice Tao Fa's tanden.

03:21:43.100 --> 03:21:47.500
Getting in close, Tōma uses Fuchi’s momentum
and flings him in close enough so that he’s

03:21:47.500 --> 03:21:49.600
able to land a slice on the Tanden.

03:21:49.600 --> 03:21:53.720
Sensing an opportunity, Gantetsusai jumps
in to deliver his attack but accidentally

03:21:53.720 --> 03:21:58.840
slips and falls into the pool as the monster
itself once again flies up into the sky.

03:21:58.840 --> 03:22:03.149
Standing there Chōbei sees Tōma arguing
with Gantetsusai and remembers how throughout

03:22:03.149 --> 03:22:06.350
there lives, he’s never seen this side of
him.

03:22:06.350 --> 03:22:10.350
Throughout their childhood he was always someone
who could only ever follow in someone's footsteps,

03:22:10.350 --> 03:22:15.620
but now hes noticed that his brother has slowly
started to become his own person.

03:22:15.620 --> 03:22:19.760
Realizing they should probably be focusing
on the battle, Chōbei points everyone's attention

03:22:19.760 --> 03:22:23.210
up to the newly evolved monster still floating
in the sky.

03:22:23.210 --> 03:22:26.450
Knowing that they can't defeat the monster
without destroying both tandens simultaneously,

03:22:26.450 --> 03:22:31.399
Chōbei assigns himself with Gantetsusai in
order kill Ju Fa with strategy he has planned,

03:22:31.399 --> 03:22:35.300
while the leftovers; Tōma and Fuchi deal
with Tao Fa.

03:22:35.300 --> 03:22:40.930
Reverting back to Simpoma he asks his brother
what he should do, Chōbei though punches

03:22:40.930 --> 03:22:46.670
him on the head demanding that he make his
own decisions now, since he has faith in his

03:22:46.670 --> 03:22:47.670
abilities.

03:22:47.670 --> 03:22:50.890
Gantetsusai isn't exactly chill about teaming
up with Chōbei and is initially reluctant

03:22:50.890 --> 03:22:55.290
to listen to his orders but after the bandit
complements his strength man gets straight

03:22:55.290 --> 03:22:56.760
up manipulated into fighting with him.

03:22:56.760 --> 03:23:01.109
Chōbei looks towards the monster and notes
that they are similar for the fact that both

03:23:01.109 --> 03:23:03.260
duo’s are willing to protect their own.

03:23:03.260 --> 03:23:07.130
In his eyes though, Tōma has grown to the
point where he no longer needs protection

03:23:07.130 --> 03:23:16.800
and because of that states that he will rip
them both a part so they can pass on together.

03:23:16.800 --> 03:23:20.220
Skipping back to before the battle begun,
we see that Rien while setting up the ritual

03:23:20.220 --> 03:23:24.260
of rite consumption told Chōbei that his
brother bears an ill omen.

03:23:24.260 --> 03:23:28.739
Back in the present time, Chōbei, Tōma,
Gantetsusai, and Fuchi all charge towards

03:23:28.739 --> 03:23:32.140
the Kishikai monster while constantly fending
off barrages of vines.

03:23:32.140 --> 03:23:36.130
Turning to the small man, Gantetsusai tells
him to give him some cover as he dives forth

03:23:36.130 --> 03:23:37.949
in an attempt to cut it down.

03:23:37.949 --> 03:23:42.250
Seeing him get hit directly though by multiple
vines, it causes Fuchi to think that the swordsman

03:23:42.250 --> 03:23:44.060
has almost reached his limit.

03:23:44.060 --> 03:23:47.790
The monster launches their spores towards
Fuchi but having seen the attack in time,

03:23:47.790 --> 03:23:50.580
is protected by Tōma who throws his own body
infront of it.

03:23:50.580 --> 03:23:55.569
Needing to snap Fuchi out of the daze he’s
in, Tōma shakes him around and explains that

03:23:55.569 --> 03:23:58.300
his tao is vital in their plan.

03:23:58.300 --> 03:24:02.500
Jumping up into the sky, Chōbei notices that
everyone is on their last legs, but this is

03:24:02.500 --> 03:24:05.380
it, they wont have another chance to win.

03:24:05.380 --> 03:24:08.949
Claiming that he’s ready now, the big man
himself manages to sneak under the monster

03:24:08.949 --> 03:24:14.350
through the water, before popping up and sending
a massive slash directly up through the immortal,

03:24:14.350 --> 03:24:18.190
cutting it in half and leaving the others
with a perfect opportunity to take it down.

03:24:18.190 --> 03:24:22.140
Fuchi, Tōma and Chōbei then come in from
both sides swinging their attacks towards

03:24:22.140 --> 03:24:23.140
the immortals.

03:24:23.140 --> 03:24:27.280
Ju Fa and Tao Fa try to reconnect into their
Kishikai form, but just before they are able

03:24:27.280 --> 03:24:31.770
to do so, our team successfully destroys the
Tanden of both immortals.

03:24:31.770 --> 03:24:35.600
Screaming for her partner, Tao Fa emerges
from the pool weakened but is quickly stopped

03:24:35.600 --> 03:24:40.850
and held in the arms by Fuchi who tells her
to stop as these are her final moments.

03:24:40.850 --> 03:24:45.210
Ju Fa then also climbs out of the water extremely
weakened and tries to attack Chōbei.

03:24:45.210 --> 03:24:49.390
Since his Tao won't be able to hinder them,
Chōbei punches himself in the gut and removes

03:24:49.390 --> 03:24:53.310
two bottles of Water Tao, that he originally
planned to use against Gabimaru.

03:24:53.310 --> 03:24:57.630
He then pours the liquid on Ju Fa, which almost
act like an acid to stop him from regenerating.

03:24:57.630 --> 03:25:02.000
Basking in victory, Chōbei just tells the
creature that he should have never picked

03:25:02.000 --> 03:25:04.500
a fight with the Aza brothers.

03:25:04.500 --> 03:25:07.960
Randomly Gantetsusai comes and finishes the
job entirely causing Chōbei to think that

03:25:07.960 --> 03:25:11.350
the man was taking pity on the creatures,
when in all reality man really did just want

03:25:11.350 --> 03:25:12.350
up the KD.

03:25:12.350 --> 03:25:16.290
In our big brutes head though his thoughts
are slightly different, while remembering

03:25:16.290 --> 03:25:20.970
Tao Fa's words from their last battle, he
kneels down and places a peach from Tao Fa's

03:25:20.970 --> 03:25:25.840
body next to Ju Fa, thanking her for the "fun"
they had throughout their battle.

03:25:25.840 --> 03:25:30.530
As he slowly dies and tears appear in his
eyes, Ju Fa apologizes to his girl for not

03:25:30.530 --> 03:25:32.510
being able to protect her.

03:25:32.510 --> 03:25:37.840
Now appearing as children (which obviously
represents the most sane and happiest time

03:25:37.840 --> 03:25:43.720
in both of their lives, before all of the
weirdness started) Eitherway the two then

03:25:43.720 --> 03:25:48.489
embrace each other in the afterlife with Tao
Fa saying that she was glad that he was her

03:25:48.489 --> 03:25:49.489
partner.

03:25:49.489 --> 03:25:52.939
Back in reality and with the battle having
been won, Fuchi wonders how the others are

03:25:52.939 --> 03:25:54.120
currents fairing.

03:25:54.120 --> 03:25:59.439
Then once again going back a bit earlier in
time, Sagiri and Mei encounter Gui Fa who

03:25:59.439 --> 03:26:03.290
says that he wont attack them if they don't
move from where they are, but also adds that

03:26:03.290 --> 03:26:07.160
he will absolutely crush them if they even
take once step forward.

03:26:07.160 --> 03:26:11.989
After arriving, Mei pointed out that this
was the Rentan Temple, yet Rien wasn't here

03:26:11.989 --> 03:26:15.170
so she just casually asked her fellow immortal
where they could've gone.

03:26:15.170 --> 03:26:19.540
Gui Fa says that Rien had left not to long
ago and he was given the task to guard the

03:26:19.540 --> 03:26:20.540
ritual circle.

03:26:20.540 --> 03:26:24.460
Gui Fa explains that the items infront of
him are meant to tell the fortune and current

03:26:24.460 --> 03:26:28.340
status of the humans fighting against the
other Tensen's, which is how he knew that

03:26:28.340 --> 03:26:30.380
her and Mei were on the way.

03:26:30.380 --> 03:26:33.920
Sagiri then reaches for her sword, causing
Gui Fa to emit their Tao towards Sagiri in

03:26:33.920 --> 03:26:37.630
a similar manner to someone overwhelming a
person with their aura, which causes Sagiri

03:26:37.630 --> 03:26:39.720
to collapse from the pressure.

03:26:39.720 --> 03:26:43.420
Impressed with the fact she can still move,
Gui Fa tells that that if she does continue

03:26:43.420 --> 03:26:45.750
to resist he will crush her.

03:26:45.750 --> 03:26:49.670
Sagiri explains that she doesn't wish to fight
and instead places her sword on the ground

03:26:49.670 --> 03:26:53.970
while apologizing for invading their island
along with their behaviour since then.

03:26:53.970 --> 03:26:58.109
With that said though, she finds it pathetic
how now he tries to stop her when all along

03:26:58.109 --> 03:27:00.840
they were purposely luring people to the island.

03:27:00.840 --> 03:27:05.510
This conflict is merely an extension of what
they sowed and sadly with how things are now,

03:27:05.510 --> 03:27:07.439
its only going to result in more losses.

03:27:07.439 --> 03:27:12.790
In an attempt to prevent this, Sagiri offers
a declaration of peace between both sides,

03:27:12.790 --> 03:27:16.479
they will leave and the immortals will allow
it to happen without delay.

03:27:16.479 --> 03:27:20.899
Hearing this, Gui Fa drops the hold he had
over Sagiri and allows her to move.

03:27:20.899 --> 03:27:25.760
However, he warns them that even if they return
back to Woguo it would be pointless.

03:27:25.760 --> 03:27:29.200
Wanting to know what he meant by this, Gui
Fa explains to the two through an illusion

03:27:29.200 --> 03:27:33.689
created with Tao, that Rien's true plan is
to depart Hōrai on a ship and release the

03:27:33.689 --> 03:27:37.189
Paradise Butterflies on to the mainland, turning
every human into Waitanhua flowers.

03:27:37.189 --> 03:27:42.521
Then once all of the humans had turned they
would form together into one giant Banko,

03:27:42.521 --> 03:27:45.399
called the divine BEAST BANKO.

03:27:45.399 --> 03:27:50.370
From that Rien can finally produce the much
sought after perfected Tan.

03:27:50.370 --> 03:27:54.399
Hearing this shakes our girl to her core as
finally for the first time in the series someone

03:27:54.399 --> 03:27:58.470
of normal sanity found out the truth about
Rien's maniacal plan.

03:27:58.470 --> 03:28:05.399
Btw Waguo is the ancient Chinese name for
Japan, pronounced Wakoku in Japanese.

03:28:05.399 --> 03:28:11.220
Funnily enough the name came about in the
3rd century and literally meant dwarf country.

03:28:11.220 --> 03:28:15.609
Later on in the 7th century and to amend their
short shaming the Japanese people changed

03:28:15.609 --> 03:28:17.360
the Kanji up to mean peace and harmony.

03:28:17.360 --> 03:28:18.360
Still rambling on here but its actually crazy
how many times the names changed, like even

03:28:18.360 --> 03:28:19.360
now there's still Nippon, Nihon, Jipang and
finally Japan itself.

03:28:19.360 --> 03:28:20.360
ANNNYWAYS

03:28:20.360 --> 03:28:21.360
Sagiri asks Gui Fa why?

03:28:21.360 --> 03:28:24.210
Why would they all go to these lengths, what
could possibly be motivating them?

03:28:24.210 --> 03:28:28.210
Gui Fa answers that they as in him and the
other Tensen, feel nothing for humans and

03:28:28.210 --> 03:28:32.130
that they are materials for them to use in
order to make an elixir.

03:28:32.130 --> 03:28:36.160
Hearing this change in her old friend, Mei
objects to this statement, saying that Jofuku's

03:28:36.160 --> 03:28:39.530
original research was for the good of mankind
and using lives isn't.

03:28:39.530 --> 03:28:44.510
Yet in the Gui Fa’s eyes, they've all changed,
ever since one specific day in which they

03:28:44.510 --> 03:28:49.090
all tested a specific method and managed to
lure in the first group of humans to the island.

03:28:49.090 --> 03:28:53.699
On that day they learned just how beautiful
and delicious humans truly are.

03:28:53.699 --> 03:28:58.410
It was more than they ever expected, humans
outside of Hōrai were weak frail things,

03:28:58.410 --> 03:29:01.470
yet they possessed far more exquisite materials.

03:29:01.470 --> 03:29:05.510
The reason for this is because humans are
beings full of doubt and indecision, they

03:29:05.510 --> 03:29:09.439
waver between the extremes which itself is
the essence of Tao.

03:29:09.439 --> 03:29:11.510
Love and hate, life and death.

03:29:11.510 --> 03:29:16.229
Due to the Tensen being born as higher beings
they simply cant fathom those aspects of Tao,

03:29:16.229 --> 03:29:20.170
so to Gui Fa its frankly unthinkable that
they would look for a more suitable form of

03:29:20.170 --> 03:29:22.160
immortality elixir at this point.

03:29:22.160 --> 03:29:27.100
With the elixir completed by Rien, Gui Fa
also says that to come to an understanding

03:29:27.100 --> 03:29:31.939
would be meaningless and all they can do now
is to try and steal more lives from the others.

03:29:31.939 --> 03:29:35.729
Looking over his shoulder the dude then points
out that as they speak Shion's talisman is

03:29:35.729 --> 03:29:40.109
beginning to burn up, symbolizing that in
his battle, he’s nearing the end of his

03:29:40.109 --> 03:29:41.109
road.

03:29:41.109 --> 03:29:45.640
In his fight with Zhu Jin, Shion manages to
cut the immortals body two hundred n fifteen

03:29:45.640 --> 03:29:46.640
times.

03:29:46.640 --> 03:29:50.340
Looking at the thing infront of him, he comes
to a quick conclusion that his plan is working,

03:29:50.340 --> 03:29:53.340
the creature is beginning to slow its regeneration
speed.

03:29:53.340 --> 03:29:57.420
Walking up to it once more, Shion absolutely
exhausted continues to attack, slicing the

03:29:57.420 --> 03:29:59.430
thing in half once more.

03:29:59.430 --> 03:30:02.939
After getting right above the creature, Zhu
Jin quickly springs back and manages to get

03:30:02.939 --> 03:30:05.410
some distance between them in an attempt to
regenerate.

03:30:05.410 --> 03:30:09.510
Nurugai goes to attack herself, but Shion
holds her back while explaining that the monster

03:30:09.510 --> 03:30:11.950
itself is also just as knackered.

03:30:11.950 --> 03:30:16.760
Terrorfied and unable to take him out, Zhu
Jin asks what in the world Shion is as he

03:30:16.760 --> 03:30:18.710
defiantly isn't normal.

03:30:18.710 --> 03:30:23.180
Remembering the moment where everything first
changed Shion grits his teeth and tells the

03:30:23.180 --> 03:30:28.109
feign that those who steal the lives of other
willingly could never under stand, while those

03:30:28.109 --> 03:30:31.319
who've been stolen from will never forget.

03:30:31.319 --> 03:30:35.490
Looking like an actual 80 year old bag of
bones Zhu Jin defends themselves by attacking

03:30:35.490 --> 03:30:38.479
the duo with the remains of all of the other
bodies that have been generated throughout

03:30:38.479 --> 03:30:39.479
the battle.

03:30:39.479 --> 03:30:43.140
However, Shion sees through the his opponent's
ruse and slices the Tao infused bodies to

03:30:43.140 --> 03:30:44.140
bits.

03:30:44.140 --> 03:30:47.899
He then jumps forth using his infamous Itto
Ryu Harvest Shower but fails to land a hit

03:30:47.899 --> 03:30:48.930
on the fleeing immortal.

03:30:48.930 --> 03:30:53.140
Zhu Jin initially thinks Shion misjudged the
distance between them, but the reality of

03:30:53.140 --> 03:30:57.520
his attack was revealed when the blind king
acting like he has perfect 20/20 vision fakes

03:30:57.520 --> 03:31:00.720
a trip to grabs the tip of his sword from
the ground and throws it towards Zhu Jin's

03:31:00.720 --> 03:31:01.720
tanden.

03:31:01.720 --> 03:31:05.979
Getting up from his injury Zhu Jin sees that
Shion himself is just as exhausted from using

03:31:05.979 --> 03:31:09.859
too much of his Tao and in that moment takes
the opportunity to attack.

03:31:09.859 --> 03:31:13.890
Nurugai runs towards Shion to assist him but
as per usual, she is told to stay back as

03:31:13.890 --> 03:31:15.620
he doesn't want to put her in danger.

03:31:15.620 --> 03:31:21.130
Sadly Zhu Jin uses this moment to her advantage
and seemingly crushes Shion with the Tao bodies.

03:31:21.130 --> 03:31:24.569
Laughing out loud thinking that she's managed
to take down one of her opponents, Zhu Jin

03:31:24.569 --> 03:31:28.130
is promptly gobsmacked as they watch Shion
slice his way out the coffin.

03:31:28.130 --> 03:31:33.510
In utter shock at Shion's determination, Zhu
Jin asks why he would shave away at his own

03:31:33.510 --> 03:31:36.399
life force and go so far to avenge his fallen
comrade.

03:31:36.399 --> 03:31:41.140
Standing there utterly broken over everything
thats happened on the island, Shion explains

03:31:41.140 --> 03:31:45.160
that he hasn't had a single chance to feel
grief or mourn, at times he even finds it

03:31:45.160 --> 03:31:47.220
difficult to rage.

03:31:47.220 --> 03:31:51.399
Still no matter what, he states that until
he managed to rid the earth of these pathetic

03:31:51.399 --> 03:31:54.779
creatures, the grief, despair, NOTHING will
return to him.

03:31:54.779 --> 03:31:58.870
He wonders how many more hundreds of cuts
itl take until he can finally put his student

03:31:58.870 --> 03:32:01.479
and best friend to rest.

03:32:01.479 --> 03:32:05.229
Literally just in fear for their life at this
point, the creature makes a last ditch effort

03:32:05.229 --> 03:32:07.960
to heal itself by slipping backwards into
the water.

03:32:07.960 --> 03:32:12.050
Coming back up its shown that somehow in just
a matter of moments Zhu Jin was able to heal

03:32:12.050 --> 03:32:14.930
themselves by taking a leaf out of Gui Fa’s
book.

03:32:14.930 --> 03:32:22.180
So unlike all of the others who partake in
Bochu Jutsu, Gui Fa doesn't, instead he maintains

03:32:22.180 --> 03:32:24.260
a middle ground between both Yin and Yang.

03:32:24.260 --> 03:32:29.109
Zhu Jin then tries something new on the side
of the Tensen's and begins to partially transform

03:32:29.109 --> 03:32:31.489
their body into their Kishikai form.

03:32:31.489 --> 03:32:36.189
Standing there and looking super freaking
clean, like the fit actually goes hard the

03:32:36.189 --> 03:32:41.370
immortal taunts Shion, asking if it was still
possible for him to land all those cuts.

03:32:41.370 --> 03:32:44.950
Just like with Tenza, Zhu Jin states that
it has accustomed to their tricks and its

03:32:44.950 --> 03:32:48.620
fairly evident as the three begin their fight
once more that Shion and Nurugai are only

03:32:48.620 --> 03:32:52.080
barely able to hold on against the partial
Kishikai form.

03:32:52.080 --> 03:32:53.080
Tricks though?

03:32:53.080 --> 03:32:56.350
this statement said by Zhu Jin hits probably
one of the saddest notes within one of our

03:32:56.350 --> 03:33:00.470
favorite characters as that is literally who
Shion is, a trickster.

03:33:00.470 --> 03:33:04.640
