crazy.

03:46:31.640 --> 03:46:36.609
Also on another note, those masks all the
Ninja wear resemble ones used in Noh theater.

03:46:36.609 --> 03:46:39.680
Noh drama is the oldest surviving form of
Japanese theater.

03:46:39.680 --> 03:46:43.790
It combines music, dance, and acting to communicate
Buddhist themes.

03:46:43.790 --> 03:46:48.830
The tradition began throughout the Muromachi
period with around 60 masks that originally

03:46:48.830 --> 03:46:50.180
had religious connotations.

03:46:50.180 --> 03:46:55.159
Funnily enough and you all probably saw this
coming, Gabi’s crazy girl we just meet wears

03:46:55.159 --> 03:46:57.439
the mask that represents a jealous female
demon.

03:46:57.439 --> 03:47:02.090
Back in the depths of Hōrai inside of the
floodgates, Rien senses the tremors coming

03:47:02.090 --> 03:47:06.330
from outside and is also reported to by Gui
Fa that the other remaining Tensen have been

03:47:06.330 --> 03:47:10.240
killed, the Rite of Just Consumption has failed,
and extremely skilled human reinforcements

03:47:10.240 --> 03:47:11.410
have arrived.

03:47:11.410 --> 03:47:15.420
With no other choice, Rien stages a counterattack
by sending the Dōshi out for battle while

03:47:15.420 --> 03:47:17.870
keeping a minimum with him as protection..

03:47:17.870 --> 03:47:22.070
As they rush towards the battlefield, Rien
reiterates that this is war, the losses and

03:47:22.070 --> 03:47:26.331
outcome of this battle matter not, before
long everything should return to how it once

03:47:26.331 --> 03:47:27.650
was.

03:47:27.650 --> 03:47:32.710
Above ground now, everyone including the Doshi
riding their steeds begin throwing hands.

03:47:32.710 --> 03:47:36.770
Seeing as how they cant manage to defeat every
fodder opponent, Gantetsusai, Fuchi, Tōma,

03:47:36.770 --> 03:47:40.029
and Chōbei decide to instead make a run for
it.

03:47:40.029 --> 03:47:43.760
Over in another battle, Shion procures himself
a sword from one of the ninja and is told

03:47:43.760 --> 03:47:45.630
by Nurugai to follow her to safety.

03:47:45.630 --> 03:47:49.729
While sprinting away themselves, Gantetsusai
lets them all know that he knows a think or

03:47:49.729 --> 03:47:51.699
two about experiencing war.

03:47:51.699 --> 03:47:55.390
These fights there currently in go way beyond
just pitting strength against strength.

03:47:55.390 --> 03:48:00.170
In war living and dying is complete luck,
there's no fun about the battles and no pride

03:48:00.170 --> 03:48:01.710
at all to be won.

03:48:01.710 --> 03:48:06.140
Its only hell on earth and the people who
survive are only those that run, those who

03:48:06.140 --> 03:48:11.050
have pawns do their bidding and the complete
madmen with the gods on their side.

03:48:11.050 --> 03:48:15.779
Over with one of those madmen and as the Dōshi
army charges towards him, Shugen remembers

03:48:15.779 --> 03:48:21.090
Eizen and is driven to cut down the entire
freaking army in only a few deadly swings.

03:48:21.090 --> 03:48:25.280
After seeing Shugen's battle skills, Kiyomaru
asked him if had some experience with war,

03:48:25.280 --> 03:48:29.109
however he’s quickly told by him that this
battle isn't war, its an execution to purge

03:48:29.109 --> 03:48:32.270
the scum who dared to defy the Shoguns honorable
blade testers.

03:48:32.270 --> 03:48:36.120
He then commands his two underlings to cut
off the enemies escape routes and slaughter

03:48:36.120 --> 03:48:37.340
them all.

03:48:37.340 --> 03:48:42.159
At the floodgates, Rien encounters this so
called wannabe Gabimaru and is surprised that

03:48:42.159 --> 03:48:43.680
he couldn't detect their presence at all.

03:48:43.680 --> 03:48:48.300
Gabi’s stalker says that they have no desire
to fight with Rien and is sure that if they

03:48:48.300 --> 03:48:51.710
just waited here, Gabimaru himself might come
to the floodgates.

03:48:51.710 --> 03:48:56.479
While asking if this person happens to be
from the mainland, Rien also commands the

03:48:56.479 --> 03:49:01.330
Dōshi to take them out, however, the second
Gabimaru just like he also did with Sagiri

03:49:01.330 --> 03:49:03.620
asks if they’d like to see some Ninjutsu?

03:49:03.620 --> 03:49:07.439
before suddenly using Ninpō: Ascetic Blaze
to incinerate the Dōshi.

03:49:07.439 --> 03:49:11.170
With the area around them beginning to catch
fire, the Ninja orders its clansmen to burn

03:49:11.170 --> 03:49:14.609
all the ships except for one while they themselves
take on Rien.

03:49:14.609 --> 03:49:20.949
Back inside of the Rentan sanctum Sagiri and
Mei are confronted by the Dōshi and Iwa Ninja.

03:49:20.949 --> 03:49:24.890
Sagiri sees the ninjas charging towards her
and instantly defends herself by sensing their

03:49:24.890 --> 03:49:27.020
Tao to track the flow of their movements.

03:49:27.020 --> 03:49:30.689
While fighting off everyone, she notices that
the Dōshi don't attack Mei while the shinobi

03:49:30.689 --> 03:49:33.890
do not attack her because of her position
in the clan.

03:49:33.890 --> 03:49:37.290
Believing that its most likely due to the
specific orders each side was given, she comes

03:49:37.290 --> 03:49:41.220
to the conclusion that the key to winning
lies in exploiting this weirdity.

03:49:41.220 --> 03:49:45.859
Two Dōshi then come charging in to attack,
however, ayoooo its time, they are randomly

03:49:45.859 --> 03:49:48.760
pulled away from the two by a random sticky
string.

03:49:48.760 --> 03:49:53.500
Ofcourse its no one other that the snnneeeaky
kunoichi herself, Yuzuriha.

03:49:53.500 --> 03:49:59.120
Seeing that her friend is still somehow alive
after her previous bout she runs in and gives

03:49:59.120 --> 03:50:00.149
her a hug.

03:50:00.149 --> 03:50:04.961
Pretty much we all got hard baited thinking
she’d passed away, when in all reality she

03:50:04.961 --> 03:50:20.710
just had 
to rest.

03:50:20.710 --> 03:50:24.560
Noticing one random ninja, Yuzuriha then finishes
off a small group of them and explains to

03:50:24.560 --> 03:50:28.310
Sagiri that before meeting up with them she
checked out the surrounding area’s.

03:50:28.310 --> 03:50:32.130
The situation is probably the worst one they
could be in, right now they are seemingly

03:50:32.130 --> 03:50:35.170
cornered by all of the battles happening around
them.

03:50:35.170 --> 03:50:38.800
Since the shinobi were hired by the shogun,
Sagiri thinks that they could persuade them

03:50:38.800 --> 03:50:43.710
to fight together, however, Yuzuriha tells
her that it just wasnt possible since they

03:50:43.710 --> 03:50:47.710
are out to kill all of the criminals and reminds
Sagiri that their task for coming here has

03:50:47.710 --> 03:50:48.850
not changed.

03:50:48.850 --> 03:50:52.430
Sagiri knows this and points out that the
elixir is most likely at the floodgates.

03:50:52.430 --> 03:50:53.430
Turning she asks if Mei was willing to accompany
them to confront Rien, but before she even

03:50:53.430 --> 03:50:54.430
has the time to answer, the three are approached
by Isuzu.

03:50:54.430 --> 03:50:57.360
Seeing Sagiri for the first time since arriving
on the island Isuzu becomes relieved, but

03:50:57.360 --> 03:51:00.899
is shocked to see her standing next to the
criminal Yuzuriha of Keishu.

03:51:00.899 --> 03:51:05.319
Sagiri tries to explain that she and the other
executioners had no other choice but to team

03:51:05.319 --> 03:51:07.180
up with the criminals given their situation,
however, Isuzu pulls out a book and reads

03:51:07.180 --> 03:51:08.180
Yuzuriha's criminal records.

03:51:08.180 --> 03:51:11.449
She tells her that many lives were stolen
by her hands, so think of her victims, do

03:51:11.449 --> 03:51:15.120
not dishonor them as Yuzuriha is truly a villan.

03:51:15.120 --> 03:51:19.131
At the same time, Kiyomaru confronts Shion
and Nurugai while Jikka confronts Chōbei

03:51:19.131 --> 03:51:20.250
and Tōma.

03:51:20.250 --> 03:51:24.319
Isuzu explains in combination with the others
that each criminal and immortal creature are

03:51:24.319 --> 03:51:28.600
their enemies and anyone who is willing to
help them, even the Asaemon, are also seen

03:51:28.600 --> 03:51:29.900
as an enemy.

03:51:29.900 --> 03:51:35.250
With that said, Isuzu asks that Sagiri move
away from Yuzuriha and come join her side.

03:51:35.250 --> 03:51:39.560
Meanwhile, Gantetsusai and Fuchi who’d temporarily
separated themselves from the Aza Brothers

03:51:39.560 --> 03:51:42.279
run off in an attempt to find an escape route.

03:51:42.279 --> 03:51:46.120
Catching their attention though and slowly
appearing through shadows behind them.

03:51:46.120 --> 03:51:52.069
Oml Shugen looks rizzed out of his freaking
mind here, like the fit is darth mall spec.

03:51:52.069 --> 03:51:56.489
Standing there infront of them, Gantetsusai
notices just how menacing this dude is.

03:51:56.489 --> 03:52:00.360
Realizing that Fuchi has untied his criminal's
hands, Shugen angrily demands he give him

03:52:00.360 --> 03:52:02.409
a proper reasoning as to why.

03:52:02.409 --> 03:52:07.040
Wondering what's up with this uptight weirdo,
Gantetsusai tries doing a similar thing like

03:52:07.040 --> 03:52:13.409
he did with Gabi to feel out how his opponent
might fight, however, Shugen, sees through

03:52:13.409 --> 03:52:18.149
his intentions and silences his him, telling
Gantetsusai that he only wishes to speak with

03:52:18.149 --> 03:52:19.149
Fuchi.

03:52:19.149 --> 03:52:23.140
Gantetsusai just stands there dumbfounded
as to who Shugen is since, unlike the other

03:52:23.140 --> 03:52:27.930
opponents he has faced, he is unable to get
an exact read on what he’s packing.

03:52:27.930 --> 03:52:32.859
Shugen still not over his first question yells
out to Fuchi to explain the reason why his

03:52:32.859 --> 03:52:34.170
criminal's hands are untied.

03:52:34.170 --> 03:52:38.310
Like we all know from everything thats happened
on the island so far, Fuchi tries telling

03:52:38.310 --> 03:52:42.399
him that they had no other choice but to ally
themselves with the criminals due to the extreme

03:52:42.399 --> 03:52:43.609
circumstances.

03:52:43.609 --> 03:52:47.909
Shugen hears his reason but as he’s here
now, tells him that he no longer has to be

03:52:47.909 --> 03:52:50.880
by Gantetsusai's side and can behead him instead.

03:52:50.880 --> 03:52:54.859
He pleads with Fuchi to not throw away all
of the memories they have together, all the

03:52:54.859 --> 03:52:58.630
times they spoke about anatomy and the path
that he has chosen in life.

03:52:58.630 --> 03:53:02.960
Saddened with the reality of the situation,
Fuchi says that he also cherishes the times

03:53:02.960 --> 03:53:08.850
he spent learning about life through his experimentations,
but also says that before coming to this island

03:53:08.850 --> 03:53:14.050
he didnt understand the value of life, no,
not until the death of his close friend.

03:53:14.050 --> 03:53:17.580
He instead draws his sword and apologizes
for disappointing him but what they need to

03:53:17.580 --> 03:53:22.000
do now is focus on escaping, they can worry
about everything else later.

03:53:22.000 --> 03:53:26.630
After drawing out his sword, Shugen is shocked
to see that Fuchi used his tsuba as Gantetsusai's

03:53:26.630 --> 03:53:27.660
eyepatch.

03:53:27.660 --> 03:53:34.350
To him and most other Samurai the blade is
a warriors soul, the Yamada’s soul.

03:53:34.350 --> 03:53:38.659
Furious he screams that if he’s indeed misplaced
his soul then he’ll be forced to, but before

03:53:38.659 --> 03:53:43.760
he can even finish his sentence man is cut
off by the BIG G who himself became dissatisfied

03:53:43.760 --> 03:53:47.479
at the fact that Shugen just assumed he could
merc him with ease.

03:53:47.479 --> 03:53:51.069
Instantly the two clash swords and while stuck
in the blade tussle Tamiya knows that he’s

03:53:51.069 --> 03:53:53.470
fine and should be able to throw him around
with the size advantage.

03:53:53.470 --> 03:53:58.250
Winning the tussle like he though, Gantetsusai
manages to knock Shugen off his feet, however

03:53:58.250 --> 03:54:02.430
as he think’s he can take advantage of this
scenario, notices that the Samurai had legitimately

03:54:02.430 --> 03:54:04.949
transformed into someone else.

03:54:04.949 --> 03:54:09.000
Having gained some distance, big G instantly
closes it and goes to strike down on him but

03:54:09.000 --> 03:54:13.069
Shugen easily blocks Gantetsusai's next attack
and takes the time to tell him about the fond

03:54:13.069 --> 03:54:16.790
memories he had helping Yamada Asaemon Genji
with his calligraphy.

03:54:16.790 --> 03:54:20.770
As he starts to describe Genji, Shugen’s
strength increases and causes Gantetsusai

03:54:20.770 --> 03:54:23.640
to see him as an image of Genji.

03:54:23.640 --> 03:54:27.609
Shugen now with this massive strength buff
deflects Gantetsusai's attack and challenges

03:54:27.609 --> 03:54:28.609
him.

03:54:28.609 --> 03:54:33.189
With all of the fallen and even alive Yamada
beginning to appear as spirits behind him,

03:54:33.189 --> 03:54:37.090
Shugen states that it will not be him who
delivers the final blow, but the blades of

03:54:37.090 --> 03:54:39.229
all Yamada Asaemon.

03:54:39.229 --> 03:54:43.210
As the bout begins, Shugen uses Genji’s
Helm-Splitter technique to completely off

03:54:43.210 --> 03:54:47.449
balance Gantetsusai who is unable to counter
before the Samurai disarms him.

03:54:47.449 --> 03:54:50.920
Having lost his sword and with no other option
left, Gantetsusai tries to throw a punch,

03:54:50.920 --> 03:54:54.640
but Shugen once again avoids the attack by
imitating Kishō's ability.

03:54:54.640 --> 03:54:58.870
With the big guy beginning to fall over Shugen
explains the kind of man that Kishō was.

03:54:58.870 --> 03:55:03.140
Though he rarely asserted himself into a conversation,
he was a genius when it came to foreseeing

03:55:03.140 --> 03:55:04.430
and warding off attacks.

03:55:04.430 --> 03:55:07.830
Stepping things up a notch, Shion suddenly
uses a combination of both Kisho’s harvest

03:55:07.830 --> 03:55:12.109
shower and Genji’s Helm Divest in an attempt
to mortally wound the criminal.

03:55:12.109 --> 03:55:15.670
Dropping to his knee’s, Gantetsusai says
that he wished he go to play some more, but

03:55:15.670 --> 03:55:18.210
now he’s slowly starting to fade.

03:55:18.210 --> 03:55:23.189
Not taking him entirely seriously, Shion screams
that mercy isn't meant for the likes of a

03:55:23.189 --> 03:55:24.460
criminal, no.

03:55:24.460 --> 03:55:26.310
This is an execution.

03:55:26.310 --> 03:55:31.080
Having swung the blade down atop big G, Shugen
is left mortified to find that no one other

03:55:31.080 --> 03:55:33.910
than Fuchi has blocked his strike.

03:55:33.910 --> 03:55:39.180
Fuchi tries explaining that crime and evil
are not the same, Gantetsusai is a undoubtedly

03:55:39.180 --> 03:55:40.939
a criminal, but by no means is he "evil".

03:55:40.939 --> 03:55:45.060
He tells him that he’s just over this who
thing, he doesn't want anyone else to pass

03:55:45.060 --> 03:55:48.949
on, even if it means turning his back on the
laws of this era.

03:55:48.949 --> 03:55:53.140
Having heard these words, Shugen sees that
Fuchi hasn't changed since the time they first

03:55:53.140 --> 03:55:54.140
met.

03:55:54.140 --> 03:55:58.910
Ahh so yeah id love to go over what they got
up to just here, best buds but ya know YouTube

03:55:58.910 --> 03:56:04.540
n all these days.

03:56:04.540 --> 03:56:08.830
Annnyways, as we bang it back to reality Shugen
suddenly slashes Fuchi before he even has

03:56:08.830 --> 03:56:10.510
a chance to react.

03:56:10.510 --> 03:56:14.260
With tears beginning to fall from his face,
Shugen just remarks that he was a sublime

03:56:14.260 --> 03:56:19.470
man to the end, someone who only ever put
those infront of himself.

03:56:19.470 --> 03:56:23.870
Elsewhere inside the Rentan Temple, Isuzu
explains to Sagiri that she has faith in Shugen

03:56:23.870 --> 03:56:25.530
because he upholds order.

03:56:25.530 --> 03:56:29.399
He protects people who abide by the law and
punishes those who go against them, the level

03:56:29.399 --> 03:56:34.970
of crime doesn't matter, in his eyes its the
standard itself that needs to be upheld.

03:56:34.970 --> 03:56:39.750
At the same time, Chōbei and Tōma surrender,
Shion lays down his weapon, and Gabimaru is

03:56:39.750 --> 03:56:44.359
approached by two ninja with faces resembling
the Iwagakure chief and his wife.

03:56:44.359 --> 03:56:49.460
Back with the fallen Fuchi, Gantetsusai thinks
that its mental he’d ever go that far for

03:56:49.460 --> 03:56:50.830
the sake of order.

03:56:50.830 --> 03:56:55.340
Absolutely raging out at this point, Shugen
screams that no, this isn't crazy, what he

03:56:55.340 --> 03:56:59.820
witnessed was pure determination from which
there is no return and for that reason he

03:56:59.820 --> 03:57:04.710
condemns Tamiya a villan before seemingly
finishing it all.

03:57:04.710 --> 03:57:09.900
Manipulating the flames themselves, Rien controls
the second Gabimaru's fire ninjutsu and uses

03:57:09.900 --> 03:57:13.270
it against the surrounding ninja taking out
a bunch of them before they even got a chance

03:57:13.270 --> 03:57:14.270
to react.

03:57:14.270 --> 03:57:17.930
Dodging out of the blast herself, the female
Gabi throws a kunai at Rien which connects

03:57:17.930 --> 03:57:22.100
directly with the immortals face, but after
it recovers immediately sees that not only

03:57:22.100 --> 03:57:25.180
can the being use "sorcery" but is also able
to regenerate.

03:57:25.180 --> 03:57:29.910
Thinking back to what Gabimaru said about
how no matter what the situation, an enemy

03:57:29.910 --> 03:57:34.880
is still a physical being, if it has a conscious
mind then a strategy can be formed.

03:57:34.880 --> 03:57:38.930
With that in mind the second Gabimaru places
out her hands onto the shoulders of some ninja

03:57:38.930 --> 03:57:41.859
and commands them to use the last of their
life to set the ships ablaze.

03:57:41.859 --> 03:57:45.620
Not wanting the ships to burn up otherwise
all the butterflies and the whole plan goes

03:57:45.620 --> 03:57:49.359
up in flames, Rien tries to manipulate Tao
in an attempt to crush the ninja boarding

03:57:49.359 --> 03:57:50.449
the ships.

03:57:50.449 --> 03:57:54.140
Unable to stop everyone and seeing just how
tense Rien had become, the second Gabimaru

03:57:54.140 --> 03:57:56.229
calls out that she found her love.

03:57:56.229 --> 03:58:00.229
To her its obvious that she’s been holding
back as to not damage the surroundings, but

03:58:00.229 --> 03:58:04.580
in reality its only the ships that cause Rien
true pain.

03:58:04.580 --> 03:58:08.180
Pondering if its a possible love, the ninja
states that at times it can be troublesome

03:58:08.180 --> 03:58:13.521
and at others a strength, but in this fight
here it is indeed the immortals weakness.

03:58:13.521 --> 03:58:17.350
All of the surrounding Ninja which seemingly
keep appearing from the cracks like insects,

03:58:17.350 --> 03:58:19.729
send a plethora shuriken towards the creature.

03:58:19.729 --> 03:58:23.780
Rien easily blocks off the basic attack, but
is shocked to see that the Elixir of Life

03:58:23.780 --> 03:58:28.470
has been taken from her by the second Gabimaru
who without a second thought tosses it to

03:58:28.470 --> 03:58:31.029
another ninja and commands them to get it
outside.

03:58:31.029 --> 03:58:35.510
As Rien tries to stop them, the second Gabimaru
activates Ninpo; Pyro Bridge to launch a torrent

03:58:35.510 --> 03:58:37.729
of fire that completely engulfs the immortal.

03:58:37.729 --> 03:58:41.779
Rien doesn't drop their concentration over
which ninja has the elixir and destroys them

03:58:41.779 --> 03:58:42.779
with a shot of Tao.

03:58:42.779 --> 03:58:46.760
However it soon comes to their attention that
one of the items they were carrying was the

03:58:46.760 --> 03:58:50.649
squad leader's mask and the other with the
elixir escaped.

03:58:50.649 --> 03:58:54.390
The female Gabi knows that she stands no chance
of winning when it comes to strength, but

03:58:54.390 --> 03:58:55.390
this is war.

03:58:55.390 --> 03:58:58.939
When someone is in an unfavorable condition
one must exploit the enemy's point of view

03:58:58.939 --> 03:59:04.640
to create chaos, that way any outcome is possible
as in war it isn't the strong who prevail,

03:59:04.640 --> 03:59:06.479
its the wicked and twisted.

03:59:06.479 --> 03:59:10.520
After bringing the elixir outside, the shinobi
pulls out a massive sea shell and signals

03:59:10.520 --> 03:59:12.500
the team that it has been acquired.

03:59:12.500 --> 03:59:16.609
Isuzu hears the signals indicating to her
that the mission is now complete.

03:59:16.609 --> 03:59:20.569
Yuzuriha who’s on the ground infront of
her unable deal massive damage due to still

03:59:20.569 --> 03:59:24.229
needing to heal attempts to fight against
Isuzu without her full power.

03:59:24.229 --> 03:59:28.569
Seeing the slimy string coming Isuzu easily
counters by kicking rubble up from the ground

03:59:28.569 --> 03:59:29.569
below.

03:59:29.569 --> 03:59:33.680
Sagiri quickly darts in and gets Yuzuriha
out of the way while asking her fellow executioner

03:59:33.680 --> 03:59:36.689
to calm down as Yuzuriha is not the villain.

03:59:36.689 --> 03:59:41.189
Utterly enraged by the fact that Sagiri just
wont listen, Isuzu responds by telling her

03:59:41.189 --> 03:59:44.949
that even though they captured the elixir
she will not stand to see any of the criminals

03:59:44.949 --> 03:59:46.939
alive before they leave.

03:59:46.939 --> 03:59:51.180
Going into a small flashback, it shows that
even tho Isuzu didnt exactly have a bond with

03:59:51.180 --> 03:59:55.439
everyone inside of the dojo she felt a connection
with Sagiri the first met since they were

03:59:55.439 --> 03:59:59.819
females in the Yamada clan, so now to see
her teamed up with an enemy on the island

03:59:59.819 --> 04:00:01.750
it makes her enraged.

04:00:01.750 --> 04:00:06.450
Meanwhile, Gabimaru watches as the two shinobi,
Kinkakubō and Ginkakubō, use Transformation

04:00:06.450 --> 04:00:10.890
Jutsu to reform their faces into the Iwagakure
chief and his wife.

04:00:10.890 --> 04:00:14.720
Speaking as the chief he tells Gabimaru that
he has been expelled from the clan, no grave

04:00:14.720 --> 04:00:18.819
shall bear his name as to leave the village
means that you no longer exist in reality.

04:00:18.819 --> 04:00:23.090
Speaking of reality the same goes for his
wife, as apparently she is only an illusion

04:00:23.090 --> 04:00:28.130
created as a scheme to help imprison his heart
inside of the clan, however it sadly backfired

04:00:28.130 --> 04:00:29.250
in his case.

04:00:29.250 --> 04:00:33.710
Funnily enough Gabimaru complements the two
Ninja on their adept use of transformation

04:00:33.710 --> 04:00:37.780
Jutsu and hearing him do so makes the big
guy shudder with joy over the fact the revered

04:00:37.780 --> 04:00:38.780
Gabimaru would say so.

04:00:38.780 --> 04:00:42.960
Hearing the two talk to him about the next
Gabi’s instructions, our boy easily figures

04:00:42.960 --> 04:00:47.080
that the next Gabimaru must be Shija, which
the two confirmed.

04:00:47.080 --> 04:00:50.930
Along with this they also updated their previous
commander that Kumokiri, along with two others

04:00:50.930 --> 04:00:52.750
had perished on the voyage to the island.

04:00:52.750 --> 04:00:57.050
They also insisted on telling Gabimaru that
Shija was obviously the person who merced

04:00:57.050 --> 04:01:01.989
all the other candidates and that in their
eyes they still view him as the true Gabimaru.

04:01:01.989 --> 04:01:06.479
Finally I can let me brain rest and just refer
to the female Gabi as Shija now, holy the

04:01:06.479 --> 04:01:09.340
idea her name wasn't mentioned until now blew
my mind when I re-read this.

04:01:09.340 --> 04:01:10.340
Gabimaru then asks them to explain the real
reason behind why the clan was hired for this

04:01:10.340 --> 04:01:11.899
mission, however, Kinkakubō responds saying
that the chief just works in mysterious ways.

04:01:11.899 --> 04:01:15.660
After they also hear the massive trumpet go
off the guys let Gabi know that it informs

04:01:15.660 --> 04:01:17.800
them that they’ve acquired the Elixir of
Life.

04:01:17.800 --> 04:01:23.680
Then moving onto the main issue at hand, Kinkakubō
humbly asks Gabimaru to end his life as this

04:01:23.680 --> 04:01:28.170
way the chief will remove the kill order on
him and if he wants to can make it painless

04:01:28.170 --> 04:01:30.260
by licking the ninja’s toxic saliva.

04:01:30.260 --> 04:01:35.979
Gabimaru found their method to be gross but
is begged by Kinkakubō to reconsider since

04:01:35.979 --> 04:01:38.250
in their hearts they’re all allies.

04:01:38.250 --> 04:01:41.830
Pointing out that they hadn't entered his
throwing hands range, Gabi praises them for

04:01:41.830 --> 04:01:44.380
following the basic ninja principles.

04:01:44.380 --> 04:01:48.850
Despite this Gabimaru flexes his bloodlust
and causes them to stumble backwards.

04:01:48.850 --> 04:01:52.790
Somewhat annoyed Kinkakubō asked if he was
still willing to defy the chief and hearing

04:01:52.790 --> 04:01:54.830
that Gabimaru planned to escape this place.

04:01:54.830 --> 04:02:00.250
Kinkakubō tells him that even if he does
make it back to Japan, Yui does not exist.

04:02:00.250 --> 04:02:03.380
Obviously our boys heard this bot ass take
how many times now?

04:02:03.380 --> 04:02:07.330
Man just cant fathom the idea that she isn't
alive, especially since he knows the people

04:02:07.330 --> 04:02:12.130
from Iwa specialize in psychological warfare,
so in his eyes he has to see it to believe

04:02:12.130 --> 04:02:13.130
it.

04:02:13.130 --> 04:02:17.189
Although they were unable to reason with him
and much to the annoyance of Gabimaru, Kinkakubō

04:02:17.189 --> 04:02:21.949
says that he and the others are all delighted
that he refused since this gives them a chance

04:02:21.949 --> 04:02:25.590
to fight to the death with the current Gabimaru
Iwagakure.

04:02:25.590 --> 04:02:30.399
Everyone inside of Iwagakure looks up to him,
especially the younglings, the idea that they

04:02:30.399 --> 04:02:33.200
all get to fight in mortal combat with him
is a dream.

04:02:33.200 --> 04:02:36.740
Funnily enough some of the higher ranks even
dropped down to get the opportunity to become

04:02:36.740 --> 04:02:40.720
fodder on this mission, JUST so they had the
chance to throw hands with Gabi.

04:02:40.720 --> 04:02:45.340
Bowing their heads in honor of what's about
to come, the plethora of Genin rush towards

04:02:45.340 --> 04:02:52.199
Gabimaru, However, using Tao sensation and
looking like he perceives everything in reality,

04:02:52.199 --> 04:02:55.720
Gabimaru quickly deals with the ninja, dodging
in and out of all of their attacks and using

04:02:55.720 --> 04:02:57.239
their own weapons against them.

04:02:57.239 --> 04:03:01.710
With the fodder losers dealt with, Gabi tells
them all that Iwagakure's tactics such as

04:03:01.710 --> 04:03:04.880
physiological warfare and numbers will not
work on him.

04:03:04.880 --> 04:03:10.060
Kinkakubō notices that Gabimaru has become
stronger but is corrected by the ninja, saying

04:03:10.060 --> 04:03:13.030
that no, he finally learned to become weak.

04:03:13.030 --> 04:03:17.360
He then states that he doesn't care who he
has to fight, whether its lord Tensen or every

04:03:17.360 --> 04:03:21.609
Iwagakure or even these new Yamada, if they
stand in his way and try to hinder him from

04:03:21.609 --> 04:03:25.470
escape, he will obliterate everyone and everything.

04:03:25.470 --> 04:03:31.370
Dude I laugh so damn hard at this part, like
we’ll just skip around quickly so you get

04:03:31.370 --> 04:03:32.370
the idea.

04:03:32.370 --> 04:03:37.460
Well as Gabimaru begins taking down the genin
who’re overly satisfied, they all introduce

04:03:37.460 --> 04:03:41.521
themselves before instantly being merced by
our man who all the while lets them know what

04:03:41.521 --> 04:03:43.540
they did wrong with their technique.

04:03:43.540 --> 04:03:46.021
Training them in their final moments like
a true king.

04:03:46.021 --> 04:03:50.230
Ending the beatdown Gabimaru takes out the
final attacking Ninja with a fat kick completely

04:03:50.230 --> 04:03:52.500
cracking the floor their standing on.

04:03:52.500 --> 04:03:57.449
Going byakugan mode Gabi activates his Tao
and takes the opportunity to sense the palace's

04:03:57.449 --> 04:04:00.850
layout, revealing the skirmishes taking place
between enemies and allies.

04:04:00.850 --> 04:04:04.760
Quickly dodging a random fodder ninja that
tried attacking from behind, he also senses

04:04:04.760 --> 04:04:09.130
that Shija is located at the floodgates in
a boat, Sagiri is safe for the time being,

04:04:09.130 --> 04:04:12.140
but he’s shocked to sense that Fuchi has
fallen.

04:04:12.140 --> 04:04:16.100
Keeping the missions main priorities first,
Gabimaru ignores assisting the others to rush

04:04:16.100 --> 04:04:19.880
towards the Rentan Temple to meet up with
Sagiri, steal the Elixir of Life from the

04:04:19.880 --> 04:04:24.100
ninja squad, and leave through the floodgates
to reunite with his wife.

04:04:24.100 --> 04:04:29.600
Meanwhile, Zhu Jin's plant like remains suddenly
re awaken, slowly moving it leaves the Taisoku

04:04:29.600 --> 04:04:34.810
Temple and takes the underground water system
to eventually reach the Divine Beast, Banko.

04:04:34.810 --> 04:04:39.890
Remembering Rien's past explanation about
how the Banko required more higher quality

04:04:39.890 --> 04:04:42.470
Tao to stay alive and that consuming it would
be dangerous.

04:04:42.470 --> 04:04:46.430
Zhu Jin in their half baked state throws the
warnings aside and makes its way into the

04:04:46.430 --> 04:04:49.430
amalgamation of vines to become one with the
Divine Beast.

04:04:49.430 --> 04:04:53.750
Erupting from the top of the palace, wood
and other remnants of it go flying everywhere

04:04:53.750 --> 04:04:58.760
as Zhu Jin emerges completely fused with the
Divine Banko and draws everyone's attention.

04:04:58.760 --> 04:05:02.580
At a similar time its revealed that Chōbei
allowed himself and Tōma to be captured by

04:05:02.580 --> 04:05:06.780
the enemy as he believes its better to bide
his time rather than fight when out-numbered.

04:05:06.780 --> 04:05:11.220
However, Chōbei bizarrely starts to feel
pain coming from his arm which as Jikka stars

04:05:11.220 --> 04:05:14.930
to ask him what's up flowers begin uncontrollably
sprouting out from his body.

04:05:14.930 --> 04:05:19.580
While this occurrence is happening, a captured
Dōshi walks in front of Jikka and starts

04:05:19.580 --> 04:05:21.699
to transform back into a human.

04:05:21.699 --> 04:05:25.750
With the dudes sentience returning he just
wonders as to where he is and the whereabouts

04:05:25.750 --> 04:05:29.330
of his allies that he arrived here with.

04:05:29.330 --> 04:05:34.240
At the same time, Gabimaru's Flower Tao also
starts to react and his body begins sprouting

04:05:34.240 --> 04:05:35.489
flowers.

04:05:35.489 --> 04:05:40.540
Looking into the distance and seeing the massive
flower monster he assumes that its most likely

04:05:40.540 --> 04:05:41.930
got something to do with it.

04:05:41.930 --> 04:05:46.550
At the floodgates, Rien's body also reacts
and while sensing what caused this change

04:05:46.550 --> 04:05:49.449
finds that Zhu Jin had merged with the Divine
Banko.

04:05:49.449 --> 04:05:53.660
The Zhu Jin-fused Banko then releases a plethora
of roots which begin to track to any large

04:05:53.660 --> 04:05:56.930
source of Tao, transforming them into trees
in the process.

04:05:56.930 --> 04:06:02.029
In the Rentan Temple, Sagiri notices that
Mei's body is starting to react to the Banko

04:06:02.029 --> 04:06:05.510
causing Isuzu to rush outside and find out
what exactly happened.

04:06:05.510 --> 04:06:09.780
Only making it to the doorway though she then
becomes horrified as she looks outside witnessing

04:06:09.780 --> 04:06:14.090
multiple sunflower like human trees, mixed
with taller Mōnshin and Sōshin stuck in

04:06:14.090 --> 04:06:17.760
the Zazen pose walking through them towards
the center of Hōrai.

04:06:17.760 --> 04:06:22.700
Meanwhile, Shugen notices Gantetsusai's and
Fuchi's disappearance and instead only finds

04:06:22.700 --> 04:06:24.189
a bed of flowers infront of him.

04:06:24.189 --> 04:06:28.460
While this has been going on, Rien thinks
back on an old conversation he had with Ran.

04:06:28.460 --> 04:06:33.320
In it he was saddened about how the Divine
Banko wilted, but refused any thought of ever

04:06:33.320 --> 04:06:36.859
turning it into Tan as it was just too strong
to control.

04:06:36.859 --> 04:06:40.699
Even for them ‘the Tensen’ it would throw
off the delicate balance of Tao that gives

04:06:40.699 --> 04:06:42.790
them form.

04:06:42.790 --> 04:06:45.521
Sadly because of what Zhu Jin has done everything
will start anew, endlessly they shall return

04:06:45.521 --> 04:06:48.470
to the outset.

04:06:48.470 --> 04:06:52.590
Just like before their hopes are dashed a
feeling one only gets while travelling between

04:06:52.590 --> 04:06:54.810
Jigokuraku itself.

04:06:54.810 --> 04:06:59.910
Having heard Rien state this once again, Ran
asks why he would go so far, what is he truly

04:06:59.910 --> 04:07:02.410
trying to achieve.

04:07:02.410 --> 04:07:05.890
Shugen who’s still looking at the flowers
infront of him realizes that both Fuchi and

04:07:05.890 --> 04:07:10.380
Gantetsusai were covered by them and wonders
what would could've possibly caused it.

04:07:10.380 --> 04:07:14.220
He is then found by Iwagakure shinobi who
have come to confirm that Shija was taken

04:07:14.220 --> 04:07:18.180
out while fighting Rien but managed to stall
him momentarily and now the Tensen is about

04:07:18.180 --> 04:07:19.670
to leave on his ship.

04:07:19.670 --> 04:07:23.710
After getting the Elixir of life from them,
Shugen orders the ninja to uncover Gantetsusai

04:07:23.710 --> 04:07:27.030
and Fuchi's bodies from the flowers and confirm
their status.

04:07:27.030 --> 04:07:31.560
One Shugen had left tho and made his way to
the floodgates, an Iwagakure shinobi reforms

04:07:31.560 --> 04:07:35.950
their face and reveals themselves to be Shija
in disguise, stating that they had substituted

04:07:35.950 --> 04:07:39.310
themselves with another Iwagakure shinobi
allowing them to escape.

04:07:39.310 --> 04:07:44.130
They then for good measure throw two kunai
at the flower bed to make sure that Gantetsusai

04:07:44.130 --> 04:07:46.479
and Fuchi don't survive.

04:07:46.479 --> 04:07:51.210
Shija jumps on a roof and once she see’s
just how messed up the area has become states

04:07:51.210 --> 04:07:53.930
that its almost as if there on the other-side.

04:07:53.930 --> 04:07:58.140
Seeing the massive Banko monster infront of
her she realizes that mere mortals are no

04:07:58.140 --> 04:07:59.859
match for such a thing.

04:07:59.859 --> 04:08:03.941
Laughing now she leaps from the building in
some hectic JoJo looking pose ready for her

04:08:03.941 --> 04:08:06.300
otherworldly deathmatch against Gabimaru.

04:08:06.300 --> 04:08:11.109
Shortly after, Fuchi still somehow alive wakes
up and comes to the conclusion that Shugen

04:08:11.109 --> 04:08:14.130
must've held back as he defiantly could've
ended him then n there.

04:08:14.130 --> 04:08:17.739
Looking over to his man, he then see that
Gantetsusai is in a terrible condition and

04:08:17.739 --> 04:08:21.399
decides that instead of treating himself he
needs to help him.

04:08:21.399 --> 04:08:25.770
With his hands trembling Fuchi tries focusing
on treating his wounds until he sees an apparition

04:08:25.770 --> 04:08:29.619
of himself telling him that he should give
up since this new outlook of his on life will

04:08:29.619 --> 04:08:31.520
not do him much good in this era.

04:08:31.520 --> 04:08:35.770
This is an Era in which men happily surrender
their lives if a superior commands it.

04:08:35.770 --> 04:08:39.220
One in which a Son takes pride in serving
as a Kaishaku.

04:08:39.220 --> 04:08:43.370
Shugen is a perfect representation of this
and thats why he acts this way, he knows that

04:08:43.370 --> 04:08:46.659
the Yamada clan is already treated like a
band of Ronin and this could cause them all

04:08:46.659 --> 04:08:48.110
to be disowned by the Shogun.

04:08:48.110 --> 04:08:53.840
His apparition pleads with Fuchi to know his
place as if he emerges from this, itl ruin

04:08:53.840 --> 04:08:54.840
everything.

04:08:54.840 --> 04:08:58.660
With Fuchi slowly beginning to fade he tells
himself that the clan does matter a lot to

04:08:58.660 --> 04:09:01.040
him and he doesn't want it to be disbanded.

04:09:01.040 --> 04:09:04.850
Still he believes that what he has learned
on this island matters and now he’s beginning

04:09:04.850 --> 04:09:08.100
to lose his mind over these competing emotions.

04:09:08.100 --> 04:09:11.600
He knows he’s that he does truly want to
support Gantetsusai, and even though Shu tried

04:09:11.600 --> 04:09:13.600
to end his life, he doesn't blame him.

04:09:13.600 --> 04:09:17.260
In the end he just wonders if this is what
if means to be human...

04:09:17.260 --> 04:09:21.659
Opening his eyes himself to the sound of someone
mumbling, Gantetsusai instant rises to his

04:09:21.659 --> 04:09:26.640
knees and panics seeing Fuchi lying down dead,
realizing that he had gave everything he had

04:09:26.640 --> 04:09:28.090
to heal him.

04:09:28.090 --> 04:09:33.040
Screaming at him he asks if Yamada Asaemon
Fuchi really just went and saved his life?

04:09:33.040 --> 04:09:39.069
Unable to open his eyes or even respond, Fuchi
just becomes delighted to hear that Gantetsusai

04:09:39.069 --> 04:09:41.140
called him by his name for the first time.

04:09:41.140 --> 04:09:46.020
In his last thoughts, Fuchi warns Shugen that
the survivors are not to be underestimated

04:09:46.020 --> 04:09:50.561
since he has observed their will to continue
fighting no matter what, everything and everyone

04:09:50.561 --> 04:09:53.060
on the island is a walking paradox.

04:09:53.060 --> 04:09:57.949
Fuchi then happily waves goodbye as he accepts
his fate and tells us all that he hopes everyone's

04:09:57.949 --> 04:10:01.600
dreams become realized enemies and allies
alike.

04:10:01.600 --> 04:10:05.689
AHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH My throat
has a meteor sized rock in it rn, that hit

04:10:05.689 --> 04:10:07.199
harder that Senta in my books.

04:10:07.199 --> 04:10:12.630
Dunno if its cause I loved these two guys
and their interactions the most, but seeing

04:10:12.630 --> 04:10:17.109
him happy for everyone in the end, figuring
out how he truly felt towards people and how

04:10:17.109 --> 04:10:21.590
he came to see that everyone was similar is
just a great way to end a character that I

04:10:21.590 --> 04:10:24.510
initially thought was a simple replacement
for the weeb king.

04:10:24.510 --> 04:10:29.949
Plus to those saying this show it just has
hands, like yeah a lot of it is but its also

04:10:29.949 --> 04:10:33.660
jam packed with proper character development
on each side and enough world building so

04:10:33.660 --> 04:10:36.279
that we don't feel like were missing out on
some massive piece of info.

04:10:36.279 --> 04:10:41.659
Might sound crazy, but for how concise and
quickly the story is moving, its still smashing

04:10:41.659 --> 04:10:44.000
everything I want to know and more.

04:10:44.000 --> 04:10:48.580
Plus the ART, GOD YUKI.

04:10:48.580 --> 04:10:54.430
Also ahh Gabimaru is still alg man just ripped
the flowers off.

04:10:54.430 --> 04:10:58.560
Several minutes before everything went down,
Gui Fa entered the Main Temple Annex to protect

04:10:58.560 --> 04:11:00.590
the Basin as ordered by Rien.

04:11:00.590 --> 04:11:04.260
While looking through the flame thingy he’s
holding, Gui Fa becomes confused if this was

04:11:04.260 --> 04:11:07.240
indeed Rien's true plan all along.

04:11:07.240 --> 04:11:12.100
In the present, Shugen is told by the Iwagakure
shinobi to not engage the giant monsters since

04:11:12.100 --> 04:11:14.790
their touch will cause him to be engulfed
in flowers.

04:11:14.790 --> 04:11:18.939
Not bothered by this Shugen makes quick work
of the monster using Senta's fighting style

04:11:18.939 --> 04:11:21.440
and cries upon thinking about his passing.

04:11:21.440 --> 04:11:25.410
Pushing forth he notices that the Banko isn't
paying attention to him and makes a run for

04:11:25.410 --> 04:11:28.470
it to enter Main Temple before the vines could
block his path.

04:11:28.470 --> 04:11:33.040
Meanwhile, Sagiri, Yuzuriha, and Isuzu defend
themselves against the monsters.

04:11:33.040 --> 04:11:37.479
Next to them and seeing as how the Tao around
is being disrupted Mei slowly begins to start

04:11:37.479 --> 04:11:38.479
blooming herself.

04:11:38.479 --> 04:11:43.210
and that they must do something quickly before
it is too late for her.

04:11:43.210 --> 04:11:46.470
Yuzuriha swings up to get a good look at Zhu
Jin and after seeing that its blocking the

04:11:46.470 --> 04:11:50.540
entrance to the floodgates with vines and
monsters, notes that it seems as if there

04:11:50.540 --> 04:11:51.850
back at square one.

04:11:51.850 --> 04:11:55.979
She then sees that Sagiri is trying to convince
Isuzu into cooperating with the convicts but

04:11:55.979 --> 04:11:57.270
to no avail.

04:11:57.270 --> 04:12:00.380
Wanting to help her she drops in and tries
her hand in persuading her.

04:12:00.380 --> 04:12:04.859
However, Gantetsusai arrives carrying Fuchi's
body while boldly stating that they do not

04:12:04.859 --> 04:12:09.229
need to join forces with her as after all
it was Shugen who took down Fuchi.

04:12:09.229 --> 04:12:15.000
After the group buries Fuchi in flowers, Gantetsusai
directs his anger towards Isuzu and once again

04:12:15.000 --> 04:12:17.430
says that they don't need her help, which
Yuzuriha disagrees with.

04:12:17.430 --> 04:12:21.420
Agreeing with him though, Isuzu says that
they do not need to cooperate, as Shugen is

04:12:21.420 --> 04:12:22.630
here.

04:12:22.630 --> 04:12:26.470
Members of this mission weren't chosen because
of their innate ability, rather the three

04:12:26.470 --> 04:12:30.189
of them were ideal disposable pawns set up
for the amusement of the Shogun.

04:12:30.189 --> 04:12:35.300
If it were a priority to them, then they would
have selected Shugen to begin with as his

04:12:35.300 --> 04:12:37.080
power is incomparable.

04:12:37.080 --> 04:12:40.630
Yuzuriha who knows that they need help becomes
annoyed with Isuzu’s stubbornness after

04:12:40.630 --> 04:12:45.159
she continuously refuses and calls her a gorilla,
only for Isuzu to get hit with a fat dose

04:12:45.159 --> 04:12:49.710
of that childhood ptsd and reply that gorillas
embody the very concept of Bushido.

04:12:49.710 --> 04:12:54.560
Getting down on her knee’s Isuzu then intends
to commit seppuku to take responsibility for

04:12:54.560 --> 04:12:58.239
the death of her comrades and hope’s that
her death will appease the shogun.

04:12:58.239 --> 04:13:03.069
As everyone continues to bicker amongst each
other, Jikka arrives with Tōma, Chōbei,

04:13:03.069 --> 04:13:06.140
Kiyomaru, Shion, Nurugai, and the Iwagakure
shinobi.

04:13:06.140 --> 04:13:10.750
Jikka tells Isuzu that if she doesn’t return
home then the responsibility will lie in to

04:13:10.750 --> 04:13:12.370
Shugen Kermit kermicide.

04:13:12.370 --> 04:13:15.930
However he does also says that he just came
up with a great plan that will be able to

04:13:15.930 --> 04:13:19.470
defeat Zhu Jin and might have a way for the
criminals to earn their freedom but needs

04:13:19.470 --> 04:13:21.910
assistance from Gabimaru in order to do so.

04:13:21.910 --> 04:13:26.310
