04:25:50.819 --> 04:25:55.240
Hearing him out, Gabi just asks her to help
as he’s in great need of her strength.

04:25:55.240 --> 04:26:00.060
With Shija having multiple personalities its
hard to know which way she’ll react.

04:26:00.060 --> 04:26:02.899
Turns out shes been waiting for months to
hear those words.

04:26:02.899 --> 04:26:06.910
A battle in her mind between helping the chief
or following her heart.

04:26:06.910 --> 04:26:11.540
Happily she agrees to help Gabimaru but only
in order to truly resurrect his true self.

04:26:11.540 --> 04:26:16.210
In a sense, she will dedicate her existence
to the sole revival of histories strongest

04:26:16.210 --> 04:26:17.939
Gabimaru the Hollow.

04:26:17.939 --> 04:26:21.930
As Shija rushes in to attack and despite his
previous injuries Gabimaru tells Sagiri to

04:26:21.930 --> 04:26:26.520
take down the regenerated Gui Fa clones behind
them while he handles fighting against Shija.

04:26:26.520 --> 04:26:30.181
Shija first starts off their attack by using
Ninpo: Hair Forged to throw multiple hair

04:26:30.181 --> 04:26:31.181
kunai at Gabimaru.

04:26:31.181 --> 04:26:35.860
While dodging them, Shija uses the opening
to use Ninpo: Flash Hand to push him backwards.

04:26:35.860 --> 04:26:40.029
Gabimaru flashes out of the way of a kunai
and fights her in close quarters combat, with

04:26:40.029 --> 04:26:44.420
the two using a multitude of technical techniques
to try and get the upper hand on the other.

04:26:44.420 --> 04:26:48.149
Simultaneously the both of them end their
initial clash by using Ninpō: Fire Monk to

04:26:48.149 --> 04:26:50.170
create a massive explosion.

04:26:50.170 --> 04:26:54.040
Knowing that Shija knows more ninjutsu than
him, Gabimaru speculates that continuing to

04:26:54.040 --> 04:26:58.670
fight with Taijutsu is more effective, however,
Shija literally word for word quotes what

04:26:58.670 --> 04:27:03.239
Gabimaru was thinking and tells him that they
are aware of every move he makes as after

04:27:03.239 --> 04:27:05.960
all they spent so much time observing him.

04:27:05.960 --> 04:27:09.830
Despite this and as the two begin fighting
once more, Gabimaru tells Shija that they

04:27:09.830 --> 04:27:12.710
are also able to read their actions with the
help of Tao.

04:27:12.710 --> 04:27:15.890
He then purposefully takes a kick to the navel
in an attempt to send himself towards the

04:27:15.890 --> 04:27:20.510
Banko's tanden and destroy it but ends up
only destroying the statue beneath it.

04:27:20.510 --> 04:27:23.800
Shija sees through him and could tell that
from the very start of their fight he has

04:27:23.800 --> 04:27:27.479
been protecting Sagiri (who they refer to
as ‘the hag’).

04:27:27.479 --> 04:27:31.430
They then start to wonder if Gabimaru's current
state is because of the hags presence and

04:27:31.430 --> 04:27:35.300
as she manages to get the upper hand, slamming
Gabi into the ground, Shija becomes saddened

04:27:35.300 --> 04:27:39.800
after seeing that Gabimaru's body is suffering
from weakened Tao regeneration.

04:27:39.800 --> 04:27:43.590
Picking up his face and staring into his eyes,
she finds it truly heartbreaking to see that

04:27:43.590 --> 04:27:47.350
her love lost his deadly ferocity and instead
choose to protect others.

04:27:47.350 --> 04:27:52.100
Shija then realizes in anger that Sagiri is
with Gabimaru to perform Tao Restoration and

04:27:52.100 --> 04:27:54.080
jumps towards her direction in disgust.

04:27:54.080 --> 04:27:56.000
Gabimaru yells out to Sagiri to run.

04:27:56.000 --> 04:27:59.950
However, Sagiri refuses, stating that she’s
had enough, she wont stand being called a

04:27:59.950 --> 04:28:02.850
hag anymore and prepares to face Shija alone.

04:28:02.850 --> 04:28:06.729
Knowing that the ninja isn't an immortal,
Sagiri uses her Tao sensory to anticipate

04:28:06.729 --> 04:28:10.620
Shija's attack, but is unable to react in
time as in an instant she appears before her

04:28:10.620 --> 04:28:12.810
and slams her to the ground.

04:28:12.810 --> 04:28:16.900
Having picked up a special bag earlier, Sagiri
pulls it out causing the female ninja to quickly

04:28:16.900 --> 04:28:21.160
dart back and ask why she is allied with Gabimaru
despite her job.

04:28:21.160 --> 04:28:25.660
Sagiri explains that yes once apon a time
she lived to a strict code, but this is no

04:28:25.660 --> 04:28:30.609
longer the case, as an era begins to shift
its almost possible to sympathize with anyone,

04:28:30.609 --> 04:28:34.330
not just Gabimaru, but the Tensen's and even
Iwagakure ninja.

04:28:34.330 --> 04:28:38.180
After hearing this statement, Shija uses her
Ninpo: knotted locks, sending her hair through

04:28:38.180 --> 04:28:41.520
the ground, before it springs up restraining
Sagiri, pinning her down.

04:28:41.520 --> 04:28:45.680
Thinking that Sagiri wants to share a similar
experience to herself, she makes her inhale

04:28:45.680 --> 04:28:47.560
the powder she tossed earlier.

04:28:47.560 --> 04:28:51.661
So you see this powder is one that manipulates
ones sensations and makes them experience

04:28:51.661 --> 04:28:53.319
an overwhelming sensation of pain.

04:28:53.319 --> 04:28:58.330
Its often used in the training of young ninja,
which just like it shows with Shija, usually

04:28:58.330 --> 04:29:01.460
results in only a few of the family members
surviving.

04:29:01.460 --> 04:29:06.090
This toxin is known as nerve powder and all
in Iwagakure undergo intensive training with

04:29:06.090 --> 04:29:09.460
it for 3 days and 3 nights until they acclimate
to the pain.

04:29:09.460 --> 04:29:13.109
As they prepare to give Sagiri another drug
which is called never bliss and connects with

04:29:13.109 --> 04:29:18.729
the pleasure section of the brain, Shija tells
her that all in Iwagakure are made to be numb,

04:29:18.729 --> 04:29:22.850
stripped of their senses so that the only
feeling they have left is one of death.

04:29:22.850 --> 04:29:27.160
Fear and despair in the face of death are
the only distinct sensation those inside the

04:29:27.160 --> 04:29:28.800
clan feel.

04:29:28.800 --> 04:29:32.330
Gabimaru first granted her that feeling, and
through her encounter with him she eventually

04:29:32.330 --> 04:29:34.189
became aware of her own mortality.

04:29:34.189 --> 04:29:40.300
Yes in it there is death which embodies life
itself, death which comes for all, true fleeting

04:29:40.300 --> 04:29:43.490
life can only be found in that moment of parting.

04:29:43.490 --> 04:29:48.489
Ahh Yuki back at it with the poetry, had to
change things up slightly so its not suuuper

04:29:48.489 --> 04:29:54.279
morbid cause ya-know YouTube, but I recommend
everyone go read this for themselves as Yuki

04:29:54.279 --> 04:29:58.989
kinda pops off with just how beautifully he
constructs a vivid image with words themselves

04:29:58.989 --> 04:29:59.989
in someone's mind.

04:29:59.989 --> 04:30:01.350
Usually a mangaka’s most potent tool is
their art or pencil, but sometimes Yuki is

04:30:01.350 --> 04:30:02.350
just as great with the writing in my opinion.

04:30:02.350 --> 04:30:04.720
With his body suffering and his Tao depleted,
as well as Sagiri being unable to combat against

04:30:04.720 --> 04:30:07.430
Shija, Gabimaru see’s their chances of victory
slowly fade away.

04:30:07.430 --> 04:30:13.810
Shija asks Gabimaru why he is desperately
clinging to life, to which he answers that

04:30:13.810 --> 04:30:16.390
he desires to live a normal life with his
wife.

04:30:16.390 --> 04:30:20.380
Shija tells Gabimaru that his wish can not
come to pass since Iwagakure will remain in

04:30:20.380 --> 04:30:24.120
pursuit of him forever and his wife does not
exist.

04:30:24.120 --> 04:30:27.880
Gabimaru denies the thought though as he knows
its the typical psychological warfare and

04:30:27.880 --> 04:30:31.560
tries to buy time to recover his Tao and present
an opening for Sagiri.

04:30:31.560 --> 04:30:35.250
Shija like shes done throughout the majority
of this bout, sees through his scheme and

04:30:35.250 --> 04:30:38.780
pleads to Gabimaru to come to his senses as
they try to explain that his wife and the

04:30:38.780 --> 04:30:40.870
life he shared with her is false, pure make
believe...

04:30:40.870 --> 04:30:45.109
Back over at the main body of the Banko, Gantetsusai
focuses on preparing himself to cut down the

04:30:45.109 --> 04:30:46.750
giant flower in front of him.

04:30:46.750 --> 04:30:50.909
Meanwhile, Jikka who aint really that keen
to do much right now decides to lay down and

04:30:50.909 --> 04:30:51.970
puts his faith in Gantetsusai.

04:30:51.970 --> 04:30:57.810
Gantetsusai interprets his unfazed behavior
as a test of courage and sits down wishing

04:30:57.810 --> 04:31:01.399
to follow along as well, which Jikka found
to be strange.

04:31:01.399 --> 04:31:05.080
He then hears the signal to take action but
is told by Jikka that the roots will tell

04:31:05.080 --> 04:31:08.210
them when the tandens have been destroyed
and when its the correct time to take out

04:31:08.210 --> 04:31:09.500
the main plant.

04:31:09.500 --> 04:31:13.159
Gantetsusai questions how he knows this and
Jikka explains that he has been able to understand

04:31:13.159 --> 04:31:18.439
how things move ever since he was young, like
how to inflict a cut or exactly where a petal

04:31:18.439 --> 04:31:19.439
would fall.

04:31:19.439 --> 04:31:23.689
His moto is one of waiting as good things
are bound to come to those who wait.

04:31:23.689 --> 04:31:28.229
Gantetsusai then senses that he is up to something
but can't seem to tell what his intentions

04:31:28.229 --> 04:31:29.229
are.

04:31:29.229 --> 04:31:35.930
Over with the grrrazy stalker gf, Shija explains
to Gabimaru that due to Iwagakure's influence,

04:31:35.930 --> 04:31:39.710
no matter how hard someone craves a normal
life, its simply unattainable.

04:31:39.710 --> 04:31:43.870
The chiefs daughter is no exception at all,
she possesses no emotions and has been merely

04:31:43.870 --> 04:31:48.290
set up to fake a relationship with him as
a way to hide the atrocities he commits.

04:31:48.290 --> 04:31:53.130
Her smile, taste’s, all is a deception crafted
to imprison his mind.

04:31:53.130 --> 04:31:57.080
Cutting off the mental stuff going on right
now as I needa point out how cracked Yuki

04:31:57.080 --> 04:32:06.909
is again, this here is a representation of
Bunraku theater 

04:32:06.909 --> 04:32:09.690
and the bodies are usually controlled by 3
different people.

04:32:09.690 --> 04:32:14.279
Its just perfect imagery to show just how
manipulated and controlled Gabi’s life has

04:32:14.279 --> 04:32:15.279
been.

04:32:15.279 --> 04:32:19.380
With this in mind, she begs for Gabimaru to
revert back to his former self and throw away

04:32:19.380 --> 04:32:21.250
any idea of a normal life.

04:32:21.250 --> 04:32:25.600
After hearing Shija out, Sagiri awkwardly
smiles as she looks up at Gabimaru standing

04:32:25.600 --> 04:32:26.750
back up.

04:32:26.750 --> 04:32:34.640
Like Sagiri suspected all our boy needed was
the confirmation that she does indeed exist.

04:32:34.640 --> 04:32:39.640
We know his Tao explodes whenever his wife
is mentioned, and for him these feelings are

04:32:39.640 --> 04:32:41.779
tied to strength and weakness.

04:32:41.779 --> 04:32:45.540
Due to that and because of how hells paradise
the dual forces of Yin and Yang can effect

04:32:45.540 --> 04:32:47.390
someone's body and mind alike.

04:32:47.390 --> 04:32:51.460
His body is then shown recovering after his
Tao becomes stabilized from the confirmation

04:32:51.460 --> 04:32:55.960
he received of his wife truly existing.

04:32:55.960 --> 04:33:00.100
Gabimaru remembers the words Yui imparted
to him, that this is the battle we call life

04:33:00.100 --> 04:33:03.420
and its important to preserve a little normalcy
at all times.

04:33:03.420 --> 04:33:07.100
Confidently he tells Shija that he always
knew his dream would come with a price, but

04:33:07.100 --> 04:33:12.531
now he’s ready to search for a new normal
life with her by his side.

04:33:12.531 --> 04:33:17.359
With his body back to normal, Gabimaru boldly
states to Shija that they will not have an

04:33:17.359 --> 04:33:21.480
advantage over him and will not allow them
to get in his way no matter what.

04:33:21.480 --> 04:33:25.531
This causes Shija to remember their past confrontation
with him when they were children where he

04:33:25.531 --> 04:33:29.670
states the exact same thing, get in my way
and ill take you out.

04:33:29.670 --> 04:33:34.449
Shija like the mental case she is then becomes
overjoyed with Gabimaru's newfound attitude,

04:33:34.449 --> 04:33:37.209
screaming that this is indeed perfect.

04:33:37.209 --> 04:33:41.061
In a past memory, Yui explains to Gabimaru
how to properly prepare chestnuts.

04:33:41.061 --> 04:33:45.549
After Gabimaru questions the point behind
it all, Yui tells him that she doesn't quiet

04:33:45.549 --> 04:33:49.629
understand herself, she just wanted to try
the normal way since growing up in Iwa wasn't

04:33:49.629 --> 04:33:51.141
normal at all.

04:33:51.141 --> 04:33:55.510
The two then sit down together to eat chestnut
rice which Yui says that she found to be "very

04:33:55.510 --> 04:33:57.000
delicious and sweet".

04:33:57.000 --> 04:34:00.650
Gabimaru though staring at his plate just
wonders if it really was since he wouldn't

04:34:00.650 --> 04:34:02.609
know due to how his sense of taste is dulled.

04:34:02.609 --> 04:34:07.930
Yui who’s sadly in the same situation then
tells him that by saying it out loud they

04:34:07.930 --> 04:34:08.930
can at least pretend to be normal.

04:34:08.930 --> 04:34:10.359
So for anyone who wanted to know, the dish
Yui made is called Kurigohan or chestnut rice.

04:34:10.359 --> 04:34:11.359
Its a traditional autumn dish in japan that
adds a hint of sweetness to an otherwise basic

04:34:11.359 --> 04:34:12.359
meal.

04:34:12.359 --> 04:34:13.359
I just wanted to make the scene slightly sadder,
the fact they couldn't even taste the change

04:34:13.359 --> 04:34:14.359
in food is rough.

04:34:14.359 --> 04:34:15.359
In the present and during the current battle,
Gabimaru manages to inflict grievous damage

04:34:15.359 --> 04:34:16.359
to Shija, who with a smile on her face realizes
that he is now fighting just like he did in

04:34:16.359 --> 04:34:17.359
his hey-day and assumes its since he isn't
being held back by the flowers effects anymore.

04:34:17.359 --> 04:34:18.359
Gabimaru says that he has not lost his battle
instincts, its just that the battlefield in

04:34:18.359 --> 04:34:20.930
general for him has changed, referring to
his memories of how he could not understand

04:34:20.930 --> 04:34:22.689
his wife's struggle.

04:34:22.689 --> 04:34:26.990
At first he never understood why she would
do something so random, it just seemed like

04:34:26.990 --> 04:34:28.520
meaningless drudgery to him.

04:34:28.520 --> 04:34:32.418
What was the point of the food, the normalcy,
he could never seem to figure it out.

04:34:32.418 --> 04:34:36.480
Looking up into his eyes, Shija figures out
that Gabimaru's "love" has no clear signs

04:34:36.480 --> 04:34:39.709
of weaknesses, and in a last ditch effort
attacks with everything that was taught to

04:34:39.709 --> 04:34:41.270
them by Gabi.

04:34:41.270 --> 04:34:43.430
Darting at him, she tries to strike his vitals,
but to no avail.

04:34:43.430 --> 04:34:47.291
Throwing a kick, Gabi effortlessly leans back
out of the way, before blocking a follow up

04:34:47.291 --> 04:34:48.740
strike thrown by her.

04:34:48.740 --> 04:34:52.590
Jumping back, she remembers the time Gabi
told her she’d never be able to master ascetic

04:34:52.590 --> 04:34:57.760
blaze, before pulling her hand upto her face
and releasing a huge torrent of flames.

04:34:57.760 --> 04:35:02.459
After using her own ascetic blaze, Shija boosts
forth, pushing the flames aside and somehow

04:35:02.459 --> 04:35:04.510
managing to stab Gabimaru's heart.

04:35:04.510 --> 04:35:10.459
Nonchalantly looking down at his injury Gabimaru
applauses Shija for her adept use of the ability,

04:35:10.459 --> 04:35:13.439
explaining that if he was still human they
might've just killed him.

04:35:13.439 --> 04:35:17.600
Now though and because he’s making it home
no matter what he grabs her hand, pulls her

04:35:17.600 --> 04:35:23.020
in close and activates Ninpō: Ascetic blaze,
FULL FIRE completely setting the duo alight.

04:35:23.020 --> 04:35:28.350
After being engulfed by Gabimaru's fire ninjutsu,
Shija thinks back over her sad existence,

04:35:28.350 --> 04:35:33.090
she remembers how everyone had an admiration
for Gabi, but hers was different, something

04:35:33.090 --> 04:35:34.090
more.

04:35:34.090 --> 04:35:37.802
Wondering what it was she felt, she thinks
about the time she fled from Gabi when they

04:35:37.802 --> 04:35:41.750
were children and questions if the reason
was because she feared that she might’ve

04:35:41.750 --> 04:35:42.750
died.

04:35:42.750 --> 04:35:46.631
As time slowly moved forth Shija caught wind
of Gabimaru being married to Yui and tries

04:35:46.631 --> 04:35:49.699
to mirror her appearance by burning the right
side of their face.

04:35:49.699 --> 04:35:54.760
In all reality though she's known for a while
that the pounding of her heart wasn't born

04:35:54.760 --> 04:36:00.340
from admiration, nor from dread, but sadly
the time for that to had indeed passed.

04:36:00.340 --> 04:36:04.109
Having collapsed to the ground with a smile
on her face, Shija with their last bit of

04:36:04.109 --> 04:36:09.410
strength creates a large whistle from their
hair and signals all of the Iwagakure shinobi.

04:36:09.410 --> 04:36:13.350
Asking what the signal was for, its revealed
that it was infact a cleansing ritual, one

04:36:13.350 --> 04:36:17.330
to clear the path forth for Gabi and the last
Ninpo she’ll ever use.

04:36:17.330 --> 04:36:22.000
They also tell him that Yui is indeed alive
and awaiting his return, apparently the chief

04:36:22.000 --> 04:36:26.250
hadn't planned to do anything until after
they returned.

04:36:26.250 --> 04:36:33.520
With their last breath, Shija asks Gabimaru,
that if she's ever reborn, in sickness and

04:36:33.520 --> 04:36:39.740
in health, until death do us part, would he
face them once more, to which he answers yes

04:36:39.740 --> 04:36:41.820
with a smile.

04:36:41.820 --> 04:36:48.480
Shija happily thanks Gabimaru for his answer
and wishes them luck in his future battles.

04:36:48.480 --> 04:37:03.359
Everyone thoughts on Shija?

04:37:03.359 --> 04:37:07.320
Moving forth now, Sagiri rolls over to Gabimaru
and is told by him that they need to re-focus

04:37:07.320 --> 04:37:10.891
their attention back onto destroying the tanden
while it is still regenerating.

04:37:10.891 --> 04:37:14.949
With everyone around being in the prime position,
Yuzuriha sounds off the next signal and all

04:37:14.949 --> 04:37:18.500
four teams simultaneously prepare to destroy
the tandens.

04:37:18.500 --> 04:37:22.020
Over with the big chillers though, Jikka begins
getting back up on his feet after sensing

04:37:22.020 --> 04:37:25.561
that the timing is right for him and Gantetsusai
to destroy the Banko.

04:37:25.561 --> 04:37:31.840
Yeeet as Big G himself begins to stand, he
states that things might be slightly difficult,

04:37:31.840 --> 04:37:36.490
revealing the titan sized Banko that had begun
taking on a new transformation.

04:37:36.490 --> 04:37:43.221
In preparation to take on the transformed
monster, Jikka begins tossing off his clothing,

04:37:43.221 --> 04:37:48.510
as a way to maintain his spiritual focus,
and asks Gantetsusai for his sword.

04:37:48.510 --> 04:37:51.750
Gantetsusai finds it odd he doesn't have a
strong enough weapon to cut down the Zhu Jin-fused

04:37:51.750 --> 04:37:56.000
Banko, but, after looking at his surroundings
and witnessing bodies of Zhu Jin sprouting

04:37:56.000 --> 04:38:00.660
out of vines, Gantetsusai chooses to follow
with Jikka's plan and gives him his sword.

04:38:00.660 --> 04:38:05.391
Yo this part is actually mental, like this
dude is him.

04:38:05.391 --> 04:38:09.459
Using his own special intuition, Jikka senses
all the fatally wrong moves he could make

04:38:09.459 --> 04:38:11.719
as he walks forth to take out the monster.

04:38:11.719 --> 04:38:16.139
Eventually after casually strolling past countless
spots where he’d die in an instant, Jikka

04:38:16.139 --> 04:38:19.959
comes to a good position with the right factors
like wind and presence around him to take

04:38:19.959 --> 04:38:21.701
down the monster.

04:38:21.701 --> 04:38:26.740
Finding that all is in sync now, Jikka swings
Gantetsusai's sword and successfully cuts

04:38:26.740 --> 04:38:31.170
down the head of the Zhu Jin-fused Banko from
a distance, just like he did in the past with

04:38:31.170 --> 04:38:32.939
the ocean monster.

04:38:32.939 --> 04:38:37.279
Having watched this unfathomable feat Gantetsusai
becomes astonished and remembers the time

04:38:37.279 --> 04:38:41.289
that he believed defeating monsters would
lead him down to the path of legends.

04:38:41.289 --> 04:38:45.949
Standing in front of him now is exactly the
sort of man to go down in history as a God

04:38:45.949 --> 04:38:46.980
Slayer.

04:38:46.980 --> 04:38:51.600
Thinking on the past some more, he also remembers
when Fuchi freed a Dōshi and refused to explain

04:38:51.600 --> 04:38:52.600
why.

04:38:52.600 --> 04:38:56.590
As a baby clone of Zhu Jin approaches him
now, Gantetsusai states that he started to

04:38:56.590 --> 04:39:00.471
understand where Fuchi was coming from and
that fighting monsters, in order to give him

04:39:00.471 --> 04:39:02.959
a thrill in his old age, doesn't affect him
anymore.

04:39:02.959 --> 04:39:07.420
Infront of him and having walked across a
field of flowers, Jikka steps up to the tanden

04:39:07.420 --> 04:39:09.389
and prepares to destroy it.

04:39:09.389 --> 04:39:12.750
Gantetsusai tries warning him that if he should
proceed then it might also have an affect

04:39:12.750 --> 04:39:16.600
on Gabimaru and Chōbei since their Tao is
connected with the monster.

04:39:16.600 --> 04:39:21.389
Despite being told this, Jikka ignores the
risks and destroys the Tanden.

04:39:21.389 --> 04:39:27.260
With the Zhu Jin Banko's destroyed, all traces
of its remains start to slowly wilt away.

04:39:27.260 --> 04:39:31.910
However, Jikka and Gantetsusai soon realize
that the giant creature is still alive.

04:39:31.910 --> 04:39:36.090
This is due to it already being morning as
warned before by Mei, and now because of that

04:39:36.090 --> 04:39:39.710
they must take on the task of destroying the
tandens simultaneously again.

04:39:39.710 --> 04:39:44.230
Chōbei sees that the Wood tanden is beginning
to slowly regenerate from the sun and finds

04:39:44.230 --> 04:39:47.878
himself to low on stamina to make another
attempt at destroying it again.

04:39:47.878 --> 04:39:51.590
Tōma yells out suggesting to Chōbei in leaving
the monster behind and trying to find a way

04:39:51.590 --> 04:39:53.030
off the island together.

04:39:53.030 --> 04:39:57.930
In his eyes there's no reason in dying here
as that would make him no different to their

04:39:57.930 --> 04:39:58.930
father.

04:39:58.930 --> 04:40:02.840
Despite his brother's plea, Chōbei activates
his break down state one last time and uses

04:40:02.840 --> 04:40:04.980
his vines to dig into the Wood tanden.

04:40:04.980 --> 04:40:08.670
He knows he doesn't have the right attribute,
but skewering the roots with his vines will

04:40:08.670 --> 04:40:11.760
allow him to cut off the regeneration to the
main body.

04:40:11.760 --> 04:40:16.700
With only one job left, he chooses to do that
exact method with each and every location

04:40:16.700 --> 04:40:20.020
as he can fully destroy the immortal..

04:40:20.020 --> 04:40:24.990
His plan ends up becoming a success as everyone
around watches Chōbei’s vines burst through

04:40:24.990 --> 04:40:27.250
all of the Tanden in each location.

04:40:27.250 --> 04:40:34.170
One last time our Demon Bandit says breakdown
and come the hell apart... but not on himself

04:40:34.170 --> 04:40:40.270
instead on the immortal Banko which as a result,
starts to wither away.

04:40:40.270 --> 04:40:44.090
Having used up all his strength, Chōbei falls
to ground and hears his brother crying out

04:40:44.090 --> 04:40:45.090
to him.

04:40:45.090 --> 04:40:50.060
Falling into a flashback he remembers the
time he held Tōma as a baby and how he felt

04:40:50.060 --> 04:40:54.830
like he could break apart at any second, but
still grabbed onto him for dear life.

04:40:54.830 --> 04:40:59.070
Once realizing that he must protect him as
his older brother, Chōbei with tears in his

04:40:59.070 --> 04:41:03.480
eyes says that he protected him, because thats
what big brothers do.

04:41:03.480 --> 04:41:08.690
In the afterlife, Chōbei kneels down before
his parents and apologizes for the sins he

04:41:08.690 --> 04:41:12.450
had committed in his life but was happy to
know that he was at least a good brother.

04:41:12.450 --> 04:41:19.611
A young Chōbei then runs to his parents with
open arms as his life comes to an end... randomly

04:41:19.611 --> 04:41:24.700
though and breaking through the light, he
notices a hand reached out to him.

04:41:24.700 --> 04:41:29.600
After the passing of his older brother, Tōma
kneels down in grief while holding on to what

04:41:29.600 --> 04:41:31.240
seems like a plant ovule.

04:41:31.240 --> 04:41:35.350
Meanwhile, Mei and Yuzuriha run out of the
temple, while complaining about the foul odor

04:41:35.350 --> 04:41:40.430
in the air, and encounter Gui Fa as a child
who’s holding on to this random Basin/Urn

04:41:40.430 --> 04:41:41.430
looking thing.

04:41:41.430 --> 04:41:45.720
So kicking things back off and as all of the
flowers around begin disintegrating Mei and

04:41:45.720 --> 04:41:51.170
Yuzuriha confront Gui Fa who’s holding onto
that weird looking pot thing.

04:41:51.170 --> 04:41:57.770
Gui Fa lets them all know that due to Jikka
cutting down the Divine Banko can senses that

04:41:57.770 --> 04:42:01.540
not only is the Banko's Tao destroyed but
also the island's as well, hinting that the

04:42:01.540 --> 04:42:03.110
land will soon meet its end.

04:42:03.110 --> 04:42:06.889
The reasoning for what Zhu Jin did aswell
was explained to the humans who wouldn't have

04:42:06.889 --> 04:42:09.799
had a clue about her want to be praised by
all of her fellow Tensen.

04:42:09.799 --> 04:42:10.799
Btw im pretty sure I mentioned this, but when
a Tensen is in a child like state they either

04:42:10.799 --> 04:42:11.799
speak like Mei or extremely slowly like Gui
Fa.

04:42:11.799 --> 04:42:13.990
Yuzuriha comments on how she felt that Gui
Fa didnt seem bothered at all by the fact

04:42:13.990 --> 04:42:18.000
the Tensen's are all dying, but is told by
him that death is not the end for them.

04:42:18.000 --> 04:42:21.782
Every being passes from life, but their Toa
will still remain.

04:42:21.782 --> 04:42:25.820
Even though reversing the process is insanely
hard, pretty much impossible under normal

04:42:25.820 --> 04:42:26.820
circumstances.

04:42:26.820 --> 04:42:30.138
The little man reveals that that they have
a chance of being revived through the Basin,

04:42:30.138 --> 04:42:32.400
pot urn looking thing he’s holding.

04:42:32.400 --> 04:42:37.100
Inside of the basin it holds all of the fallen
Tensen’s ovules which after 1,000 years

04:42:37.100 --> 04:42:39.680
had passed will allow them to fully revive.

04:42:39.680 --> 04:42:43.750
Yuzuriha who doesn't care about what happens
1000 years from now decides that it was time

04:42:43.750 --> 04:42:47.920
for her and Mei to enter the floodgates but
is warned by Gui Fa that yes she might now

04:42:47.920 --> 04:42:52.350
care about the future, but she better fret
about what's going to happen in the coming

04:42:52.350 --> 04:42:55.670
hours, as Rien Cannot be stopped.

04:42:55.670 --> 04:43:00.400
Meanwhile at the floodgates, Shugen bursts
his way through the overgrowth and grabs onto

04:43:00.400 --> 04:43:03.958
the anchors line in an attempt to halt the
ships departure to Japan.

04:43:03.958 --> 04:43:08.780
Idk what man was thinking and as we probably
all saw coming the line snaps allowing Rien

04:43:08.780 --> 04:43:10.638
their safe departure.

04:43:10.638 --> 04:43:14.670
However turns out Shugen actually tore the
rope in half himself to use the anchor as

04:43:14.670 --> 04:43:18.160
a grappling hook to fling himself all the
way up into the boat.

04:43:18.160 --> 04:43:22.150
Standing infront of the final boss, Shugen
states that he doesn't care what cargo he

04:43:22.150 --> 04:43:24.930
intends to move, but he will never reach the
mainland!

04:43:24.930 --> 04:43:28.850
Looking back at him Rien tells him the same,
in that not a single soul will leave this

04:43:28.850 --> 04:43:30.378
island alive.

04:43:30.378 --> 04:43:33.980
Darting at the immortal, she manages to easily
defend herself against Shugen but also tries

04:43:33.980 --> 04:43:36.718
to hold back as to not damage the ship's interior.

04:43:36.718 --> 04:43:40.040
Shugen screams at himself not to falter and
slashes Rien across the chest, connecting

04:43:40.040 --> 04:43:43.208
with the tanden, but this has no effect due
to his Water Tao not being the right match

04:43:43.208 --> 04:43:45.160
to hinder his Wood Tao.

04:43:45.160 --> 04:43:48.170
Pointing his finger forth he then shoots a
blast of Tao which connects directly with

04:43:48.170 --> 04:43:50.860
the spot on Shugen's chest where his heart
would be.

04:43:50.860 --> 04:43:54.360
Sliding back while gritting his teeth, the
Yamada states that they will not fall to the

04:43:54.360 --> 04:43:58.810
dark arts of these feigns, revealing that
somehow Rien's blast of Tao actually hit Tenza’s

04:43:58.810 --> 04:44:00.718
headband which he’d placed under his robe.

04:44:00.718 --> 04:44:05.708
Thinking about how Tenza saved him once more,
Shugen notes that reckless assault will only

04:44:05.708 --> 04:44:06.930
serve him poorly.

04:44:06.930 --> 04:44:11.190
Instead... to win he must call forth the true
essence of what it means to be a Yamada Asaemon.

04:44:11.190 --> 04:44:15.298
Choosing to replicate the abilities of the
other Yamada to fight, Shugen bursts forth

04:44:15.298 --> 04:44:18.878
and uses a plethora of his close friends abilities
to slash at the creature.

04:44:18.878 --> 04:44:22.660
Rien senses something strange with Shugen's
Tao and upon receiving another cut to his

04:44:22.660 --> 04:44:26.730
tanden from a replicated attack used by Shion,
starts to cough up blood.

04:44:26.730 --> 04:44:30.980
Jumping back in fear, Rien is just confused
as he was sure this dudes Tao wasn't meant

04:44:30.980 --> 04:44:31.980
to affect him.

04:44:31.980 --> 04:44:36.170
Yet, after looking closer, realizes that Shugen
has the ability to change the attribute of

04:44:36.170 --> 04:44:38.590
his Tao, which they always assumed was impossible.

04:44:38.590 --> 04:44:43.128
Seeing that they have to take him seriously,
Rien drops the control they had over the flames

04:44:43.128 --> 04:44:47.030
around them to give her full attention during
the battle.

04:44:47.030 --> 04:44:50.870
Shugen who aint concerned with these flames
tries to attack, yet Rien who would have loved

04:44:50.870 --> 04:44:54.780
to study this man on any other day, takes
things up a notch and severs Shugen's right

04:44:54.780 --> 04:44:56.318
arm with a feathered fan.

04:44:56.318 --> 04:45:00.490
She then states that the time for tinkering
is over and changes to their true form as

04:45:00.490 --> 04:45:03.070
Yin allows for a far greater focus.

04:45:03.070 --> 04:45:08.570
Back with the children sized Tensen, Mei asks
Gui Fa as to what exactly Rien's true goal

04:45:08.570 --> 04:45:09.880
was.

04:45:09.880 --> 04:45:13.890
Flashing into a dark room and using their
Tao illusion ability, Gui Fa shows Mei and

04:45:13.890 --> 04:45:16.888
Yuzuriha what they saw earlier in Rien's laboratory.

04:45:16.888 --> 04:45:21.780
Like remember in the last arc where he got
surprised at a revelation that wasn't expanded

04:45:21.780 --> 04:45:26.700
on, well here its shown that not only did
he find the ovules, but also an extensive

04:45:26.700 --> 04:45:30.230
amount of research on restoring the body of
someone, not the soul.

04:45:30.230 --> 04:45:35.050
Then beyond that he noticed a wall that wasn't
in place, behind that unfamiliar door hidden

04:45:35.050 --> 04:45:39.511
by an illusion was even more research and
notes that eluded to the true goal of Rien.

04:45:39.511 --> 04:45:45.990
We all think its to merc everyone in Japan
and yes that is true, but just as everyone

04:45:45.990 --> 04:45:50.140
reacts to these clones looking after a mysterious
crippled figure in a bed, mei lets them all

04:45:50.140 --> 04:45:53.740
know that that person is the grand master
.

04:45:53.740 --> 04:45:55.950
A sudden noise then breaks them out of the
illusion.

04:45:55.950 --> 04:45:59.860
Gui Fa explains that the noise came from Rien
who’d managed to finally set sail on the

04:45:59.860 --> 04:46:02.468
open ocean after having dealt with Shugen.

04:46:02.468 --> 04:46:07.560
Despite the circumstance, Mei asks Gui Fa
to continue with there explanation on Jofuku's

04:46:07.560 --> 04:46:08.560
plans.

04:46:08.560 --> 04:46:13.060
Gui Fa tells Mei that they are making an incorrect
assumption, Jofuku had indeed died long ago

04:46:13.060 --> 04:46:16.070
that their master had already died and had
been turned into a gold statue in order for

04:46:16.070 --> 04:46:19.700
his body to be preserved after undergoing
Arborification.

04:46:19.700 --> 04:46:23.120
Back in the past when they were first not
permitted to meet with the master, it wasn't

04:46:23.120 --> 04:46:28.290
because he was busy, more that he had actually
arborified and passed from the mortal realm.

04:46:28.290 --> 04:46:32.520
For the last 700 years Rien has worked non
stop for this day.

04:46:32.520 --> 04:46:36.480
The way of Tao explains that the soul and
body are one and through this it led her to

04:46:36.480 --> 04:46:40.450
believe they would have been able to revive
the soul just like any other part of a body.

04:46:40.450 --> 04:46:46.240
Gui Fa then tells Mei and Yuzuriha that Rien's
true goal is to revive Jofuku using the Tao

04:46:46.240 --> 04:46:50.640
of all citizens inside of Japan, not use it
to make a perfect elixir for themselves like

04:46:50.640 --> 04:46:52.452
we originally thought.

04:46:52.452 --> 04:46:56.790
Knowing that Jofuku was already dead and while
speaking in their native Chinese tounge, Me

04:46:56.790 --> 04:47:02.290
asks Gui Fa who was the Hōko that they found
earlier on when getting the basin.

04:47:02.290 --> 04:47:07.690
The little man reveals that the person was
the real body of Rien, who’d begun arborifying

04:47:07.690 --> 04:47:08.968
in that room.

04:47:08.968 --> 04:47:13.850
The person they’re familiar with is merely
a puppet crafted out of Tao.

04:47:13.850 --> 04:47:18.130
The puppets insane quality is due to a level
of Tao manipulation that surpasses what every

04:47:18.130 --> 04:47:19.708
other Tensen is capable of.

04:47:19.708 --> 04:47:23.980
All of it points to one solid conclusion in
his eyes, Rien is not a Tensen, but infact

04:47:23.980 --> 04:47:28.250
a human and the wife of Jofuku.

04:47:28.250 --> 04:47:34.230
When Jofuku left ancient China with his 3000
voyagers, one of them was indeed Rien.

04:47:34.230 --> 04:47:39.990
The Tensen all originally thought they were
an amalgamation of mystic Tao and Flower Tao,

04:47:39.990 --> 04:47:41.610
yet this was false.

04:47:41.610 --> 04:47:46.888
First Rien created another version of herself
and from that the other Tensen were all born.

04:47:46.888 --> 04:47:51.210
Back when a change first started to show in
Rien, it wasn't because she was mad, but because

04:47:51.210 --> 04:47:55.840
her body had started to under go arborification
limiting her time and only allowing her to

04:47:55.840 --> 04:47:57.850
control the clone version of herself remotely.

04:47:57.850 --> 04:48:03.040
Gui Fa who doesn't fully understand the matters
beyond his comprehension just calls Rien foolish

04:48:03.040 --> 04:48:06.090
and starts to criticize the notion of love
humans have.

04:48:06.090 --> 04:48:11.320
In his eyes it makes them pretty and cruel,
full of arrogance lacking in style, suspicious

04:48:11.320 --> 04:48:16.790
and paranoid and even still it drives them
to sacrifice absolutely everything they already

04:48:16.790 --> 04:48:17.790
have.

04:48:17.790 --> 04:48:22.888
After over 1000 years of building everything,
Rien is willing to throw away everything if

04:48:22.888 --> 04:48:26.370
it just means they get a chance at holding
their love once more.

04:48:26.370 --> 04:48:31.860
Then with a final statement he tells them
that within two hours Rien will reach Japan

04:48:31.860 --> 04:48:34.790
to initiate their plan.

04:48:34.790 --> 04:48:38.910
Taking this all in, Yuzuriha panics wanting
some form of break after everything they’ve

04:48:38.910 --> 04:48:39.910
been through.

04:48:39.910 --> 04:48:43.370
She even questions if this is just another
trap the Tensen are trying to set up for them,

04:48:43.370 --> 04:48:46.510
but Gui Fa explains that he’s stuck in a
paradox of his own.

04:48:46.510 --> 04:48:49.430
He wants Rien to leave, but also wants to
save her.

04:48:49.430 --> 04:48:54.610
Unable to understand the feelings he currently
he has, he asks Mei for her opinion on the

04:48:54.610 --> 04:48:55.610
matter.

04:48:55.610 --> 04:48:58.250
Before she could give her answer, Yuzuriha
hits her over the head and tells her that

04:48:58.250 --> 04:48:59.660
they should hurry to where the others are.

04:48:59.660 --> 04:49:04.910
As a parting gift, Gui Fa warns her that according
to the I Ching they found in Rien's room.

04:49:04.910 --> 04:49:09.600
Which for those who forgot, I Ching allows
the Tensen to tell the fortune of specific

04:49:09.600 --> 04:49:10.600
people.

04:49:10.600 --> 04:49:15.860
Through this he was able to determine that
most likely, only two men and one woman will

04:49:15.860 --> 04:49:16.860
survive, shocking Yuzuriha.

04:49:16.860 --> 04:49:21.240
Gui Fa relies on the on this Ching to foresee
fate and those who’s names are unknown cannot

04:49:21.240 --> 04:49:25.580
be include, but Rien themselves may be among
those counted.

04:49:25.580 --> 04:49:29.490
One thing is for sure though, the art of I
Ching does not lie.

04:49:29.490 --> 04:49:34.570
Having left Gui Fa, Yuzuriha and Mei then
arrive at the entrance to the floodgates with

04:49:34.570 --> 04:49:40.458
everyone gathered (with the exception of Gantetsusai
who went ahead to try to stop Rien from departing,

04:49:40.458 --> 04:49:43.290
as well as the absence of the Aza brothers
who have yet to return.)

04:49:43.290 --> 04:49:46.968
Obviously this is because well he’s holding
onto the ovule of his big bro.

04:49:46.968 --> 04:49:51.620
After discussing how they need to find a specific
ship with a light load to catch the main vessel,

04:49:51.620 --> 04:49:55.350
the group enters the floodgates, only to be
left disappointed that all the ships have

04:49:55.350 --> 04:49:56.830
been burned.

04:49:56.830 --> 04:50:00.830
Looking out through the wreckages, Nurugai
spots one unharmed ship but is told by Shion

04:50:00.830 --> 04:50:04.290
that they will not be able to use it since
the wreckage of all of the other vessels is

04:50:04.290 --> 04:50:07.280
blocking the water from flowing and allowing
them to move out.

04:50:07.280 --> 04:50:12.610
With everyone left hopeless, Gabimaru see’s
another vision of his wife and dives into

04:50:12.610 --> 04:50:15.298
the water to try to remove the debris.

04:50:15.298 --> 04:50:19.990
Jikka tries reasoning with him, but our boy
screams back that re-thinking is impossible,

04:50:19.990 --> 04:50:23.020
he only has one goal and refuses to give up.

04:50:23.020 --> 04:50:28.100
Wanting to help and seeing the pain in his
eyes, both Sagiri and Nurugai dive in to help,

04:50:28.100 --> 04:50:30.230
despite it being an impossible task.

04:50:30.230 --> 04:50:35.830
Standing behind them, our little girl Mei
thinks back to what Gui Fa asked her.

04:50:35.830 --> 04:50:40.980
Pointing her hands forth and closing her eyes,
Yuzuriha then sees Mei about to unleash her

04:50:40.980 --> 04:50:45.650
power, which she objects to doing since she
knows that her body will be at risk.

04:50:45.650 --> 04:50:50.000
She pleads with her, asking if she wanted
to Talk with Rien and Jofuku, but with a smile

04:50:50.000 --> 04:50:55.540
on her face Mei explodes and transforms into
her Kishikai, commanding everyone to get on

04:50:55.540 --> 04:51:00.000
the ship while she handles the task of making
a path.

04:51:00.000 --> 04:51:05.910
Ahhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh WHY MEI

04:51:05.910 --> 04:51:09.400
Back in the early days and while looking after
the first Humans who came to the island with

04:51:09.400 --> 04:51:13.870
them, Mei asks Jofuku why he decided to bring
people to the island since the emperor only

04:51:13.870 --> 04:51:15.390
seeks the elixir.

04:51:15.390 --> 04:51:19.530
Jofuku explains to her that because Tao goes
far beyond just typical human understanding

04:51:19.530 --> 04:51:23.820
and for that reason she shouldn't concern
herself with these difficult matters.

04:51:23.820 --> 04:51:30.388
In another memory and after Rien finished
a session of dank Bōchū Jutsu with Jofuku,

04:51:30.388 --> 04:51:34.900
Mei is told by her to not feel ashamed by
the practice as even the young ones will perform

04:51:34.900 --> 04:51:38.950
this training some day, so she mustn't continue
to harbor doubts.

04:51:38.950 --> 04:51:43.570
Then as the children grew older, she recalls
her punishment for defying Rien and how she

04:51:43.570 --> 04:51:45.980
felt powerless to do anything about it.

04:51:45.980 --> 04:51:50.048
She was fed up with it all, so she fled and
told herself that she was unable to make a

04:51:50.048 --> 04:51:54.958
change, but After recalling Gui Fa's past
question as to why she returned to Hōrai,

04:51:54.958 --> 04:51:58.730
Mei remembers that it was once again because
she was fed up with it all....

04:51:58.730 --> 04:52:04.468
In the present, Mei explodes into her Kishikai
state and continues that she was fed up with

04:52:04.468 --> 04:52:06.540
have fled over and over.

04:52:06.540 --> 04:52:11.810
Not anymore though, now she flaps all five
of her massive wings and blows away the wreckage,

04:52:11.810 --> 04:52:14.750
giving everyone a clear enough path to get
onboard the ship.

04:52:14.750 --> 04:52:18.770
Sagiri prepares herself to yell out to Mei
in concern, but is interrupted by Gabimaru,

04:52:18.770 --> 04:52:22.160
who begins yelling out himself, telling her
that she is running the risk of dying if she

04:52:22.160 --> 04:52:25.940
continues to stay in her Kishikai form and
her original goal of being able to have the

04:52:25.940 --> 04:52:27.610
normal life will fade away.

04:52:27.610 --> 04:52:32.390
Mei then returns to normal, dropping out of
her fighting form and hugs both Sagiri and

04:52:32.390 --> 04:52:33.390
Gabimaru individually.

04:52:33.390 --> 04:52:37.910
She thanks both of them for everything they
have done for her, but this is how she takes

04:52:37.910 --> 04:52:40.400
responsibility for everything.

04:52:40.400 --> 04:52:44.430
She tells the confused Gabi and Sagiri that
watching them has a way of filling her with

04:52:44.430 --> 04:52:49.690
courage and finally thanks Sagiri for combing
her hair, before slapping her palms together

04:52:49.690 --> 04:52:54.960
revealing that they were actually in an illusion
and Mei had transported everyone to the ship.

04:52:54.960 --> 04:53:00.740
As Mei uses one last gust of her wings, she
pushes the ship forth allowing them to rush

04:53:00.740 --> 04:53:01.960
after the final boss.

04:53:01.960 --> 04:53:07.548
In her last moments as she begins withering
away, Mei apologizes to everyone for not being

04:53:07.548 --> 04:53:12.900
to sail off with them, to her father, to her
family, and to Rien for not realizing their

04:53:12.900 --> 04:53:19.208
feelings after they banished her and how she
could not stop them.

04:53:19.208 --> 04:53:23.650
Elsewhere and aboard the ship, our G, the
legend, king of the samurai, Tamiya Gantetsusai

04:53:23.650 --> 04:53:26.090
walks his way through the flames of hell.

04:53:26.090 --> 04:53:30.798
Over the other side of the burning ship, Rien
reclaims the Elixir of Life after finding

04:53:30.798 --> 04:53:33.048
it lying next to the defeated Shugen.

04:53:33.048 --> 04:53:37.060
She then wonders as to why he had it on him
but quickly dismisses the question after having

04:53:37.060 --> 04:53:38.558
it back in her hands.

04:53:38.558 --> 04:53:43.100
With the elixir returned, Rien sees that all
that is left to do is put her faith in the

04:53:43.100 --> 04:53:47.920
Paradise Butterflies and becomes happy to
know that her dream will soon come true.

04:53:47.920 --> 04:53:52.370
As things were going well in her favor, the
puppet randomly starts to feel its body suffering

04:53:52.370 --> 04:53:55.190
due to the real Rien's Tao control starting
to lessen.

04:53:55.190 --> 04:53:59.450
With time running short, Rien hopes that she
reaches Japan soon.

04:53:59.450 --> 04:54:04.430
Meanwhile on the flaming deck, Gantetsusai
finds Shugen unconscious and starts to wonder

04:54:04.430 --> 04:54:07.070
as to why his severed arm is not bleeding.

04:54:07.070 --> 04:54:10.720
Shugen then wakes up badly injured and sees
Gantetsusai standing right in front of him

04:54:10.720 --> 04:54:15.388
without Fuchi by his side, but soon remembers
as to why this was not the case.

04:54:15.388 --> 04:54:19.040
Gantetsusai tells Shugen that he was glad
that he managed to wake up, since it wouldnt

04:54:19.040 --> 04:54:21.798
have felt right to cut him while he was still
down.

04:54:21.798 --> 04:54:25.670
Somehow Shugen manages to block the attack
on time but falls down after having been knocked

04:54:25.670 --> 04:54:28.740
off balance losing his sword in the process.

04:54:28.740 --> 04:54:32.260
Gantetsusai tells Shugen that its useless
for him to fight back now that he has lost

04:54:32.260 --> 04:54:37.260
his right arm but is told by the injured Asaemon
that as a samurai he can not give up.

04:54:37.260 --> 04:54:41.250
Just straight up annoyed Gantetsusai kicks
Shugen in the face and screams that all of

04:54:41.250 --> 04:54:46.720
them are a band of fools, all this damn honor
and dignity forced him to cut down his own

04:54:46.720 --> 04:54:47.720
friend.

04:54:47.720 --> 04:54:50.628
He punches him in the face and kicks his stomach
while telling him that his ways of living

04:54:50.628 --> 04:54:52.250
are utterly corrupt.

04:54:52.250 --> 04:54:56.170
Shugen makes an attempt to defend himself
by swinging his sword but falls down after

04:54:56.170 --> 04:54:58.610
losing his balance once again.

04:54:58.610 --> 04:55:02.638
Gantetsusai turns his back on Shugen, calls
him out to be a purely pathetic samurai and

04:55:02.638 --> 04:55:06.180
tells him that he doesn't care if he decides
to burn to death.

04:55:06.180 --> 04:55:11.100
As he watches the blade of his sword burn
within the fire, Shugen grabs it and cauterizes

04:55:11.100 --> 04:55:15.628
the stump of his right arm after remembering
Fuchi's advice about disinfecting a wound.

04:55:15.628 --> 04:55:19.280
He practices getting used to swinging his
sword with his left arm in front of Gantetsusai

04:55:19.280 --> 04:55:23.160
and recalls the time Fuchi discussed with
him how the human body is a tool and that

04:55:23.160 --> 04:55:26.920
by searching its construction and limits one
can manipulate it as they see fit.

04:55:26.920 --> 04:55:31.100
Gantetsusai then becomes shocked to see that
Shugen in a matter of moments managed to adapted

04:55:31.100 --> 04:55:33.510
to using his left arm to wield his sword.

04:55:33.510 --> 04:55:38.558
The Yamada screams to Gantetsusai that Fuchi
was caught up in his sentimentality but says

04:55:38.558 --> 04:55:41.750
that his samurai spirit lives within him.

04:55:41.750 --> 04:55:45.180
Falling into another memory of the past he
recalls the time where Shugen pointed out

04:55:45.180 --> 04:55:47.080
how weird the Yamada clan was.

04:55:47.080 --> 04:55:53.360
Fuchi tho said that even though they got rocks
thrown at them, the clan allowed him to partake

04:55:53.360 --> 04:55:58.850
in his offbeat proclivities and for that reason
its always going to be extremely dear to him.

04:55:58.850 --> 04:56:03.010
Shugen then proceeds to tell Gantetsusai that
someone like him can never understand a samurai's

04:56:03.010 --> 04:56:07.760
sense of duty to protect all those they hold
dear and that he has long since abandoned

04:56:07.760 --> 04:56:09.780
sentimentality.

04:56:09.780 --> 04:56:15.400
After he finishes his statement, Shugen's
eyes mysteriously invert.

04:56:15.400 --> 04:56:19.400
Not noticing this, big G points out the fact
that he sheds tears quite a lot for someone

04:56:19.400 --> 04:56:24.210
without sentimentality and prepares to fight
him but senses something different.

04:56:24.210 --> 04:56:29.500
Earlier before arriving at the floodgates,
Shugen senses a strange energy emitting from

04:56:29.500 --> 04:56:33.520
the gourd containing the Elixir of Life and
becomes suspicious of its contents, prompting

04:56:33.520 --> 04:56:37.570
him to straight up open the bottle and taste
test it for any underlying poisons.

04:56:37.570 --> 04:56:41.150
Much to the shock of the shinobi accompany
him he spits out its remains and then declares

04:56:41.150 --> 04:56:42.968
it to be safe for consumption.

04:56:42.968 --> 04:56:46.860
By the time he faces Gantetsusai though its
obvious that the full effects of the elixir

04:56:46.860 --> 04:56:50.180
is shown to have run its course as Shugen's
eyes start to change, along with his heart

04:56:50.180 --> 04:56:51.180
beating fast.

04:56:51.180 --> 04:56:54.370
In a moment he then darts at the elderly G
and tries to strike him down.

04:56:54.370 --> 04:56:58.840
Comparing him to last time, Gantetsusai notices
that Shugen is able to fight properly again

04:56:58.840 --> 04:57:02.830
as if nothing went wrong and that the way
he moves his body is similar to Fuchi's.

04:57:02.830 --> 04:57:08.090
To him its as if he’s fighting against his
friend, which complicated things for him and

04:57:08.090 --> 04:57:12.192
meant that he didnt defend as the fake Fuchi
sliced at his chest.

04:57:12.192 --> 04:57:16.910
After his robe is cut, Gantetsusai sees the
bandages Fuchi used to heal him with before

04:57:16.910 --> 04:57:20.680
his death and decides to stop fighting, keeling
down instead.

04:57:20.680 --> 04:57:23.480
Looking at him, Shugen question if he was
ready to surrender.

04:57:23.480 --> 04:57:29.820
Yeah in a freaking million years though, like
I think you need to understand that BIG Gantetsusai

04:57:29.820 --> 04:57:34.270
is built differently, he tells Shugen that
he was just remembering the reason as to why

04:57:34.270 --> 04:57:38.780
he boarded the ship in the first place and
how he never even intended to fight him.

04:57:38.780 --> 04:57:43.160
Slowly standing up, Gantetsusai explains that
in the past he toured the provinces fighting

04:57:43.160 --> 04:57:47.690
anyone of strength, but at some point they
never ever scratched the itch he sought to

04:57:47.690 --> 04:57:48.690
find.

04:57:48.690 --> 04:57:53.388
His nick name "Blade Dragon", came about after
he took down his very first monster, a Ryukotsu

04:57:53.388 --> 04:57:56.200
known to us feeble English readers as a ship's
"keel".

04:57:56.200 --> 04:58:00.900
With that said, Gantetsusai smiles as he brings
his sword down and slashes the ship in two

04:58:00.900 --> 04:58:05.170
causing a massing explosion as the energy
blast connects with the ocean below.

04:58:05.170 --> 04:58:09.090
Falling back with his wounds reopened he laughs
that he was unable to completely cut the ship

04:58:09.090 --> 04:58:12.600
in half but figures that another attempt would
be able to.

04:58:12.600 --> 04:58:18.250
Absolutely enraged with what's happened, Rien
floating there in the sky asks what in the

04:58:18.250 --> 04:58:19.600
world he’s just done.

04:58:19.600 --> 04:58:25.970
Gantetsusai that he could not stop the ship
since it is made out of Tao.

04:58:25.970 --> 04:58:29.200
As she begins to slowly stroll towards the
duo now, Gantetsusai says that he hasn't managed

04:58:29.200 --> 04:58:34.378
to cleave the ship in two, but he did managed
to slow her down enough for our next crew.

04:58:34.378 --> 04:58:39.400
Guessing that his work is done, he readies
himself to get off the ship instead of continuing

04:58:39.400 --> 04:58:44.650
to fight, stating that his life was a gift
given to him and that he will not throw it

04:58:44.650 --> 04:58:45.650
away.

04:58:45.650 --> 04:58:49.170
However, he does tell both Rien and Shugen
that someone else stronger than him will arrive

04:58:49.170 --> 04:58:52.960
shortly and that he hopes their ready to face
him.

04:58:52.960 --> 04:58:56.600
Looking over the boat and through the flames
he becomes happy to see that Gabimaru and

04:58:56.600 --> 04:58:59.320
the squad had finally pulled up.

04:58:59.320 --> 04:59:04.330
Gabimaru jumps onboard the ship, compliments
Gantetsusai for the work he has done, and

04:59:04.330 --> 04:59:08.378
tells him that he will handle the task of
taking down the ship as he faces both Rien

04:59:08.378 --> 04:59:11.208
and Shugen.

04:59:11.208 --> 04:59:14.080
ITS THE FINAL SHOWDOWN!!!

04:59:14.080 --> 04:59:18.000
Before boarding the ships themselves, Gabimaru
pointed out that the flames were far too strong

04:59:18.000 --> 04:59:20.638
for everyone but him to jump onboard.

04:59:20.638 --> 04:59:25.610
Alone and walking through the flames like
a Yamabushi Monk, Gabimaru approaches Rien

04:59:25.610 --> 04:59:27.320
and Shugen.

04:59:27.320 --> 04:59:31.050
Shugen standing there himself, takes note
of the setting in front of him and compares

04:59:31.050 --> 04:59:34.480
it to the past portrait he and Eizen looked
at depicting hell.

04:59:34.480 --> 04:59:39.000
Which just goes back to how the series is
called Jigokuraku and how that word when broken

04:59:39.000 --> 04:59:42.210
down means 1 heaven and 2 hells.

04:59:42.210 --> 04:59:47.660
Wonder if that also refers to the amount of
survivors on this mission 2 men and 1 woman,

04:59:47.660 --> 04:59:56.360
could have been infront of our eyes from the
get go.

04:59:56.360 --> 05:00:02.230
Either way lets push forth and discover how
Yuki ended this amazing series.

05:00:02.230 --> 05:00:05.641
Nevertheless Shugen then announces that he
will for the sake of the world and the clan

05:00:05.641 --> 05:00:07.580
punish even the devil himself.

05:00:07.580 --> 05:00:11.840
Hearing his war cry, Gabimaru commented that
he’s already used to this hellish domain,

05:00:11.840 --> 05:00:16.210
while Rien on the other hand just found her
situation with them to be irritating.

05:00:16.210 --> 05:00:22.340
In an instant all of them clash blades, hands
and feet in a three way free for all.

05:00:22.340 --> 05:00:24.620
Continuing all of them then weave through
each others strikes.

05:00:24.620 --> 05:00:28.020
Rien blocks Gabimaru's attack and tells him
that she will not allow him to damage the

05:00:28.020 --> 05:00:31.558
ship any further and will use everything they
have to kill him while stomping their foot

05:00:31.558 --> 05:00:32.650
on the ninja.

05:00:32.650 --> 05:00:37.180
Rien sees Shugen about to attack her from
behind and uses her fan to counter.

05:00:37.180 --> 05:00:41.040
Taking things up a level, Shugen manages to
anticipates her attack using the Tao sensory

05:00:41.040 --> 05:00:44.240
ability and comes in to strike using Shion's
Wood affinity.

05:00:44.240 --> 05:00:48.510
However, Rien who’s just in another class
when it comes to the level of skill, stands

05:00:48.510 --> 05:00:53.718
on the tip of Shugen's sword, telling him
as a Shinsen, the highest class of hermit,

05:00:53.718 --> 05:00:59.160
a human such as himself will not be able to
harm her, before raising her hand and firing

05:00:59.160 --> 05:01:01.640
a point blank invisible Tao attack.

05:01:01.640 --> 05:01:06.180
Watching from the side, Gabimaru sees that
Rien is a lot stronger than Zhu Jin and Ran

05:01:06.180 --> 05:01:10.100
but remembers from his conversation with Jikka
earlier that as long as Rien's priority is

05:01:10.100 --> 05:01:13.240
keeping the ship intact he should be able
to hold his own.

05:01:13.240 --> 05:01:17.890
In the battle though Rien becomes shocked
to see her tanden slightly cut and sees that

05:01:17.890 --> 05:01:22.100
it was done by no one other than our queen,
Sagiri, who boarded the ship after remembering

05:01:22.100 --> 05:01:28.760
that Gabimaru will need her help since her
Wood Tao will actually harm Rien.

05:01:28.760 --> 05:01:34.760
After Nurugai makes a point that their best
chances at survival is fighting together,

05:01:34.760 --> 05:01:41.610
the survivors (with the exception of Jikka
cause mans on the sneak) all decide to board

05:01:41.610 --> 05:01:43.770
Rien's ship to take her down together.

05:01:43.770 --> 05:01:48.410
Rien states that a gathering of humans will
do nothing to stop her, however Gabi silences

05:01:48.410 --> 05:01:52.650
her nonsense, he already knows that they’re
just a bunch of randoms who came together.

05:01:52.650 --> 05:01:55.100
BUT they will do anything to survive and make
it home.

05:01:55.100 --> 05:01:56.100
Meanwhile on the survivors' ship, Jikka lays
down, while in support of his comrades, and

05:01:56.100 --> 05:01:57.100
says that he will do his job of guarding the
ship.

05:01:57.100 --> 05:02:01.290
Knowing that Rien's Tao is too powerful, Yuzuriha
and Gabimaru decide that the best course of

05:02:01.290 --> 05:02:05.870
action is to try to have her deplete her Tao,
similar to how they managed to defeat Ran,

05:02:05.870 --> 05:02:10.350
with everyone else acting as distractions.

05:02:10.350 --> 05:02:14.708
Sprinting forth Yuzuriha makes the first attack
by using her Ninpo: concealed armor ability

05:02:14.708 --> 05:02:20.080
in combination with Ninpo: puppet slime to
create her supreme move: Crimson confection

05:02:20.080 --> 05:02:21.080
guard.

05:02:21.080 --> 05:02:24.480
She knows that only two dudes and 1 chick
will survive, but pushes forth either way

05:02:24.480 --> 05:02:28.500
and puts her faith in Sagiri and Shion, knowing
that the both of them can make the final cut

05:02:28.500 --> 05:02:29.940
together.

05:02:29.940 --> 05:02:34.260
Rien destroys Yuzuriha's armored soldiers
but is struck in the head after failing to

05:02:34.260 --> 05:02:37.260
notice the sneaky Kunoichi charging towards
her.

05:02:37.260 --> 05:02:41.550
Even still, Rien manages to simply send her
back with a Tao infused blast, however in

05:02:41.550 --> 05:02:45.780
that moment she's caught of guard by Nurugai
who while sliding behind them, remembers Shion's

05:02:45.780 --> 05:02:50.628
teachings in the use of Tao and cuts Rien's
left arm using Tenza's Itto-Ryu ultimate pounding

05:02:50.628 --> 05:02:51.790
torrent technique.

05:02:51.790 --> 05:02:56.010
With their body falling to bits, Rien quickly
reconnects it and uses the partially severed

05:02:56.010 --> 05:03:00.850
branch arm to grab ahold of Nurugai but luckily
for our mountain warrior has her limb cut

05:03:00.850 --> 05:03:02.180
off by the Blade Dragon..

05:03:02.180 --> 05:03:09.120
Gabi who comes down from above notices a perfect
opportunity and in combination with Gantetsusai’s

05:03:09.120 --> 05:03:15.060
merciless eye killer move: Skypeak Splitter
uses his secret art: Shandi gust to simultaneously

05:03:15.060 --> 05:03:18.210
light on fire and cut the immortals tanden.

05:03:18.210 --> 05:03:22.690
With Rien left wide open, Gabimaru calls out
to Sagiri and Shion to perform their combined

05:03:22.690 --> 05:03:25.160
attack to destroy Rien's tanden.

05:03:25.160 --> 05:03:30.910
Stepping forth in perfect motion, both the
Yamada use their ultimate technique: Hidden

05:03:30.910 --> 05:03:35.850
Blade dual wheel moon to bisect the immortals
top half sending it flying up into the air

05:03:35.850 --> 05:03:37.580
and bringing the intense battle to an end.

05:03:37.580 --> 05:03:38.580
Jokes as if its over yet, we still got a goooood
amount to go.

05:03:38.580 --> 05:03:43.530
In retaliation the Tensen simply claps their
hands together, revealing that she's perfectly

05:03:43.530 --> 05:03:49.320
fine and the events that had transpired were
an illusion of Tao created by her.

05:03:49.320 --> 05:03:54.510
Looking to her left she watches Shion falls
down infront of her.

05:03:54.510 --> 05:03:59.718
With Sagiri stunned still, Rien walks forth
revealing that everyone (except for Shugen,

05:03:59.718 --> 05:04:02.958
Isuzu, Kiyomaru, and Gabimaru) has fallen.

05:04:02.958 --> 05:04:07.650
Irritated with the pathetic foolishness of
these Humans, she explains to Sagiri that

05:04:07.650 --> 05:04:11.010
Hermits are those who touch apon the truths
of this divine plane.

05:04:11.010 --> 05:04:15.780
The only thing that has ever remained beyond
their reach is the world of the gods themselves,

05:04:15.780 --> 05:04:21.070
still in her eyes she will soon even reach
that state, revealing the buddha like Kishikai

05:04:21.070 --> 05:04:23.080
state that she wields.

05:04:23.080 --> 05:04:27.860
All that remains is the complete destruction
of Waguo.

05:04:27.860 --> 05:04:31.958
After seeing Rien enter her Kishikai form,
Gabimaru prepares to use a technique against

05:04:31.958 --> 05:04:36.058
her, yet, Rien instantly blasts him in the
face with a Tao lightning bolt before he is

05:04:36.058 --> 05:04:37.058
given a chance to attack.

05:04:37.058 --> 05:04:38.483
I just realized, its kinda like a mix of Buddha
and Raijin, but yeah.

05:04:38.483 --> 05:04:41.930
Sagiri comes and actually manages to stab
Rien's tanden from behind but is told by the

05:04:41.930 --> 05:04:44.590
Tensen that her Tao is far too weak to harm
her body.

05:04:44.590 --> 05:04:48.500
Seeing that Sagiri was about to be crushed,
Shugen jumps in to save Sagiri from Rien's

05:04:48.500 --> 05:04:52.660
Tao manipulation and orders both Isuzu and
Kiyomaru to have the criminals return to the

05:04:52.660 --> 05:04:56.410
ship, explaining that they cannot allow a
monster to steal the Yamada clan's duty to

05:04:56.410 --> 05:04:57.980
execute them.

05:04:57.980 --> 05:05:03.050
WHICH IS CRAZY.

05:05:03.050 --> 05:05:05.920
Hearing that some of that were gonna escape
allowing them to escape, Rien dismantles the

05:05:05.920 --> 05:05:12.420
entirety of the ships exterior, while keeping
the room where Jofuku is placed intact.

05:05:12.420 --> 05:05:18.450
As she holds on to Kiyomaru's hand, Sagiri
becomes shocked to see that the young Asaemon

05:05:18.450 --> 05:05:22.558
has been crushed by a piece of the debris
that was previously sent flying.

05:05:22.558 --> 05:05:24.628
Poor duuude, RIP Kiyo.

05:05:24.628 --> 05:05:29.250
Seeing her comrade, Isuzu becomes shocked
and rushes towards their direction.

05:05:29.250 --> 05:05:34.878
However, Rien senses her and literally takes
control of Isuzu's body, before ultimately

05:05:34.878 --> 05:05:38.308
crushing her in front of Shugen, much to his
horror.

05:05:38.308 --> 05:05:42.270
Screaming for both of his friends, Shugen
jumps upto where the immortal is and tries

05:05:42.270 --> 05:05:44.410
to attack Rien in a blind fit of rage.

05:05:44.410 --> 05:05:49.460
Sneaking up from behind as this happened,
Gabimaru grabs onto Rien and sets her ablaze

05:05:49.460 --> 05:05:53.860
with an intense amounts of flames, which in
turn allows the meglomaniac Shugen a chance

05:05:53.860 --> 05:05:57.870
to cut off one of Rien's arms but also as
a side effect is caught.

05:05:57.870 --> 05:06:03.380
While trying to incinerate her, Gabimaru has
a sudden memory of Yui's face and ends up

05:06:03.380 --> 05:06:08.020
ceases his attack, realizing that he’ll
perish if he continues.

05:06:08.020 --> 05:06:11.670
Looking at is own hand, he then notices that
his Tao is starting to resonate with Rien's

05:06:11.670 --> 05:06:16.218
and because of that he falls into a similar
dark world to that of Zhu Jin's before suddenly

05:06:16.218 --> 05:06:19.740
bursting into a bundle of flowers and falling
to the ground arborified.

05:06:19.740 --> 05:06:26.400
So back before they boarded the ship, Jikka
did his thing and made a bunch of predictions

05:06:26.400 --> 05:06:32.320
as to how the survivors should go about fighting,
but believes that there is no solution.

05:06:32.320 --> 05:06:37.450
Knowing that, Jikka decides to stay on the
ship as ya know they've gotta have someone

05:06:37.450 --> 05:06:38.450
guarding it, much to Yuzuriha's annoyance.

05:06:38.450 --> 05:06:42.180
In the present, Jikka watches the outcome
on the ship and sees that he was right on

05:06:42.180 --> 05:06:43.730
the survivors not being able to stop Rien.

05:06:43.730 --> 05:06:49.230
He then brings out a drinking barrel and decides
to toast to the end of humanity.

05:06:49.230 --> 05:06:53.990
On board the skeleton of a vessel and while
watching Gabimaru arborify, Rien says that

05:06:53.990 --> 05:06:58.628
she knows not of his ambitions, but hopes
that he has pleasant dreams and as the go

05:06:58.628 --> 05:07:03.350
to land the finishing blow believe that all
those who are still alive will die in the

05:07:03.350 --> 05:07:07.340
fire or will lose the will to fight as they
soon reach Japan.

05:07:07.340 --> 05:07:12.470
Sitting there herself, Sagiri feels that she's
utterly powerless and reflects on all of the

05:07:12.470 --> 05:07:15.390
times she has failed to do anything against
her enemies.

05:07:15.390 --> 05:07:20.782
She then looks at Gabimaru and begins to say
she gives up, but stops in her tracks after

05:07:20.782 --> 05:07:24.090
seeing just how bad his arborfication is.

05:07:24.090 --> 05:07:29.141
Rising to his feet, Shugen, badly burned from
Gabimaru's flames, orders Sagiri to return

05:07:29.141 --> 05:07:32.280
to the other ship since she cannot fight in
the state she is in.

05:07:32.280 --> 05:07:36.221
He looks at the reflection in his blade and
to him its obvious that our girl lost her

05:07:36.221 --> 05:07:40.058
resolve after witnessing too many of her friends
pass away.

05:07:40.058 --> 05:07:45.830
So and since she is literally the only heir
left for the clan (apart from Jikka) he orders

05:07:45.830 --> 05:07:49.540
her to board the other vessel as he cant afford
to lose her.

05:07:49.540 --> 05:07:54.840
Having survived being fatally wounded, Shugen
boldly states that he will make Isuzu and

05:07:54.840 --> 05:08:00.250
Kiyomaru proud by eternally carrying out his
clan's duty without any doubt within him.

05:08:00.250 --> 05:08:05.010
As she senses Shugen's Tao surging, Sagiri
remembers the time Shugen congratulated her

05:08:05.010 --> 05:08:09.350
for earning a ranking and how she will bring
about a change as a woman to the clan's male

05:08:09.350 --> 05:08:10.980
dominant trade.

05:08:10.980 --> 05:08:15.580
Speaking up Sagiri questions Shugen if its
even possible for people to live without doubt,

05:08:15.580 --> 05:08:18.760
and if they do does it even translate to strength?

05:08:18.760 --> 05:08:23.500
Over the time on this mission, she’s come
face to face with doubt over and over again.

05:08:23.500 --> 05:08:28.570
Her doubt as well as those of the criminals,
executioners and even Tensen.

05:08:28.570 --> 05:08:32.060
Everyone struggles and doubts themselves only
to struggle some more.

05:08:32.060 --> 05:08:37.000
If abandoning doubt is truly the way of the
samurai, then like Shion, she rebukes the

05:08:37.000 --> 05:08:39.830
roles and states that she isn't one in that
case.

05:08:39.830 --> 05:08:44.280
With all of the fallen Yamada placing a hand
on her back she screams that she refuses to

05:08:44.280 --> 05:08:48.440
leave these feelings behind and instead while
picking up her sword exclaims that TO THE

05:08:48.440 --> 05:08:53.770
BITTER END, SHE WILL REMAIN FULL OF DOUBT
AND CONFUSION AS FOR THAT IS WHO SHE IS.

05:08:53.770 --> 05:09:01.370
N im like hell yeah this actually gave me
the biggest spur of encouragement.

05:09:01.370 --> 05:09:15.600
Im way to harsh on myself for my pronunciation
or the way I speak, or how bad I am at reading,

05:09:15.600 --> 05:09:17.620
but stuff it.

05:09:17.620 --> 05:09:22.770
Like Sagiri here im thanking Shugen for these
words as we are truly grateful to him.

05:09:22.770 --> 05:09:28.430
Looking at her, Shugen feels this random sensation
emitting from Sagiri, its neither tranquility

05:09:28.430 --> 05:09:32.378
or intensity but something else completely.

05:09:32.378 --> 05:09:36.780
Sagiri herself then looks back at Gabimaru
and asks him in her mind if it was okay for

05:09:36.780 --> 05:09:38.840
her to have faith...

05:09:38.840 --> 05:09:43.990
In a time once passed we see Gabimaru being
introduced to the 8th daughter of the chief

05:09:43.990 --> 05:09:45.372
Yui.

05:09:45.372 --> 05:09:50.180
Initially she becomes spooked after Gabimaru
raises his hand towards her and pats her head

05:09:50.180 --> 05:09:52.180
as if she's some kinda pet.

05:09:52.180 --> 05:09:56.940
Yui questions his action, to which Gabimaru
answers that ever since that day he’d wanted

05:09:56.940 --> 05:09:59.300
to become more open with.

05:09:59.300 --> 05:10:08.940
But at the time it just didnt feel real, he’d
stolen lives so he thought he never qualified

05:10:08.940 --> 05:10:10.620
for a normal life.

05:10:10.620 --> 05:10:15.218
Yui says that she doesn’t understand where
he was coming from and tells Gabimaru that

05:10:15.218 --> 05:10:19.372
he is still eligible to have a normal life
despite his past sins.

05:10:19.372 --> 05:10:24.080
She notes that he seemed to be suffering some
kind of pain, but the acts of regret and reflection

05:10:24.080 --> 05:10:26.390
are all apart of ones atonement.

05:10:26.390 --> 05:10:30.990
She asked if it was enough that just a single
person accepted him for who he was causing

05:10:30.990 --> 05:10:33.040
Gabi to question what she meant.

05:10:33.040 --> 05:10:36.540
Thinking on this, Gabi believes that it is
enough and that he should accept himself for

05:10:36.540 --> 05:10:41.450
who he is so that he can finally be free of
his burden and move on.

05:10:41.450 --> 05:10:47.340
In the present, Sagiri raises her sword above
Gabimaru's Arborified body and tells him that

05:10:47.340 --> 05:10:50.760
he must accept his burdens while continuing
to live on.

05:10:50.760 --> 05:10:55.600
She then brings her sword down and executes
the roles she was initially charged with.

05:10:55.600 --> 05:11:00.340
Momentarily, Gabimaru regains consciousness,
with his body back to normal, and finds his

05:11:00.340 --> 05:11:03.200
own flower arborified head in front of him.

05:11:03.200 --> 05:11:07.700
Noticing that his sense of self finally returned,
Sagiri explains that she had to amputate the

05:11:07.700 --> 05:11:11.520
parts of his body that were deeply rooted
with vines and used the most outlandish method

05:11:11.520 --> 05:11:14.780
of Tao Restoration by pressing his Tanden
next to hers.

05:11:14.780 --> 05:11:19.310
While he stands there impressed with her approach,
Sagiri states that she cannot see a way to

05:11:19.310 --> 05:11:23.430
defeat their enemy but is told by Gabimaru
that they need to keep fighting as long as

05:11:23.430 --> 05:11:26.270
their alive, much to her satisfaction.

05:11:26.270 --> 05:11:30.060
Gabimaru also thanks Sagiri for leading him
back towards doubt to increase the speed of

05:11:30.060 --> 05:11:31.060
his healing.

05:11:31.060 --> 05:11:36.840
(she did this by like guiding the thoughts
in his head, bring up his wife etc).

05:11:36.840 --> 05:11:41.860
After Sagiri jokes about actually following
through with her original task, Gabimaru says

05:11:41.860 --> 05:11:46.610
that they cannot rely on fate due to the risk
of failure and also readies himself to fight

05:11:46.610 --> 05:11:48.798
alongside Sagiri.

05:11:48.798 --> 05:11:54.250
Shion and Nurugai fall into the ocean while
carrying Gantetsusai who remains unconscious.

05:11:54.250 --> 05:11:58.190
Jikka then tries to bring them onboard the
ship as requested by Shion but falls into

05:11:58.190 --> 05:12:02.960
the ocean as well due to being intoxicated.

05:12:02.960 --> 05:12:06.600
After everyone (including Yuzuriha) is brought
back on the ship, Jikka lets them know that

05:12:06.600 --> 05:12:12.298
it would not matter if they had saved him
since he believes that Rien is utterly unstoppable.

05:12:12.298 --> 05:12:16.468
While on the other ship, Rien senses Tao growing
from where Gabimaru and Sagiri's are, and

05:12:16.468 --> 05:12:17.628
looks in their direction.

05:12:17.628 --> 05:12:21.870
Jumping towards her Rien fends off a plethora
of attacks and uses a bolt of Tao lightning

05:12:21.870 --> 05:12:27.100
as an attack but misses Sagiri after Gabimaru
pulls her out of the way.

05:12:27.100 --> 05:12:30.650
Nurugai and Shion watch as Gabimaru and Sagiri
fight together in perfect synchronization

05:12:30.650 --> 05:12:34.450
but also points out that they need some sort
of strategy.

05:12:34.450 --> 05:12:38.690
Darting forth, Gabi is handed Sagiri's sword
and goes in to strike Rien's tanden.

05:12:38.690 --> 05:12:42.558
However, Jikka notes that that strategy will
not work since the hindering attribute will

05:12:42.558 --> 05:12:44.760
lose the necessary power needed.

05:12:44.760 --> 05:12:48.930
Using another strategy, Gabimaru attempts
to use Sagiri as a human sword by holding

05:12:48.930 --> 05:12:51.872
her by the legs, but quickly dismisses the
idea.

05:12:51.872 --> 05:12:56.940
In light of their ridiculous tactics, Rien
sees that she cant afford to waste any more

05:12:56.940 --> 05:12:59.850
time fighting them and must take down Sagiri
using her bulked up arms.

05:12:59.850 --> 05:13:05.250
On the other side of the boat, Shugen looks
at Sagiri and remembers the time he felt worried

05:13:05.250 --> 05:13:07.480
that she was selected for the shogun's mission.

05:13:07.480 --> 05:13:12.350
He assumed that her kindness would be a hinderance,
but now in light of things starts to see that

05:13:12.350 --> 05:13:13.350
it doesn't.

05:13:13.350 --> 05:13:17.260
Sagiri remembers how Gabimaru pointed out
to her how she lost to Shija due to giving

05:13:17.260 --> 05:13:21.218
into anger instead of focusing on the middle
path that gives Tao its power and in that

05:13:21.218 --> 05:13:27.420
moment accepts that both strength, weakness,
and doubt make her who she is.

05:13:27.420 --> 05:13:31.510
After her Tao is strengthen, Sagiri attacks
Rien with a clear mindset of knowing that

05:13:31.510 --> 05:13:37.190
she is the "spear" and the “linchpin”
that will take her down while our sneaky sneaker,

05:13:37.190 --> 05:13:41.760
Gabimaru is the spy from within the shadows,
as after all being a sneaky shinobi is what

05:13:41.760 --> 05:13:44.590
he does best.

05:13:44.590 --> 05:13:48.310
Moments before Sagiri made her charge and
remembering that Rien's true goal is to revive

05:13:48.310 --> 05:13:53.290
Jofuku, Gabimaru tells her to remember what
happens when those extreme emotions take over.

05:13:53.290 --> 05:13:54.570
It weakens their Tao.

05:13:54.570 --> 05:13:59.930
Tao is held together by a clean discord between
both Yin and Yang, to much to either side

05:13:59.930 --> 05:14:01.398
and the power fades.

05:14:01.398 --> 05:14:06.140
So if her heart is filled with rage, then
maybe they have a chance.

05:14:06.140 --> 05:14:11.388
In reality and as Sagiri is placating the
big boss, Gabimaru lands in the same room

05:14:11.388 --> 05:14:17.600
as the gilded statue of Jo Fuku, causing the
buddha wannabe to fall directly into their

05:14:17.600 --> 05:14:18.600
trap.

05:14:18.600 --> 05:14:22.638
As he charges towards Jofuku's corpse, with
his Ninpō: Ascetic Blaze activated, Gabimaru

05:14:22.638 --> 05:14:26.200
knows that when her Tao is disrupted, Sagiri
will slash her tanden.

05:14:26.200 --> 05:14:31.230
The timing has to be perfect, but as he goes
to smash down on the floor of the boat notices

05:14:31.230 --> 05:14:35.700
that there is a post-wedding brazier, a flower
crown, and a pair of traditional wedding garbs

05:14:35.700 --> 05:14:37.680
laid out infront of the statue.

05:14:37.680 --> 05:14:42.690
Stunned Gabi thinks back to when Yuzuriha
said Rein’s true goal was to revive her

05:14:42.690 --> 05:14:47.490
master, yet after seeing what's infront of
him, Gabimaru for the first time realizes

05:14:47.490 --> 05:14:51.070
that Rien and Jofuku are a married couple.

05:14:51.070 --> 05:14:54.708
Beginning to falter, he tries pushing himself
forth as he knows he needs to be in perfect

05:14:54.708 --> 05:14:58.500
sync with Sagiri and this truly is there last
moment, missing it means death.

05:14:58.500 --> 05:15:03.531
Seeing his wife with the smile on her face
and knowing the pain that it’d cause someone

05:15:03.531 --> 05:15:06.700
to loose their beloved, he drops to the floor
unable to follow through.

05:15:06.700 --> 05:15:16.792
Unexpectedly, the merchant of death, sir order
66 Shugen jumps out from behind Gabimaru,

05:15:16.792 --> 05:15:22.020
and screams that to be a samurai means being
prepared to give your life at any moment.

05:15:22.020 --> 05:15:26.390
For DUTY is the pride of a samurai and the
pride of the Yamada Clan.

05:15:26.390 --> 05:15:29.840
Raising up his sword he envisions Eizen doing
the same.

05:15:29.840 --> 05:15:34.890
Free of thought till death, with singular
devotion, towards the embrace of deaths warm

05:15:34.890 --> 05:15:39.180
grasp, he brings down his blade with the vision
of a demonic Eizen behind him, allowing him

05:15:39.180 --> 05:15:44.070
to deal a powerful Tao-imbued sword slash
that not only slices Jofuku's gilded statue

05:15:44.070 --> 05:15:48.170
in 2, but the entire ship itself.

05:15:48.170 --> 05:15:52.958
Having witnessed confirmed passing of her
loved one, Rien screams in horror as her late

05:15:52.958 --> 05:15:57.320
husband's body is destroyed, gives Sagiri
the perfect opportunity to bisect the Tensen

05:15:57.320 --> 05:15:59.210
and destroy her plant ovule.

05:15:59.210 --> 05:16:03.260
So with everything lining up for our girl,
she swings her own blade forth and manages

05:16:03.260 --> 05:16:05.708
to slice the immortal Kishikai in two.

05:16:05.708 --> 05:16:12.430
With the battle finally over, Sagiri, Gabimaru,
and Shugen are seen exhausted while the upper

05:16:12.430 --> 05:16:16.548
half of the puppet starts to disintegrate
inside of the ocean.

05:16:16.548 --> 05:16:21.390
Having defeating the final immortal, the ship
starts to fall apart, since the only thing

05:16:21.390 --> 05:16:24.750
that was keeping it held together was Rien's
Tao.

05:16:24.750 --> 05:16:28.430
After retrieving the Elixir of Life, Gabimaru
yells out to Sagiri to grab his hand while

05:16:28.430 --> 05:16:29.940
they make their way back to the ship.

05:16:29.940 --> 05:16:33.982
Sagiri wants to look for Shugen, but once
she turns around and sees that he has passed

05:16:33.982 --> 05:16:39.378
away due to overexerting too much of his Tao
in his previous attack continues forth.

05:16:39.378 --> 05:16:46.420
Randomly Gabimaru Sagiri suddenly receives
a gapping wound as if she was hit by some

05:16:46.420 --> 05:16:48.548
sort of Tao attack directly in the stomach.

05:16:48.548 --> 05:16:53.340
With Gabimaru left in shock he turns to sees
that the culprit is Rien, who stands before

05:16:53.340 --> 05:16:56.308
them with her body being partially covered
in flowers.

05:16:56.308 --> 05:17:01.370
Her only desire was to be with her husband
and now because of that she states that this

05:17:01.370 --> 05:17:02.750
is the end of everything.

05:17:02.750 --> 05:17:07.050
She furiously vows to Gabimaru that she will
take away everything from him and the other

05:17:07.050 --> 05:17:08.050
humans.

05:17:08.050 --> 05:17:12.360
Suddenly Gabimaru's left hand is then crushed
by Rien causing him to drop to the ground.

05:17:12.360 --> 05:17:17.360
Laying there and after remembering a past
lesson from Eizen about how a Kaishaku is

05:17:17.360 --> 05:17:19.548
needed when performing seppuku, since the
punishment does not have the victim die immediately,

05:17:19.548 --> 05:17:24.610
Sagiri comes up with the idea of using hemostasis
on herself, but quickly concludes that it

05:17:24.610 --> 05:17:26.430
may not work to help her recover.

05:17:26.430 --> 05:17:31.080
She then remembers Gui Fa's past words to
her on how the only thing each side can do

05:17:31.080 --> 05:17:37.680
now is steal lives from each other and ponders
if that is truly the only recourse.

05:17:37.680 --> 05:17:43.490
After seeing Gabimaru punctured by Rien, Nurugai
prepares to rush over to assist him.

05:17:43.490 --> 05:17:47.628
However, Jikka grabs her and explains her
that power will not be able to stop Rien.

05:17:47.628 --> 05:17:52.110
Back over with the dying immortal and while
having Gabimaru suffer for his ‘crimes’,

05:17:52.110 --> 05:17:56.910
Rien remembers how he hesitated to destroy
Jofuku's body and asks him as to why he did

05:17:56.910 --> 05:17:57.910
so.

05:17:57.910 --> 05:18:02.170
Gabimaru answers that in the moment he was
about to strike, an image of his wife appeared

05:18:02.170 --> 05:18:05.490
in his mind, which caused him to end up faltering.

05:18:05.490 --> 05:18:10.770
As Rien thinks about her lost love, Gabimaru
tries to reason with her, saying that maybe

05:18:10.770 --> 05:18:14.110
he thought they could relate.

05:18:14.110 --> 05:18:19.380
Having heard these words, Rien looks back
on her loving memories with Jofuku, how he

05:18:19.380 --> 05:18:25.468
slowly started to grow old and arborify while
she till the very end stayed by his side.

05:18:25.468 --> 05:18:29.580
Remembering the love that she once felt and
beginning to cry herself, She brings her hands

05:18:29.580 --> 05:18:35.968
together and in a final act decides to heal
Gabimaru and Sagiri's wounds

05:18:35.968 --> 05:18:44.750
With everyone watching, even the survivors
on the nearby boat, Rien starts to disintergrate,

05:18:44.750 --> 05:18:47.980
turning her body into a bunch of flower petals.

05:18:47.980 --> 05:18:53.350
In the afterlife its said that Rien who was
finally at piece managed to have her soul

05:18:53.350 --> 05:18:55.820
reunite with her husband.

05:18:55.820 --> 05:19:01.638
Jikka, while still intoxicated, becomes happy
with the outcome of the battle and tells Gabimaru

05:19:01.638 --> 05:19:05.960
and Sagiri that he had faith in them all along,
much to their, as well as Shion's, Nurugai's,

05:19:05.960 --> 05:19:07.690
and Gantetsusai's, annoyance.

05:19:07.690 --> 05:19:12.990
On the other hand, Yuzuriha suggests in forgiving
him since he is the one in charge of steering

05:19:12.990 --> 05:19:13.990
the ship.

05:19:13.990 --> 05:19:14.990
Jikka becomes delighted to know that Yuzuriha
was on his side and tells them that he was

05:19:14.990 --> 05:19:15.990
going to get back to "rowing" the ship, which
Nurugai and Yuzuriha commented on being ineffective.

05:19:15.990 --> 05:19:20.370
As they make their way towards Edo, which
is around an hour or so away, Shion informs

05:19:20.370 --> 05:19:25.090
everyone that he and Nurugai will not be returning
and will go their separate ways on a small

05:19:25.090 --> 05:19:26.090
boat.

05:19:26.090 --> 05:19:56.790
He also reminds them about their situation
with who will get the pardon upon returning.

05:19:56.790 --> 05:20:04.090
After seeing Sagiri depressed, Yuzuriha tells
her that a happy ending was never going to

05:20:04.090 --> 05:20:09.260
be possible for them and asks if an executioner
like her started to become fond of criminals.

05:20:09.260 --> 05:20:15.240
Sagiri wipes a tear as she happily answers
yes, after coming to see them as people dear

05:20:15.240 --> 05:20:20.620
to her and asks if it was wrong of her to
not know the answer to the situation.

05:20:20.620 --> 05:20:25.120
Yuzuriha says no and points out that everyone
else besides herself was a villain, which

05:20:25.120 --> 05:20:29.430
leads to everyone having a comical conversation
about just how villainous each person is.

05:20:29.430 --> 05:20:34.548
After he and his wife are pointed out to be
evil, Gabimaru shocks everyone after he laughs

05:20:34.548 --> 05:20:37.968
at the ridiculous thought of Yui being a villain.

05:20:37.968 --> 05:20:43.150
Having become interested in knowing more about
his wife, the groups asks Gabimaru to tell

05:20:43.150 --> 05:20:46.260
them more about her, to which he agrees.

05:20:46.260 --> 05:20:53.840
Later, Gabimaru, Yuzuriha, Gantetsusai, and
Sagiri stand up to try and figure out who

05:20:53.840 --> 05:20:57.530
will return with the Elixir of Life.

05:20:57.530 --> 05:21:04.400
Shortly after, the shogun becomes informed
that a ship has returned from the island voyage

05:21:04.400 --> 05:21:12.680
with only two men and one woman boarding.

05:21:12.680 --> 05:21:18.140
At the magistrate, Sagiri and Jikka present
themselves to the shogun as the two only surviving

05:21:18.140 --> 05:21:22.310
Asaemons to make it out alive and are ordered
by Aoki to make their report.

05:21:22.310 --> 05:21:26.298
Sagiri remembers earlier back how Jikka will
take the initiative in making the report but

05:21:26.298 --> 05:21:34.930
wonders as to what he will do.

05:21:34.930 --> 05:21:39.320
Jikka first bows his head in gratitude for
being assigned to the mission and tells them

05:21:39.320 --> 05:21:43.190
that, since Shugen has lost his life during
the mission, he will be the one to make the

05:21:43.190 --> 05:21:44.250
report (covering for our boy, love to see
it).

05:21:44.250 --> 05:21:48.548
Jikka then presents the deliverance of the
Elixir of Life and reports that the only surviving

05:21:48.548 --> 05:21:51.820
criminal was Tamiya Gantetsusai after the
other criminals, Gabimaru, Aza Chōbei, Yuzuriha,

05:21:51.820 --> 05:21:52.980
and Nurugai, were executed by him.

05:21:52.980 --> 05:21:58.670
With this, Gantetsusai is then pardoned by
the shogun (and I never doubted BIG G FOR

05:21:58.670 --> 05:22:11.370
A SECOND I knew man was gonna make it home,
like the blade dragon, aint no one killing

05:22:11.370 --> 05:22:12.370
our man).

05:22:12.370 --> 05:22:15.600
Before allowing Aoki to end all matters, Jikka
asks him about the arrangements that were

05:22:15.600 --> 05:22:18.190
made concerning the Iwagakure chief.

05:22:18.190 --> 05:22:23.280
Aoki confirms to Jikka that the Iwagakure
chief was dealt with, after the latter testified

05:22:23.280 --> 05:22:27.450
that the leader had his own ambitions during
the mission, which was viewed as treason against

05:22:27.450 --> 05:22:34.548
the shogun, and presents the leader's severed
head, much to Sagiri's shock.

05:22:34.548 --> 05:22:39.860
Aoki also reports that the body of the chief
has been transformed into a tree after they

05:22:39.860 --> 05:22:45.270
forced him to test the effects of the elixir
before beheading him, as per Jikka's suggestion.

05:22:45.270 --> 05:22:51.138
Aoki then questions if the state of the chief
could be viewed as immortality but is convinced

05:22:51.138 --> 05:22:55.660
by Jikka that the shogun could live forever
as a divine tree to watch over his family

05:22:55.660 --> 05:23:03.480
in exchange for his humanity.

05:23:03.480 --> 05:23:09.000
After their business with the shogun was over,
Jikka falls down tired and becomes pleased

05:23:09.000 --> 05:23:10.860
that things somehow went according to plan.

05:23:10.860 --> 05:23:15.770
Earlier on the ship, Jikka saw that Gabimaru
and Yuzuriha had picked Gantetsusai as the

05:23:15.770 --> 05:23:20.280
one to receive the pardon due to his high
reputation and suggests that they themselves

05:23:20.280 --> 05:23:24.150
abandon their names and former life upon separating
on boats.

05:23:24.150 --> 05:23:34.260
Which just like Yuzuriha points out, it connects
this with the I Ching Gui Fa warned her about

05:23:34.260 --> 05:23:35.440
on Kotaku.

05:23:35.440 --> 05:23:39.718
As they prepare to depart, Sagiri receives
a goodbye hug from Nurugai and yells out her

05:23:39.718 --> 05:23:44.468
farewells to Yuzuriha who happily waves back
already having started to leave on her own

05:23:44.468 --> 05:23:45.468
vessel.

05:23:45.468 --> 05:23:48.640
Looking over, she then sees that Gabimaru
is the last to depart.

05:23:48.640 --> 05:23:54.350
The two meet each others gazes and as Gabi
walks by happily say their goodbyes without

05:23:54.350 --> 05:24:10.550
even having to say a word.

05:24:10.550 --> 05:24:17.128
In the present, Jikka sees Sagiri thinking
about the others and tries to cheer her up,

05:24:17.128 --> 05:24:21.110
stating that it was fate that brought everyone
together and now all they can do is hope that

05:24:21.110 --> 05:24:24.740
whatever path in life they are on, it will
make them happy.

05:24:24.740 --> 05:24:30.170
After hearing these words, Sagiri looks up
with a smile as she starts to cry.

05:24:30.170 --> 05:24:37.080
Meanwhile, Tōma is revealed to have somehow
found a boat and departed from Kotaku, but

05:24:37.080 --> 05:24:40.230
not by himself, dude is mysteriously accompanied
by an unknown person.

05:24:40.230 --> 05:24:41.491
After the arrangements were made by Jikka,
Gabimaru who had finally managed to make it

05:24:41.491 --> 05:24:42.491
home becomes shocked to see Yui standing atop
some stairs and eagerly runs towards her.

05:24:42.491 --> 05:24:43.491
After finally being reunited, the couple set
out on their own path in life.

05:24:43.491 --> 05:24:44.491
(so we finally made it huh, our boy is home
with his wife who exists and he didnt have

05:24:44.491 --> 05:24:45.491
to merc big G in the process, pure bliss)

05:24:45.491 --> 05:24:46.491
Skipping forth in time though, over in British
Hong Kong during the mid-1800s, a young man

05:24:46.491 --> 05:24:47.491
sitting in a chair notices that the men he
took down do not look like the locals, to

05:24:47.491 --> 05:24:48.491
which he’s informed by his brother that
these men are from England due to the recent

05:24:48.491 --> 05:24:49.491
war causing chaos in power.

05:24:49.491 --> 05:24:50.491
You know who it is, the BANDIT BROTHERS TOMA
AND CHOBEI BIG CHILLING TOGETHER, Chōbei

05:24:50.491 --> 05:24:51.491
hearing this becomes pleased, since he believes
that it is an opportunity for him to take

05:24:51.491 --> 05:24:52.491
over the city and declares to the Englishmen
that he now rules the underworld from here

05:24:52.491 --> 05:24:53.491
on out..

05:24:53.491 --> 05:24:54.491
So as some of you might've guessed the reason
Chōbei is alive, is somewhat similar to Gabi,

05:24:54.491 --> 05:24:55.491
but with the added use of the Tensen's special
pot.

05:24:55.491 --> 05:24:56.491
His brother stimulated his ovule while keeping
him stored in the urn to help speed up his

05:24:56.491 --> 05:24:57.491
regeneration.

05:24:57.491 --> 05:24:58.491
One of them men suddenly whips out a gun and
calls Chōbei a freaking baby, which Tōma

05:24:58.491 --> 05:24:59.491
translates for him and after learning that
he was insulted, Chōbei transforms into his

05:24:59.491 --> 05:25:00.491
breakdown state and merks the dude for insulting
him.

05:25:00.491 --> 05:25:01.491
At the same time, in a teahouse in Japan's
Hitoyoshi Domain, Shion gives his opinion

05:25:01.491 --> 05:25:02.491
on Nurugai's new appearance, saying she was
too young to wear that, but is told that she

05:25:02.491 --> 05:25:03.491
prefers her new look since the other girls
around her dress the same.

05:25:03.491 --> 05:25:04.491
Nurugai is then hit on by two men, which she
found flattering, but sees Shion ward them

05:25:04.491 --> 05:25:05.491
off with a threat.

05:25:05.491 --> 05:25:06.491
Nurugai becomes disappointed but is given
a lecture by Shion about how all men are either

05:25:06.491 --> 05:25:07.491
beasts or thieves, then noticing something
on her face begins to clean the dirt off.

05:25:07.491 --> 05:25:08.491
The two then decide to head North to find
Nurugai's people and having watched this entire

05:25:08.491 --> 05:25:09.491
thing happen a random woman wonders if they
are father and daughter despite not seeing

05:25:09.491 --> 05:25:10.491
any resemblances.

05:25:10.491 --> 05:25:11.491
Meanwhile, while traveling, Sagiri talks to
Yuzuriha about how Gantetsusai has opened

05:25:11.491 --> 05:25:12.491
