05:25:21.491 --> 05:25:22.491
Sagiri replies that she could not help the
urge for a little reunion.

05:25:22.491 --> 05:25:23.491
She then asks her mate why she decided to
accompany her, to which Yuzuriha answers its

05:25:23.491 --> 05:25:24.491
