with them.

05:25:28.491 --> 05:25:29.491
Once they all walk inside, Yui offers to wake
Gabimaru up to have him see them which causes

05:25:29.491 --> 05:25:30.491
the chicks to be surprised as Gabi probably
didnt sleep at all on the island (apart from

05:25:30.491 --> 05:25:31.491
ya know the knockouts).

05:25:31.491 --> 05:25:32.491
Sagiri also finds it hard to believe this
but states that he was no longer the same

05:25:32.491 --> 05:25:33.491
"Gabimaru" as before.

05:25:33.491 --> 05:25:34.491
All of them then roll over to check up on
Gabimaru and after seeing just how out to

05:25:34.491 --> 05:25:35.491
it he is, states that they probably cant rouse
him as dudes gone from stray cat to house

05:25:35.491 --> 05:25:36.491
cat.

05:25:36.491 --> 05:25:37.491
Letting him be then, we skip away from Gabi
for the final time and leave the three woman

05:25:37.491 --> 05:25:38.491
