that has happened.

05:25:38.491 --> 05:25:39.491
Time then fast-forwards several centuries
where Gui Fa is seen ending an online class

05:25:39.491 --> 05:25:40.491
while living in human society (funnily this
ended during ovid so the whole online class

05:25:40.491 --> 05:25:41.491
thing hits different when you think that for
the last 2 years of this series man was stuck

05:25:41.491 --> 05:25:42.491
in doors writing).

05:25:42.491 --> 05:25:43.491
Mei then enters the room to tell Gui Fa that
Ju Fa and Tao Fa have sprouted which was a

05:25:43.491 --> 05:25:44.491
lot earlier than anticipated.

05:25:44.491 --> 05:25:44.507
Walking off together Gui Fa just says that
he hopes they others progress just as well.

